e and a global presence, we’re experts at solving the\nchallenges of staying connected in today’s fast-paced world. Our proven, resilient solutions ensure\nyour organization communicates securely and is ready for whatever comes next.\n\n[learn more about mitel][89]\n\n## Built for Your Business Designed For Growth\n\n### Unified Communications and Collaboration\n\nreliable, cost-effective communication\n\nStay connected with essential voice, messaging, and video designed for seamless, efficient\noperations.\n\n[explore uc][90]\n[city of Baltimore]\n\nThe City of Baltimore gained greater "}}, "page_text": "* [Customer Center][1] * [Partners][2] [ MITEL ][3] * [ Why Mitel ][4] * [ Solutions ][5] * [Industries][6] * [Healthcare][7] * [Education][8] * [Field Services][9] * [Financial Services][10] * [Government & Defense][11] * [Hospitality & Cruising][12] * [Manufacturing][13] * [Retail][14] * [Business Needs][15] * [Hybrid Communications][16] * [Mitel AI Ecosystem][17] * [Call Center & Customer Experience][18] * [Security Compliance Resilience][19] * [Remote Working][20] * [On-site Strategies][21] * [Migrate to the cloud][22] * [App Integrations Gallery][23] * [Business Profiles][24] * [Enterprise][25] * [Midsize][26] * [Small Business][27] ### Mitel Named Leader Again in the 2026 Aragon Research Globe for Intelligent CC [Aragon-2026-ICC-Cover] Read how Mitel leads in the direction and demands of the Contact Center market [Read Now][28] * [ Products & Services ][29] * [Unified Communications & Collaboration][30] * [Mitel's Zoom Hybrid Workplace][31] * [MiCollab][32] * [OpenScape UC][33] * [Unify Phone][34] * [Microsoft Teams Integration][35] * [Business Communications Platforms][36] * [MiVoice Business][37] * [OpenScape Voice][38] * [OpenScape 4000][39] * [MiVoice MX-ONE][40] * [OpenScape Business][41] * [Advanced UC & CX Solutions][42] * [Mitel CX][43] * [Mitel Workflow Studio][44] * [Mitel Workforce Optimization][45] * [MiContact Center Enterprise][46] * [Devices & Accessories][47] * [IP Phones][48] * [Mitel SIP Phones Open SIP Market][49] * [DECT Solutions][50] * [OpenScape Desk Phone CP Series][51] * [Conference Phones][52] * [Critical Communications][53] * [Mitel Xpert][54] * [Revolution][55] * [Critical Event Management][56] * [Mitel EHR Integrated Solutions][57] * [OpenScape Alarm Response][58] * [Professional & Managed Services][59] * [Advise][60] * [Transform][61] * [Operate][62] * [Optimize][63] * [Secure & Sovereign Hosted Cloud][64] * [Mitel Secure Cloud][65] * [Software Assurance][66] ### Techaisle White Paper [TechAisle White Paper] A Techaisle survey reveals hybrid and AI are the priority when modernizing communications. [Learn More][67] * [ Resources ][68] * [Resource Center][69] * [EBooks & Guides][70] * [White Papers][71] * [Videos][72] * [Infographics][73] * [Webinars][74] * [Company][75] * [About Mitel][76] * [Leadership][77] * [Board of Directors][78] * [Careers][79] * [News & Announcements][80] * [Case Studies][81] * [Technical Document Center][82] * [Blog][83] * [Security Advisories][84] ### Navigating Uncertainty [Frost & Sullivan Report 2025] Mitel is recognized for innovation leadership in organizational resilience when it counts. [Read Now][85] [Contact Sales][86] # Powering the Connections that Power Your World Communications built for today’s demands and tomorrow’s possibilities, from AI to whatever comes next. [explore solutions][87] [Talk to an Expert][88] * **+70M** Users Worldwide * **#1** UC Provider Worldwide * **2,100** Patents ## Your Trusted Partner in Business Communications Mitel is the market leader in unified communications, trusted by enterprises of all sizes and industries. With decades of experience and a global presence, we’re experts at solving the challenges of staying connected in today’s fast-paced world. Our proven, resilient solutions ensure your organization communicates securely and is ready for whatever comes next. [learn more about mitel][89] ## Built for Your Business Designed For Growth ### Unified Communications and Collaboration reliable, cost-effective communication Stay connected with essential voice, messaging, and video designed for seamless, efficient operations. [explore uc][90] [city of Baltimore] The City of Baltimore gained greater control of operating expenses, reducing carrier costs by 75% and saving thousands of dollars in annual maintenance. [Read more.][91] ### Customer Experience smarter communication, stronger connections Enhance agent productivity and customer engagement with AI-assisted collaboration, analytics, and integrations. [DISCOVER CX Solutions][92] [Connect group] Connect Group updated their contact center landscape of 80 locations, saving £500,000 in their first year and redirecting ~30% of calls to IVR. [Read more.][93] ### Critical Communications communication without compromise Highly secure, reliable, and designed with industry-specific capabilities for demanding environments. [EXPLORE Critical Communications][94] [Rosewood Schloss Fuschl] For Rosewood Schloss Fuschl, Mitel helped reduce operational costs, improve guest communication, and ensure maximum security across the resort.[Read more.][95] ### Professional and Managed Services EXPERTISE WHEN AND WHERE YOU NEED IT Maximize communications value or extend IT capacity with Mitel or trusted partners, so solutions perform, and teams focus on what matters most. [Learn more][96] [Colerain] An expert services-led approach helped Colerain Township cut costs, boost efficiency, and stay responsive with a tailored, always-connected solution. [Read more.][97] ## Why Businesses Choose Mitel We don’t just sell technology - we enable business continuity, growth and innovation, * ### Scalable & Future-Ready Grow without limits with seamless, adaptable communication solutions that evolve when you do. [EXplore NOW][98] * ### Operational Efficiency Unify communication, streamline IT, and empower teams with a platform built for agility. [SEE HOW][99] * ### Cost Optimization Maximize impact with lower TCO, predictable costs, and ROI you can measure. [OPTIMIZE NOW][100] * ### Reliability & Continuity Carrier-grade resilience, built-in security, and always-on performance you can trust. [DISCOVER NOW][101] * ### Experience-Driven Innovation Empower employees, engage customers, and gain an edge with proven communication solutions. [SEE NOW][102] * ### Deployment Flexibility Cloud, hybrid, or on-prem—deploy your way, without vendor lock-in or compromise. [FIND OUT HOW][103] * [HYATT] * [BFA] * [Carlsberg] * [Printemps] ## Trusted By Leading Enterprises Worldwide Our experts can help you find the right mix of industry-specific solutions to meet your communications challenges head on. [Explore by all industries][104] * [ ### Healthcare ][105] * [ ### education ][106] * [ ### Financial Services ][107] * [ ### Manufacturing ][108] * [ ### Hospitality & Cruise ][109] * [ ### government ][110] ### Healthcare Utilize secure, compliant, and resilient communications solutions that help improve patient care while supporting the specific needs of healthcare professionals. [Learn more][111] **55%** are choosing hybrid for better security **75%** choose Mitel for our hybrid, cloud, and on-premises options **55%** believe AI in communication will increase staff efficiency ### Education Embrace critical communication needs like student safety, teacher-administrator collaboration, sensitive data protection, and hybrid learning for better education outcomes. [Learn more][112] **81%** select Mitel because of our reliability. **52%** are modernizing their communication infrastructure with a focus on student engagement **61%** are investing in communication AI to improve staff efficiency ### Financial Services Empower your financial services operations with resilient unified communications solutions that enhance customer interactions while meeting the rigorous demands of security and regulatory compliance. [Learn more][113] **54%** are investing in AI to Improve customer service response time **88%** choose Mitel for our hybrid, cloud, and on-premises options **66%** are choosing hybrid for the cloud + on-premises mix that supports staff wherever they work ### Manufacturing Use the power of unified communications to connect locations, optimize supply chain workflows, and empower employees to help achieve your goals. [Learn more][114] **62%** are choosing hybrid for the cloud + on-premises mix that supports staff wherever they work **53%** are investing in AI to improve customer service response time **81%** choose Mitel for the security of our portfolio ### Hospitality & Cruise Scalable, reliable communications provide the ideal guest experience while helping streamline operations. [Learn more][115] **73%** work with Mitel because of our flexibility **61%** are investing in communication AI to improve staff efficiency **74%** are choosing hybrid for the cloud + on-premises mix that supports staff wherever they work ### Government Leverage secure, compliant, and resilient communication solutions to support the service and safety of citizens while enhancing the productivity of employees. [Learn more][116] By providing greater internal control, Mitel saved Baltimore County 75% of their carrier costs. Verhnills District manages ~50% more calls per day without additional resources with Mitel Orion Township earned >10% cost savings with Mitel, compared to their legacy system. ## 6,000+ Global Partners. ## Find The Right OneFor Your Business Our global network of trusted partners ensures you get the best solutions tailored to your needs [Search for your local specialist][117] ## Stay Ahead with the Latest Trends in Business Communications Informed choices lead to stronger outcomes. Explore curated guidance and resources to help shape your communications strategy. [Techaisle White Paper cover] ### A Hybrid and AI Future for UC Read our latest research on the future of UC. [Learn more][118] [Mitel Named Leader Again in the 2026 Aragon Research Globe for Intelligent CC] ### Mitel Named Leader Again in the 2026 Aragon Research Globe for Intelligent CC Read how Mitel leads in the direction and demands of the Contact Center market [Learn more][119] [Frost and Sullivan Report Cover] ### Navigating Uncertainty Mitel is recognized for innovation leadership in organizational resilience when it counts. [Learn more][120] Contact us ## Unlock the Power of Communication with Mitel Let’s talk. * [Contact Us Now][121] * [Find a Partner][122] [Mitel][123] ## Support Page * [Partner Technical Support][124] * [Document center][125] * [Security Advisories][126] * [Mitel User Group][127] ## Partners * [Partner Training][128] * [Find a partner][129] * [Become a Partner][130] * [Mitel Technology Network][131] ## Company * [Contact Us][132] * [Data Protection][133] * [Legal][134] * [Modern Slavery Statements][135] * © 2026 Mitel Networks Corp. All Rights Reserved. * [Site Feedback][136] * [Accessibility Feedback][137] * [Cookie Preferences][138] * [Do not sell or share my personal data][139] [1]: /customer-center [2]: /partners [3]: / [4]: https://www.mitel.com/about/why-mitel [5]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions [6]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industries [7]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/healthcare [8]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/education [9]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/field-services [10]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/financial-services [11]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/government [12]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/hospitality [13]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/manufacturing [14]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/industry/retail [15]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions#BusinessNeeds [16]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/business-need/hybrid-communications [17]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/business-need/mitel-ai-ecosystem [18]: https://www.mitel.com/solutions/business-need/call-center-customer-experience [19