n information is managed by your organization. Please get in touch with your organization's administrator to reset your password. Your registration request has been denied. If you believe this is a mistake, please reach out to our Web Support using the Contact Us form. Sign in [Loading...] [Forgot Password?][163] New Account? [ Register Here ][164] Unable to Sign In? [ Visit Support ][165] [ My Micron Dashboard ][166] [ Logout ][167] [Privacy Policy][168] # Micron is the critical layer powering AI [Accelerate your AI][169] [ AI ## HBM4 designed for NVIDIA Vera Rubin in high volume production [Micron HBM4 NVIDIA] ][170] [ Data Center SSD ## World’s first PCIe^{®} Gen6 SSD in mass production [Micron gen6 ssd] ][171] [ Community ## Investing in social impact [Instructor guiding students during a hands-on learning activity] ][172] [ AI ## Edge AI accelerates with Micron [Surfer riding a wave representing Micron’s role in accelerating Edge AI innovation.] ][173] [ Data center SSD ## Industry leading 245TB SSD now shipping [6600 ION] ][174] ## Innovation makes new solutions possible [ ## Data center Choose the right data center memory and storage solutions and get control over the essential systems affecting your business. Learn more [Stacked servers animated icon] ][175] [ ## Client PC Micron’s flexible memory and storage powers PCs from thin and light notebooks that last all day on a single battery charge to powerful data-hungry workstations. Learn more [Laptop computer animated icon] ][176] [ ## Automotive For more than 30 years and trillions of miles, Micron has been committed to bringing high-performance memory and storage technology to the automotive industry. Learn more [Steering wheel animated icon] ][177] [ ## Mobile Mobile memory and storage accelerate AI-driven technologies that enable predictive, insightful and new experiences for end users. Learn more [Mobile phone animated icon] ][178] MARKET AND INDUSTRIES ## Memory and storage for industrial IoT solutions Micron engineers advanced memory and storage solutions designed to meet the dynamic demands of industrial IoT and aerospace systems. Our technologies provide exceptional performance, reliability, and longevity, ensuring high-quality applications with a zero-defect mindset. [ Explore IoT solutions ][179] [Industrial robot arm on product line] ## Featured blogs [ DRAM ## When memory changes the equation: What we learned putting LPDDR to work in the data center Khayam Anjam | July 2026 View AI blog [Neon-lit data center server corridor] ][180] [ Memory ## Why agentic AI is rewriting the rules for CPU and memory infrastructure Sudharshan Vazhkudai, Sujit Somandepalli and Raj Narasimhan | July 2026 View AI blog [Abstract AI visualization representing data center compute and memory infrastructure] ][181] [ Storage ## Micron 6600 ION 245TB is now shipping — redefining data center storage at scale Bill Bollengier | May 2026 View storage blog [Networking server data center] ][182] [ Markets & Industries ## The rise of smarter robots and why memory is becoming their superpower Emily Vorhies | March 2026 View markets & industries blog [Workers in cleanroom] ][183] [ See all Blogs ][184] ## Design tools Your single source for tools and resources needed to maximize Micron's products and solutions for your design needs. * [FBGA and part decoder][185] * [DRAM power calculators][186] * [NAND power calculator][187] * [Simulation models][188] * [Chipset compatibility guides][189] * [SPD part number lookup][190] * [Cross-reference tools ][191] * [UFSparm][192] * [SSD firmware][193] * [Software and drivers ][194] * [Storage Executive software][195] * [Obsolete part catalogs][196] [ View all design tools ][197] [High tech user interface] [ Careers ## Your future starts here At Micron, we foster a culture of inclusion and growth to bring out the best in each other. With global opportunities, team member development and career advancement, we invest in you. Help us drive tomorrow's technology to enrich life for all. Innovate with us [A group of people collaborating on a laptop in an outdoor setting] ][198] [ U.S. expansion ## Building memory and R&D manufacturing in the U.S. With more than $250 billion in planned investment through 2035, Micron's memory fabs in Idaho, New York, and Virginia will strengthen U.S. economic and national security and are expected to create approximately 90,000 direct and indirect jobs across the U.S. semiconductor supply chain. Learn about U.S. expansion [US R&D footprint map] ][199] ## Design tools Access our design tools and resources to test, build, and maintain high-performance solutions to support your design process. [ Visit design tools ][200] ## Search for, filter and download data sheets Get in-depth information about product features, specifications, functionality, and more. [ Search for data sheets ][201] ## Order a Micron sample Your online source for placing and tracking orders for Micron memory samples. [ Order samples ][202] ## Downloads and technical documentation Resources to help you design, test, build and optimize your innovative designs. [ Downloads and tech docs ][203] [ Products][204] * [ Memory ][205] * [ Storage ][206] * [ Multichip packages ][207] * [ Technology leadership ][208] * [ Design tools ][209] [ Markets & industries][210] * [ AI ][211] * [ Automotive ][212] * [ Client PC ][213] * [ Consumer ][214] * [ Data center and servers ][215] * [ Customer and partner storage success ][216] * [ Industrial IoT ][217] * [ Mobile ][218] * [ Network infrastructure ][219] [ Partners][220] * [ Partners overview ][221] * [ Partner networks ][222] * [ Technology", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Micron Technology — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Micron manufactures DRAM, NAND, and NOR memory. | Manufactures DRAM, NAND, and NOR memory. | United States | USA", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "74", "Y Score": "73", "Overall Score": "74", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Siltronic AG", "Website": "https://www.siltronic.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Germany", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Germany)", "Operational Presence": "Germany", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Siltronic is a German manufacturer of hyperpure silicon wafers, a key material for semiconductor production.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "DE", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Siltronic AG — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Manufacturer of hyperpure silicon wafers, a key material for semiconductors.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "siltronic.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "siltronic.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[[Siltronic AG – go to home]][1]\n* [Contact][2]\n* [Sites][3]\n* Languages\n  * [ Deutsch ][4]\n  * [ English ][5]\n* [Products][6]\n  \n  #### Silicon wafers\n  \n  Hyperpure silicon wafers are the basis for almost all semiconductor elements and consequently\n  represent an essential basis for the world’s electronics industry. With various diameters,\n  material properties, and surface qualities, Siltronic’s extensive product range covers the global\n  semiconductor industry’s specific requirements.\n  * [\n    \n    #### Polished wafers\n    \n    Perfect surfaces for versatile applications\n    \n    ][7]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Epitaxial wafers\n    \n    Superior basis for highly integrated components.\n    \n    ][8]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Special products\n    \n    Specialized wafers for innovative technologies\n    \n    ][9]\n* [Our Company][10]\n  \n  #### Siltronic AG\n  \n  Perfect Silicon Solutions: Positioned as one of the world’s leading manufacturers of silicon\n  wafers with diameters up to 300 mm, Siltronic partners with many preeminent chip manufacturers and\n  companies in the semiconductor industry.\n  * [\n    \n    #### About Siltronic\n    \n    Technology leader and driving force for innovation\n    \n    ][11]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Strategy & Values\n    \n    Our goals, strategic priorities, and guiding principles.\n    \n    ][12]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Management\n    \n    Siltronic AG Executive Board and Supervisory Board\n    \n    ][13]\n  * [\n    \n    #### History\n    \n    Siltronic’s history goes back to the year 1953.\n    \n    ][14]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Sites\n    \n    Globally positioned: Siltronic is manufacturing in Asia, Europe and the USA.\n    \n    ][15]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Quality\n    \n    Achieving the ultimate in quality standards determines our corporate philosophy\n    \n    ][16]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Compliance\n    \n    Responsible actions as key to success\n    \n    ][17]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Partners\n    \n    Solution-oriented customer and supplier relations\n    \n    ][18]\n* [Sustainability][19]\n  \n  #### Sustainability\n  \n  Sustainability is part of our corporate DNA – for the benefit of people and the environment, as\n  well as with a view to the company's profitability.\n  * [\n    \n    #### Commitments\n    \n    Commitment beyond legal requirements\n    \n    ][20]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Targets\n    \n    Our targets help us to become better and better\n    \n    ][21]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Managing sustainability\n    \n    How we manage our sustainability performance\n    \n    ][22]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Environment\n    \n    How we protect the environment and its resources\n    \n    ][23]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Supply chain\n    \n    Together with our suppliers for more sustainability\n    \n    ][24]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Working conditions\n    \n    What we offer our employees\n    \n    ][25]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Products\n    \n    Products with benefits for sustainability\n    \n    ][26]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Society\n    \n    Siltronic is part of society\n    \n    ][27]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Transparency\n    \n    Reporting and evaluation\n    \n    ][28]\n* [Career][29]\n  \n  #### Success Stories\n  \n  Founded in Germany, at home in the world: Today Siltronic is a global employer in which employees\n  around the world place their trust and loyalty. Employees appreciate the good team spirit and\n  sustainable personnel development just as much as they value the corporate culture based on\n  flexibility and initiative.\n  \n  [Open positions in Germany][30] [Open positions in the USA][31] [Open positions in Singapore][32]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Students and Graduates\n    \n    ][33]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Professionals\n    \n    ][34]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Working in Germany\n    \n    ][35]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Working in USA\n    \n    ][36]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Working in Singapore\n    \n    ][37]\n  * [\n    \n    #### Siltronic as an employer\n    \n    ][38]\n* [Investors][39]\n  \n  #### Investor Relations\n  \n  Siltronic AG has been listed since 2015 and is included on the SDAX and the TecDAX. At Siltro"}}, "page_text": "[[Siltronic AG – go to home]][1] * [Contact][2] * [Sites][3] * Languages * [ Deutsch ][4] * [ English ][5] * [Products][6] #### Silicon wafers Hyperpure silicon wafers are the basis for almost all semiconductor elements and consequently represent an essential basis for the world’s electronics industry. With various diameters, material properties, and surface qualities, Siltronic’s extensive product range covers the global semiconductor industry’s specific requirements. * [ #### Polished wafers Perfect surfaces for versatile applications ][7] * [ #### Epitaxial wafers Superior basis for highly integrated components. ][8] * [ #### Special products Specialized wafers for innovative technologies ][9] * [Our Company][10] #### Siltronic AG Perfect Silicon Solutions: Positioned as one of the world’s leading manufacturers of silicon wafers with diameters up to 300 mm, Siltronic partners with many preeminent chip manufacturers and companies in the semiconductor industry. * [ #### About Siltronic Technology leader and driving force for innovation ][11] * [ #### Strategy & Values Our goals, strategic priorities, and guiding principles. ][12] * [ #### Management Siltronic AG Executive Board and Supervisory Board ][13] * [ #### History Siltronic’s history goes back to the year 1953. ][14] * [ #### Sites Globally positioned: Siltronic is manufacturing in Asia, Europe and the USA. ][15] * [ #### Quality Achieving the ultimate in quality standards determines our corporate philosophy ][16] * [ #### Compliance Responsible actions as key to success ][17] * [ #### Partners Solution-oriented customer and supplier relations ][18] * [Sustainability][19] #### Sustainability Sustainability is part of our corporate DNA – for the benefit of people and the environment, as well as with a view to the company's profitability. * [ #### Commitments Commitment beyond legal requirements ][20] * [ #### Targets Our targets help us to become better and better ][21] * [ #### Managing sustainability How we manage our sustainability performance ][22] * [ #### Environment How we protect the environment and its resources ][23] * [ #### Supply chain Together with our suppliers for more sustainability ][24] * [ #### Working conditions What we offer our employees ][25] * [ #### Products Products with benefits for sustainability ][26] * [ #### Society Siltronic is part of society ][27] * [ #### Transparency Reporting and evaluation ][28] * [Career][29] #### Success Stories Founded in Germany, at home in the world: Today Siltronic is a global employer in which employees around the world place their trust and loyalty. Employees appreciate the good team spirit and sustainable personnel development just as much as they value the corporate culture based on flexibility and initiative. [Open positions in Germany][30] [Open positions in the USA][31] [Open positions in Singapore][32] * [ #### Students and Graduates ][33] * [ #### Professionals ][34] * [ #### Working in Germany ][35] * [ #### Working in USA ][36] * [ #### Working in Singapore ][37] * [ #### Siltronic as an employer ][38] * [Investors][39] #### Investor Relations Siltronic AG has been listed since 2015 and is included on the SDAX and the TecDAX. At Siltronic, we regard investor relations as an obligation as well as a strong motivation. Our interactions with our shareholders and investors are characterized by transparency and openness. This is the only way to build trust and shape the future together. * [ #### Information on the share Facts, figures and analyst estimates ][40] * [ #### Reports and presentations Current reports and presentations provide insights. ][41] * [ #### Fact Sheet Siltronic in overview ][42] * [ #### Corporate Governance Confident and concentrated on the essentials: our principles of corporate governance. ][43] * [ #### Financial releases Voting rights announcements, Directors’ Dealings and ad hoc disclosures ][44] * [ #### Annual General Meeting Agendas, important downloads and presentations ][45] * [ #### Investor Relations Team and Order Service Your contacts for all IR matters ][46] * [ #### Financial Calendar All important financial market dates at a glance ][47] * [Press][48] * [ #### Press releases Current releases and archive ][49] * [ #### Media Press photos and videos ][50] * [ #### Press contact and order service Your contact for all press requests ][51] # Precision, innovation, growth Siltronic AG is one of the world’s leading providers of high tech wafer solutions made from hyperpure silicon and has been a trusted partner of major semiconductor manufacturers for decades. [ ### Company profile ][52] As one of the leading providers of high tech wafer solutions, Siltronic operates globally and maintains production sites in Asia, Europe, and the USA. Silicon wafers form the foundation of the modern semiconductor industry and are the basis for chips used in all areas of digital life – from servers and computers to smartphones, electric vehicles, and wind turbines. Internationally positioned and close to customers, the company consistently focuses on quality, technology, innovation, and operational excellence. Siltronic AG employs around 4,300 people worldwide and has been listed in the Prime Standard of the German Stock Exchange since 2015. Siltronic AG shares are included in the MDAX and TecDAX indices. [About Siltronic AG][53] [ #### Products Find out more about our extensive product portfolio. ][54] [ #### Sites Siltronic AG is manufacturing in Asia, Europe and the USA. ][55] [ #### Career Become a part of Siltronic’s success story by applying now. ][56] [ 07/30/2026, 07.00 am (CET/CETS) #### Wafer demand supports 2026 sales outlook Sales in H1 2026 at EUR 628.1 million (H1 2025: EUR 674.8 million) below previous-year level due to negative FX effects and the SD line closure; Q2 2026 sales… ][57] [ 07/24/2026, 02.10 pm (CET/CETS) #### Supervisory Board of Siltronic AG resolves early contract extension for Klaus Buchwald as COO Munich, July 24, 2026 – At its meeting today, the Supervisory Board of Siltronic AG extended the Executive Board contract of COO Klaus Buchwald, originally… ][58] [ 06/22/2026, 10.00 am (CET/CETS) #### Siltronic returns to the MDAX Munich, June 22, 2026 – As of today, the Siltronic AG share has been readmitted to the MDAX stock index. This follows the positive development of its… ][59] [ Press releases ][60] [ ### The Siltronic share - a top performing MDAX and TecDAX share ][61] Siltronic AG has been listed on the stock market since 2015, and was included on the TecDAX just a few months after the IPO and is a member of the MDAX. [Find out more][62] [ ### Careers at Siltronic ][63] As a technology leader and one of the world’s top manufacturers of silicon wafers, Siltronic offers excellent career opportunities. We are always looking for new, highly motivated colleagues who want to help us shape the future of semiconductor technology. Are you a young professional having completed your education or training, a university graduate, or a highly qualified expert looking for new challenges with excellent prospects? Let’s meet soon! [Find out more][64] [ #### Professionals ][65] [ #### Students and Graduates ][66] [ #### Siltronic as an employer ][67] * [Imprint][68] * [Privacy protection][69] * [Legal notice][70] creation: [599media GmbH][71] [[LinkedIn - Logo]LinkedIn][72][[Xing - Logo]LinkedIn][73] #### Your cookie settings We use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue without changing your settings, we'll assume that you are happy to receive all cookies from this website. Read more in our [privacy policy][74]. Manage settings Reject all Accept all #### Your cookie settings We use cookies to ensure that we give you the best experience on our website. If you continue without changing your settings, we'll assume that you are happy to receive all cookies from this website. Read more in our [privacy policy][75]. Categories External Media Streaming Services Determines whether the service and its cookies are enabled or not. Our website may contain elements from external sources. It should be noted that we have no influence on whether operators of other websites comply with the applicable data protection provisions. For more information on the individual providers, please refer to the detailed information. Show detailed information The providers using cookies on this site are listed below. Where possible, you can choose t