uality & certifications][115] * [Digital manufacturing][116] [View all manufacturing][117] * Design support * [GF Connect customer portal ][118] * [MIPS Atlas portal ][119] * [GlobalSolutions™ ecosystem][120] * [Value-added partner program][121] * [Process design kits (PDK)][122] * [Resource center][123] [View all design support][124] * About GF * [Company overview][125] * [Leadership][126] * Innovation * [GF Accelerate][127] * [GF Labs][128] * [University partnerships][129] * [View all][130] * [Sustainability & responsibility][131] * [Community impact][132] * [Suppliers][133] * [Public policy engagement][134] * [Risk & business continuity management][135] * [Contact us][136] * News & events * [News][137] * [Blog][138] * [Events][139] * [Media contacts][140] * [Media library][141] [View all news & events][142] * Careers * [Life at GF][143] * [Early career][144] * [Professional opportunities][145] * [Recruiting & career events][146] * Where we work * [North America][147] * [EMEA][148] * [APAC][149] * [All locations][150] * [Search jobs ][151] [View all careers][152] * [Investors (opens in a new tab)][153] * Login * [GF Connect portal][154] * [MIPS Atlas portal][155] * [Supplier portal][156] # GF signs $300 million LOI with U.S. Department of Commerce to accelerate U.S. silicon photonics # leadership The expected award from the CHIPS Research and Development Office will accelerate research and development of next-generation silicon photonics — the optical technology that underpins the AI and high-performance computing data centers. [Read more: GF signs $300 million LOI with U.S. Department of Commerce to accelerate U.S. silicon photonics leadership][157] ## 2026 Sustainability Report Our 12th annual report covers GF’s progress across climate, safety, resource conservation, our people and the supply chain, and how we’ll keep growing responsibly. [Read report][158] ## GF qualifies SLATE advanced packaging technology Production readiness of SLATE^{™} wafer-to-wafer bonding technology on our industry-leading 9SW radio–frequency silicon-on-insulator (RF-SOI) platform delivers advanced 3D integration (3DI) for compact, high-performance cellular front-ends [Read more: GF qualifies SLATE advanced packaging technology][159] ## How GF is bringing RF GaN to system-level reality Our GaN-on-silicon approach combines the performance advantages of GaN with the cost advantages and volume of 200mm silicon manufacturing [Read more: How GF is bringing RF GaN to system-level reality][160] News GF signs $300 million LOI with U.S. Department of Commerce to accelerate U.S. silicon photonics leadership Sustainability & responsibility 2026 Sustainability Report News GF qualifies SLATE advanced packaging technology Insights How GF is bringing RF GaN to system-level reality ## Technologies * Advanced packaging * CMOS * Power * Quantum technology * RF * Silicon photonics * MIPS ### Advanced packaging Compact, high-performance, energy-efficient systems with 2.5D/3D, W2W and D2W bonding and interposer-based architectures to support next-generation heterogeneous integration [Learn more: Advanced packaging][161] ### CMOS Delivering power efficiency and performance with competitive PPA, leading RF and application-optimized features, enabling always-on, responsive intelligent systems at the edge and beyond [FDX™ FD-SOI][162] [Feature-rich CMOS][163] [FinFET][164] ### Power BCD and power GaN solutions deliver high power density, efficiency and integrated reliability, enabling scalable power architectures across consumer and industrial applications [BCD][165] [Power GaN][166] ### Quantum technology We bridge quantum from research to deployable systems with scalable semiconductor technologies, advanced manufacturing and system-level integration. [Learn more: Quantum technology][167] ### RF High performance, signal power and reliability for mobile, automotive, infrastructure and aerospace and defense applications [RF-SOI][168] [SiGe][169] [RF GaN][170] ### Silicon photonics Energy-efficient optical connectivity supporting today’s pluggables and the transition of co-packaged optics built on a scalable, production-proven platform that enables high-bandwidth optical interconnects [Learn more: Silicon photonics][171] ### MIPS MIPS, a GlobalFoundries company, delivers the virtual platforms, standards-based compute and ASSP design capabilities for making software into silicon [Visit site (opens in a new tab)][172] ## Manufacturing excellence, globally & locally ### Malta, New York GF Malta is a highly-automated manufacturing site and our global headquarters, delivering advanced semiconductor technologies for high-performance, security‑critical applications. [Learn more: Malta, New York][173] ### Burlington, Vermont The GF Burlington site is a global center of excellence for RF and GaN technologies, with decades of expertise supporting high‑performance connectivity and power applications. [Learn more: Burlington, Vermont][174] ### Dresden, Germany GF Dresden is one of Europe’s most productive and modern semiconductor manufacturing sites, delivering reliable, high‑volume technologies for long‑lifecycle applications. [Learn more: Dresden, Germany][175] ### Singapore The GF Singapore site is a high-mix, high‑volume manufacturing hub supporting advanced specialty technologies for automotive, smart mobile devices, industrial, photonics and connectivity markets worldwide. [Learn more: Singapore][176] ### Guangzhou, China China is one of the world’s largest and fastest growing semiconductor markets with a highly innovative industry and skilled talent pool. We are committed to supporting China’s growing ecosystem. [Learn more: Guangzhou, China][177] ## Serving diverse markets with essential technologies Aerospace & defense Automotive Data center & communications infrastructure Home & industrial IoT Smart mobile devices ### Aerospace & defense The future of defense will be more reliant than ever on semiconductors. We deliver the silicon innovations that make next-generation capabilities possible on land, at sea, in the air, in Earth’s orbit and beyond. [Learn more: Aerospace & defense][178] ### Automotive With a proven portfolio of automotive‑grade technologies, we power the performance, safety and efficiency automakers need to build the next generation of intelligent, software‑defined vehicles. [Learn more: Automotive][179] ### Data center & communications infrastructure We are at the forefront of enabling fast, efficient data transmission and high-efficiency power delivery within and across data centers and communications infrastructure. Our advanced solutions are shaping the future of modern connectivity while meeting the growing demands for bandwidth and power. [Learn more: Data center & communications infrastructure][180] ### Home & industrial IoT Our advanced solutions enable smarter, more capable devices that improve everyday life and redefine possibilities in home, industry, retail & logistics and healthcare. [Learn more: Home & industrial IoT][181] ### Smart mobile devices The world of smart mobile devices is evolving rapidly, driven by the need for enhanced user experiences, better connectivity and new form factors like smart glasses. We are at the forefront of this transformation, providing advanced solutions for enhanced imaging, display, RF, imaging and display. [Learn more: Smart mobile devices][182] ## Latest news & insights [News & events][183] * [Stretching the antenna: Advanced antenna tuning with 9SW and SLATE™ advanced packaging technology on 9SW][Stretching the antenna: Advanced antenna tuning with 9SW and SLATE™ advanced packaging technology on 9SW] Aug 11, 2026", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "GlobalFoundries — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: GlobalFoundries is a foundry that manufactures semiconductors for other companies, but it builds the chips itself. | Provides foundry services for various semiconductor applications. | United States | USA", "