reer ][82]\n  * [ back ][83]\n  * [ Career ][84]\n  * [ Starting work at Jenoptik ][85]\n  * [ Jenoptik as an employer ][86]\n  * [ Partners ][87]\n  * [ Job offers ][88]\n  * [ Events ][89]\n* Search\n  search [ Close ][90]\n\nNew CEO for Jenoptik\n\nDr. Dominic Dorfner was appointed to become the new CEO of JENOPTIK AG. He will assume the position\nin August 2026.\n* [\n  \n  ## Significant increase in orders and earningsHalf-year results\n  * Strong order intake momentum, particularly in OEM businesses\n  * Revenue slightly above prior year; profitability significantly improved\n  * Guidance for 2026 specified\n  \n  learn more\n  \n  ][91]\n* [\n  \n  ## Advanced solutions for life sciences and medical technology\n  \n  Mastering challenges in diagnostics and therapy for a better future.\n  \n  more\n  \n  ][92]\n* [\n  \n  ## Optical systems for semiconductor equipment\n  \n  From individual modules to complete systems – we're your experienced partner for advanced,\n  high-quality semiconductor equipment manufacturing.\n  \n  discover more\n  \n  ][93]\n* [\n  \n  ## High-tech fab in Dresden, Germany\n  \n  Manufacturing micro-optics for the semiconductor equipment industry\n  \n  discover more\n  \n  ][94]\n* [\n  \n  ## Safe actions save lives\n  \n  Driver inattention and speeding are major causes of crashes in work zones.\n  \n  Discover our traffic law enforcement solutions that help keep work zones safe for all road users.\n  \n  explore\n  \n  ][95]\nPrev Next\n\n# About Jenoptik\n\nWe are a global technology group operating in the photonics market. Our growth areas inclu"}}, "page_text": "Dear user, your browser has JavaScript turned off or an installed extension (for example, NoScript) is blocking the execution of Javascript. If you want to use our services without restriction, please enable Javascript in your browser settings. Thank you for your understanding. [ColorRay] ** [Logo: Jenoptik - More Light] ** * [ Blog ][1] * [ Contact Form ][2] * [ Purch