it’s proven. [ Explore Lam ][98] [►][99] [▐▐][100] ## Breakthrough isn’t just a product. It’s a process. Making semiconductors is a highly complex and iterative process. And as technology gets smaller, we think bigger meeting the challenges of precision control at the atomic scale. For every innovative product you see, we’re already thinking… what’s next? [View Products][101] Your browser doesn’t support HTML5 video tag. ## Together we go further Everyone at Lam is a deep listener, in tune with what customers, suppliers, and key stakeholders in the entire ecosystem expect. And in turn, we’ve created an environment based on effective communication, implicit trust, and past success. [ VIEW CUSTOMER SUPPORT ][102] [►][103] [▐▐][104] ## News & Events ### Lam Blog Learn about our company, people, and products. [**View Blog Posts >>**][105] ### Press Releases Read the latest news. [**View Press Releases >>**][106] ### Events Stay up-to-date with our activities. [**View Event Calendar >>**][107] ## Find your next role Job Title or Keyword Function Select one [ ][108] [Select one][109] [Administration][110] [Business Development][111] [Business Operations][112] [Customer Support][113] [Electrical Engineering][114] [Engineering/Technology][115] [Environmental Health and Safety / Facilities][116] [Field Process Engineering][117] [Field Service Engineering][118] [Finance/Accounting][119] [Human Resources][120] [Information Systems][121] [Legal][122] [Logistics][123] [Manufacturing][124] [Marketing/Public Relations/Communications][125] [Mechanical Engineering][126] [Operations][127] [Process Engineering][128] [Product Engineering][129] [Program and Project Management][130] [Quality Engineering][131] [Sales/Account Management][132] [Software Engineering][133] [Supply Chain][134] [Technician][135] [Technical Support][136] [Test Engineering][137] Region Select one [ ][138] [Select one][139] [Austria][140] [China][141] [France][142] [India][143] [Italy][144] [Japan][145] [Malaysia]