* [\n    Global Manufacturing\n    ][50]\n  * [\n    Supply Chain Management\n    ][51]\n  * [\n    Digital IoT and IIoT\n    ][52]\n  * [\n    Product Lifecycle Management Services\n    ][53]\n  * [\n    Machine Vision Cables & Optical Technologies\n    ][54]\n  * [\n    Flex Faraday Xtreme™: EMI Shielded Flexible Circuit\n    ][55]\n  * [\n    Rapid Prototyping\n    ][56]\n  * [\n    Product Lifecycle Solutions and Repair\n    ][57]\n  * [\n    Product Testing\n    ][58]\n  * [\n    Intercon 1\n    ][59]\n* [\n  Quality\n  ][60]\n* [\n  Insights\n  ][61]\n* [\n  About Nortech\n  ][62]\n  * [\n    Company News\n    ][63]\n  * [\n    Contact Nortech\n    ][64]\n* [\n  ][65]\n[ Contact ][66]\n\n# A Strategic Partner for Complex Electro-Mechanical Engineering and Manufacturing with Rugged\n# Reliability\n\nNortech is an interconnect innovator and world-class global electronics manufacturing services (EMS)\npartner for complex, rugged, high-density PCBs, flex and rigid-flex circuits, custom molded cable\nassemblies and full system builds. We leverage our expertise in engineering, supply chain,\nfulfillment, and lifecycle management, with a global manufacturing footprint, to deliver proven\nelectro-mechanical and interconnect solutions. Develop the next generation of products with Nortech\nas your strategic EMS partner.\n\n[ Explore Our Solutions ][67]\n\n# A Strategic Partner for Complex Electro-Mechanical Engineering and Manufacturing with Rugged\n# Reliability\n\nNortech is an interconnect innovator and world-class global electronics manufacturing services (EMS)\npartner for complex, rugged, high-density PCBs, flex and rigid-flex circuits, complex cable\nassemblies, and full system builds. We leverage our expertise in engineering, supply chain,\nfulfillment, and lifecycle management, with a global manufacturing footprint, to deliver proven\nelectro-mechanical and interconnect solutions. Develop the next generation of products with Nortech\nas your strategic EMS partner.\n\n[ Click here ][68]\n\n## Nortech Solutions\n\n[ [Nortech Global Manufacturing] ][69]\n\n### [Global Manufacturing][70]\n\nLeveraging resources through "}}, "page_text": "* [RESOURCES][1] * [Locations][2] * [Glossary][3] * [Nortech Brand Standards][4] * [INVESTOR RELATIONS][5] * [Corporate Profile][6] * [Stock Quote][7] * [Governance][8] * [SEC Filings][9] * [CAREERS][10] * [RESOURCES][11] * [Locations][12] * [Glossary][13] * [Nortech Brand Standards][14] * [INVESTOR RELATIONS][15] * [Corporate Profile][16] * [Stock Quote][17] * [Governance][18] * [SEC Filings][19] * [CAREERS][20] * [ Medical Device ][21] * [ Medical Engineering & Design ][22] * [ Medical Interconnect Solutions ][23] * [ Medical PCB Assemblies ][24] * [ Medical Device Box Build ][25] * [ Aerospace & Defense ][26] * [ Aerospace & Defense Interconnect Solutions ][27] * [ Molded Cable Assemblies ][28] * [ Flat Molded Cable Assemblies ][29] * [ Underwater, Subsea, Marine Cable Assemblies ][30] * [ Fiber Optic Cable Assemblies ][31] * [ RF Cable Assemblies ][32] * [ Data and Vision Cable Assemblies ][33] * [ Mechanical and Harness Assemblies ][34] * [ Terminations and Assemblies ][35] * [ Backshells, Housings and Connectors ][36] * [ Aerospace & Defense PCB Assemblies ][37] * [ Aerospace and Defense Quality Compliance and Test Capabilities ][38] * [ Aerospace & Defense Tooling Design, Testing, Prototyping ][39] * [ Industrial ][40] * [ Industrial Engineering & Design ][41] * [ Industrial Interconnect Solutions ][42] * [ Industrial PCB Assembly Solutions ][43] * [ Fiber Optic Capabilities ][44] * [ Active Optical Xtreme® ][45] * [ Expanded Beam Xtreme® ][46] * [ MTP/MPO Connector Cables & Ferrules ][47] * [ Power Over Fiber Systems ][48] * [ Solutions ][49] * [ Global Manufacturing ][50] * [ Supply Chain Management ][51] * [ Digital IoT and IIoT ][52] * [ Product Lifecycle Management Services ][53] * [ Machine Vision Cables & Optical Technologies ][54] * [ Flex Faraday Xtreme™: EMI Shielded Flexible Circuit ][55] * [ Rapid Prototyping ][56] * [ Product Lifecycle Solutions and Repair ][57] * [ Product Testing ][58] * [ Intercon 1 ][59] * [ Quality ][60] * [ Insights ][61] * [ About Nortech ][62] * [ Company News ][63] * [ Contact Nortech ][64] * [ ][65] [ Contact ][66] # A Strategic Partner for Complex Electro-Mechanical Engineering and Manufacturing with Rugged # Reliability Nortech is an interconnect innovator and world-class global electronics manufacturing services (EMS) partner for complex, rugged, high-density PCBs, flex and rigid-flex circuits, custom molded cable assemblies and full system builds. We leverage our expertise in engineering, supply chain, fulfillment, and lifecycle management, with a global manufacturing footprint, to deliver proven electro-mechanical and interconnect solutions. Develop the next generation of products with Nortech as your strategic EMS partner. [ Explore Our Solutions ][67] # A Strategic Partner for Complex Electro-Mechanical Engineering and Manufacturing with Rugged # Reliability Nortech is an interconnect innovator and world-class global electronics manufacturing services (EMS) partner for complex, rugged, high-density PCBs, flex and rigid-flex circuits, complex cable assemblies, and full system builds. We leverage our expertise in engineering, supply chain, fulfillment, and lifecycle management, with a global manufacturing footprint, to deliver proven electro-mechanical and interconnect solutions. Develop the next generation of products with Nortech as your strategic EMS partner. [ Click here ][68] ## Nortech Solutions [ [Nortech Global Manufacturing] ][69] ### [Global Manufacturing][70] Leveraging resources through a global network of centers of excellence, operations, and shared services with the ability to scale production and respond quickly to changes in demand. [ [Nortech Engineering & Design] ][71] ### [Engineering & Design][72] Early engagement is key to designing for manufacturability, regulatory approval, and speed to market. Along with our program management expertise, we will meet your time and budget constraints. [ [fiber optic capabilities from Nortech Bemidji] ][73] ### [Fiber Optic][74] Fiber optic cable technology delivers power, control, and data with less cable and processor space. Customized to connect intelligent devices across longer distances. [ [Nortech endoscope held by a medical professional] ][75] ### [Product Lifecycle Management][76] Providing support from pencil sketch to product launch, from inventory planning to post market services. [ [Nortech box build] ][77] ### [Complex, Integrated Box Builds & Assemblies][78] Nortech specializes in integrated box-build assemblies in an FDA-registered facility which includes a clean room. Our services extend to creating enclosures, custom fixtures, and higher-level assemblies. [ [Nortech printed circuit board assembly (pbca)] ][79] ### [Printed Circuit Board Assemblies][80] Low volume/high mix production environments allow for PCB assembly solutions that are flexible and scalable. [ [Nortech Custom Cable & Harness Assemblies] ][81] ### [Custom Cable & Harness Assemblies][82] Partnering with clients to develop, manufacture, and service wire, cable, fiber optic and complex harness products for mission-critical applications worldwide. [ [Supply chain demand forecasting graphic] ][83] ### [Supply Chain Management][84] Creating strategic partnerships with our customers and suppliers to manage commodities and level production for optimal inventory availability. ### Nortech Systems is a strategic partner providing highly customized solutions built on quality, ### performance and innovation in engineering and manufacturing. [ Strategic Demand Planning Increase inventory availability and accurate revenue actualization by creating a strategic partnership. We collaborate with you to create an accurate demand plan, level production, and lifecycle management, and incorporate a domestic and global view of supply chain risks. Learn More ][85] [ New Product Engineering and Design Nortech's in-house engineers utilize a concept-to-product development process that builds on our strong application and manufacturing experience. We bring new products to market quickly and efficiently while meeting stringent safety and quality standards. Our team's expertise consistently produces reliable, high-quality products. Learn More ][86] [ Flexible and Robust Quality System Nortech Systems has a long and successful history of working with customers at all development levels – from startups to mature product manufacturers. We have a flexible yet robust quality management system. Our system ensures our products and services meet customer specifications and exceed expectations for all quality workmanship requirements. Learn More ][87] ## Markets We Serve [Jay Miller, President & CEO of Nortech | About Nortech] > \"At Nortech, our mission is to deliver exceptional value by solving complex challenges with > innovative, customized engineering, design, manufacturing and data management for the critical > markets we serve.\" > > Jay Miller > President & CEO ## Insights [PCB manufacturing optimization] ### [Design For Manufacturability: Reducing Cost and Risk in Complex PCBAs][88] As printed circuit board assemblies (PCBAs) become more complex, the gap between design and manufacturability continues to widen.... [Read More »][89] [Fiber Optic Connection_Power Over Fiber] ### [How Power Over Fiber Works][90] As engineers evaluate alternatives to traditional copper-based power delivery, the biggest question is how Power Over Fiber works?... [Read More »][91] ### [Ruggedized Fiber Optic Connectivity][92] In mission-critical environments, the integrity of data transmission hinges on the choice of fiber optic connectors. Discover how... [Read More »][93] [A Power Over Fiber billboard in Times Square highlights a modern approach to power and data transmission using optical fiber instead of copper cabling.] ### [Power Over Fiber: A Better Approach for EMI-Sensitive Systems][94] Are you getting frustrated with the cost of copper? Power Over Fiber offers a fundamentally different approach that... [Read More »][95] Load More Nortech Systems is a leading provider of design and manufacturing solutions for complex electromedical devices, electromechanical systems, assemblies, and components. Its manufacturing and supply chain capabilities are vertically integrated around wire, cable, and interconnect assemblies, printed circuit board assemblies, as well as system-level assembly, integration, and final test. Headquartered in Maple Grove, Minn., Nortech currently has six manufacturing locations and design centers across the U.S., Latin America, and Asia. Nortech Systems is traded on the NASDAQ Stock Market under the symbol NSYS. [ Linkedin ][96] [ Facebook ][97] [ Youtube ][98] ## Capabilities * [Global Manufacturing Solutions][99] * [Fiber Optic Cables][100] * [Digital IoT and IIoT][101] * [Medical Imaging & Devices][102] * [Aerospace & Defense EMS Solutions][103] * [Industrial & Commercial Manufacturing][104] * [Global Manufacturing Solutions][105] * [Fiber Optic Cables][106] * [Digital IoT and IIoT][107] * [Medical Imaging & Devices][108] * [Aerospace & Defense EMS Solutions][109] * [Industrial & Commercial Manufacturing][110] ## Quick Links * [Solutions][111] * [Careers][112] * [Investor Relations][113] * [News & Media][114] * [Quality Management][115] * [CMMC Certification][116] * [About Nortech][117] * [Solutions][118] * [Careers][119] * [Investor Relations][120] * [News & Media][121] * [Quality Management][122] * [CMMC Certification][123] * [About Nortech][124] ## Contact [Main: 952.345.2244][125] [US. Toll Free: 800.808.8281][126] [Contact Us Today][127] [ 7550 Meridian Circle N, Suite 150 Maple Grove, MN 55369 USA][128] **[Terms of Use & Privacy Policy][129] | ****[Terms & Conditions – Suppliers][130] | ****[Terms & Conditions – Customers][131] | ****[Accessibility Statement][132]