 Transport][15] * [Vertical Gradient Freeze][16] * [Chemical Vapor Deposition and Infiltration ][17] * [Chemical Vapor Deposition][18] * [Chemical Vapor Infiltration][19] * [Fluidized Bed Process][20] * [Sintering ][21] * [High Pressure Sintering][22] * [Vacuum Sintering][23] * [Diffusion Bonding ][24] * [Brazing ][25] * [Purification ][26] * [Fluoride Ion Cleaning][27] * [Graphite Purification][28] * [Plasma Surface Treatment ][29] * [Pulse Plasma Nitriding][30] * [Plasma Frontend][31] * [Plasma Backend][32] * [Atmospheric Plasma Cleaning][33] * [Plasma Cleaning and Activation][34] [Innovations][35] [News & Events][36] [Locations][37] [Imprint][38] [ Corporate ][39] * [ Industries ][40] * [ Semiconductor ][41] * [ Energy ][42] * [ Aerospace & Defense ][43] * [ Automotive ][44] * [ Medical ][45] [Innovations][46] [News & Events][47] [Locations][48] [Imprint][49] [ Corporate ][50] * [ Services ][51] * Life Cycle Service * [Service Level Agreement ][52] * [First Level Support ][53] * [Spare Parts Management ][54] * [Preventive Measures ][55] * [Preventive Inspection][56] * [Training][57] * [Service Level Agreement][58] * [System Upgrades ][59] * Contract Service * [Vacuum Processing ][60] * [Vacuum Brazing][61] * [Diffusion Bonding][62] * [Vacuum Heat Treatment][63] * [Engineering][64] * [Metrology Services ][65] * [Scanning Acoustic Microscopy][66] * [Scanning Infrared Depolarization][67] * [Plasma Application and Process Support ][68] [Innovations][69] [News & Events][70] [Locations][71] [Imprint][72] [ Corporate ][73] * [ Career ][74] * [ Overview ][75] * [ Open Positions ][76] [Innovations][77] [News & Events][78] [Locations][79] [Imprint][80] [ Corporate ][81] [ Corporate ][82] EN DE CN TW KR * Products & Technologies * Metrology * Wafer Inspection * [Scanning Acoustic Microscopy][83] * [Scanning InfraRed Depolarization][84] * [Hyperspectral Vision][85] * [Ellipsometry][86] * [Vapor Phase Decomposition][87] * [Power Device Inspection][88] * [Advanced Packaging Inspection][89] * [Volume Inspection][90] * [Thin Film Inspection][91] * Material Solutions * Crystal Growth * [Czochralski Process][92] * [Float Zone][93] * [Physical Vapor Transport][94] * [Vertical Gradient Freeze][95] * Chemical Vapor Deposition and Infiltration * [Chemical Vapor Deposition][96] * [Chemical Vapor Infiltration][97] * [Fluidized Bed Process][98] * Sintering * [High Pressure Sintering][99] * [Vacuum Sintering][100] * [Diffusion Bonding][101] * [Brazing][102] * Purification * [Fluoride Ion Cleaning][103] * [Graphite Purification][104] * Plasma Surface Treatment * [Pulse Plasma Nitriding][105] * [Plasma Frontend][106] * [Plasma Backend][107] * [Atmospheric Plasma Cleaning][108] * [Plasma Cleaning and Activation][109] * Industries * [Semiconductor][110] * [Energy][111] * [Aerospace & Defense][112] * [Automotive][113] * [Medical][114] * Services * Life Cycle Service * [Service Level Agreement][115] * [First Level Support][116] * [Spare Parts Management][117] * Preventive Measures * [Preventive Inspection][118] * [Training][119] * [Service Level Agreement][120] * [System Upgrades][121] * Contract Service * Vacuum Processing * [Vacuum Brazing][122] * [Diffusion Bonding][123] * [Vacuum Heat Treatment][124] * [Engineering][125] * Metrology Services * [Scanning Acoustic Microscopy][126] * [Scanning Infrared Depolarization][127] * [Plasma Application and Process Support][128] * Career * [Overview][129] * [Open Positions][130] Highly specialised - Globally established Evolve Future Technologies. [Products & Technologies][131] [Abstract blue digital landscape with glowing grid lines extending into the distance and particles floating against a dark, futuristic sky] TECHNOLOGY THAT SHAPES THE FUTURE ## INSPIRED BY VISION. LEAD BY TECH. We are a leading international high-tech company specializing in metrology and material solutions. We develop and manufacture innovative systems for the production, refinement, and inspection of advanced materials − serving industries from semiconductors to aerospace technology. With our cutting-edge solutions, we enable progress for our customers by making their processes more efficient, precise, and sustainable – giving them a decisive competitive advantage. High performance Systems for future key industries ## Products & Technologies At PVA TePla, we develop and manufacture customized systems for high‑precision material production, refinement, and processing. We also provide advanced solutions for the acoustic, chemical, and optical inspection and analysis of materials and components. Our portfolio of products and technologies enables efficient, reliable, and scalable high‑quality production. [Abstract blue-toned digital landscape with glowing data connections and floating hexagonal cells, each displaying a key visual representing PVA TePla’s technologies] [ Products & Technologies ][132] [Group of PVA employees in a modern office or meeting room, engaged in conversation. Several people wear dark blue PVA shirts, with presentation boards and large windows in the background] ## About PVA TEPLA PVA TePla AG combines technological foresight with a strong sense of responsibility - to our customers, our people, and the planet. As a publicly listed company with global operations and German roots, we foster a culture of innovation, sustainability, and long-term value creation. Our mission: to shape the future through knowledge, collaboration, and integrity. [Find out more][133] [Digital stock market chart with glowing financial data on a screen] ## Investor Relations As a global technology group specializing in Metrology and Material Solutions, PVA TePla is driven by innovation, sustainable growth, and transparent communication. It is our commitment to keep our shareholders, analysts, and all stakeholders comprehensively and up-to-date informed about our corporate development, share performance, strategic direction, and future prospects at any time. [Find out more][134] [PVA TePla_People walking inside the PVA TePla production hall] ## Career At PVA TePla, you’ll be part of an international team developing innovative solutions for the future. We offer a modern work environment where your ideas are valued and where you can take on responsibility from day one. With us, you’ll find room to grow—both personally and professionally—alongside colleagues who share your curiosity and drive. Discover new perspectives, expand your skills, and contribute to exciting projects. [Find out more][135] [Sunlit landscape with green fields, water ponds, and distant hills] ## Sustainability We create value by integrating environmental, social and governance (ESG) principles into all areas of our business. Through innovation, we shape sustainable markets and drive solutions for a responsible future. Our commitment to people, climate protection and ethical leadership ensures that our actions make a measurable difference for our customers, employees, partners and society. [Find out more][136] Precision. Innovation. Global Impact. ## News & Events [ View all ][137] [ 08/05/2026 ### PVA TePla Reports Strong Order Intake and Improved Business Performance in the Second Quarter of ### 2026 ][138] [ 07/08/2026 ### PVA TePla and Fraunhofer IISB Establish Joint Lab for Aluminum Nitride Substrates ][139] [ 06/16/2026 ### PVA TePla AG: Annual General Meeting Confirms Growth Path ][140] [ 05/07/2026 ### PVA TePla off to a strong start to the year. Order intake in the first quarter of 2026 at record levels ][141] [ 08/19/2026 ### Automation Taipei Taiwan, Taipei, booth P1431 ][142] [ 08/25/2026 ### Jefferies Semiconductor, IT Hardware & Communications Technology Conference ][143] [ 09/01/2026 ### China MedTech China, Shanghai, booth 3A201 ][144] [ 09/02/2026 ### Semicon Taiwan Taiwan, Taipei, booth I3010 ][145] [ Corporate ][146] [Certification][147] [Imprint][148] [Privacy Policy][149] [General Terms & Conditions][150] [Cookie settings][151] © PVA TePla AG 2026 [Innovations][152] [News & Even