gh-pressure-sintering/ [23]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/sintering/vacuum-sintering/ [24]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/diffusion-bonding/ [25]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/brazing/ [26]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/purification/ [27]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/purification/fluoride-ion-cleaning/ [28]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/purification/graphite-purification/ [29]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/plasma-surface-treatment/ [30]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/plasma-surface-treatment/pulse-plasma-nitriding / [31]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/plasma-surface-treatment/plasma-frontend/ [32]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-technologies/plasma-surface-treatment/plasma-backend/ [33]: https://www.pvatepla.com/products-", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "PVA TePla AG — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Manufactures vacuum and plasma systems for semiconductor manufacturing. | PVA TePla provides vacuum and plasma systems used in semiconductor manufacturing, including wafer bonding and cleaning equipment. | Germany | Germany", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "74", "Y Score": "69", "Overall Score": "72", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Teledyne DALSA", "Website": "https://www.teledynedalsa.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Designs and manufactures CCD/CMOS image sensors and provides foundry services.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Teledyne DALSA — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Designs and manufactures CCD/CMOS image sensors, a core semiconductor product.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "teledynedalsa.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "teledynedalsa.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[\n\n# [Teledyne DALSA Logo] | Teledyne DALSA\n\n][1]\n[Log in][2] | [Create profile][3] | [Language][4]\nSearch our website\nToggle navigation\n* [Home][5]\n* [Products ****][6]\n  * #### [Imaging][7]\n    \n    Components & Systems\n    * [Cameras][8]\n      \n      High performance 1D/2D CMOS and CCD cameras.\n    * [3D Sensors][9]\n      \n      High accuracy laser profiling, stereo imaging, and Time-of-Flight sensors and cameras.\n    * [Frame Grabbers][10]\n      \n      Industry-leading image acquisition boards.\n    * [Image Sensors][11]\n      \n      Sensing all the wavelengths since 1980.\n    * [Software][12]\n      \n      From user friendly application software to industrial strength code libraries and SDKs.\n    * [Smart Cameras / Vision Sensors][13]\n      \n      Compact, self-contained vision tools with embedded software.\n    * [Vision Systems - Multicamera][14]\n      \n      Scalable multi-camera systems with embedded software.\n    * [Embedded Vision Systems][15]\n      \n      Scalable multi-camera systems with embedded software.\n    * [Medical & Dental X-Ray][16]\n      \n      Industry-leading low dose CMOS detectors and image processing software for medical and dental\n      applications including fluoroscopy.\n    * [Industrial X-Ray][17]\n      \n      Powerful, innovative detectors and X-Ray generators for NDT and security applications.\n    * [Infrared Detectors][18]\n      \n      Versatile uncooled long-wave infrared sensors for industrial and defense applications.\n    * [Custom Design][19]\n      \n      Made-to-order solutions, from minor tweaks to major engineering.\n    * [» View by Application][20]\n    \n    #### [MEMS & Semiconductors][21]\n    \n    Specialized Semiconductor Services\n    * [MEMS Fabrication][22]\n      \n      One of the world's foremost pure-play MEMS foundries, supporting both 150 mm and 200 mm wafer\n      processes.\n    * [CCD Fabrication][23]\n      \n      Industry-leading manufacturing capability for high-performance CCD fabrication processes.\n    * [» View by Application][24]\n* [Learn ****][25]\n  * [Markets and Applications][26]\n  * [Knowledge Center][27]\n  * [CCD vs CMOS][28]\n  * [White Papers][29]\n  * [Application Notes][30]\n  * [Industry Articles][31]\n  * [Research Papers][32]\n* [Support ****][33]\n  * [Support Overview][34]\n  * [Downloads Center][35]\n  * [Documentation][36]\n  * [Line/Frame Rate Calculators][37]\n  * [Software Registration][38]\n  * [Request Product Support][39]\n  * [Warranty Information][40]\n  * [Legacy Products][41]\n  * [Camera Accessories][42]\n  * [Partner Areas][43]\n* [News ****][44]\n  * [Newsroom][45]\n  * [Tradeshows][46]\n  * [Webinars][47]\n  * [Subscribe to Mailing List][48]\n  * [Industry Articles][49]\n  * [Video Library][50]\n  * [Possibility Hub][51]\n* [Company ****][52]\n  * [Careers at Teledyne DALSA][53]\n  * [Diversity and Inclusion][54]\n  * [Company Profile][55]\n  * [Executive Team][56]\n  * [About Imaging][57]\n  * [About the Foundry][58]\n  * [Quality & Certifications][59]\n  * [Environmental Compliance][60]\n  * [Terms and Conditions][61]\n  * [Privacy Policy][62]\n  * [Cookies Policy][63]\n  * [Website Terms of Use][64]\n  * [Teledyne Technologies][65]\n* [Contact ****][66]\n  * [Contact Sales][67]\n  * [Office Locations][68]\n  * [How to Buy][69]\n  * [Find a Distributor][70]\n  * [Request for Credit Account][71]\n  * [Customer Complaint Resolution][72]\n  * [Website Feedback][73]\n* [Terms and Conditions][74]\n\n# Linea HS2\n\n16K TDI Line Scan Camera, 1 Megahertz Line Rate\n\n[Learn more about Linea HS2][75]\n\n# Introducing Teledyne Vision Solutions\n\nTeledyne DALSA is proud to be part of Teledyne Vision Solutions (TVS), the industry's most\ncomprehensive portfolio of imaging technology.\n\n[Explore Teledyne Vision Solutions][76]\n\n### MEMS Fabrication\n\nFrom prototyping to volume production, our MEMS foundry offers **world-leading 200 mm capabilities**\nfor producing micromachines including intertial sensors, actuators, microphones and micromirrors for\napplications from consumer electronics to automobiles, optical n"}}, "page_text": "[ # [Teledyne DALSA Logo] | Teledyne DALSA ][1] [Log in][2] | [Create profile][3] | [Language][4] Search our website Toggle navigation * [Home][5] * [Products ****][6] * #### [Imaging][7] Components & Systems * [Cameras][8] High performance 1D/2D CMOS and CCD cameras. * [3D Sensors][9] High accuracy laser profiling, stereo imaging, and Time-of-Flight sensors and cameras. * [Frame Grabbers][10] Industry-leading image acquisition boards. * [Image Sensors][11] Sensing all the wavelengths since 1980. * [Software][12] From user friendly application software to industrial strength code libraries and SDKs. * [Smart Cameras / Vision Sensors][13] Compact, self-contained vision tools with embedded software. * [Vision Systems - Multicamera][14] Scalable multi-camera systems with embedded software. * [Embedded Vision Systems][15] Scalable multi-camera systems with embedded software. * [Medical & Dental X-Ray][16] Industry-leading low dose CMOS detectors and image processing software for medical and dental applications including fluoroscopy. * [Industrial X-Ray][17] Powerful, innovative detectors and X-Ray generators for NDT and security applications. * [Infrared Detectors][18] Versatile uncooled long-wave infrared sensors for industrial and defense applications. * [Custom Design][19] Made-to-order solutions, from minor tweaks to major engineering. * [» View by Application][20] #### [MEMS & Semiconductors][21] Specialized Semiconductor Services * [MEMS Fabrication][22] One of the world's foremost pure-play MEMS foundries, supporting both 150 mm and 200 mm wafer processes. * [CCD Fabrication][23] Industry-leading manufacturing capability for high-performance CCD fabrication processes. * [» View by Application][24] * [Learn ****][25] * [Markets and Applications][26] * [Knowledge Center][27] * [CCD vs CMOS][28] * [White Papers][29] * [Application Notes][30] * [Industry Articles][31] * [Research Papers][32] * [Support ****][33] * [Support Overview][34] * [Downloads Center][35] * [Documentation][36] * [Line/Frame Rate Calculators][37] * [Software Registration][38] * [Request Product Support][39] * [Warranty Information][40] * [Legacy Products][41] * [Camera Accessories][42] * [Partner Areas][43] * [News ****][44] * [Newsroom][45] * [Tradeshows][46] * [Webinars][47] * [Subscribe to Mailing List][48] * [Industry Articles][49] * [Video Library][50] * [Possibility Hub][51] * [Company ****][52] * [Careers at Teledyne DALSA][53] * [Diversity and Inclusion][54] * [Company Profile][55] * [Executive Team][56] * [About Imaging][57] * [About the Foundry][58] * [Quality & Certifications][59] * [Environmental Compliance][60] * [Terms and Conditions][61] * [Privacy Policy][62] * [Cookies Policy][63] * [Website Terms of Use][64] * [Teledyne Technologies][65] * [Contact ****][66] * [Contact Sales][67] * [Office Locations][68] * [How to Buy][69] * [Find a Distributor][70] * [Request for Credit Account][71] * [Customer Complaint Resolution][72] * [Website Feedback][73] * [Terms and Conditions][74] # Linea HS2 16K TDI Line Scan Camera, 1 Megahertz Line Rate [Learn more about Linea HS2][75] # Introducing Teledyne Vision Solutions Teledyne DALSA is proud to be part of Teledyne Vision Solutions (TVS), the industry's most comprehensive portfolio of imaging technology. [Explore Teledyne Vision Solutions][76] ### MEMS Fabrication From prototyping to volume production, our MEMS foundry offers **world-leading 200 mm capabilities** for producing micromachines including intertial sensors, actuators, microphones and micromirrors for applications from consumer electronics to automobiles, optical networking equipment to DNA sequencing. [» MEMS fabrication services][77] ### Software From user-friendly application software to industrial strength code libraries and SDKs. Teledyne DALSA offers **powerful**,** easy to use** software to enable your vision applications. Learn more here. [» Vision Software][78] #### News * [ Teledyne Healthcare to showcase cutting-edge imaging innovations at RSNA 2024][79] 2024-11-19 * [ Teledyne unveils a dynamic new website for its Teledyne Vision Solutions group][80] 2024-09-19 * [ Teledyne unveils the first 16k TDI line scan camera with a 1-Megahertz line rate][81] 2024-09-17 [ Visit newsroom][82] #### Careers [ See all career postings][83] [ ###### Products ][84] [ ###### Support ][85] [ ###### Markets & Applications ][86] [ ###### About Us ][87] [ ###### Contact Sales ][88] [Back to top][89] Teledyne DALSA is a global leader in high performance digital imaging and semiconductor technology, headquartered in Waterloo, ON, Canada. ##### Company * [Company Profile][90] * [Executive][91] * [Careers][92] * [News][93] * [Contact Sales][94] * [Teledyne Technologies][95] ##### Products * [Imaging][96] * [MEMS][97] * [Lidar][98] ##### Resources * [Knowledge Center][99] * [Product Support][100] * [Drivers and SDKs][101] * [Software Registration][102] * [Terms and Conditions][103] ###### Connect With Us A Teledyne Technologies company. © 2026 Teledyne Digital Imaging Inc. [Comments? Feedback? Let us know how we're doing.][104] [Privacy Policy][105] | [Cookies Policy][106] | [Website Terms of Use][107] ## Select your language: [English][108] [Françai