s (PDKs)][79] * [IP Solutions][80] * [Design Services][81] * [Design Partners][82] * MANUFACTURING * [Manufacturing Overview][83] * [TPSCo][84] * [TPSCo Overview and History][85] * [TPSCo Manufacturing Facilities][86] * [TPSCo Quality Certificates][87] * [TPSCo Corporate Social Responsibility Principles][88] * [TPSCo Board of Directors][89] * [TPSCo Join Us][90] * [Process Services][91] * [MPW Shuttle Program][92] * [Quality Policy & Certificates][93] * NEWS & EVENTS * [Press Release][94] * [Events][95] * [Branding][96] * [Media Contacts][97] * [INVESTORS][98] * CONTACT * [Sales][99] * [Facilities][100] * [Investor Relations][101] * [Media Relations][102] * ABOUT * [Corporate Overview][103] * [FAQ][104] * [Vision, Mission & Values][105] * [History][106] * [Executive Management][107] * [Board of Directors][108] * [Corporate Social Responsibility (ESG)][109] * [Community Contribution][110] * TECHNOLOGY * [Process Technology Offerings][111] * [RF & HPA][112] * [Power Management][113] * [CMOS Image Sensor][114] * [Display Solutions][115] * [Non Imaging Sensors][116] * [Aerospace & Defense][117] * [Automotive][118] * [Mixed-Signal/CMOS][119] * [Non-Volatile Memory (NVM)][120] * [MEMS][121] * [Research & Develpoment][122] * DESIGN ENABLEMENT * [Design Enablement Overview][123] * [Process Design Kits (PDKs)][124] * [IP Solutions][125] * [Design Services][126] * [Design Partners][127] * MANUFACTURING * [Manufacturing Overview][128] * [TPSCo][129] * [TPSCo Overview and History][130] * [TPSCo Manufacturing Facilities][131] * [TPSCo Quality Certificates][132] * [TPSCo Corporate Social Responsibility Principles][133] * [TPSCo Board of Directors][134] * [TPSCo Join Us][135] * [Process Services][136] * [MPW Shuttle Program][137] * [Quality Policy & Certificates][138] * NEWS & EVENTS * [Press Release][139] * [Events][140] * [Branding][141] * [Media Contacts][142] * [INVESTORS][143] * CONTACT * [Sales][144] * [Facilities][145] * [Investor Relations][146] * [Media Relations][147] ## Cutting-edge imaging solutions customized for your needs ## High-end, state of the art imaging technology with unique and unmatched pixel design flexibility [ Learn More ][148] ## Enabling a New Era of Communication ## Industry-leading RF and HPA technology solutions for wireless communication and infrastructure [ Learn More ][149] ## Where Analog and Value Meet ## Leading the analog ecosystem with full circle value creation [ Learn More ][150] ## An Environment of Innovation ## Moving great ideas into value [ Learn More ][151] ## Our People – Your Success ## Long-term partnerships with strong commitment to customer success [ Learn More ][152] ## [Technology][153] A broad range of advanced customizable and innovative analog process technologies for growing markets such as infrastructure, automotive, mobile, medical, industrial, consumer and aerospace and defense, among others. [ Read More ][154] ## [Manufacturing][155] Worldwide operational footprint with multi-fab production options in three geographic regions, providing global capacity assurance and flexibility with best qualities and manufacturing capabilities. [ Read More ][156] ## [Investors][157] Tower Semiconductor (NASDAQ/TASE: TSEM), focuses on increasing shareholders value by enhancing its strong financial foundation, enabling the Company to pursue and realize its goals and emerging opportunities towards value creation. [ Read More ][158] ## Latest News [ ### Tower Semiconductor to Participate in August and September Investor Conferences ][159] 12 Aug, 2026 [ ### OpenLight and Tower Semiconductor Expand PH18DA Photonics Ecosystem to Accelerate Photonic IC ### Development ][160] 11 Aug, 2026 [ ### Tower Semiconductor Announces Record Results for Revenue and Profitability for the Second ### Quarter 2026 with Third Quarter 2026 Record Revenue Guidance ][161] 4 Aug, 2026 [ ### Tower Semiconductor with METI Support Announces Strategic Capacity Expansion in Japan ][162] 14 Jul, 2026 [ ### Tower Semiconductor Announces Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results and Conference Call ][163] 7 Jul, 2026 [ ### Tower Semiconductor and Marvell Ship Over Five Million Coherent Photonic ICs ][164] 18 Jun, 2026 [ ### IQE and Tower Semiconductor Announce Multi-year InP epiwafer Supply Agreement ][165] 15 Jun, 2026 [ ### Tower Semiconductor Signs Customer Contracts for $1.3 Billion Silicon Photonics Revenue for 2027 ][166] 13 May, 2026 [ ### Tower Semiconductor Reports First Quarter 2026 Financial Results with 15% Year over Year Revenue ### Growth ][167] 13 May, 2026 ## Events [ ### Siemens EDA Forum 2026 China ][168] Aug 13, 2026 [ Read More » ][169] [ ### TGS China 2026 ][170] Sep 08, 2026 [ Read More » ][171] [ ### CIOE China 2026 ][172] Sep 09 - 11, 2026 [ Read More » ][173] [ ### ECOC 2026 ][174] Sep 21 - 23, 2026 [ Read More » ][175] [ ### VISION 2026 ][176] Oct 06 - 08, 2026 [ Read More » ][177] [ ### TGS USA 2026 ][178] Nov 17, 2026 [ Read More » ][179] [ ### ICCAD China 2026 ][180] Nov 19 - 20, 2026 [ Read More » ][181] [ ### OFC 2027 ][182] Mar 09 - 11, 2027 [ Read More » ][183] [ ### APEC 2027 ][184] Mar 09 - 11, 2027 [ Read More » ][185] ## Investor Relations ### [Tower Semiconductor Announces Record Results for Revenue and Profitability for the Second ### Quarter 2026 with Third Quarter 2026 Record Revenue Guidance][186] August 4, 2026 [Press Release][187] [Webcast Link][188] [Conference Call Link][189] [Supporting Slides][190] ### [Tower Semiconductor with METI Support Announces Strategic Capacity Expansion in Japan][191] July 14, 2026 [Frequently Asked Questions – Tower METI PR | July 2026 ][192] ## Upcoming IR Events ### 2026 Jefferies Semiconductor, IT Hardware & Communications Technology Conference **Four Seasons, Chicago** August 25-26, 2026 ### Benchmark – StoneX’s 13th Annual TMT Conference **New York Athletic Club, NY** Sept. 10, 2026 ## What We Do Tower Semiconductor, the leading foundry of high- value analog semiconductor solutions, specializes in manufacturing analog integrated circuits for more than 300 customers worldwide in growing markets such as mobile, infrastructure, automotive, medical, industrial, consumer, and aerospace and defense. [Read More >][193] ## Corporate Social Responsibility Creating a corporate culture that is ethical and moral in every aspect, providing all employees an opportunity to grow as individuals and to thrive, while enriching and improving not only individuals’ lives, but enhancing society as a whole. [Read More >][194] [good deeds day Tower Semiconductor] ###### About * [ Technology ][195] * [ Design Enablement ][196] * [ Manufacturing ][197] * [ News & Events ][198] * [ Investors ][199] ###### Contact Us * [ Careers ][200] * [ Customer Portal ][201] * [ Terms & Conditions ][202] * [ Privacy Policy ][203] ###### © 2026 Tower Semiconductor * [ Accessibility Statement ][204] * [ Employees ][205] * [ Compliance and Ethics Hotline ][206] * [ website: Custom-Sites.com ][207] ###### Follow Us [ Linkedin ][208] [ Facebook ][209] [ Youtube ][210] [ Weixin ][211] Tower Semiconductor websites place cookies on your device to give you the best user experience. By using our websites, you agree to the placement of these cookies. Click to [Learn more][212] [ Accept & Close ][213] [1]: #content [2]: https://portal.towersemi.com/ebiz/ [3]: https://careers.towerjazz.com [4]: / [5]: https://jp.towersemi.com [6]: https://towersemi.com/about/corporate-overview/ [7]: https://towersemi.com/about/faq/ [8]: https://towersemi.com/about/vision-mission-values/ [9]: https://towersemi.com/about/history/ [10]: https://towersemi.com/about/towersemi-executives/ [11]: https://towersemi.com/about/board-of-directors/ [12]: https://towersemi.com/about/corporate-social-responsibility-esg/ [13]: https://towersemi.com/about/community-contribution/ [14]: https://towersemi.com/technology/process-technology-offerings/ [15]: https://towersemi.com/technology/rf-and-hpa/ [16]: https://towersemi.com/technology/power-management/ [17]: https: