ts and E-Ships][22]\n    * [Trains & Traction][23]\n  * Industrial Motor Drives\n    \n    #### [Industrial Motor Drives][24]\n    * [Low Voltage Motor Drives][25]\n    * [Heat Pump & Air Conditioning][26]\n    * [Servo Drives][27]\n  * Renewable Energy\n    \n    #### [Renewable Energy][28]\n    * [Energy Storage Systems][29]\n    * [Fast Charging][30]\n    * [Residential & Light Commercial Solar Systems][31]\n    * [Industrial & Commercial Solar Systems][32]\n    * [Utility Scale Renewable Energy][33]\n  * [Materials Applications][34]\n* [Tools & Support][35]\n* Company\n  \n  ### [Explore Company][36]\n  * [About][37]\n  * [Locations][38]\n  * [Senior Leadership][39]\n  * [Powerful Perspectives][40]\n  * [Quality][41]\n  * [Sustainability][42]\n  * [News][43]\n  * [Events][44]\n* [Careers][45]\n* [Investors][46]\n\nLanguage: English\n* [English][47]\n* [简体中文 - Chinese (Simplified)][48]\n* [繁體中文 - Chinese (Traditional)][49]\n[Contact][50]\nSearchClick to closeClick to closeWhat are you looking for?\nSearch\n[View Cart ][51]\nMain menu navigation\n\n# AI is scaling fast. Can the grid scale with it?\n\nLearn about our role in powering AI with reliable silicon carbide-based solid-state transformers\n\n[Read the Article][52]\n\n# Accelerating industrial e-mobility\n\nLearn how our technology has enabled Stercom to scale grid compatibility pioneered in passenger EV\nV2X applications to power heavy-duty, off-highway, and commercial EVs.\n\n[View Case Study][53]\n\n# Engineering for Outcomes\n\nLearn about the three ways Gen 5 achieves real-world performance\n\n[Read Article][54]\n\n# A New Foundation for Critical Power Conversion\n\nRead how together with Amperesand we are building the cornerstone of tomorrow’s grid\n\n[View case study ][55]\n\n# Designer’s Guide for SiC\n\nThis free virtual half-day event discovers how silicon carbide improves efficiency, boosts\nreliability, increases power density, and extends system life.\n\n[Watch on Demand][56]\n\n# Achieve Unrivaled Amperage Per SiC Area\n\nAn accelerated path to more efficient and compact systems with the latest Gen 5 1200 V MOSFETs\n\n[View Product][57]\n\n# Two Families. One Vision. Powering the applications that power the world\n\nDiscover two new 3.3 kV SiC modules that unlock the full potential of renewable energy across the\nentire energy lifecycle — from generation and storage to conversion and distribution.\n\n[View products][58]\n\n# AI is scaling fast. Can the grid scale with it?\n\nLearn about our role in powering AI with reliable silicon carbide-based solid-state transformers\n\n[Read the Article][59]\n\n# Accelerating industrial e-mobility\n\nLearn how our technology has enabled Stercom to scale grid compatibility pioneered in passenger EV\nV2X applications to power heavy-duty, off-highway, and commercial EVs.\n\n[View Case Study][60]\n\n## The Power to Make It Real™\n\nAt Wolfspeed, we are the creators of the next-generation semiconductor technology that powers the\nworld’s most disruptive innovations. In other words, it’s our job to make humankind’s greatest\nambitions – real.\n\nFor us, making it real means making it the Wolfspeed way. We deliver unparalleled reliability on a\nmassive scale from the first U.S.-based silicon carbide corridor with end-t"}}, "page_text": "Skip to content [[Wolfspeed Logo]][1] ## Main menu navigation * Products ### [Explore Products][2] * [Power Modules][3] * [Discrete MOSFETs][4] * [Discrete Schottky Diodes][5] * [Bare Die MOSFETs][6] * [Bare Die Schottky Diodes][7] * [Reference Designs][8] * [Gate Driver Boards][9] * [Evaluation Kits][10] * [Materials Products][11] * Applications ### [Explore Applications][12] * Artificial Intelligence #### [Artificial Intelligence][13] * [Datacenter & Server Power Supplies][14] * [Uninterruptible Power Supplies][15] * Automotive #### [Automotive][16] * [EV Powertrain][17] * [On-Board Charger][18] * [On-Board DC/DC Converter][19] * E-Mobility #### [E-Mobility][20] * [Commercial, Construction & Agriculture Vehicles][21] * [E-Boats and E-Ships][22] * [Trains & Traction][23] * Industrial Motor Drives #### [Industrial Motor Drives][24] * [Low Voltage Motor Drives][25] * [Heat Pump & Air Conditioning][26] * [Servo Drives][27] * Renewable Energy #### [Renewable Energy][28] * [Energy Storage Systems][29] * [Fast Charging][30] * [Residential & Light Commercial Solar Systems][31] * [Industrial & Commercial Solar Systems][32] * [Utility Scale Renewable Energy][33] * [Materials Applications][34] * [Tools & Support][35] * Company ### [Explore Company][36] * [About][37] * [Locations][38] * [Senior Leadership][39] * [Powerful Perspectives][40] * [Quality][41] * [Sustainability][42] * [News][43] * [Events][44] * [Careers][45] * [Investors][46] Language: English * [English][47] * [简体中文 - Chinese (Simplified)][48] * [繁體中文 - Chinese (Traditional)][49] [Contact][50] SearchClick to closeClick to closeWhat are you looking for? Search [View Cart ][51] Main menu navigation # AI is scaling fast. Can the grid scale with it? Learn about our role in powering AI with reliable silicon carbide-based solid-state transformers [Read the Article][52] # Accelerating industrial e-mobility Learn how our technology has enabled Stercom to scale grid compatibility pioneered in passenger EV V2X applications to power heavy-duty, off-highway, and commercial EVs. [View Case Study][53] # Engineering for Outcomes Learn about the three ways Gen 5 achieves real-world performance [Read Article][54] # A New Foundation for Critical Power Conversion Read how together with Amperesand we are building the cornerstone of tomorrow’s grid [View case study ][55] # Designer’s Guide for SiC This free virtual half-day event discovers how silicon carbide improves efficiency, boosts reliability, increases power density, and extends system life. [Watch on Demand][56] # Achieve Unrivaled Amperage Per SiC Area An accelerated path to more efficient and compact systems with the latest Gen 5 1200 V MOSFETs [View Product][57] # Two Families. One Vision. Powering the applications that power the world Discover two new 3.3 kV SiC modules that unlock the full potential of renewable energy across the entire energy lifecycle — from generation and storage to conversion and distribution. [View products][58] # AI is scaling fast. Can the grid scale with it? Learn about our role in powering AI with reliable silicon carbide-based solid-state transformers [Read the Article][59] # Accelerating industrial e-mobility Learn how our technology has enabled Stercom to scale grid compatibility pioneered in passenger EV V2X applications to power heavy-duty, off-highway, and commercial EVs. [View Case Study][60] ## The Power to Make It Real™ At Wolfspeed, we are the creators of the next-generation semiconductor technology that powers the world’s most disruptive innovations. In other words, it’s our job to make humankind’s greatest ambitions – real. For us, making it real means making it the Wolfspeed way. We deliver unparalleled reliability on a massive scale from the first U.S.-based silicon carbide corridor with end-to-end substrate and power device fabrication to fulfill the world’s growing demand. ## Latest Product Releases [View All Products][61] [ [Composite image of the top & bottom of Wolfspeed's Discrete Silicon Carbide (SiC) MOSFET in a TSC (U2) package.] 1200 V Automotive Qualified SiC MOSFET in Top-Side Cooled package High power dissipation capability in industry-standard TSC package. PPAP capable, optimized for high-voltage DC/DC converters and EV battery chargers. ][62] [ 1200 V Automotive Qualified Bare Die SiC MOSFETs – Gen 4 Qualified for continuous operation at 185°C junction temperature. Optimized for automotive powertrain, motor drives & circuit breakers. ][63] [ [Front & bottom view of the Wolfspeed YM3L silicon carbide power module.] 1200 V Automotive Qualified 6-pack (3-phase) SiC Power Module Family High reliability and easy integration with a direct-cooled Pin Fin baseplate. Optimized for traction inverters in heavy-duty, and agricultural vehicles. ][64] [ [Angled product photo of the front and back of the TO-247-3 package used for Wolfspeed's Discrete Silicon Carbide MOSFETs.] 1700 V Industrial qualified SiC MOSFET Family 30 mΩ RDS(on) family of discrete devices in variety of packaging options. Optimized for solar inverters and switched mode power supplies. ][65] [ [Composite image of the top and bottom of a Wolfspeed discrete silicon carbide MOSFET in a Q (TSC) package.] 1200 V Q-TSC MOSFETs The Q-TSC is a high-creepage, top-side cooled SiC package that delivers lower thermal impedance, enabling superior power dissipation and simplified thermal management. Purpose-built for the demanding power and cooling requirements of AI data center infrastructure. ][66] [ [Product rendering of a Wolfspeed Gen 5 Bare Die Silicon Carbide MOSFET.] Gen 5 1200 V Automotive Bare Die MOSFETs Achieve the utmost conduction efficiency to help meet current density targets. Optimized for traction inverters and solid-state circuit breakers. ][67] [ [Product photo of the the Wolfspeed WolfPACK™ Silicon Carbide Power Module with a high current pin] 3300 V Wolfspeed WolfPACK® SiC Modules The scalable full-bridge baseplate-less modules. Engineered for modularity offering flexibility to configure multi-level, series-stacked, or parallel converter architectures. ][68] [ [Mid-angle product photography of Wolfspeed's LM Power Module] 3300 V Baseplate SiC Modules High-power half-bridge modules for >800 A applications. Optimized for demanding converter topologies used in solar, grid-scale energy storage, and wind-power infrastructure. ][69] [ [Rendering of Wolfspeed's 10000 V Bare Die silicon carbide (SiC) MOSFET] 10000 V Bare Die Silicon Carbide MOSFETs 10 kV bare die MOSFET enables design flexibility, delivering a step function improvement in system’s size, weight, reliability, and cost of ownership. ][70] [ [Composite image of the top and bottom of a Wolfspeed silicon carbide (SiC) power module in a TM package.] Automotive Single Switch Overmolded Power Modules Enhanced power cycling capabilities in industry-standard footprint. Optimized for electric powertrain and traction inverter systems. ][71] [ [Product image of the Wolfspeed Wolfpack SiC Power Module in the FM3 package.] 1200 V Industrial Qualified, Full-Bridge SiC Power Module – Gen 4 17 mΩ module in industry-standard package with an option of pre-applied thermal interface material. Optimized for EV chargers, high-efficiency converters & renewable energy. ][72] [ [Product rendering of three Wolfspeed Silicon Carbide Bare Die MOSFETs.] 2300 V Bare Die Silicon Carbide MOSFETs – Gen 4 Low resistance at operating temperature. Optimized for UPS, renewable energy & medium voltage drives. ][73] [ [Composite image of the top & bottom of Wolfspeed's Discrete Silicon Carbide (SiC) MOSFET in a TSC (U2) package.] 1200 V Automotive Qualified SiC MOSFET in Top-Side Cooled package High power dissipation capability in industry-standard TSC package. PPAP capable, optimized for high-voltage DC/DC converters and EV battery chargers. ][74] [ 1200 V Automotive Qualified Bare Die SiC MOSFETs – Gen 4 Qualified for continuous operation at 185°C junction temperature. Optimized for automotive powertrain, motor drives & circuit breakers. ][75] [ [Front & bottom view of the Wolfspeed YM3L silicon carbide power module.] 1200 V Automotive Qualified 6-pack (3-phase) SiC Power Module Family High reliability and easy integration with a direct-cooled Pin Fin baseplate. Optimized for traction inverters in heavy-duty, and agricultural vehicles. ][76] [ [Angled product photo of the front and back of the TO-247-3 package used for Wolfspeed's Discrete Silicon Carbide MOSFETs.] 1700 V Industrial qualified SiC MOSFET Family 30 mΩ RDS(on) family of discrete devices in variety of packaging options. Optimized for solar inverters and switched mode power supplies. ][77] [ [Composite image of the top and bottom of a Wolfspeed discrete silicon carbide MOSFET in a Q (TSC) package.] 1200 V Q-TSC MOSFETs The Q-TSC is a high-creepage, top-side cooled SiC package that delivers lower thermal impedance, enabling superior power dissipation and simplified thermal management. Purpose-built for the demanding power and cooling requirements of AI data center infrastructure. ][78] [ [Product rendering of a Wolfspeed Gen 5 Bare Die Silicon Carbide MOSFET.] Gen 5 1200 V Automotive Bare Die MOSFETs Achieve the utmost conduction efficiency to help meet current density targets. Optimized for traction inverters and solid-state circuit breakers. ][79] [ [Product photo of the the Wolfspeed WolfPACK™ Silicon Carbide Power Module with a high current pin] 3300 V Wolfspeed WolfPACK® SiC Modules The scalable full-bridge baseplate-less modules. Engineered for modularity offering flexibility to configure multi-level, series-stacked, or parallel converter architectures. ][80] [ [Mid-angle product photography of Wolfspeed's LM Power Module] 3300 V Baseplate SiC Modules High-power half-bridge modules for >800 A applications. Optimized for demanding converter topologies used in solar, grid-scale energy storage, and wind-power infrastructure. ][81] ## Our technology commitment [ [Close-up photo of a red tractor in a snow-covered field. Used to symbolize how Wolfspeed's portfolio is strong and durable.] ### Designed to last, even in the harshest environments We enable our customers to design longer-lasting systems to perform in tough operating environments with products delivering ruggedness at every stage of product life cycle. Learn more ][82] [Three large solar panels set against a green field mid-ground and mountainous background. Image used as an example of our energy storage technology.] ### Designed to comprehensively improve system efficiency We empower our customers to more effectively create, convert and store energy with technology providing higher ampacity while minimizing conduction and switching losses. [Close up image of an electric car that is plugged in and charging. Used to illustrate how our product line enables you to use high quality products without adding to product time.] ### Designed to reduce system cost and development time We equip our customers to pivot to new system architectures to minimize their maintenance costs and production time with clean switching and high-performance devices. ## The Pioneers of Silicon Carbide [ ### About Wolfspeed Wolfspeed continues to lead the industry transition from silicon to silicon carbide across both materials and devices as the world’s only pure-play, vertically integrated silicon carbide company. As the pioneers of silicon carbide, we are committed to powering a better world for everyone. Who We Are ][83] [ ### Product Portfolio Our solutions, including silicon carbide material, Power Modules, Discrete Power Devices and Power Die Products, are helping make cars, planes, renewables, race teams, cities, and everything in between, better, faster, greener, cooler, and more sustainable for billions to live better", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Wolfspeed — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Specializes in wide-bandgap semiconductors, manufactures its own products. | Specializes in wide-bandgap semiconductors for power and RF applications, a key segment of the global semiconductor market. | United States | United States", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "76", "Y Score": "69", "Overall Score": "72", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Cerebras Systems", "Website": "https://www.cerebras.net", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "United States", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Builds wafer-scale AI processors for deep learning.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Cerebras Systems — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Builds wafer-scale AI processors, a semiconductor product.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "cerebras.net", "data": {"company": {"name": "cerebras.net"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n\nProducts\n\n[\nCustomers\n][2][\nPartners\n][3]\n\nDevelopers\n\nResources\n\n[\nPricing\n][4]\n\nCompany\n\n[Contact us][5][Get Started][6]\n[\n\nLovable and Cerebras Partner to Power AI Software Creation. Learn more >>\n\n][7]\n\nFollow\n\nGet Updates\n* [Newsletter Signup][8]\n\nCompany\n* [About Us][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n* [Contact Us][11]\n* [Investor Relations][12]\n* [Website Terms of Use][13]\n* [Privacy Policy][14]\n* [Cookie Policy][15]\n* [Other Terms & Policies][16]\n* [Service Status][17]\n* [Trust Center][18]\n\nNews\n* [Newsroom][19]\n* [In the News][20]\n* [Press kit][21]\n\nInsights\n* [Customer Spotlight][22]\n* [Blog][23]\n* [Publications][24]\n* [Whitepapers][25]\n\nPerformance comparisons are based on third-party benchmarking or internal testing. Observed\ninference speed improvements versus GPU-based systems may vary depending on workload, configuration,\ndate and models being tested.\n\n[info@cerebras.ai][26]\n\n1237 E. Arques Ave Sunnyvale, CA 94085\n\n© 2026 Cerebras.\nAll rights reserved.\n\n# The World’s Fastest AI Runs on The World’s Biggest chip\n\n#### The Cerebras Wafer-Scale Engine is purpose-built for ultra-fast AI. It is 58x larger and 15x\n#### faster than GPUs. Designed for builders who want to do extraordinary things.\n\n[Learn more][27]\n\n## Cerebras and Lovable Power Faster AI Software Creation\n\n### The world’s fastest inference will enable Lovable to respond as fast as people think.\n\n[Learn more][28]\n\n## Cerebras and AMD Partner on Disaggregated Inference\n\n#### AMD Helios and the Cerebras Wafer-Scale Engine will combine high-throughput prefill with\n#### ultra-fast token generation.\n\n[Learn more][29]\n\n## CrowdStrike and Cerebras Partner to Transform Cybersecurity\n## \n\n#### The world's fastest inference enables more context, more validation, and more trusted decisions\n#### inside the operational window.\n\n[Learn more][30]\n\n## Scaling CS-3\n## Production by 7x\n\n#### Cerebras and Flex are expanding U.S. manufacturing in Milpitas, California. This partnership\n#### brings together Cerebras’ breakthrough wafer-scale systems and Flex’s advanced manufacturing\n#### expertise.\n\n[Learn more][31]\n\n## Cerebras Systems Accelerates AI Infrastructure Across Europe\n\n#### Cerebras is scaling to **200MW of AI compute capacity by the end of 2027**\n\n[Learn more][32]\n\n## Deploy AI anywhere.\n\nThe same models and agents across cloud, on-premise, and on-device. Inference runs in-region —\nkeeping you within your latency envelope, data residency obligations, and compliance frameworks.\n\n### ### Cloud\n\n### Serve open models in seconds\n\nIncluding GLM, OpenAI, Qwen, Llama and more with an API key\n\n### ### Dedicated\n\n### ### On-Prem\n\nAndrew Feldman\n\nCo-founder & CEO\nCerebras Systems\n\nSam Altman\n\nCEO\nOpenAI\n\nJack Dorsey\n\nCEO\nBlock\n\nAndrew Feldman\n\nCo-founder & CEO\nCerebras Systems\n\nSam Altman\n\nCEO\nOpenAI\n\nJack Dorsey\n\nCEO\nBlock\n\n## The Cerebras Advantage\n\n## Build Products that Others Can't\n\n### Code at the speed of thought\n\nCode, debug, and refactor instantly so developers never lose their flow.\n\n[Case study: Cognition][33]\n\n### Agents that never stall\n\nExecute multi-step workflows without delays or timeouts.\n\n[Case study: NinjaTech][34]\n\n### Instant Answers\n\nComplex reasoning in under a second — perfect for deep search, copilots, and analysis.\n\n[Case study: AlphaSense][35]\n\n### Conversations that flow\n\nInstant, accurate voice responses for higher quality interactions.\n\n[Case study: Tavus][36]\n\n## Unmatched Speed & Quality\n\nDeploy frontier models at production scale with world-record speeds. Faster inference means more\nreasoning and better output quality in the same latency budget.\n\n[View available models & benchmarks][37]\n\nGemma-4-31B\n\nKimi K2.6\n\nGLM-4.7\n\nCodex-Spark\n\n## Leading\n## Price-Performance\n\nSlash AI infrastructure costs compared to GPU clouds while achieving up to 15x faster inference.\n\n[View pricing][38]\n\n## Enterprise-Grade, Developer-Friendly\n\nBattle-tested at scale by leading cloud service providers and enterprises. Get started in <30\nseconds with dr"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] Products [ Customers ][2][ Partners ][3] Developers Resources [ Pricing ][4] Company [Contact us][5][Get Started][6] [ Lovable and Cerebras Partner to Power AI Software Creation. Learn more >> ][7] Follow Get Updates * [Newsletter Signup][8] Company * [About Us][9] * [Careers][10] * [Contact Us][11] * [Investor Relations][12] * [Website Terms of Use][13] * [Privacy Policy][14] * [Cookie Policy][15] * [Other Terms & Policies][16] * [Service Status][17] * [Trust Center][18] News * [Newsroom][19] * [In the News][20] * [Press kit][21] Insights * [Customer Spotlight][22] * [Blog][23] * [Publications][24] * [Whitepapers][25] Performance comparisons are based on third-party benchmarking or internal testing. Observed inference speed improvements versus GPU-based systems may vary depending on workload, configuration, date and models being tested. [info@cerebras.ai][26] 1237 E. Arques Ave Sunnyvale, CA 94085 © 2026 Cerebras. All rights reserved. # The World’s Fastest AI Runs on The World’s Biggest chip #### The Cerebras Wafer-Scale Engine is purpose-built for ultra-fast AI. It is 58x larger and 15x #### faster than GPUs. Designed for builders who want to do extraordinary things. [Learn more][27] ## Cerebras and Lovable Power Faster AI Software Creation ### The world’s fastest inference will enable Lovable to respond as fast as people think. [Learn more][28] ## Cerebras and AMD Partner on Disaggregated Inference #### AMD Helios and the Cerebras Wafer-Scale Engine will combine high-throughput prefill with #### ultra-fast token generation. [Learn more][29] ## CrowdStrike and Cerebras Partner to Transform Cybersecurity ## #### The world's fastest inference enables more context, more validation, and more trusted decisions #### inside the operational window. [Learn more][30] ## Scaling CS-3 ## Production by 7x #### Cerebras and Flex are expanding U.S. manufacturing in Milpitas, California. This partnership #### brings together Cerebras’ breakthrough wafer-scale systems and Flex’s advanced manufacturing #### expertise. [Learn more][31] ## Cerebras Systems Accelerates AI Infrastructure Across Europe #### Cerebras is scaling to **200MW of AI compute capacity by the end of 2027** [Learn more][32] ## Deploy AI anywhere. The same models and agents across cloud, on-premise, and on-device. Inference runs in-region — keeping you within your latency envelope, data residency obligations, and compliance frameworks. ### ### Cloud ### Serve open models in seconds Including GLM, OpenAI, Qwen, Llama and more with an API key ### ### Dedicated ### ### On-Prem Andrew Feldman Co-founder & CEO Cerebras Systems Sam Altman CEO OpenAI Jack Dorsey CEO Block Andrew Feldman Co-founder & CEO Cerebras Systems Sam Altman CEO OpenAI Jack Dorsey CEO Block ## The Cerebras Advantage ## Build Products that Others Can't ### Code at the speed of thought Code, debug, and refactor instantly so developers never lose their flow. [Case study: Cognition][33] ### Agents that never stall Execute multi-step workflows without delays or timeouts. [Case study: NinjaTech][34] ### Instant Answers Complex reasoning in under a second — perfect for deep search, copilots, and analysis. [Case study: AlphaSense][35] ### Conversations that flow Instant, accurate voice responses for higher quality interactions. [Case study: Tavus][36] ## Unmatched Speed & Quality Deploy frontier models at production scale with world-record speeds. Faster inference means more reasoning and better output quality in the same latency budget. [View available models & benchmarks][37] Gemma-4-31B Kimi K2.6 GLM-4.7 Codex-Spark ## Leading ## Price-Performance Slash AI infrastructure costs compared to GPU clouds while achieving up to 15x faster inference. [View pricing][38] ## Enterprise-Grade, Developer-Friendly Battle-tested at scale by leading cloud service providers and enterprises. Get started in <30 seconds with drop-in OpenAI API compatibility. [Read customer testimonials][39] ## Train, Fine-tune, Serve - on one platform Start with lightning-fast inference, then fine-tune or even pre-train models with your own data to optimize models for specific use cases. [Explore training options][40] ## What customers are saying Lovable was built on the idea that the person closest to a problem should be able to solve it. Cerebras helps us make Lovable respond as fast as our customers think,so instead of wondering if an idea’s worth trying, they just build it. Our users deserve infrastructure that keeps up with how they work. Anton Osika CEO and co-founder, Lovable. OpenAI’s compute strategy is to build a resilient portfolio that matches the right systems to the right workloads. Cerebras adds a dedicated low-latency inference solution to our platform. That means faster responses, more natural interactions, and a stronger foundation to scale real-time AI to many more people. Sachin Katti Head of Compute Infrastructure, OpenAI By partnering with Cerebras, we are integrating cutting-edge AI infrastructure […] that allows us to deliver the unprecedented speed, most accurate and relevant insights available – helping our customers make smarter decisions with confidence. Raj Neervannan CTO and co-founder, AlphaSense By delivering over 2,000 tokens per second for Scout – more than 30 times faster than closed models like ChatGPT or Anthropic, Cerebras is helping developers everywhere to move faster, go deeper, and build better than ever before. Ahmad Al-Dahle VP of GenAI at Meta With Cerebras’ inference speed, GSK is developing innovative AI applications, such as intelligent research agents, that will fundamentally improve the productivity of our researchers and drug discovery process. Kim Branson SVP of AI and ML, GSK Our clinicians will be able to make more informed decisions based on genomic data, significantly reducing the time it takes to find the right treatment and – more importantly – reducing the physical toll on patients. Matthew Callstrom, M.D., Ph.D Chair for the Department of Radiology, Mayo Clinic For Notion, productivity is everything. Cerebras gives us the instant, intelligent AI needed to power real-time features like enterprise search, and enables a faster, more seamless user experience. Sarah Sachs AI Lead, Notion Combining Cerebras’ best-in-class compute with LiveKit’s global edge network has allowed us to create AI experiences that feel more human, thanks to the system’s ultra-low latency. Russell D’sa CEO and CO-Founder, LiveKit We have a cancer-drug response prediction model that’s running many hundreds of times faster on that chip (Cerebras) than it runs on a conventional GPU… We are doing in a few months what would normally take a drug development process years… Rick Stevens Associate Director, Argonne National Laboratory Working with Cerebras lets us treat speed as a first-class design parameter. When your agent runs at ~1000 tokens per second, you have the opportunity to optimize all parts of the agent together, including context retrieval, UI, and model behavior. Cerebras enables us to pursue an entirely new set of bets, from deeper codebase understanding to fundamentally new interaction patterns. Scott Wu CEO, Cognition Inference is the moment a model actually does something useful for a customer, and right now, speed and performance are the bottleneck. What we've built with Cerebras solves that: by splitting the inference workload across Trainium and the CS-3, and EFA connecting them, each system does what it's best at. The result is inference that's an order of magnitude faster and higher performance than what's available today. David Brown Vice President, Compute & ML Services, AWS ## **Build the Best AI-powered Apps** ### Start with a free trial on the Cerebras Inference Cloud. [Get started][41] [1]: #main-content [2]: /customer-spotlights [3]: /partners [4]: /pricing [5]: /build-with-us [6]: https://cloud.cerebras.ai/?utm_source=homepage [7]: /press-release/cerebras-and-lovable [8]: /subscribe [9]: /company [10]: /join-us [11]: /build-with-us [12]: https://investors.cerebras.ai [13]: /terms-of-service [14]: /privacy-policy [15]: /cookie-policy [16]: /other-terms-and-policies [17]: https://status.cerebras.ai/ [18]: https://trust.cerebras.ai/ [19]: /company/newsroom [20]: /company/news [21]: /company/press-kit [22]: /customer-spotlights [23]: /blog [24]: /publications [25]: /whitepapers [26]: mailto:info@cerebras.ai [27]: https://www.cerebras.ai/inference [28]: /press-release/cerebras-and-lovable [29]: /press-release/amd-and-cerebras-announce-industry-leading-ultra-low-latency-and-high-throughpu t-ai-inference [30]: https://investors.cerebras.ai/news-releases/news-release-details/crowdstrike-and-cerebras-part ner-power-ai-detection-and-response [31]: /flex [32]: https://investors.cerebras.ai/news-releases/news-release-details/cerebras-systems-accelerates- european-expansion-200mw-ai-compute [33]: /blog/case-study-cognition-x-cerebras [34]: /blog/ninjatech-ai-powering-the-one-size-fits-all-ai-agent [35]: /customer-spotlights/alphasense [36]: /blog/building-real-time-digital-twin-with-cerebras-at-tavus [37]: https://artificialanalysis.ai/providers/cerebras [38]: /pricing [39]: /customer-spotlights [40]: /cloud [41]: https://cloud.cerebras.ai", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Cerebras Systems — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Builds wafer-scale AI processors, a semiconductor product. | Builds wafer-scale AI processors for deep learning. | United States | United States", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "75", "Y Score": "67", "Overall Score": "71", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "STATS ChipPAC", "Website": "https://www.statschippac.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Singapore", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Singapore)", "Operational Presence": "Singapore", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Leading OSAT headquartered in Singapore, providing advanced packaging solutions.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "SG", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "STATS ChipPAC — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: OSAT providing advanced packaging, builds/owns packaging technology.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "statschippac.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "statschippac.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[About][1]\n\n##### About\n\n[Culture & Values][2][Leadership Team][3][Worldwide Locations][4][Ethics &\nCompliance][5][Careers][6]\n[Applications][7]\n\n##### Applications\n\n[Automotive][8][Computing][9][Memory][10][AI Edge][11][Power & Energy][12]\n[Technology & Solutions][13]\n\n##### Technology & Services\n\n[Turnkey Services][14][Test Services][15][Design Services][16][Packaging Services][17][Semiconductor\nPackage Integration Design][18][Wafer Probing][19][Wafer Bumping][20][Assembly][21][Global Drop\nShipping][22]\n\n##### **Technology**\n\n[Advanced 2.5D / 3D Packaging Solutions][23][Ultra High-Density Advanced SiP\nTechnology][24][Ultra-Thin Wafer Level Packaging Technology][25][High-Performance Flip Chip\nTechnology][26][Superior Memory Packaging Technology][27]\n[Sustainability][28]\n\n##### Sustainability\n\n[Green Manufacturing][29][Conflict-Free Mineral Policy][30][ESG][31]\n[Technology & Solutions][32][Sustainability][33]\n[Newsroom][34][Contact Us][35]\n\n# Connecting Technologies\n\nAdvanced IC back-end manufacturing for a smarter world.\n\n# Global Microsystems Integration Leader\n\n### 30+\n\nyears of semiconductor backend manufacturing expertise\n\n### 20+\n\noperational locations worldwide\n\n### Your Trusted Partner for a More Interconnected Future\n\nSTATS ChipPAC is the world’s leading integrated circuit manufacturing and technology services\nprovider. We offer a full range of turnkey services that include semiconductor package integration\ndesign and characterization, R&D, wafer probing, wafer bumping, package assembly, final testing, and\ndrop shipment to vendors around the world.\n[Learn More][36]\n\n# Applications\n\nAdvanced packaging designed for the systems shaping tomorrow:\n\n#### Power & Energy\n\n#### Automotive\n\n#### Computing\n\n#### Memory\n\n#### AI Edge\n\n[Learn More][37]\n\n# Future-Proof\n# Technologies\n\nPioneering next-generation technologies to address tomorrow's challenges\n[Learn More][38]\n\n### Wirebond Packaging\n\nStreamline semiconductor assembly with cost-effective, flexible wirebond interconnections.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Flip Chip Packaging\n\nAchieve high-density interconnects and improved electrical and thermal performance.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Wafer Bumping\n\nEnhance miniaturisation and power distribution with wafer bumping to enable direct attachment for\nadvanced packaging solutions.\n\n### Wafer Level Packaging\n\nDeliver powerful, multi-functional devices in smaller, thinner, and cost-efficient packages.\n\nLearn More\n\n### System-in-Package\n\nIntegrate multiple circuits into a compact system to boost performance, functionality, and\nprocessing speeds.\n\nLearn More\n\n### MEMS and Sensors Packaging\n\nEnable next-gen smart devices with MEMS and sensor packaging, designed for diverse industries.\n\n### 2.5 / 3D Packaging (TBD)\n\nMaximise performance by stacking and interconnecting components.\n\n### Power Device Packaging\n\nImprove power and analogue device performance with high-temperature, advanced packaging solutions.\n\n### Advancement of Mainstream Packaging\n\nRefine mainstream packaging with advanced process control to improve performance, lower costs, and\nexpand application potential.\n\n# Future-Proof\n# Technologies\n\nBuilt to keep the world running smarter and faster.\n[Learn More][39]\n\n### Wirebond Packaging\n\nStreamline semiconductor assembly with cost-effective, flexible wirebond interconnections.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Flip Chip Packaging\n\nAchieve high-density interconnects and improved electrical and thermal performance.\n\nLearn More\n\n### Wafer Bumping\n\nEnhance miniaturisation and power distribution with wafer bumping to enable direct attachment for\nadvanced packaging solutions.\n\n### Wafer Level Packaging\n\nDeliver powerful, multi-functional devices in smaller, thinner, and cost-efficient packages.\n\nLearn More\n\n### System-in-Package\n\nIntegrate multiple circuits into a compact system to boost performance, functionality, and\nprocessing speeds.\n\nLearn More\n\n### MEMS and Sensors Packaging\n\nEnable next-gen smart devices with MEMS and sensor packaging, designed for diverse indus"}}, "page_text": "[About][1] ##### About [Culture & Values][2][Leadership Team][3][Worldwide Locations][4][Ethics & Compliance][5][Careers][6] [Applications][7] ##### Applications [Automotive][8][Computing][9][Memory][10][AI Edge][11][Power & Energy][12] [Technology & Solutions][13] ##### Technology & Services [Turnkey Services][14][Test Services][15][Design Services][16][Packaging Services][17][Semiconductor Package Integration Design][18][Wafer Probing][19][Wafer Bumping][20][Assembly][21][Global Drop Shipping][22] ##### **Technology** [Advanced 2.5D / 3D Packaging Solutions][23][Ultra High-Density Advanced SiP Technology][24][Ultra-Thin Wafer Level Packaging Technology][25][High-Performance Flip Chip Technology][26][Superior Memory Packaging Technology][27] [Sustainability][28] ##### Sustainability [Green Manufacturing][29][Conflict-Free Mineral Policy][30][ESG][31] [Technology & Solutions][32][Sustainability][33] [Newsroom][34][Contact Us][35] # Connecting Technologies Advanced IC back-end manufacturing for a smarter world. # Global Microsystems Integration Leader ### 30+ years of semiconductor backend manufacturing expertise ### 20+ operational locations worldwide ### Your Trusted Partner for a More Interconnected Future STATS ChipPAC is the world’s leading integrated circuit manufacturing and technology services provider. We offer a full range of turnkey services that include semiconductor package integration design and characterization, R&D, wafer probing, wafer bumping, package assembly, final testing, and drop shipment to vendors around the world. [Learn More][36] # Applications Advanced packaging designed for the systems shaping tomorrow: #### Power & Energy #### Automotive #### Computing #### Memory #### AI Edge [Learn More][37] # Future-Proof # Technologies Pioneering next-generation technologies to address tomorrow's challenges [Learn More][38] ### Wirebond Packaging Streamline semiconductor assembly with cost-effective, flexible wirebond interconnections. Learn More ### Flip Chip Packaging Achieve high-density interconnects and improved electrical and thermal performance. Learn More ### Wafer Bumping Enhance miniaturisation and power distribution with wafer bumping to enable direct attachment for advanced packaging solutions. ### Wafer Level Packaging Deliver powerful, multi-functional devices in smaller, thinner, and cost-efficient packages. Learn More ### System-in-Package Integrate multiple circuits into a compact system to boost performance, functionality, and processing speeds. Learn More ### MEMS and Sensors Packaging Enable next-gen smart devices with MEMS and sensor packaging, designed for diverse industries. ### 2.5 / 3D Packaging (TBD) Maximise performance by stacking and interconnecting components. ### Power Device Packaging Improve power and analogue device performance with high-temperature, advanced packaging solutions. ### Advancement of Mainstream Packaging Refine mainstream packaging with advanced process control to improve performance, lower costs, and expand application potential. # Future-Proof # Technologies Built to keep the world running smarter and faster. [Learn More][39] ### Wirebond Packaging Streamline semiconductor assembly with cost-effective, flexible wirebond interconnections. Learn More ### Flip Chip Packaging Achieve high-density interconnects and improved electrical and thermal performance. Learn More ### Wafer Bumping Enhance miniaturisation and power distribution with wafer bumping to enable direct attachment for advanced packaging solutions. ### Wafer Level Packaging Deliver powerful, multi-functional devices in smaller, thinner, and cost-efficient packages. Learn More ### System-in-Package Integrate multiple circuits into a compact system to boost performance, functionality, and processing speeds. Learn More ### MEMS and Sensors Packaging Enable next-gen smart devices with MEMS and sensor packaging, designed for diverse industries. ### 2.5 / 3D Packaging Maximise performance by stacking and interconnecting components. # Turnkey Microsystems Solutions STATS ChipPAC offers end-to-end microsystem solutions, from design to test. With expertise in RF SiP design, wafer-level processing, and system-level testing, we provide product-tailored solutions that minimize time-to-market and ensure optimal performance for diverse applications. #### Turnkey Services #### Design Characterization #### Wafer Bumping #### Packaging #### Testing #### Reliability Testing & #### Failure Analysis [Learn More][40] # Our Commitment to Planet, People, and Principles Building a smarter, more sustainable future through measurable goals and responsible innovation. [Learn More][41] #### Environmental Goals Achieving net-zero emissions by 2050, with milestones including 90% renewable energy use by 2030 and <1% landfill rates by 2024. #### Social Responsibility Certified by RBA VAP, we prioritise health, safety, and ethical practices. #### Governance Excellence ISO14064-1 and ISO45001 certifications reflect our commitment to transparency and accountability in all operations. # Latest Stories Varius auctor nibh nullam sed. A iaculis sodales pretium sed facilisis magna. #### Explore all stories #### Non eget massa lectus placerat Turpis dui malesuada varius dui. Venenatis dolor arcu pretium pharetra aliquet sit. [Read More][42] #### Non eget massa lectus placerat Turpis dui malesuada varius dui. Venenatis dolor arcu pretium pharetra aliquet sit. [Read More][43] #### Non eget massa lectus placerat Turpis dui malesuada varius dui. Venenatis dolor arcu pretium pharetra aliquet sit. [Read More][44] # Careers at STATS ChipPAC With roles across multiple disciplines, we empower our employees to thrive in a collaborative environment. We value diverse perspectives and offer our employees the chance to contribute to projects that impact industries worldwide. [Learn More][45] # Global Reac