rement ][83] [ Events ][84] For Investors [ Investor Relations ][85] [ Share ][86] [ Financial Events, Conferences & Roadshows ][87] [ Corporate Governance ][88] [ Annual General Meeting ][89] [ Financial Reports ][90] [ Company Announcements & Regulatory Disclosures ][91] [ Contact ][92] Newsroom [ Latest News & Events ][93] [ Media Library ][94] EN English [Deutsch][95] [日本語][96] [简体中文][97] [繁體中文][98] [한국어][99] [ Contact ][100] # Growing Innovation in the semiconductor industry SUSS is a leading provider of precision-engineered systems and process solutions for backend lithography, wafer bonding, and photomask processing. Guided by a mindset of openness, courage, and ambition, we drive next-generation innovation across the semiconductor industry. [ Our products ][101] Your browser does not support html5 video. What we do ## We develop future-proof technology with scalable impact ## Our portfolio Designed for precision, reliability and scalable impact, our solutions enable the semiconductor breakthroughs of tomorrow. Imaging Solutions [ UV Scanning ][102] [ Mask Alignment ][103] [ExpertiseArea-imaging_546x878_8_5.webp] Bonding Solutions [ Permanent Bonding ][104] [ Temporary Bonding ][105] [ExpertiseArea-bonding2_546x878_8_5.webp] Coating Solutions [ Industrial Inkjet Printing for Semiconductor Manufacturing ][106] [ Coating & Developing ][107] [ExpertiseArea-coating_546x878_8_5.webp] Photomask Solutions [ Cleaning ][108] [ Bake & Develop ][109] [ExpertiseArea-photomask_546x878_8_5.webp] ## We combine technical excellence with a pioneering spirit – enabling your visions to become ## world-changing innovations At SUSS, it’s never been only about technology – it’s our values and beliefs that have made us a trusted partner to the semiconductor industry for over 75 years. [ About us ][110] ##### Empowering sustainable growth We think long-term. That’s why we continuously invest in our team, our manufacturing capacities, and our technologies – ensuring lasting success, yours and ours. ##### Developing scalable solutions through partnership Innovative technologies are born from close collaboration. So we engage early, listen closely, and engineer solutions tailored to your needs. With open dialogue and long-term commitment, we turn shared vision into engineered reality. ##### Challenging the status quo There’s no innovation without ambition. We don’t just aim to meet your expectations – we strive to exceed them. We keep raising the bar to keep you at the forefront. ##### Delivering excellence since 1949 Founded as a sales office for microscopes, cameras, and laboratory equipment in a Munich garage, SUSS has grown into a partner of the world’s leading semiconductor companies. By delivering engineered excellence and providing dedicated regional services and sales support, we’ve earned the trust of customers around the globe. ## What's new at SUSS Press releases, Investor Relations news, and more: Explore our latest publications and discover what’s happening at SUSS. [ View all news ][111] [ 06/08/2026 Order book reaches record of €473.7 million, providing strong visibility for 2027 Corporate News ][112] [ 29/07/2026 SUSS invests in Advanced Packaging Innovation Center to support further growth Corporate News [suss_advanced_packaging_innovation_center.jpg] ][113] [ 04/06/2026 Shares of SUSS MicroTec SE are being included in the MDAX for the first time Corporate News ][114] [ 03/06/2026 Annual General Meeting of SUSS approves all agenda items with a large majority and confirms Supervisory Board mandates Corporate News ][115] [ 06/08/2026 Order book reaches record of €473.7 million, providing strong visibility for 2027 Corporate News ][116] [ 29/07/2026 SUSS invests in Advanced Packaging Innovation Center to support further growth Corporate News [suss_advanced_packaging_innovation_center.jpg] ][117] [ 04/06/2026 Shares of SUSS MicroTec SE are being included in the MDAX for the first time Corporate News ][118] [ 03/06/2026 Annual General Meeting of SUSS approves all agenda items with a large majority and confirms Supervisory Board mandates Corporate News ][119] [Three people in semiconductor production cleanroom] Your career at SUSS ## Breaking Barriers. Together. We believe that innovation thrives where trust leads. That’s why we give you the freedom to do what you do best and encourage you to go even further. Your ideas matter, whether you're in the lab, out in the field or in the office. [ SUSS as employer ][120] [Walking Man with Laptop] ## Let’s talk! Let’s grow innovation together! Tell us about your project and your challenges – so we can come up with a perfect solution. [ Contact us ][121] Products / Solutions [ Product Overview ][122] [ Cleaning ][123] [ Bake & Develop ][124] [ UV Scanning ][125] [ Mask Alignment ][126] [ Inkjet Printing ][127] [ Coating & Developing ][128] [ Permanent Bonding ][129] [ Temporary Bonding ][130] Services [ Customer Service ][131] [ Training Center ][132] Careers [ SUSS as employer ][133] [ Why join us ][134] [ Apprentices ][135] [ Application process ][136] [ Open Jobs ][137] Company [ About us ][138] [ Management ][139] [ Sustainability ][140] [ Quality Management ][141] [ Purchasing & Procurement ][142] Insights [ Investor Relations ][143] [ Latest News & Events ][144] [ Contact ][145] [ Events ][146] [ ][147] Stay always up to date [ Subscribe to Newsletter ][148] © 2026 SUSS MicroTec SE [ Imprint ][149] [ Privacy Policy ][150] [ Terms of Use ][151] [ Terms & Conditions ][152] [ ][153] [ ][154] © 2026 SUSS MicroTec SE [1]: /en [2]: /en/investor-relations [3]: /en/investor-relations/share [4]: /en/investor-relations/financial-calendar [5]: /en/investor-relations/corporate-governance [6]: /en/investor-relations/annual-general-meeting [7]: /en/investor-relations/finanzberichte [8]: /en/investor-relations/company-announcements-and-regulatory-disclosures [9]: /en/investor-relations/https-www.suss.com-en-investor-relations-contact [10]: /en/newsroom/latest-news