bal.com/html/ir_audit.php [32]: /csr/sustainability-governance/ip-management [33]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_profile.php [34]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_stock.php [35]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_dividends.php [36]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_meeting.php [37]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_events.php [38]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_news.php [39]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_agent.php [40]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_analyst.php [41]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_irsform.php [42]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_contact.php\\ [43]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/ir_alert.php\\ [44]: https://ir.aseglobal.com/html/index.php [45]: /contact [46]: / [47]: /ch/home [48]: /about [49]: /organization-chart [50]: /milestones [51]: /plants-offices [52]: /press-room [53]: /about [54]: /csr [55]: /csr/stakeholder-engagement [56]: /csr/sustainability-governance [57]: /csr/integrity-a", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "ASE Technology Holding — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: ASE is an OSAT provider that performs assembly and test services, which are part of semiconductor manufacturing. | Largest OSAT (outsourced semiconductor assembly and test) provider. | Taiwan | Taiwan", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "70", "Y Score": "70", "Overall Score": "70", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "BluGlass Limited", "Website": "https://www.bluglass.com.au", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Australia", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Australia)", "Operational Presence": "Australia", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Australian company developing gallium nitride (GaN) semiconductor technology for LEDs and lasers.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "AU", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "BluGlass Limited — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops gallium nitride semiconductor technology for LEDs and lasers, building the technology.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "bluglass.com.au", "data": {"company": {"name": "bluglass.com.au"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "COMPANY\n[ VIRTUAL TOUR ][1] Search for:\n\n#### COMPANY\n* [About][2]\n* [Corporate Directory][3]\n* [Our People][4]\n* [Virtual Tour][5]\n* [Intellectual Property][6]\n* [News][7]\n* [Corporate Governance][8]\n* [Contact][9]\n* [Careers][10]\n\n#### INVESTORS\n* [Announcements][11]\n* [Reports][12]\n* [Presentations][13]\n* [Analyst Reports][14]\n* [Investor Webcast][15]\n\n#### CUSTOMERS\n* [Laser Diodes][16]\n* [LEDs + MicroLEDs][17]\n* [RPCVD][18]\n* [Foundry Services by EpiBlu][19]\n\n# INVESTOR\n\n# CUSTOMER\n\nNews\n\n# INVESTOR CREATING A BRIGHTER FUTURE\n* [Announcements][20]\n* [Reports][21]\n* [Presentations][22]\n* [Analyst Reports][23]\n* [Investor Webcast][24]\n\n# CUSTOMER BRINGING INNOVATION TO LIFE\n* [Laser Diodes][25]\n* [LEDs + MicroLEDs][26]\n* [RPCVD][27]\n* [Foundry Services by EpiBlu][28]\n\nNews\n[\n\n###### BluGlass Quarter Report – June 2026\n\nJul 31, 2026\n][29] [\n\n###### BluGlass secures A$1.4 million Phase II contract from Uviquity\n\nJul 16, 2026\n][30] [\n\n###### Jim Haden appointed Managing Director\n\nJul 13, 2026\n][31] [\n\n###### BluGlass receives ~$6.6 million in connection with Options\n\nJun 09, 2026\n][32]\n\n### Developing the next evolution in GaN technology\n\nPlug-and-play and custom laser diodes for the industrial, display, and scientific industries\n\nENTER\n\n# Home\n\n### About\n\n##### WELCOME TO BLUGLASS\n\nWith more than a decade’s experience partnering with the photonics industries, BluGlass is a\nsemiconductor manufacturer delivering cutting-edge, custom laser and LED products for the global\nindustrial, display, defence and scientific markets.\n\nOur full suite, end-to-end laser diode design, fabrication and packaging capability, backed by our\nnetwork of expert fabrication partners, means our customers benefit from our agile and robust\ncapability for small-batch custom laser diode products through to high-volume production.\n\nWe are proud of our reputation for helping customers and partners solve complex technology problems\nby combining the best of traditional nitride growth techniques with our own unique low temperature,\nlow hydrogen nitride growth process. Our revolutionary growth technology, called **remote plasma\nchemical vapour deposition (RPCVD)** offers many unique benefits to our customers – promising\nbrighter, higher performing, and novel devices.\n\n[View more][33]\n\n### Our Products\n\n##### NEXT GENERATION LASER DIODES POWERING THE FUTURE\n\nBluGlass offers custom and volume manufactured GaN laser diodes for the industrial, defence,\ndisplay, and scientific markets.\n\nOur full suite, end-to-end laser diode design, fabrication and packaging capability means we can\nprovide highly bespoke solutions to solve our customers’ unique product challenges. We offer a\nspectrum of wavelengths from 405nm-525nm in both single and multi-mode options.\n\nBluGlass’ products are being fully reliability tested to ensure product quality from development to\ndispatch in our state-of-the-art facilities in Sydney, Australia, and Nashua, USA.\n\nIf you are looking for a cost-effective partner to help you address your GaN needs, BluGlass has the\nexpertise to help bring your next innovation to life.\n\n[View More][34]\n\n### OUR PEOPLE\n\n##### EXPLORING THE BOUNDS OF WHAT IS POSSIBLE IS IN OUR DNA\n\nOur talented team are united by a shared commitment to finding solutions that help expand the bounds\nof what’s possible; helping our customers power the photonics solutions of tomorrow.\n\nBringing together specialist scientists, engineers and commercial staff, the team at BluGlass\ncombine academic, industry and commercial expertise and experience to deliver continuous innovation\nand ground-breaking invention.\n\n[View More][35]\n\n### OUR TECHNOLOGY\n\n##### BRIGHTER, MORE EFFICIENT LASERS\n\nOur revolutionary growth technology, called **remote plasma chemical vapour deposition (RPCVD)**,\noffers many unique benefits to our customers – including novel, low resistivity and higher\nefficiency laser diodes.\n\nWe combine traditional growth techniques with our proprietary RPCVD and **active-as-grown**\n(AAG) "}}, "page_text": "COMPANY [ VIRTUAL TOUR ][1] Search for: #### COMPANY * [About][2] * [Corporate Directory][3] * [Our People][4] * [Virtual Tour][5] * [Intellectual Property][6] * [News][7] * [Corporate Governance][8] * [Contact][9] * [Careers][10] #### INVESTORS * [Announcements][11] * [Reports][12] * [Presentations][13] * [Analyst Reports][14] * [Investor Webcast][15] #### CUSTOMERS * [Laser Diodes][16] * [LEDs + MicroLEDs][17] * [RPCVD][18] * [Foundry Services by EpiBlu][19] # INVESTOR # CUSTOMER News # INVESTOR CREATING A BRIGHTER FUTURE * [Announcements][20] * [Reports][21] * [Presentations][22] * [Analyst Reports][23] * [Investor Webcast][24] # CUSTOMER BRINGING INNOVATION TO LIFE * [Laser Diodes][25] * [LEDs + MicroLEDs][26] * [RPCVD][27] * [Foundry Services by EpiBlu][28] News [ ###### BluGlass Quarter Report – June 2026 Jul 31, 2026 ][29] [ ###### BluGlass secures A$1.4 million Phase II contract from Uviquity Jul 16, 2026 ][30] [ ###### Jim Haden appointed Managing Director Jul 13, 2026 ][31] [ ###### BluGlass receives ~$6.6 million in connection with Options Jun 09, 2026 ][32] ### Developing the next evolution in GaN technology Plug-and-play and custom laser diodes for the industrial, display, and scientific industries ENTER # Home ### About ##### WELCOME TO BLUGLASS With more than a decade’s experience partnering with the photonics industries, BluGlass is a semiconductor manufacturer delivering cutting-edge, custom laser and LED products for the global industrial, display, defence and scientific markets. Our full suite, end-to-end laser diode design, fabrication and packaging capability, backed by our network of expert fabrication partners, means our customers benefit from our agile and robust capability for small-batch custom laser diode products through to high-volume production. We are proud of our reputation for helping customers and partners solve complex technology problems by combining the best of traditional nitride growth techniques with our own unique low temperature, low hydrogen nitride growth process. Our revolutionary growth technology, called **remote plasma chemical vapour deposition (RPCVD)** offers many unique benefits to our customers – promising brighter, higher performing, and novel devices. [View more][33] ### Our Products ##### NEXT GENERATION LASER DIODES POWERING THE FUTURE BluGlass offers custom and volume manufactured GaN laser diodes for the industrial, defence, display, and scientific markets. Our full suite, end-to-end laser diode design, fabrication and packaging capability means we can provide highly bespoke solutions to solve our customers’ unique product challenges. We offer a spectrum of wavelengths from 405nm-525nm in both single and multi-mode options. BluGlass’ products are being fully reliability tested to ensure product quality from development to dispatch in our state-of-the-art facilities in Sydney, Australia, and Nashua, USA. If you are looking for a cost-effective partner to help you address your GaN needs, BluGlass has the expertise to help bring your next innovation to life. [View More][34] ### OUR PEOPLE ##### EXPLORING THE BOUNDS OF WHAT IS POSSIBLE IS IN OUR DNA Our talented team are united by a shared commitment to finding solutions that help expand the bounds of what’s possible; helping our customers power the photonics solutions of tomorrow. Bringing together specialist scientists, engineers and commercial staff, the team at BluGlass combine academic, industry and commercial expertise and experience to deliver continuous innovation and ground-breaking invention. [View More][35] ### OUR TECHNOLOGY ##### BRIGHTER, MORE EFFICIENT LASERS Our revolutionary growth technology, called **remote plasma chemical vapour deposition (RPCVD)**, offers many unique benefits to our customers – including novel, low resistivity and higher efficiency laser diodes. We combine traditional growth techniques with our proprietary RPCVD and **active-as-grown** (AAG) epitaxial growth technologies in the development of standard and enhanced laser diode designs. We collaborate closely with our customers to create unique epitaxial structures that improve performance and help solve specific challenges to bring new technologies and innovation to life. Our enhanced laser diodes are designed to address the significant resistivity and performance losses suffered in GaN lasers today – to enable higher-brightness, higher-efficiency diodes, produced at commercial scale at our state-of-the-art facilities in Australia and the USA. [View more][36] ### VIRTUAL TOUR #### [Tour the facility][37] * COMPANY * [About][38] * [Corporate Directory][39] * [Our People][40] * [Virtual Tour][41] * [Intellectual Property][42] * [News][43] * [Corporate Governance][44] * [Contact][45] * [Careers][46] * INVESTORS * * [Announcements][47] * [Reports][48] * [Presentations][49] * [Analyst Reports][50] * [Investor Webcast][51] * CUSTOMERS * [Laser Diodes][52] * [LEDs + MicroLEDs][53] * [RPCVD][54] * [Foundry Services by EpiBlu][55] ##### Contact us 74 Asquith Street Silverwater, NSW, 2128 Australia [P: +61 2 9334 2300][56] [Mail: admin@bluglass.com][57] ##### Follow us [ [