"D-Wave Systems", "Website": "https://www.dwavesys.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Builds quantum annealing processors, a specialized semiconductor technology for quantum computing.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "D-Wave Systems — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Builds quantum annealing processors, a specialized semiconductor technology.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "dwavesys.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "dwavesys.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "D-Wave Quantum | Quantum Realized\n\nHardware Breakthrough Advances Quantum Error Correction   [Read Paper ][1]\n\n[ [Logo] ][2]\n* [INVESTORS][3]\n* [CAREERS][4]\n* [STORE][5]\n* [CONTACT][6]\n* [Log In][7]\n* Products\n  \n  ### Products\n  \n  Discover how you can use quantum computing today\n  * [ Product Overview A dual-platform quantum approach ][8]\n  * [ Annealing Quantum Systems Quantum computers built for business and science ][9]\n  * [ Gate-Model Quantum Systems Supporting error awareness with dual-rail qubits ][10]\n  * [ Cloud Platform The Leap™ quantum cloud service provides real-time quantum access ][11]\n  * [ Software & Tools The Ocean™ suite of open-source tools are accessible via the Ocean SDK for\n    rapid quantum development ][12]\n  * [ Professional Services The D-Wave Launch™ program on-boards your business to quantum computing\n    ][13]\n  * [ Learning Solutions Start your journey! Explore D-Wave applications, events, and resources\n    ][14]\n* Solutions\n  \n  ### Solutions\n  \n  Discover how you can use quantum computing today\n  \n  #### By Use Case\n  * [ Quantum Optimization Summary ][15]\n  * [ Workforce Scheduling ][16]\n  * [ Production Scheduling ][17]\n  * [ Logistics Routing ][18]\n  * [ Resource Optimization ][19]\n  * [ Additional Use Cases ][20]\n  \n  #### By Role\n  * [ Developer Get started building real quantum applications ][21]\n  * [ Tech & Business Leaders Learn how quantum computing fits into your technology portfolio ][22]\n  * [ Quantum Research Explore the boundaries of quantum computing ][23]\n* Sectors\n  \n  ### Sectors\n  \n  Discover how you can use quantum computing today\n  * [ Manufacturing & Logistics ][24]\n  * [ Public Sector ][25]\n  * [ Quantum Research ][26]\n  * [ Quantum AI ][27]\n  * [ Advanced Computing ][28]\n* Learn\n  \n  ### Learn\n  \n  Start your journey! Explore D-Wave applications, events, and resources.\n  * [ What is Quantum Computing? ][29]\n  * [ Customer Success Stories ][30]\n  * [ Featured Applications ][31]\n  * [ D-Wave's Approach ][32]\n  * [ Publications ][33]\n  * [ Resource Library ][34]\n  * [ Events & Webinars ][35]\n  * [ \"Quantum Matters\" Podcast ][36]\n  * [ Training ][37]\n  * [ Blog ][38]\n* Build\n  \n  ### Build\n  \n  Unlock your quantum skills and start building quantum applications today\n  * [ Community Forums Connect with and learn from other quantum developers. ][39]\n  * [ Getting Started Step-by-step approach to building quantum applications today. ][40]\n  * [ Code Samples Search for and run working examples by industry, problem type, and tools or\n    techniques. ][41]\n  * [ Developer Start here! ][42]\n  * [ Documentation Find out more about D-Wave’s quantum technologies and how they work. ][43]\n* Company\n  \n  ### Company\n  \n  We are the practical quantum computing company. Learn more about who we are and what we do.\n  * [ About D-Wave ][44]\n  * [ Newsroom ][45]\n  * [ Leadership ][46]\n  * [ Careers ][47]\n  * [ Media Resources ][48]\n  * [ Contact ][49]\n[Get Started][50]\n\n# Address Your Complex Computational Challenges with Quantum Computing\n\nWhen classical approaches alone can’t keep up with today’s toughest modeling, simulation, and\noptimization problems, D-Wave helps organizations move forward. As the only quantum computing\ncompany building both annealing and gate-model systems, D-Wave provides powerful solutions designed\nto accelerate smarter decisions and drive scalable impact.\n\n[\n\nExplore Technology\n\n][51]\n[\n\nConnect with D-Wave\n\n][52]\n\n# Address Your Complex Computational Challenges with Quantum\n\nWhen classical approaches alone can’t keep up with today’s toughest modeling, simulation, and\noptimization problems, D-Wave helps organizations move forward. As the only quantum computing\ncompany building both annealing and gate-model systems, D-Wave provides powerful solutions designed\nto address highly complex problems, accelerate smarter decisions, and drive scalable impact.\n\n[Expore Technology][53]\n[Connect with D-Wave][54]\n[ [Two Qubit Gate Quantum Error Correction] ][55]\n\n**Why D-Wave's "}}, "page_text": "D-Wave Quantum | Quantum Realized Hardware Breakthrough Advances Quantum Error Correction [Read Paper ][1] [ [Logo] ][2] * [INVESTORS][3] * [CAREERS][4] * [STORE][5] * [CONTACT][6] * [Log In][7] * Products ### Products Discover how you can use quantum computing today * [ Product Overview A dual-platform quantum approach ][8] * [ Annealing Quantum Systems Quantum computers built for business and science ][9] * [ Gate-Model Quantum Systems Supporting error awareness with dual-rail qubits ][10] * [ Cloud Platform The Leap™ quantum cloud service provides real-time quantum access ][11] * [ Software & Tools The Ocean™ suite of open-source tools are accessible via the Ocean SDK for rapid quantum development ][12] * [ Professional Services The D-Wave Launch™ program on-boards your business to quantum computing ][13] * [ Learning Solutions Start your journey! Explore D-Wave applications, events, and resources ][14] * Solutions ### Solutions Discover how you can use quantum computing today #### By Use Case * [ Quantum Optimization Summary ][15] * [ Workforce Scheduling ][16] * [ Production Scheduling ][17] * [ Logistics Routing ][18] * [ Resource Optimization ][19] * [ Additional Use Cases ][20] #### By Role * [ Developer Get started building real quantum applications ][21] * [ Tech & Business Leaders Learn how quantum computing fits into your technology portfolio ][22] * [ Quantum Research Explore the boundaries of quantum computing ][23] * Sectors ### Sectors Discover how you can use quantum computing today * [ Manufacturing & Logistics ][24] * [ Public Sector ][25] * [ Quantum Research ][26] * [ Quantum AI ][27] * [ Advanced Computing ][28] * Learn ### Learn Start your journey! Explore D-Wave applications, events, and resources. * [ What is Quantum Computing? ][29] * [ Customer Success Stories ][30] * [ Featured Applications ][31] * [ D-Wave's Approach ][32] * [ Publications ][33] * [ Resource Library ][34] * [ Events & Webinars ][35] * [ \"Quantum Matters\" Podcast ][36] * [ Training ][37] * [ Blog ][38] * Build ### Build Unlock your quantum skills and start building quantum applications today * [ Community Forums Connect with and learn from other quantum developers. ][39] * [ Getting Started Step-by-step approach to building quantum applications today. ][40] * [ Code Samples Search for and run working examples by industry, problem type, and tools or techniques. ][41] * [ Developer Start here! ][42] * [ Documentation Find out more about D-Wave’s quantum technologies and how they work. ][43] * Company ### Company We are the practical quantum computing company. Learn more about who we are and what we do. * [ About D-Wave ][44] * [ Newsroom ][45] * [ Leadership ][46] * [ Careers ][47] * [ Media Resources ][48] * [ Contact ][49] [Get Started][50] # Address Your Complex Computational Challenges with Quantum Computing When classical approaches alone can’t keep up with today’s toughest modeling, simulation, and optimization problems, D-Wave helps organizations move forward. As the only quantum computing company building both annealing and gate-model systems, D-Wave provides powerful solutions designed to accelerate smarter decisions and drive scalable impact. [ Explore Technology ][51] [ Connect with D-Wave ][52] # Address Your Complex Computational Challenges with Quantum When classical approaches alone can’t keep up with today’s toughest modeling, simulation, and optimization problems, D-Wave helps organizations move forward. As the only quantum computing company building both annealing and gate-model systems, D-Wave provides powerful solutions designed to address highly complex problems, accelerate smarter decisions, and drive scalable impact. [Expore Technology][53] [Connect with D-Wave][54] [ [Two Qubit Gate Quantum Error Correction] ][55] **Why D-Wave's New Two-Qubit Gate is a Breakthrough for Quantum Error Correction** [Read Blog][56] [ [D-Wave and AT&T logo lockup] ][57] **AT&T Signs Agreement to Expand Use of D-Wave's Technology Across Network Operations** [Read Release][58] [ [Globe showing the United States with interconnected lines circling it] ][59] **D-Wave Named to Leaders Category in IDC MarketScape's 2026 Quantum Computing Vendor Assessment** [Read Report][60] ## Quantum Realized D-Wave has developed a clear framework that deflates the hype, helping you develop an informed position on quantum. The framework consists of three simple benchmarks to consider when assessing a particular quantum company’s value. [ Explore the Framework ][61] [Promo Quantumrealized] What D-Wave Does Quantum Computing Technology for Today's Tough Problems As the only quantum computing company with a dual-platform approach, spanning both annealing and gate-model technologies, D-Wave is uniquely positioned to help customers solve their full range of computationally complex problems. Our goal is simple: find better answers to your toughest problems and put them to work faster. [ Get Started ][62] **Optimization** Tackle large-scale optimization problems with millions of variables, competing objectives, and real-world constraints. [Explore Solutions][63] **Systems** Quantum systems designed to support enterprise applications, pioneering research and scientific breakthroughs. [Explore Systems][64] **Cloud Platform** On-demand access to the Leap™ quantum cloud platform and powerful hybrid solvers. D-Wave offers production-grade accessibility, reliability, and security. [Explore Leap Service][65] **Developer Tools** Build, test, and scale applications with Ocean™ tools, APIs, and open-source software that make it easy to integrate quantum into existing workflows. [Explore Ocean Tools][66] **Research** Advance scientific discovery and applied innovation with quantum technologies that support exploration across materials simulation, optimization, and more. [Explore Research][67] **Professional Services** The D-Wave Launch™ program pairs you with experts to identify promising use cases, validate fit, and move from discovery to pilot to production. [Explore Launch][68] **Training** Help your teams understand, evaluate and build practical quantum computing applications. [Explore Courses][69] **Quantum AI** Explore how advancing quantum AI solutions can build more efficient, rapid, and energy-saving AI and machine learning workloads. [Explore AI][70] Customer Stories Quantum Computing in Production [Groceries] ### Pattison Food Group Expends 80% less time and effort on creating complex employee schedules. [ Read Case Story ][71] [Casestudy Fordottoson] ### Ford Otosan Builds production schedules 83% faster. [ Watch Video ][72] [Casestudy Ntt] ### NTT DOCOMO Improved network performance by 15%. [ Read Case Story ][73] Newsroom ### Latest News and Events [ [Investor Press Release Image] Press Release D-Wave Is One of Only Two Companies Named to the Leaders Category in the IDC MarketScape: Worldwide Quantum Computing 2026 Vendor Assessment ][74] * [ Press Release #### D-Wave Announces World’s First Gate-Model Quantum Computing Simulator for Error-Aware #### Programming ][75] * [ Press Release #### D-Wave to Receive $1.5 Million Grant Through NSF Project to Strengthen U.S. Quantum Computing #### Leadership ][76] * [ Press Release #### BASF and D-Wave Announce Completion of Proof-of-Concept Project, Demonstrating Benchmark in #### Manufacturing Efficiency ][77] [ See All News ][78] ## Ready to Start Your Quantum Computing Journey? D-Wave can help your team evaluate, build, and deploy quantum-powered applications using annealing quantum computing systems and hybrid solvers. [Talk with an Expert ][79] [[Great Place to Work® D-Wave 2026 Certification Badge]][80] [[AICPA SOC 2 Compliance Badge]][81] [Footer Logo] [ Join Our Email Marketing List ][82] Follow Us [ [Facebook] ][83] [ [LinkedIn] ][84] [ [YouTube] ][85] [ [X.com] ][86] ### Products * [Product Overview][87] * [Cloud Platform][88] * [Systems][89] * [Professional Services][90] * [Software & Tools][91] * [Learning Solutions][92] ### Solutions * [Quantum Optimization Summary][93] * [Workforce Scheduling][94] * [Production Scheduling][95] * [Vehicle Routing][96] * [Resource Optimization][97] * [Cargo Loading][98] ### Sectors * [Manufacturing & Logistics][99] * [Public Sector][100] * [Quantum Research][101] * [Quantum AI][102] ### Learn * [Quantum Computing][103] * [D-Wave's Approach][104] * [Customer Success Stories][105] * [Featured Applications][106] * [Resource Library][107] * [Publications][108] * [Events & Webinars][109] * [Training][110] ### Build * [Getting Started][111] * [Developer][112] * [Documentation][113] * [Community Forums][114] * [Code Samples][115] ### Company * [About D-Wave][116