icly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "MY", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "SilTerra Malaysia — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: SilTerra is a semiconductor foundry that manufactures wafers, thus building the product.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "silterra.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "silterra.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "* [About Us][1]\n  * [Corporate Profile][2]\n  * [Corporate Information][3]\n  * [Corporate Social Responsibility][4]\n  * [Semiconductor Value Chain][5]\n* [Our Solutions][6]\n  * [Technology][7]\n  * [Design Solutions][8]\n  * [Services][9]\n* [Manufacturing][10]\n  * [Manufacturing][11]\n  * [Accreditation][12]\n  * [Environmental, Health & Safety (EHS)][13]\n  * [Quality and HSPM][14]\n* [End Markets][15]\n* [News][16]\n  * [Announcements][17]\n  * [Events][18]\n* [ESG][19]\n* [Career][20]\n  * [Our People][21]\n  * [Why Join Us][22]\n  * [Vacancies][23]\n  * [Internship Opportunities][24]\n  * [Career Fair][25]\n* [Contact Us][26]\nMenu\n* [About Us][27]\n  * [Corporate Profile][28]\n  * [Corporate Information][29]\n  * [Corporate Social Responsibility][30]\n  * [Semiconductor Value Chain][31]\n* [Our Solutions][32]\n  * [Technology][33]\n  * [Design Solutions][34]\n  * [Services][35]\n* [Manufacturing][36]\n  * [Manufacturing][37]\n  * [Accreditation][38]\n  * [Environmental, Health & Safety (EHS)][39]\n  * [Quality and HSPM][40]\n* [End Markets][41]\n* [News][42]\n  * [Announcements][43]\n  * [Events][44]\n* [ESG][45]\n* [Career][46]\n  * [Our People][47]\n  * [Why Join Us][48]\n  * [Vacancies][49]\n  * [Internship Opportunities][50]\n  * [Career Fair][51]\n* [Contact Us][52]\n* [MPW Program][53]\n* [MyFab][54]\n* [Vendor Management][55]\n* [MPW Program][56]\n* [MyFab][57]\n* [Vendor Management][58]\n\nGREAT TECHNOLOGY, ENABLING INNOVATION\nEVERYWHERE\n\n## We are a Global Semiconductor Foundry\n\nWe are continuously innovating to bring leading-edge semiconductor solutions that will transform the\nworld\n\nGlobally ranked 19^{th} by IC Insights in the category of pure-play foundries in 2023, SilTerra\nstrives to provide outstanding technologies and services to our customers.\n\n \n\nOur leadership in advanced semiconductor wafer processing sets the stage to bring transformation in\nconsumer electronics, next generation data communications networks, industrial, medical technologies\nand mobility.\n\n \n\nSilTerra is a strategic investment of Dagang NeXchange Berhad (“DNeX”) and Beijing Integrated\nCircuit Advanced Manufacturing and High-End Equity Investment Fund Center (Limited Partnership)\n(“CGP Fund”).\n\n[ Explore More ][59]\nLocation\n\n\n\nHeadquartered in Kulim with sales office in Taiwan.\n\nYears of Operation\n\n\n\nMore than 24 years\n\nEmployees\n\n\n\nMore than 1,100 skilled employees\n\nManufacturing Capacity\n\n\n\n40,000 wafers per month\n\n## Technology Solutions that Transform the World\n\nWe work closely with our technology partners to bring next-generation solutions to life.\n\n[ Explore More ][60]\n\n## Sustainability Statement\n\nOur Approach to Sustainability\n\nSilTerra is committed to contributing toward global action to create greater environmental\nsustainability and improve social equity. We have a responsibility towards various stakeholders\nincluding our shareholders, employees, customers, and business partners to operate in a manner that\nis ethical and responsible while providing assurance of long-term business viability.\n\n \n\nThese commitments are the foundation of our sustainability agenda, which is integral to all our\ndecisions and direction encompassing Environmental, Social, and Governance (“ESG”) matters. To be an\nexemplary corporate citizen, we strive to address areas most critical to our stakeholders and our\nbusiness sustainability.\n\n \n\nWe place particular emphasis on 12 material issues as shown below which have strategic importance to\nour business, stakeholder concerns, and our ability to make a positive impact.\n\n[ Read More ][61]\n\n#### Environmental\n\n##### GHG Emissions\n\n##### Energy Management\n\n##### Resource Management\n\n##### Ecological Impact\n\n#### Social\n\n##### Employee Health and Safety\n\n##### Community Relations\n\n##### Workforce Management\n\n##### Product Quality and Safety\n\n#### Governance\n\n##### Business Ethic\n\n##### Data Privacy and Security\n\n##### Supply Chain Management\n\n##### Business Model Resilience\n\n## Working at SilTerra\n\nAt SilTerra, we recognize that our technology begins with our p"}}, "page_text": "* [About Us][1] * [Corporate Profile][2] * [Corporate Information][3] * [Corporate Social Responsibility][4] * [Semiconductor Value Chain][5] * [Our Solutions][6] * [Technology][7] * [Design Solutions][8] * [Services][9] * [Manufacturing][10] * [Manufacturing][11] * [Accreditation][12] * [Environmental, Health & Safety (EHS)][13] * [Quality and HSPM][14] * [End Markets][15] * [News][16] * [Announcements][17] * [Events][18] * [ESG][19] * [Career][20] * [Our People][21] * [Why Join Us][22] * [Vacancies][23] * [Internship Opportunities][24] * [Career Fair][25] * [Contact Us][26] Menu * [About Us][27] * [Corporate Profile][28] * [Corporate Information][29] * [Corporate Social Responsibility][30] * [Semiconductor Value Chain][31] * [Our Solutions][32] * [Technology][33] * [Design Solutions][34] * [Services][35] * [Manufacturing][36] * [Manufacturing][37] * [Accreditation][38] * [Environmental, Health & Safety (EHS)][39] * [Quality and HSPM][40] * [End Markets][41] * [News][42] * [Announcements][43] * [Events][44] * [ESG][45] * [Career][46] * [Our People][47] * [Why Join Us][48] * [Vacancies][49] * [Internship Opportunities][50] * [Career Fair][51] * [Contact Us][52] * [MPW Program][53] * [MyFab][54] * [Vendor Management][55] * [MPW Program][56] * [MyFab][57] * [Vendor Management][58] GREAT TECHNOLOGY, ENABLING INNOVATION EVERYWHERE ## We are a Global Semiconductor Foundry We are continuously innovating to bring leading-edge semiconductor solutions that will transform the world Globally ranked 19^{th} by IC Insights in the category of pure-play foundries in 2023, SilTerra strives to provide outstanding technologies and services to our customers. Our leadership in advanced semiconductor wafer processing sets the stage to bring transformation in consumer electronics, next generation data communications networks, industrial, medical technologies and mobility. SilTerra is a strategic investment of Dagang NeXchange Berhad (“DNeX”) and Beijing Integrated Circuit Advanced Manufacturing and High-End Equity Investment Fund Center (Limited Partnership) (“CGP Fund”). [ Explore More ][59] Location Headquartered in Kulim with sales office in Taiwan. Years of Operation More than 24 years Employees More than 1,100 skilled employees Manufacturing Capacity 40,000 wafers per month ## Technology Solutions that Transform the World We work closely with our technology partners to bring next-generation solutions to life. [ Explore More ][60] ## Sustainability Statement Our Approach to Sustainability SilTerra is committed to contributing toward global action to create greater environmental sustainability and improve social equity. We have a responsibility towards various stakeholders including our shareholders, employees, customers, and business partners to operate in a manner that is ethical and responsible while providing assurance of long-term business viability. These commitments are the foundation of our sustainability agenda, which is integral to all our decisions and direction encompassing Environmental, Social, and Governance (“ESG”) matters. To be an exemplary corporate citizen, we strive to address areas most critical to our stakeholders and our business sustainability. We place particular emphasis on 12 material issues as shown below which have strategic importance to our business, stakeholder concerns, and our ability to make a positive impact. [ Read More ][61] #### Environmental ##### GHG Emissions ##### Energy Management ##### Resource Management ##### Ecological Impact #### Social ##### Employee Health and Safety ##### Community Relations ##### Workforce Management ##### Product Quality and Safety #### Governance ##### Business Ethic ##### Data Privacy and Security ##### Supply Chain Management ##### Business Model Resilience ## Working at SilTerra At SilTerra, we recognize that our technology begins with our people. We consider our people as our greatest asset. Our culture encourages to push our selves, be our best and take on technology challenges to make a positive impact in this world. [ Explore More ][62] # Contact Us * SilTerra Malaysia Sdn. Bhd. 199501039745 (368948-D) * +604-401 5111 [ Facebook-f ][63] [ ][64] [ Linkedin ][65] [ ][66] © 2024 Copyright SilTerra Malaysia Sdn. Bhd. 199501039745 (368948-D) All rights reserved. Trademarks and brands are the property of their respective owners. We use cookies to enable services and functionality on our site and to improve your website experience. By clicking on Accept, you agree to our use of such technologies for marketing and analytics. See Privacy Policy. [ Accept ][67] [1]: # [2]: https://www.silterra.com/corporate-profile/ [3]: https://www.silterra.com/corporate-information/ [4]: https://www.silterra.com/corporate-social-responsibility/ [5]: https://www.silterra.com/semiconductor-value-chain/ [6]: # [7]: https://www.silterra.com/technology/ [8]: https://www.silterra.com/design-solutions/ [9]: https://www.silterra.com/services/ [10]: # [11]: https://www.silterra.com/manufacturing/ [12]: https://www.silterra.com/accreditation/ [13]: https://www.silte