 our DNA, culture and business strategy. ## FTSE4Good Index Inari Amertron Berhad has met the globally recognised standard and qualified for inclusion into the FTSE4Good Bursa Malaysia (“F4GBM”) Index since 22 June 2020. The F4GBM is a recognition given to qualified public companies listed on Bursa Malaysia Securities Berhad which has demonstrated strong Environmental, Social and Governance (“ESG”) practices. The inclusion into the F4GBM Index represents an outstanding achievement by Inari to its strong commitment towards balancing profitability and sustainability. Inari Amertron Berhad has met the globally recognised standard and qualified for inclusion into the FTSE4Good Bursa Malaysia (“F4GBM”) Index since 22 June 2020. The F4GBM is a recognition given to qualified public companies listed on Bursa Malaysia Securities Berhad which has demonstrated strong Environmental, Social and Governance (“ESG”) practices. The inclusion into the F4GBM Index represents an outstanding achievement by Inari to its strong commitment towards balancing profitability and sustainability. ### **Economic** **Best Practice Results** Inari promises to deliver quality services and products to our customers, uphold good business conduct and ethics and deliver good returns to our shareholders. ### **Environment** **Caring for Our Planet** Inari will continue to advocate green development across all our current and future business operations. ### **Workplace** **Caring for Our People** Inari has systems in place to continuously improve workplace wellbeing, respect human right, retain talent and bring untoward incidents at workplace to zero. ### **Communities** **Giving Back** Inari is committed to continuously improve the wellbeing and living standard of its surrounding communities. ## Corporate Office **Malaysia** **Address:** D-07-03, Plaza Kelana Jaya Jalan SS7/13A, Kelana Jaya, 47301 Petaling Jaya, Selangor, Malaysia. **Email:** [i-enquiry@inari-amertron.com.my][183] **Phone:** +603 7876 0169 **Fax:** +603 7876 0167 ## Operating Offices **Malaysia** **Address:** Plot 51, Jalan Hilir Sungai Keluang 4, Phase 4 Bayan Lepas Free Industrial Zone, 11900 Bayan Lepas, Pulau Pinang, Malaysia. **Email:** [i-enquiry@inari-amertron.com.my][184] **Phone:** +604 645 6618 **Fax:** +604 646 0618 **Philippines** **Address:** Building 2430 Maloma Street, Clark Freeport Zone, Clarkfield, Pampanga, Philippines 2023. **Email:** [i-enquiry@inari-amertron.com.my][185] **Phone:** +63 45 599 3253 **Fax:** +63 45 599 3254 **China** **Address:** 中国江苏省昆山市昆山综合保税区新竹路8# No. 8, Xin Zhu Road, Kunshan Comprehensive Bonded Zones, Kunshan City, Jiangsu Province, 215300, China **Email:** [i-enquiry@inari-amertron.com.my][186] **Phone:** +86 512 5736 6835 **Fax:** +86 512 5735 9860 [Inari Amertron Berhad Logo] Inari Amertron Berhad 益纳利美昌有限公司 is an investment holding company with wholly-owned subsidiaries involved in the Outsourced Semiconductor Assembly and Test (OSAT) & electronics manufacturing (EMS) industries. **About Us** [Our Vision & Mission][187] [Our Key Beliefs][188] [Board of Directors][189] [Senior Management Team][190] **Services & Solutions** [Our Operation][191] [Wafer Probe & Processing][192] [Assembly][193] [Package Test][194] [Other Services][195] **Quality & Awards** [QMS & Certifications][196] [Quality Policy & Assurance][197] [Our Awards][198] **CG & Sustainability** [Board Charter][199] [Terms of Reference][200] [Policies and Procedures][201] [Corporate Governance Reports][202] [Sustainability Statements][203] [Corporate Social Responsibilities][204] [Occupational Safety and Health][205] **Investor Relations** [Bursa Announcements][206] [Financial Results][207] [Annual Reports][208] [Annual General Meetings][209] [News & Press Releases][210] [Stock Information][211] [IR Contact][212] **Corporate Office** Tel: +603 7876 0169 | Fax: +6", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Inari Amertron — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: OSAT sp