oundry\n   [ Intel Foundry ][81]\n   * [ World-Class Wafer Foundry ][82]\n   * [ Advanced Packaging ][83]\n   * [ Chiplets ][84]\n   * [ Software and Services ][85]\n   * [ Design Ecosystem Accelerator Alliances ][86]\n7. More +\n1. [My Intel Dashboard ][87]\n   My Tools\n   Sign Out\n2. Select Language\n3. Toggle Search Ask Intel\n   Ask Intel Ask Intel\n   \n   \n   Quick Links\n   * [ Product Information ][88]\n   * [ Support ][89]\n   * [ Drivers & Software ][90]\n   \n   Recent\n[Cube Shadow Image]\n[product badge for Intel Xeon 6+ processors]\n\nIntel® Xeon® 6+ processors\n\n## Meet the future of network performance\n\nGet high-density, power-efficient performance for AI-ready networking and 5G core.\n\n[Explore the capabilities][91]\n[Product badge for Intel Arc G-series processors]\n\nIntel® Arc™ G-series processors\n\n## More power in the palm of your hand\n\nThe new handheld processor delivering AI-powered upscaling, richer visuals, and longer battery life.\n\n[See what’s inside][92]\n[Image of a McLaren yellow F1 racing car on top of a black background]\n\n## Innovation at full throttle\n\nIntel and McLaren Racing are teaming up to push the boundaries of what’s possible.\n\n[See what’s driving it][93]\n[Graphic of pink and white Computex logo overtop of a dark blue background]\n\n## Inside Intel at Computex\n\nCatch the biggest"}}, "page_text": "[ Skip To Main Content ][1] Toggle Navigation 1. Products [ Products Home ][2] [ Processors ][3] * [ Intel® Core™ Ultra Processors ][4] * [ Intel® Core™ Processors ][5] * [ Intel® Xeon® Processors ][6] * [ Intel® Xeon® CPU Max Series ][7] * [ Intel® Arc™ G-Series Processors ][8] * [ Intel Atom® Processors ][9] [ Select Systems & Devices ][10] * [ AI PCs Powered by Intel ][11] * [ Gaming Systems ][12] * [ Intel vPro® for Business ][13] * [ Intel® Arc™ Graphics ][14] * [ Intel® Wi-Fi Products ][15] [ AI Accelerators ][16] * [ Intel® Gaudi® AI Accelerators ][17] * [ Intel® Data Center GPU Flex Series ][18] [ Network 