ore Career * [Browse & Apply][191] * [Application Process][192] * Resources at TSMC * [Core Values][193] * [Relocation to Headquarter][194] * Life at TSMC * [Working Environment][195] * [Inclusive Workplace][196] * [ESG][197] * Research * [Overview][198] * Research Areas * [Overview][199] * [Logic][200] * [Interconnect][201] * [Memory][202] * [Artificial Intelligence][203] * Collaborations * [Collaboration Programs][204] * [Events][205] * Careers * [Openings][206] * [Core Values][207] * [Vision and Mission][208] * [Inclusive Workplace][209] * About TSMC * [Overview][210] * Company Info * [Overview][211] * [Vision and Mission][212] * [Values and Business Philosophy][213] * [Organization][214] * [Executives][215] * [Board of Directors][216] * [Document Center][217] * Foundation & Museum * [TSMC Museum of Innovation][218] * [TSMC Charity Foundation][219] * [TSMC Education and Culture Foundation][220] * Policy * [Human Rights Policy][221] * [Quality Policy][222] * [Risk Management Policy][223] * Contact Us * [TSMC Fabs][224] * [Subsidiaries][225] * [Business Contacts][226] * [Investor Relations, Public Relations, ESG Contacts][227] * [Procurement Contacts][228] * [Career Contact][229] * [Whistleblowing Mechanism][230] * Search * * [English][231] * [繁中][232] * [简中][233] * [日本語][234] Search [2026 TSMC Global OIP Ecosystem Events] ## 2026 TSMC ## Global OIP Ecosystem Events Join Us to Connect, Collaborate, and Shape the Future of AI [LEARN MORE][235] [A14] ## TSMC A14 ## With NanoFlex™ Pro Advancing the AI Future [LEARN MORE][236] [A16] ## TSMC A16™ ## Nanosheet with Super Power Rail Best suited for HPC / AI with Innovative, best-in-class backside power solution [LEARN MORE][237] [2024 Sustainability Report] ## 2024 Sustainability Report [LEARN MORE][238] [Innovation Zone] ## Innovation Zone Explore 2025 Innovation Zone highlight and customer demo videos [LEARN MORE][239] [TSMC University FinFET Program] ## TSMC University FinFET Program [LEARN MORE][240] [LATEST NEWS][241] [ RECENT EVENTS ][242] [ 2027 Advance Offer Program ][243] [ TSMC 2Q26 Earnings Conference and Conference Call (2026/07/16) ][244] [ 2026 Technology Symposium Highlights ][245] BLOG [ A Shared Commitment to Energy-Efficient AI (2025/11/07) ][246] [ Advancing 3D IC Design for AI Innovation (2024/09/26) ][247] [ Celebrating 15 Years of Innovation Enabled by OIP Ecosystem Collaboration (2023/10/06) ][248] ## Start Your Career with TSMC When you work at TSMC, you can transform your passion into results. Search Jobs Location Taiwan Canada China Germany - Dresden Germany - Munich Japan - Yokohama Japan - Osaka Japan - Tsukuba Japan - Kumamoto Korea Netherlands USA - Arizona USA - California USA - Massachusetts USA - Texas USA - Washington USA - Washington, D.C. Career Area R&D More-than-Moore Technology IC Design Technology Manufacturing (fabs) Facility & Industrial Safety / Environmental Protection Product Development R&D Advanced Packaging Technology Developmen Quality and Reliability Information Technology Internal Audit Business Development Customer Service Corporate Planning Finance / Accounting Human Resources Legal Materials Mgt. & Risk Mgt. Corporate Sustainability (ESG) Administration Testing Development and Technology Accessibility Inclusion Major Electronics Electrical Chemistry/Chemical Materials Physics Mechanical Information Technology/Management Industrial Engineering/Management Manufacturing Engineering Business Management Finance/Accounting Social Science Others Job Type Technician Engineer / Admin Manager Search Jobs ##### Sustainability Report TSMC publishes its Sustainability Report annually to transparently reflect the values and progress the Company delivers. The Report is compiled in line with international standards of sustainability and responds to issues of stakeholders’ concerns. [LEARN MORE ][249] ##### 38th Taiwan Continuous Improvement Awards (TCIA) TSMC continues to enhance Total Quality of local industries and recognizes outstanding suppliers at Taiwan Continuous Improvement Awards (TCIA). [LEARN MORE ][250] ##### TSMC Charity Foundation The TSMC Charity Foundation defined four key focuses, according to TSMC's Corporate Social Responsibility Policy and UN Sustainable Development Goals, we focused on : taking care of elder people, promoting filial piety, caring for the disadvantaged, and protecting the environment to create a better Taiwan Society. [LEARN MORE ][251] ##### TSMC Education and Culture Foundation TSMC Education and Culture Foundation has been long-time devoted to education and culture to fulfill TSMC's social responsibility. The Foundation's three engagements are caring about the educational disadvantaged, supporting youth with multiple educational platforms, and promoting arts and culture. [LEARN MORE ][252] ##### TSMC Museum of Innovation Here we explore how TSMC and its innovative business model accelerate innovation in integrated circuit (IC) design and product applications. These innovations propel ICs' pervasiveness in our modern world while significantly improving our lives. Here too, we learn how TSMC contributes to global IC innovation and to Taiwan's economy. [LEARN MORE ][253] ##### TSMC Green Buildings TSMC was among a select group of companies invited to screen videos highlighting their CSR efforts at the 2012 United Nations Conference on Sustainable Development, also known as the \"Rio +20\" Conference. [LEARN MORE ][254] [ [tsmc-online] TSMC-Online Online information and transaction for our customers ][255] [ [tsmc-supply] TSMC-Supply Online 360 The web-based portal for TSMC suppliers ][256] [ [document-center ] Document Center Find more information about TSMC ][257] * [Dedicated IC Foundry][258] * [Overview][259] * [Technology][260] * [Manufacturin", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "TSMC — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: TSMC is the world's largest dedicated semiconductor foundry, manufacturing chips for others. | World's largest dedicated semiconductor foundry. | Taiwan | Taiwan", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "69", "Y Score": "66", "Overall Score": "68", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "X-FAB Silicon Foundries", "Website": "https://www.xfab.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Germany", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Germany)", "Operational Presence": "Germany", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "X-FAB is a leading foundry for analog/mixed-signal semiconductors, with manufacturing facilities in Germany, offering specialized processes for automotive, industrial, and medical", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "DE", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "X-FAB Silicon Foundries — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Foundry manufacturing analog/mixed-signal semiconductors.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "xfab.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "xfab.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[[XFAB Logo]][1]\n* [News/Events][2]\n* [Investors][3]\n* [Career][4]\n* [Tools][5]\n* [My X-FAB][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n* [Search][8]\n* [About us][9]\n  * [News & Events][10]\n  * [Investors][11]\n  * [Career][12]\n  * [Sustainability][13]\n* [Markets][14]\n  * [Automotive][15]\n  * [Medical][16]\n  * [Industrial][17]\n  * [Communication & Consumer][18]\n* [Technology][19]\n  * [High Voltage][20]\n  * [e-NVM][21]\n  * [Sensors][22]\n  * [Photonics][23]\n  * [SiC & GaN][24]\n  * [WLP & 3D Integration][25]\n  * [Silicon-based Microfluidics][26]\n  * [Innovation][27]\n* [Manufacturing][28]\n  * [Our Fabs][29]\n  * [Supply Chain Management][30]\n  * [Quality][31]\n  * [Prototyping][32]\n* [Design Support][33]\n  * [FeatureXplorer][34]\n  * [ResourceXplorer][35]\n  * [X-CHAIN][36]\n  * [IP Portal][37]\n* [EN][38]\n\n## Your specialty foundryFOR THE ANALOG WORLD\n\n# What we do...\n\nX-FAB is a global foundry group providing a comprehensive set of specialty technologies and design\nIP to enable its customers to develop world-leading semiconductor products that are manufactured at\nX-FAB's six wafer fabs located in Malaysia, Germany, France, and the United States.\n\nWith our expertise in analog/mixed-signal technologies, microsystems/MEMS and silicon carbide (SiC),\nX-FAB is the development and manufacturing partner for its customers, primarily serving\nthe [automotive][39], [industrial][40], and [medical][41] end markets.\n\n## News\n\nJun 23, 2026\n\n### [Grant notification presented: X-FAB develops Erfurt site into a center for microsystems\n### technology][42]\n\nGerman federal government and Free State of Thuringia support key project for the future of\nThuringia’s microelectronics location with Euro 127.4 million\n\n[ Read more ][43]\n\nMay 28, 2026\n\n### [X-FAB and Cadence Strengthen Collaboration to Streamline Design Migration Across Nodes][44]\n\nX-FAB Silicon Foundries has expanded its long-standing collaboration with [Cadence][45] to deliver a\nstreamlined and highly automated approach to design migration across semiconductor…\n\n[ Read more ][46]\n\nFeb 24, 2026\n\n### [SandGrain Launches Secure IoT Solution Based on X-FAB’s Proven 180 nm Foundry Technology][47]\n\nTechnology collaboration enables first-time-right success and fast time-to-market for SandGrain's\nunique CyberRock solution in a European ecosystem\n\n[ Read more ][48]\n[More News][49]\n\n## Events\n\nSep 27\n\n### [ICSCRM 2026][50]\n\nYokohama, Japan | 27 September - 2 October 2026\n\nJoin X-FAB at ICSCRM 2026 in Yokohama, Japan, from September 28 to October 2, and visit us at\n**Booth C1**.\n\nAs a leading foundry for specialty semiconductor technologies, X-FAB will…\n\n[ Read more ][51]\nNov 10\n\n### [electronica 2026][52]\n\nMunich, Germany | 10-13 November 2026\n\nX-FAB will be exhibiting at **electronica 2026**, the world’s leading electronics trade show and\nconference where the global semiconductor community will gather.\n\nThroughout the show,…\n\n[ Read more ][53]\nNov 19\n\n### [ICCAD 2026][54]\n\nBeijing, China | 19-20 November 2026\n\nIC Annual Development Forum & IC Design Industry Exhibition (ICCAD-Expo) has consistently played a\nvital role in promoting industrial agglomeration, connecting industrial…\n\n[ Read more ][55]\nMar 07\n\n### [APEC 2027][56]\n\nNew Orleans, Louisiana, USA | 7-11 March 2027\n\nX-FAB is proud to be part of the coming Applied Power Electronics Conference (APEC), the premier\nevent for power electronics professionals. Visit our booth to discover how X-FAB’s…\n\n[ Read more ][57]\n\n## Market solutions\n\nWith our broad range of specialty technologies including the unique combination of CMOS and MEMS\nprocess capabilities, we are well equipped to manufacture complex devices that meet the exacting\nquality requirements of the automotive, industrial, consumer and medical industries. \n\n### Automotive\n\nReliability and trust are two key requisites for serving the automotive industry. Our focus on\nsecurity issues, complex demands and the extreme environmental conditions faced by the automotive\nindustry helps us determine which advanced solutions best bene"}}, "page_text": "[[XFAB Logo]][1] * [News/Events][2] * [Investors][3] * [Career][4] * [Tools][5] * [My X-FAB][6] * [Contact][7] * [Search][8] * [About us][9] * [News & Events][10] * [Investors][11] * [Career][12] * [Sustainability][13] * [Markets][14] * [Automotive][15] * [Medical][16] * [Industrial][17] * [Communication & Consumer][18] * [Technology][19] * [High Voltage][20] * [e-NVM][21] * [Sensors][22] * [Photonics][23] * [SiC & GaN][24] * [WLP & 3D Integration][25] * [Silicon-based Microfluidics][26] * [Innovation][27] * [Manufacturing][28] * [Our Fabs][29] * [Supply Chain Management][30] * [Quality][31] * [Prototyping][32] * [Design Support][33] * [FeatureXplorer][34] * [ResourceXplorer][35] * [X-CHAIN][36] * [IP Portal][37] * [EN][38] ## Your specialty foundryFOR THE ANALOG WORLD # What we do... X-FAB is a global foundry group providing a comprehensive set of specialty technologies and design IP to enable its customers to develop world-leading semiconductor products that are manufactured at X-FAB's six wafer fabs located in Malaysia, Germany, France, and the United States. With our expertise in analog/mixed-signal technologies, microsystems/MEMS and silicon carbide (SiC), X-FAB is the development and manufacturing partner for its customers, primarily serving the [automotive][39], [industrial][40], and [medical][41] end markets. ## News Jun 23, 2026 ### [Grant notification presented: X-FAB develops Erfurt site into a center for microsystems ### technology][42] German federal government and Free State of Thuringia support key project for the future of Thuringia’s microelectronics location with Euro 127.4 million [ Read more ][43] May 28, 2026 ### [X-FAB and Cadence Strengthen Collaboration to Streamline Design Migration Across Nodes][44] X-FAB Silicon Foundries has expanded its long-standing collaboration with [Cadence][45] to deliver a streamlined and highly automated approach to design migration across semiconductor… [ Read more ][46] Feb 24, 2026 ### [SandGrain Launches Secure IoT Solution Based on X-FAB’s Proven 180 nm Foundry Technology][47] Technology collaboration enables first-time-right success and fast time-to-market for SandGrain's unique CyberRock solution in a European ecosystem [ Read more ][48] [More News][49] ## Events Sep 27 ### [ICSCRM 2026][50] Yokohama, Japan | 27 September - 2 October 2026 Join X-FAB at ICSCRM 2026 in Yokohama, Japan, from September 28 to October 2, and visit us at **Booth C1**. As a leading foundry for specialty semiconductor technologies, X-FAB will… [ Read more ][51] Nov 10 ### [electronica 2026][52] Munich, Germany | 10-13 November 2026 X-FAB will be exhibiting at **electronica 2026**, the world’s leading electronics trade show and conference where the global semiconductor community will gather. Throughout the show,… [ Read more ][53] Nov 19 ### [ICCAD 2026][54] Beijing, China | 19-20 November 2026 IC Annual Development Forum & IC Design Industry Exhibition (ICCAD-Expo) has consistently played a vital role in promoting industrial agglomeration, connecting industrial… [ Read more ][55] Mar 07 ### [APEC 2027][56] New Orleans, Louisiana, USA | 7-11 March 2027 X-FAB is proud to be part of the coming Applied Power Electronics Conference (APEC), the premier event for power electronics professionals. Visit our booth to discover how X-FAB’s… [ Read more ][57] ## Market solutions With our broad range of specialty technologies including the unique combination of CMOS and MEMS process capabilities, we are well equipped to manufacture complex devices that meet the exacting quality requirements of the automotive, industrial, consumer and medical industries. ### Automotive Reliability and trust are two key requisites for serving the automotive industry. Our focus on security issues, complex demands and the extreme environmental conditions faced by the automotive industry helps us determine which advanced solutions best benefit automotive designers and their customers. [Read more][58] ### Medical As a supplier for the medical market - one in which people trust technology for their health and recovery - we are committed to deliver solutions that are accurate and reliable for our customers' medical devices. [Read more][59] ### Industrial The products designed with our processes for the industrial market find their way into a broad range of industrial applications that require both robust devices and highly flexible manufacturing capabilities. [Read more][60] ### Consumer & Mobile Applications We entered the mobile communications market with a clear vision: connecting mobile devices with the real world. With this vision in mind, we became a leading foundry provider for discrete and integrated mobile sensor solutions, offering expert support to enable first-time-right designs. [Read more][61] ## Sustainability Sustainability embodies many different facets, from environmental care to health and safety, human rights, business ethics and social responsibility. Visit our sustainability webpage to find more information. [Sustainability at X-FAB][62] ## Technology portfolio As a pure-play foundry specialized in analog/mixed-signal applications, we offer a wide range of modular CMOS and SOI processes in geometries ranging from 1.0 µm to 110 nm as well as special MEMS and SiC process capabilities. See our whole portfolio here: [technology overview][63] ### [ CMOS & SOI ][64] 13 process families with over 450 options ### [ MEMS ][65] MEMS with or without integrated CMOS ### [ SiC & GaN ][66] Processing technologies for WBG 6” SiC & 8” GaN-on-Si ### [ Heterogeneous Integration ][67] 3D Integration and Wafer Level Package Solutions [Read more][68] ## Social media channels ## Contact For more information, please contact us: First name* Last name* Company* E-Mail* Country Please SelectAfghanistanAlbaniaAlgeriaAndorraAngolaAntigua and BarbudaArgentinaArmeniaAustraliaAustriaAzerbaijanBahamasBahrainBangladeshBarbadosBelarusBelgiumBeliz eBeninBhutanBoliviaBosnia and HerzegovinaBotswanaBrazilBruneiBulgariaBurkina FasoBurundiCabo VerdeCambodiaCameroonCanadaCentral African RepublicChadChileChinaColombiaComorosCongo (Congo-Brazzaville)Costa RicaCôte d'IvoireCroatiaCubaCyprusCzechia (Czech Republic)Democratic Republic of the CongoDenmarkDjiboutiDominicaDominican RepublicEcuadorEgyptEl SalvadorEquatorial GuineaEritreaEstoniaEswatin