ite": "https://www.ensilica.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "United Kingdom", "Continent / Geography": "EU(United Kingdom)", "Operational Presence": "United Kingdom", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "UK-based fabless semiconductor company specializing in mixed-signal ASICs.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "GB", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "EnSilica — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Fabless semiconductor company designing mixed-signal ASICs.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "ensilica.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "ensilica.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Search for:\n* [Follow][1]\n[Contact us][2]\n* [What We Offer][3]\n  * [Turnkey ASIC][4]\n  * [Design Services][5]\n  * [Manufacturing Services][6]\n  * [Products (ASSP)][7]\n    * [SatCom Products][8]\n    * [Automotive / Industrial Products][9]\n  * [Silicon IP][10]\n* [Markets][11]\n  * [Industrial][12]\n  * [Automotive][13]\n  * [Communications][14]\n  * [Healthcare][15]\n* [Careers][16]\n  * [Life at EnSilica][17]\n  * [Job Vacancies][18]\n* [Investors][19]\n* [News & Insights][20]\n* [Company][21]\n  * [About Us][22]\n  * [EnSilica’s Engineering Strength][23]\n  * [Case Studies][24]\n  * [Leadership Team][25]\n  * [Quality & Sustainability][26]\n  * [Locations][27]\n  * [Sales & Representatives][28]\n  * [Partners][29]\n    * [Development & Supply Chain Partners][30]\n    * [Innovation Partners][31]\n* [Contact Us][32]\n\n# Your turnkey ASIC supplier\n\n## Turnkey ASICs Complex Mixed-Signal and RF Industrial, Automotive and Comms Safe and Secure\n## Silicon World-Class Design Teams Engineering Excellence Full Supply Chain Delivery High-Quality,\n## Production-Proven\n\n## European fabless semiconductor company specialising in complex mixed-signal & RF chips.\n## \n## Delivering safe and secure silicon for demanding applications.\n\n#### Who we are\n\nWith our world-class expertise in RF, mmWave, mixed-signal and digital ICs, we are the supplier of\nchoice for customers in the automotive, industrial and communications markets.\n\nEnSilica has a 25 year track record of delivering high-quality solutions to demanding industrial\nstandards.\n\n#### Why Ensilica\n\n## Our team has the expertise and experience to deliver high-quality products and solutions to\n## specification, on time, and on budget.\n\n[Engineering Strength][33]\n\n#### Proven Track Record in ASIC Design\n\n[Turnkey ASIC][34]\n\n#### Full End-to-End ASIC Services\n\n[Design Services][35]\n\n#### Specialization in Mixed-Signal and RF Design\n\n#### Silicon-Proven IP Portfolio\n\n[Silicon IP][36]\n\n#### Flexible Engagement Models\n\n#### Strong Supply Chain and Foundry Partnerships\n\n[Partners][37]\n\n### Number of successful designs\n\n### Employees Worldwide\n\n### Number of Design Locations worldwide\n\n%\n\n### More than 80% Engineers\n\n### Continents\n\n#### Core Skills\n\n## World-class domain expertise\n\n### Sensing & Control Systems\n* Combining precision analog interfaces, deterministic timing, high-performance processing, and\n  built-in functional safety and cybersecurity.\n* Solutions spanning through MCUs for PLC and control applications, sensor processing, radar, and\n  edge AI across automotive, industrial, healthcare, and critical infrastructure markets.\n\n### Communication Systems\n* ASSP and ASIC solutions for advanced communications systems, including satellite user terminals\n  and payloads, high-throughput microwave backhaul, radio units, and resilient positioning,\n  navigation, and timing (PNT).\n* Analog, hybrid, and digital beamforming for flat-panel phased-array terminals, alongside low-power\n  5G NTN modems built on software-defined radio architectures.\n\n### Functional Safety & Cybersecurity\n* Functional safety and cybersecurity as core elements of EnSilica silicon\n* ASIC and ASSP solutions for systems requiring deterministic behaviour, reliability, and long-term\n  security.\n* Development flows align with recognised standards including ISO 26262 and DO-254, enabling robust\n  fault management and predictable operation.\n* Hardware-rooted security is integrated in line under the PSA framework and ISO 21434, including\n  secure boot, isolation, post quantum cryptographic acceleration, and secure key management.\n\n### Power Management and High Voltage\n* Application-specific ASICs for automotive and industrial power management and high-voltage systems\n  using BCD technologies.\n* Solutions integrating power management, high-voltage analog circuitry, gate drivers, and\n  half-bridge and H-bridge architectures with precision sensing and deterministic digital control.\n\n#### Some of our recent projects\n\n## We have the knowledge to deliver.\n\n[[ASI"}}, "page_text": "Search for: * [Follow][1] [Contact us][2] * [What We Offer][3] * [Turnkey ASIC][4] * [Design Services][5] * [Manufacturing Services][6] * [Products (ASSP)][7] * [SatCom Products][8] * [Automotive / Industrial Products][9] * [Silicon IP][10] * [Markets][11] * [Industrial][12] * [Automotive][13] * [Communications][14] * [Healthcare][15] * [Careers][16] * [Life at EnSilica][17] * [Job Vacancies][18] * [Investors][19] * [News & Insights][20] * [Company][21] * [About Us][22] * [EnSilica’s Engineering Strength][23] * [Case Studies][24] * [Leadership Team][25] * [Quality & Sustainability][26] * [Locations][27] * [Sales & Representatives][28] * [Partners][29] * [Development & Supply Chain Partners][30] * [Innovation Partners][31] * [Contact Us][32] # Your turnkey ASIC supplier ## Turnkey ASICs Complex Mixed-Signal and RF Industrial, Automotive and Comms Safe and Secure ## Silicon World-Class Design Teams Engineering Excellence Full Supply Chain Delivery High-Quality, ## Production-Proven ## European fabless semiconductor company specialising in complex mixed-signal & RF chips. ## ## Delivering safe and secure silicon for demanding applications. #### Who we are With our world-class expertise in RF, mmWave, mixed-signal and digital ICs, we are the supplier of choice for customers in the automotive, industrial and communications markets. EnSilica has a 25 year track record of delivering high-quality solutions to demanding industrial standards. #### Why Ensilica ## Our team has the expertise and experience to deliver high-quality products and solutions to ## specification, on time, and on budget. [Engineering Strength][33] #### Proven Track Record in ASIC Design [Turnkey ASIC][34] #### Full End-to-End ASIC Services [Design Services][35] #### Specialization in Mixed-Signal and RF Design #### Silicon-Proven IP Portfolio [Silicon IP][36] #### Flexible Engagement Models #### Strong Supply Chain and Foundry Partnerships [Partners][37] ### Number of successful designs ### Employees Worldwide ### Number of Design Locations worldwide % ### More than 80% Engineers ### Continents #### Core Skills ## World-class domain expertise ### Sensing & Control Systems * Combining precision analog interfaces, deterministic timing, high-performance processing, and built-in functional safety and cybersecurity. * Solutions spanning through MCUs for PLC and control applications, sensor processing, radar, and edge AI across automotive, industrial, healthcare, and critical infrastructure markets. ### Communication Systems * ASSP and ASIC solutions for advanced communications systems, including satellite user terminals and payloads, high-throughput microwave backhaul, radio units, and resilient positioning, navigation, and timing (PNT). * Analog, hybrid, and digital beamforming for flat-panel phased-array terminals, alongside low-power 5G NTN modems built on software-defined radio architectures. ### Functional Safety & Cybersecurity * Functional safety and cybersecurity as core elements of EnSilica silicon * ASIC and ASSP solutions for systems requiring deterministic behaviour, reliability, and long-term security. * Development flows align with recognised standards including ISO 26262 and DO-254, enabling robust fault management and predictable operation. * Hardware-rooted security is integrated in line under the PSA framework and ISO 21434, including secure boot, isolation, post quantum cryptographic acceleration, and secure key management. ### Power Management and High Voltage * Application-specific ASICs for automotive and industrial power management and high-voltage systems using BCD technologies. * Solutions integrating power management, high-voltage analog circuitry, gate drivers, and half-bridge and H-bridge architectures with precision sensing and deterministic digital control. #### Some of our recent projects ## We have the knowledge to deliver. [[ASIL-D automotive chassis controller ASIC]][38] February 3, 2026 ### ASIL-D automotive chassis controller ASIC [[Sensor interface cryptographic Bridge ASIC]][39] February 3, 2026 ### Sensor interface cryptographic Bridge ASIC [[Energy harvesting authentication ASIC]][40] January 27, 2026 ### Energy harvesting authentication ASIC No results found. [More Case Studies][41] #### End to End Capabilities #### Quality statement ## Quality is at the heart of everything we do. At EnSilica, we are dedicated to delivering ## high-quality, custom ASIC and SoC solutions with a strong focus on reliability, safety, and ## industry compliance. Our commitment to excellence is underpinned by a certified quality management system, ensuring every project meets rigorous ISO standards from concept to final delivery. [Read More][42] #### NEws ## What’s new at EnSilica [More News & Insights][43] [[Why Communications Systems Are Migrating to ASIC Architectures]][44] July 9, 2026 | Articles ### Why Communications Systems Are Migrating to ASIC Architectures As communications systems continue to evolve to support higher data rates, lower power consumption and increasing ... [Read More][45] July 9, 2026 | EnSilica in the press ### Why Communications Systems are Migrating to ASIC Architectures Electronic Design [Read More][46] [[Meet us at CWTEC 2026]][47] June 29, 2026 | Events ### Meet us at CWTEC 2026 We're excited to be attending CWTEC 2026 — the CW Technology & Engineering Conference — on 8 July in London! ... [Read More][48] No results found. #### EnSilica Leadership Team ## Leadership Team [Meet our Team][49] ### Ian Lankshear Chief Executive Officer ### Peter Jeutter Vice President of Sales ### Davide Sarta Senior Vice President of Engineering ### Alan Wong Chief Technology Officer ### Kristoff Rademan Chief Financial Officer ### Olivia Slater Vice President - Operations & Quality ### Bernard Wu Vice President of Sensing & Control Business Unit ### Paul Morris Vice President of RF and Comms Business Unit ### Ramesh Doddamene Vice President - Design Services ### Helen Royston Head of HR ### Contact us to unlock your semiconductor solution [Contact Us][50] [][51] Registered in England and Wales. Company no: 04220106. Registered office: 100 Park Drive, Milton Park, Abingdon, Oxfordshire OX14 4RY [Contact Us][52] Policies * [Environmental Policy][53] * [Quality Policy][54] * [Privacy Policy][55] * [Cookies Policy][56] * [T&Cs of Use][57] Company * [About Us][58] * [Investors][59] * [Leadership Team][60] * [Quality & Sustainability][61] * [Design Locations][62] * [Development & Supply Chain Partners][63] Contact Us * [Contact Form][64] * [Sales & Representatives][65] * [+44 118 321 7310][66] * [sales@ensilica.com][67] Social Media * [LinkedIn][68] Copyright © 2026 Ensilca™ Privacy Notice This site uses cook