Ys][19] * [Linear Drivers][20] * [PAM DSPs][21] * [PCIe Retimers][22] * [Transimpedance Amplifiers][23] Storage * [Fibre Channel][24] * [HDD][25] * [Storage Accelerators][26] * [SSD Controllers][27] Custom * [ASIC][28] * [Marvell Government Solutions][29] [Data Center ][30] [Enterprise][31] [Carrier][32] * COMPANY Our Company * [About][33] * [Careers][34] * [Sustainability][35] * [Investors][36] * [Leadership][37] Media * [Blog][38] * [Events][39] * [Media Kit][40] * [Newsroom][41] * [Videos][42] Contact * [Contact Us][43] * [Locations][44] * [Sales][45] * [Support][46] * SUPPORT Support by Product * [Custom ASIC][47] * [Data Processing Units][48] * [Ethernet Controllers][49] * [Fibre Channel][50] * [Ethernet PHYs][51] * [Security Solutions][52] * [Storage][53] * [Ethernet Switches][54] Tools & Resources * [Customer Portal Login][55] * [Public Document Library][56] * [Public Driver Downloads][57] * [Product Security Center][58] BY TYPE Compute * [CXL][59] * [Data Processing Units][60] * [Security][61] Networking * [Coherent DSPs][62] * [Coherent-lite DSPs][63] * [Data Center Switches][64] * [DCI Optical Modules][65] * [Enterprise Switches][66] * [Ethernet Controllers][67] * [Ethernet PHYs][68] * [Linear Drivers][69] * [PAM DSPs][70] * [PCIe Retimers][71] * [Transimpedance Amplifiers][72] Storage * [Fibre Channel][73] * [HDD][74] * [Storage Accelerators][75] * [SSD Controllers][76] Custom * [ASIC][77] * [Marvell Government Solutions][78] BY MARKET * [Data Center ][79] * [Enterprise][80] * [Carrier][81] [ Watch the latest **Marvell Essential Technology Videos** WATCH NOW ][82] Our Company * [About][83] * [Careers][84] * [Sustainability][85] * [Investors][86] * [Leadership][87] Media * [Blog][88] * [Events][89] * [Media Kit][90] * [Newsroom][91] * [Videos][92] Contact * [Contact Us][93] * [Locations][94] * [Sales][95] * [Support][96] [ Watch the latest **Marvell Essential Technology Videos** WATCH NOW ][97] Support by Product * [Custom ASIC][98] * [Data Processing Units][99] * [Ethernet Controllers][100] * [Fibre Channel][101] * [Ethernet PHYs][102] * [Security Solutions][103] * [Storage][104] * [Ethernet Switches][105] Tools & Resources * [Customer Portal Login][106] * [Public Document Library][107] * [Public Driver Downloads][108] * [Product Security Center][109] FMS 2026 # Advancing AI # memory # infrastructure [Learn More][110] [Groundbreaking MicroLED Solutions] [Groundbreaking MicroLED Solutions] [Learn More][111] COMPUTEX 2026 Keynote # The future of AI # scaling depends # on connectivity [Learn More][112] [Next-generation CXL Switch] [Next-generation CXL Switch] [Learn More][113] Scale up and Scale out # First Monolithic # 102.4 Tbps # Switch [Learn More][114] [Scale up and Scale out] [Scale up and Scale out] [Learn More][115] Marvell Acquires Polariton # Advancing the # future of optical # connectivity [Learn More][116] [Marvell aquires Polariton] [Marvell aquires Polariton] [Learn More][117] strategic partnership # Expand the AI # ecosystem with # NVlink Fusion [Learn More][118] [Industry-first 1.6T Optical DSPs] [Industry-first 1.6T Optical DSPs] [Learn More][119] 1. fms26 2. computex26 3. t100 4. polariton 5. nvda ## Marvell Enables AI Infrastructure To realize the promise of AI, hyperscalers are undertaking one of the largest infrastructure buildouts in history—and they rely on Marvell as a critical AI infrastructure partner. Marvell designs custom silicon tailored for any application and offers the industry’s most comprehensive portfolio of interconnects and network switch products. From custom compute to rack, row, data center, campus and multi-campus connectivity, Marvell enables the world’s most advanced AI infrastructure. [Learn More][120] [Marvell Enables AI Infrastructure] ### Markets * DATA CENTER * ENTERPRISE * CARRIER Marvell Data Center Solutions [Marvell Data Center Solutions] DATA CENTER ### Scaling AI As the number and size of AI models explodes, data center infrastructure requirements are evolving rapidly, forcing innovation across the compute, interconnect and switching domains of accelerated infrastructure. Marvell custom silicon and system-level connectivity platforms enable hyperscalers to design and implement their own unique AI data-center architectures optimized for their own unique applications. [Learn More][121] Marvell Enterprise Solutions [Marvell Enterprise Solutions] ENTERPRISE ### Modernizing and Securing Networks To power digital transformation, there must be a more robust, secure and autonomous enterprise network that spans from HQ to branch to data center to cloud. Network equipment must support rising bandwidth demands, a more complex threat landscape and the analytics needed to power AIOps tools. Marvell has a networking and compute portfolio that delivers performance, intelligence, security and telemetry needed for the modern enterprise network. [Learn More][122] Marvell 5G wireless carrier solutions [Marvell 5G wireless carrier solutions] CARRIER ### Connecting the World with 5G Network Silicon With increased capabilities, performance and edge intelligence, 5G enables a plethora of new consumer and enterprise applications that promise to transform entire industries and serve the world’s diverse connectivity needs for years to come. Marvell compute, security and networking platforms effectively operate on a global scale with the performance and programmability that enable carriers to sustainably innovate in this frontier without compromise. [Learn More][123] [ Previous ][124] [ Next ][125] ### More to Explore [ ### About Marvell LEARN ABOUT US ][126] [ ### Careers LEARN MORE ][127] [ ### Investors LEARN MORE ][128] ##### Company * [Awards][129] * [Industry Associations][130] * [Trade Compliance][131] * [Trademarks][132] * [The Marvell Code][133] ##### Support * [Driver Downloads][134] * [Customer Portal Login][135] * [Support by Product][136] * [Marvell Concern Line][137] * [FAQs][138] ##### Careers * [University Recruiting][139] * [Jobs at Ma