nformation Top][157] * [Stock Data][158] * [Dividends][159] * [Shareholders' Meeting][160] * [Analyst Coverage][161] * [Stock Quote][162] * [ Dialogue with Shareholders and Investors ][163] * [ IR Releases ][164] * [ IR Calendar ][165] * [ FAQ ][166] * [ Contact Us ][167] * [ Disclaimer ][168] * [News Releases][169] * [ [Products] ][170] * [ [Manufacturing] ][171] * [ [About MegaChips] ][172] * [ [Sustainability] ][173] * [ [Initiatives to Enhance Human Resources] ][174] Stop ## Important Information * [ [Japan's First] Collaboration with Acumino to Establish AI Robot Demonstration Environment ][175] * [ \"Initiatives to Enhance Human Resources\" has been updated. ][176] ## Products To solve your problems with ASIC full turn-key services, ASSP, and module, MegaChips provides strategic solutions, leveraging our analog and digital technology. [Learn More][177] * [ ASIC ][178] * [ ASSP ][179] * [ Module ][180] * [ Document Download ][181] * [ Introduction of Products (YouTube) ][182] * [ Product Releases ][183] ## Manufacturing (Monozukuri) While satisfying customer needs with unique core technology, MegaChips provides safe and reliable products with Japanese Monozukuri quality through our advanced development capability and technology. [Learn More][184] * [ Production ][185] * [ Quality ][186] * [ Procurement ][187] * [ Partnership ][188] ## About MegaChips MegaChips is a global fabless semiconductor company which furthers the development of products centering on system LSIs. To support the business success of customers with unique technology and innovative solutions – this has been one of our unchanging core values. [Learn More][189] [ WHO WE ARE ][190] * [ Our Philosophy ][191] * [ President’s Message ][192] * [ Corporate Profile ][193] * [ Access Map ][194] ## Sustainability MegaChips has regarded response to issues surrounding sustainability as a key challenge in strategic management. We promote sustainability-related initiatives through our business activities, aiming to further enhance corporate value by collaborating with shareholders. [Learn More][195] * [ Environment ][196] * [ Social ][197] * [ Governance ][198] * [ Human Capital ][199] * [ Financial Summaries ][200] * [ Management Policy ][201] * [ Financial Data ][202] * [ Stock Information ][203] * [ IR Library ][204] ## Investor Relations MegaChips aims for continuous growth by pursuing business potential and profitability. [Learn More][205] ## News Releases [More][206] * [ [Founder's history Masahiro Shindo] ][207] * [ [Initiatives to Enhance Human Resources] ][208] * [ [LinkedIn] ][209] [MegaChips Corporation] As Japan’s first fabless manufacturer, MegaChips contributes to the industry and the lifestyles of people through our unique LSI, based on analog and digital technology. [ Contact Us ][210] [Products][211] * [ASIC][212] * [ASSP][213] * [Module][214] * [Document Download][215] * [Product Releases][216] [Manufacturing][217] * [Production][218] * [Quality][219] * [Partnership][220] [About MegaChips][221] * [Our Philosophy][222] * [Message from President & CEO][223] * [Who We Are][224] * [Directors and Auditors][225] * [Corporate Profile][226] * [History][227] * [Access Map][228] * [Founder's History][229] [Sustainability][230] * [Environment][231] * [Social][232] * [Governance][233] [Investor Relations][234] * [Management Policy][235] * [Financial Data][236] * [IR Library][237] * [Stock Information][238] * [Dialogue with Shareholders and Investors][239] * [IR Releases][240] * [IR Calendar][241] * [FAQ][242] * [Contact Us][243] * [Disclaimer][244] [News Releases][245] * [ Privacy Policy ][246] * [ Using This Website ][247] * [ Site Map ][248] © MegaChips Corporation * [[linkedin]][249] * [[twitter]][250] * [[facebook]][251] [SNSシェアメニュー 開く] [[ページトップへ]][252] [1]: /english/ [2]: /english/inquiry/ [3]: /english/product/ [4]: /english/product/asics/ [5]: /english/product/asics/design/ [6]: /english/product/asics/technology/ [7]: /english/product/asics/solution/ [8]: /english/product/assps/ [9]: /english/product/assps/broadband-plc/ [10]: /english/product/assps/100base-t1/ [11]: /english/product/assps/100base-tx_2ch/ [12]: /english/product/modules/ [13]: /english/product/modules/wifi-halow/ [14]: /english/product/download/ [15]: /english/product/product_news/ [16]: /english/manufacturing/ [17]: /english/manufacturing/mfg/ [18]: /english/manufacturing/quality/ [19]: /english/manufacturing/partnership/ [20]: /english/company/ [21]: /english/company/philosophy/ [22]: /english/company/message/ [23]: /english/company/who-we-are/ [24]: /english/company/who-we-are/business-model.html [25]: /english/company/who-we-are/history.html [26]: /english/company/who-we-are/rd.html [27]: /english/company/who-we-are/global.html [28]: /english/company/member/ [29]: /english/company/outline/ [30]: /english/company/history/ [31]: /english/company/access/ [32]: /english/company/founder/ [33]: /english/company/founder/index.html [34]: /english/company/founder/page02.html [35]: /english/company/founder/page03.html [36]: /english/company/founder/page04.html [37]: /english/company/founder/page05.html [38]: /english/company/founder/page06.html [39]: /english/company/founder/page07.html [40]: /english/company/founder/page08.html [41]: /english/company/founder/page_extra-edition01.html [42]: /english/company/founder/page_extra-edition02.html [43]: /english/sustainability/ [44]: /english/sustainability/eco/ [45]: /english/sustainability/social/ [46]: /english/sustainability/social/contribution/ [47]: /english/sustainability/social/work_environment/ [48]: /english/sustainability/governance/ [49]: /english/irinfo/ [50]: /english/irinfo/management/ [51]: /english/company/message/ [52]: /english/irinfo/management/middle_plan/ [53]: /english/company/member/ [54]: /english/irinfo/management/governance/ [55]: /english/irinfo/management/risk/ [56]: /english/irinfo/management/policy/ [57]: /english/irinfo/finance/ [58]: /english/irinfo/finance/sales/ [59]: /english/irinfo/finance/assets/ [60]: /english/irinfo/finance/cash_flow/ [61]: /english/irinfo/finance/indicator/ [62]: /english/irinfo/finance/per_share/ [63]: /english/irinfo/resource/ [64]: /english/irinfo/resource/ir_lib/ [65]: /english/irinfo/resource/annual/ [66]: /english/irinfo/resource/explanatory/ [67]: /english/irinfo/stockinfo/", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "MegaChips Corporation — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Designs and supplies SoCs, builds its own technology. | Designs and supplies SoCs and system solutions for consumer electronics and industrial applications. | Japan | Japan", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "67", "Y Score": "64", "Overall Score": "66", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Plessey Semiconductors", "Website": "https://www.plesseysemiconductors.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "United Kingdom", "Continent / Geography": "EU(United Kingdom)", "Operational Presence": "United Kingdom", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "UK-based developer of microLED and sensor technologies.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "GB", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Plessey Semiconductors — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Developer of microLED and sensor technologies, builds its own products.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "plesseysemiconductors.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "plesseysemiconductors.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to content][1]\n[ ][2]\n* * [About][3]\n  * [Technology][4]\n  * [Careers][5]\n  * [News][6]\n  * [Contact][7]\n[ ][8]\n* * [About][9]\n  * [Technology][10]\n  * [Careers][11]\n  * [News][12]\n  * [Contact][13]\nwelcome to plessey\n\n# Engineering\n# the future in light\n\n[ Our technology\n][14]\n[ Contact\n][15]\n\n### Technologies shaped by light.\n### We design and build two photonic technologies – integrated under one roof, engineered to work\n### together.\n\nmicroleds\n\n### Smaller, brighter, sharper, more efficient.\n\nThe visual interface for AR, MR and next-era wearables. Our MicroLED technology delivers\nunprecedented pixel density and energy efficiency. Designed for people, ready to scale.\n\noptical interconnects\n\n### Replacing electrical signals with light\n\nHigher data rates. Lower latency. Far less energy. Built for the growing demands of AI\ninfrastructure, optical interconnects move data between chips, cards and racks more efficiently than\nconventional electrical connections.\n\nTogether, these technologies form the hardware foundation for AI and next-era computing.\n\n[ Explore our technology\n][16]\n\n## Total process.\n## One operation.\n\nOnly Plessey combines research, IP, materials, processes and manufacturing in one integrated\noperation. By controlling every step – from source to signal – we shorten development cycles and\nstrengthen every stage.\n\n##### Deep know-how\n\n70+ years of innovation. We’ve built our expertise through decades of research, development and\nmanufacturing in photonics and semiconductor technologies.\n\n##### Broad capability\n\nResearch to volume production. Our integrated facility enables rapid iteration from laboratory\nbreakthrough to scaled manufacturing – without handoffs, delays or compromised specifications.\n\n##### Single facility\n\nPlymouth, UK – every stage connected. When research, process engineering and production occupy the\nsame building, problems get solved faster and products reach market sooner.\n\n[ About Plessey\n][17]\n\n### Independent spirit. Serious intent.\n\n###### We don’t follow familiar paths—we set new ones. Tested, proven, scaled.\n\nWhen the world’s largest technology companies need breakthroughs in optical technologies, they come\nto us. Not noise, not hype – just capability, trusted and relied on.\n\nSeventy years of invention – still moving forward.\n\n## Latest from Plessey\n\n[ Visit News\n][18]\n[\n\n29.07.2026\n\nBlog\n\n###### Fuelling Ivybridge Community College’s Greenpower Team\n\n][19] [\n\n20.07.2026\n\nBlog\n\n###### Celebrating our people at Plessey’s summer party\n\n][20] [\n\n17.07.2026\n\nBlog\n\n###### Work experience meets social media\n\n][21] [\n\n07.07.2026\n\nBlog\n\n###### Lighting the way with St Luke’s Hospice\n\n][22]\n\n## Ready to discuss\n## your requirements?\n\n[ Get in touch\n][23]\n[ ][24]\n\nQuick links\n* * [About][25]\n  * [Technology][26]\n  * [Careers][27]\n  * [News][28]\n  * [Contact][29]\n  * [Client portal ][30]\n\nLegal\n* * [Privacy & security][31]\n  * [Cookies][32]\n  * [Legal][33]\n  * [Quality assurance][34]\n  * [Modern slavery][35]\n  * [Cookie Policy (UK)][36]\n\nSocial\n* [Linkedin][37]\n* [X][38]\n* [Youtube][39]\n* [Facebook][40]\n* [Instagram][41]\n\nContact\n* [+44 (0)1752 693000][42]\n\n[ISO 9001:2015] [ISO 14001:2015] [ISO 45001:2018] [Cyber Essentials]\n© 2026 Plessey Semiconductors Ltd Design by [Foundation][43]\nManage Consent\nTo provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device\ninformation. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing\nbehavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect\ncertain features and functions.\nFunctional Functional Always active\nThe technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use\nof a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of\ncarrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic communications network.\nPreferences Preferences\nThe technical storage or access is nece"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to content][1] [ ][2] * * [About][3] * [Technology][4] * [Careers][5] * [News][6] * [Contact][7] [ ][8] * * [About][9] * [Technology][10] * [Careers][11] * [News][12] * [Contact][13] welcome to plessey # Engineering # the future in light [ Our technology ][14] [ Contact ][15] ### Technologies shaped by light. ### We design and build two photonic technologies – integrated under one roof, engineered to work ### together. microleds ### Smaller, brighter, sharper, more efficient. The visual interface for AR, MR and next-era wearables. Our MicroLED technology delivers unprecedented pixel density and energy efficiency. Designed for people, ready to scale. optical interconnects ### Replacing electrical signals with light Higher data rates. Lower latency. Far less energy. Built for the growing demands of AI infrastructure, optical interconnects move data between chips, cards and racks more efficiently than conventional electrical connections. Together, these technologies form the hardware foundation for AI and next-era computing. [ Explore our technology ][16] ## Total process. ## One operation. Only Plessey combines research, IP, materials, processes and manufacturing in one integrated operation. By controlling every step – from source to signal – we shorten development cycles and strengthen every stage. ##### Deep know-how 70+ years of innovation. We’ve built our expertise through decades of research, development and manufacturing in photonics and semiconductor technologies. ##### Broad capability Research to volume production. Our integrated facility enables rapid iteration from laboratory breakthrough to scaled manufacturing – without handoffs, delays or compromised specifications. ##### Single facility Plymouth, UK – every stage connected. When research, process engineering and production occupy the same building, problems get solved faster and products reach market sooner. [ About Plessey ][17] ### Independent spirit. Serious intent. ###### We don’t follow familiar paths—we set new ones. Tested, proven, scaled. When the world’s largest technology companies need breakthroughs in optical technologies, they come to us. Not noise, not hype – just capability, trusted and relied on. Seventy years of invention – still moving forward. ## Latest from Plessey [ Visit News ][18] [ 29.07.2026 Blog ###### Fuelling Ivybridge Community College’s Greenpower Team ][19] [ 20.07.2026 Blog ###### Celebrating our people at Plessey’s summer party ][20] [ 17.07.2026 Blog ###### Work experience meets social media ][21] [ 07.07.2026 Blog ###### Lighting the way with St Luke’s Hospice ][22] ## Ready to discuss ## your requirements? [ Get in touch ][23] [ ][24] Quick links * * [About][25] * [Technology][26] * [Careers][27] * [News][28] * [Contact][29] * [Client portal ][30] Legal * * [Privacy & security][31] * [Cookies][32] * [Legal][33] * [Quality assurance][34] * [Modern slavery][35] * [Cookie Policy (UK)][36] Social * [Linkedin][37] * [X][38] * [Youtube][39] * [Facebook][40] * [Instagram][41] Contact * [+44 (0)1752 693000][42] [ISO 9001:2015] [ISO 14001:2015] [ISO 45001:2018] [Cyber Essentials] © 2026 Plessey Semiconductors Ltd Design by [Foundation][43] Manage Consent To provide the best experiences, we use technologies like cookies to store and/or access device information. Consenting to these technologies will allow us to process data such as browsing behavior or unique IDs on this site. Not consenting or withdrawing consent, may adversely affect certain features and functions. Functional Functional Always active The technical storage or access is strictly necessary for the legitimate purpose of enabling the use of a specific service explicitly requested by the subscriber or user, or for the sole purpose of carrying out the transmission of a communication over an electronic communications network. Preferences Preferences The technical storage or access is necessary for the legitimate purpose of storing preferences that are not requested by the subscriber or user. Statistics Statistics The technical storage or access that is used exclusively for statistical purposes. The technical storage or access that is used exclusively for anonymous statistical purposes. Without a subpoena, voluntary compliance on the part of your Internet Service Provider, or additional records from a third party, information stored or retrieved for this purpose alone cannot usually be used to identify you. Marketing Marketing The technical storage or access is required to create user profiles to send advertising, or to track the user on a website or across several websites for similar marketing purposes. * [Manage options][44] * [Manage services][45] * [Manage {vendor_count} vendors][46] * [Read more about these purposes][47] Accept Deny View preferences Save preferences [View preferences][48] * [{title}][49] * [{title}][50] * [{title}][51] Manage consent [1]: #primary [2]: https://plessey.com [3]: https://plessey.com/about/ [4]: https://plessey.com/technology/ [5]: https://plessey.com/careers/ [6]: https://plessey.com/news/ [7]: https://plessey.com/contact/ [8]: https://plessey.com [9]: https://plessey.com/about/ [10]: https://plessey.com/technology/ [11]: https://plessey.com/careers/ [12]: https://plessey.com/news/ [13]: https://plessey.com/contact/ [14]: https://plessey.com/technology/ [15]: https://plessey.com/contact/ [16]: https://plessey.com/technology/ [17]: https://plessey.com/about/ [18]: https://plessey.com/news/ [19]: https://plessey.com/fuelling-ivybridge-community-colleges-greenpower-team/ [20]: https://plessey.com/celebrating-our-people-at-plesseys-summer-party/ [21]: https://plessey.com/work-experience-meets-social-media/ [22]: https://plessey.com/lighting-the-way-with-st-lukes-hospice/ [23]: https://plessey.com/contact/ [24]: https://plessey.com [25]: https://plessey.com/about/ [26]: https://plessey.com/technology/ [27]: https://plessey.com/careers/ [28]: https://plessey.com/news/ [29]: https://plessey.com/contact/ [30]: https://portal.plesseysemi.com/Secure/Login.aspx?ReturnUrl=%2fDefault.aspx [31]: https://plessey.com/privacy-security/ [32]: https://plessey.com/cookies/ [33]: https://plessey.com/legal/ [34]: https://plessey.com/quality-assurance/ [35]: https://plessey.com/modern-slavery/ [36]: https://plessey.com/cookie-policy-uk/ [37]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/plessey-semiconductors [38]: https://x.com/Plesseysemicon [39]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyPI77jVzWesgDXmPz_iTMA [40]: https://www.facebook.com/pages/Plessey-Semiconductors-Ltd/134987766544324 [41]: https://www.instagram.com/plesseysemiconductors/ [42]: mailto:+44 (0)1752 693000 [43]: https://studiofoundation.com/ [44]: # [45]: # [46]: # [47]: https://cookiedatabase.org/tcf/purposes/ [48]: # [49]: # [50]: # [51]: #", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Plessey Semiconductors — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Developer of microLED and sensor technologies, builds its own products. | UK-based developer of microLED and sensor technologies. | United Kingdom | United Kingdom", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "69", "Y Score": "62", "Overall Score": "66", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Semikron Danfoss", "Website": "https://www.semikron-danfoss.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Germany", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Germany)", "Operational Presence": "Germany", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops and manufactures power semiconductor modules for industrial and automotive applications, relevant to the global semiconductor market.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "DE", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Semikron Danfoss — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and manufactures power semiconductor modules, building semiconductor devices.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "semikron-danfoss.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "semikron-danfoss.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Search]\n* [[Search]][1]\n* [Menu]\n\n# Power Electronics for Data Centers\n\nToday, both small and large data centers rely on Semikron Danfoss power modules inside UPS systems\nand motor drives for reliable power transfer and cooling.\n\n[Learn more][2]\n\n## Featured Topics\n\nInnovation highlights shaping the future of power electronics\n* [\n  [Next-Gen Freewheeling Diodes]\n  \n  Next-Gen Freewheeling Diodes\n  \n  CAL7 diodes pair Semikron Danfoss’s proven CAL design with the latest thin wafer technology for\n  smooth switching in high-power industrial applications.\n  \n  ][3]\n* [\n  [Improved Reliability for Renewable Applications]\n  \n  Improved Renewables Reliability\n  \n  Power converters for wind, solar, and energy storage push power density and reliability limits.\n  Semikron Danfoss supports this with advanced packaging and devices.\n  \n  ][4]\n\n## Application Manual Power Semiconductors\n\n3rd edition – fully updated for today’s practice\n[Application Manual Power Semiconductors 3rd edition]\n\nNow more comprehensive than ever, the Application Manual Power Semiconductors 3rd edition goes\nbeyond previous versions with even richer content and practical guidance for engineers, designers,\nand decision-makers.\n\nWith over 500 pages of in-depth knowledge, this manual delivers clear, accessible explanations of\nsemiconductor fundamentals paired with advanced insights into power module packaging technologies,\nmodule performance, and reliability testing.\n\n[Download free copy now][5]\n\n## Service & Support** **\n\nTools and services to support your business\n* [\n  [Semikron Danfoss Online Shop]\n  \n  Power Electronics Online Shop\n  \n  The Semikron Danfoss e-commerce solution that truly simplifies and accelerates your business.\n  \n  ][6]\n* [\n  [Material Number Lookup Tool]\n  \n  Material Number Lookup\n  \n  Use our Material Number Lookup Tool to convert old Semikron Danfoss material numbers to new ones.\n  \n  ][7]\n* [\n  [SemiSel Simulation]\n  \n  SemiSel Simulation\n  \n  Designed to calculate losses and temperatures, SemiSel is the ultimate tool for selecting power\n  semiconductors.\n  \n  ][8]\n\n## Product & Technology Innovations\n\nKey technology trends, new products & innovative solutions\n* [\n  [SEMiX 3p+]\n  \n  Efficient by Design, Scaled for Growth – SEMiX 3p+\n  \n  Designed for modern industrial converters, SEMiX 3p+ delivers improved electrical and thermal\n  performance while preserving the simplicity and scalability that have made the SEMiX platform a\n  benchmark across motor drives, renewable energy systems, UPS solutions, and power supplies.\n  \n  ][9]\n* [\n  [SEMITRANS 3+]\n  \n  Proven Package, Next-Level Performance – SEMITRANS 3+\n  \n  Supporting multiple-source IGBT and SiC chipsets, and with a complete internal redesign, the\n  SEMITRANS 3+ pushes multi-level inverter and half bridge circuit configurations to higher power\n  and reliability, while leveraging a trusted, industry-standard package.\n  \n  ][10]\n\n## Pioneering ESG in the Semiconductor Business\n\nAs a leading innovator in power electronics and semiconductors, we are deeply committed to our\nEnvironmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) principles at Semikron Danfoss. They are guiding\nframework for incorporating sustainability and ethical values into every facet of our business.\n\n[Our ESG Ambition][11]\n\n## SKiiP®4 SiC 2kV\n\nAddressing the 1500VDC Challenge\n\nFocus on your innovation – powered by SiC, ready as a system-level building block. Whether you are\nadvancing power-to-X and green hydrogen production, optimizing high-efficiency motor drives,\ndesigning for 1500VDC grid architectures, or improving power quality and active filtering – you need\nreliable, high-performance power. We deliver it. Across renewable energy and industrial power\nconversion applications, SKiiP 4 SiC 2kV is your advantage. The power tool built for the 1500VDC\nchallenge.\n\n[More about SKiiP 4 SiC][12]\n\n## High power applications\n\nWith optimum electrical performance\n\nThe SEMITRANS 20 package is now released for serial production. This new "}}, "page_text": "[Search] * [[Search]][1] * [Menu] # Power Electronics for Data Centers Today, both small and large data centers rely on Semikron Danfoss power modules inside UPS systems and motor drives for reliable power transfer and cooling. [Learn more][2] ## Featured Topics Innovation highlights shaping the future of power electronics * [ [Next-Gen Freewheeling Diodes] Next-Gen Freewheeling Diodes CAL7 diodes pair Semikron Danfoss’s proven CAL design with the latest thin wafer technology for smooth switching in high-power industrial applications. ][3] * [ [Improved Reliability for Renewable Applications] Improved Renewables Reliability Power converters for wind, solar, and energy storage push power density and reliability limits. Semikron Danfoss supports this with advanced packaging and devices. ][4] ## Application Manual Power Semiconductors 3rd edition – fully updated for today’s practice [Application Manual Power Semiconductors 3rd edition] Now more comprehensive than ever, the Application Manual Power Semiconductors 3rd edition goes beyond previous versions with even richer content and practical guidance for engineers, designers, and decision-makers. With over 500 pages of in-depth knowledge, this manual delivers clear, accessible explanations of semiconductor fundamentals paired with advanced insights into power module packaging technologies, module performance, and reliability testing. [Download free copy now][5] ## Service & Support** ** Tools and services to support your business * [ [Semikron Danfoss Online Shop] Power Electronics Online Shop The Semikron Danfoss e-commerce solution that truly simplifies and accelerates your business. ][6] * [ [Material Number Lookup Tool] Material Number Lookup Use our Material Number Lookup Tool to convert old Semikron Danfoss material numbers to new ones. ][7] * [ [SemiSel Simulation] SemiSel Simulation Designed to calculate losses and temperatures, SemiSel is the ultimate tool for selecting power semiconductors. ][8] ## Product & Technology Innovations Key technology trends, new products & innovative solutions * [ [SEMiX 3p+] Efficient by Design, Scaled for Growth – SEMiX 3p+ Designed for modern industrial converters, SEMiX 3p+ delivers improved electrical and thermal performance while preserving the simplicity and scalability that have made the SEMiX platform a benchmark across motor drives, renewable energy systems, UPS solutions, and power supplies. ][9] * [ [SEMITRANS 3+] Proven Package, Next-Level Performance – SEMITRANS 3+ Supporting multiple-source IGBT and SiC chipsets, and with a complete internal redesign, the SEMITRANS 3+ pushes multi-level inverter and half bridge circuit configurations to higher power and reliability, while leveraging a trusted, industry-standard package. ][10] ## Pioneering ESG in the Semiconductor Business As a leading innovator in power electronics and semiconductors, we are deeply committed to our Environmental, Social, and Governance (ESG) principles at Semikron Danfoss. They are guiding framework for incorporating sustainability and ethical values into every facet of our business. [Our ESG Ambition][11] ## SKiiP®4 SiC 2kV Addressing the 1500VDC Challenge Focus on your innovation – powered by SiC, ready as a system-level building block. Whether you are advancing power-to-X and green hydrogen production, optimizing high-efficiency motor drives, designing for 1500VDC grid architectures, or improving power quality and active filtering – you need reliable, high-performance power. We deliver it. Across renewable energy and industrial power conversion applications, SKiiP 4 SiC 2kV is your advantage. The power tool built for the 1500VDC challenge. [More about SKiiP 4 SiC][12] ## High power applications With optimum electrical performance The SEMITRANS 20 package is now released for serial production. This new industrial standard high-power module simplifies high-voltage inverter designs for applications like solar, wind, energy storage and drives. Its reliable design provides sufficient margin for high-voltage inverters in 2- and 3-level topologies. The superior switching performance allows for easy paralleling of multiple modules, ensuring uniform current distribution and well-behaved voltage waveforms. [More about SEMITRANS 20][13] ## New Multi-Sourcing Option for IGBTs Expanded IGBT chip portfolio delivers more choice Our power modules are available with the latest CRRC IGBT chips, offering blocking voltages of 1200V, 1700V, and 2300V, a maximum operating junction temperature of 175°C, and low conduction and switching losses. ## Power Electronic Stacks The Fastest Path to World-Class Power Electronic Systems Focus on your core innovation while we handle the complexity of high-power conversion. Ready-to-integrate stacks up to multi-megawatt range accelerate your path from concept to production. Leverage proven SiC expertise and global support to boost performance, simplify your supply chain, and cut time-to-market by years. ## Technical Webinars** ** Experts in Dialog * [ [Sign up and watch the webinar] More Compact and Efficient Motor Drives with Silicon Carbide With recent technological advancements, silicon carbide is becoming the first choice for enabling energy savings and increasing power density. ][14] * [ [Sign up and watch the webinar] Join our Technical Webinars Join us for one of our engaging technical webinars! Registration is quick, easy, and completely free. Choose from live sessions or on-demand options to suit your schedule. ][15] ## Semikron Danfoss** ** We are the Ultimate Partner in Power Electronics Semikron Danfoss is a global technology leader in power electronics. Our product offerings include semiconductor devices, power modules, stacks and systems. In a world that is going electric, Semikron Danfoss technologies are more relevant than ever. With our innovative solutions for automotive, industrial and renewable applications we help the world utilize energy more efficiently and sustainable and thus to significantly reduce overall CO2 emissions – one of the biggest challenges the world faces today. We take care of our employees and create value for our customers by investing significantly in innovation, technology, capacity, and service to deliver best-in-industry performance and for a sustainable future. * [Download Center][16] * [SemiSel][17] * [Online Shop][18] * [Sitemap][19] * [Subscription Terms][20] * [Contact us][21] * Sign up for latest news * [Privacy policy][22] * [Terms of use][23] * [Legal notice][24] * Cookies * [[LinkedIn]][25] * [[YouTube]][26] [1]: /search [2]: /technologies-solutions/featured-topics/power-electronics-for-datacenters [3]: /technologies-solutions/featured-topics/cal7 [4]: /technologies-solutions/featured-topics/improved-reliability-for-renewable-applications [5]: https://assets.danfoss.com/documents/latest/524715/AB509142199100en-000204.pdf [6]: https://shop.semikron-danfoss.com [7]: https://www.semikron-danfoss.com/material-number-lookup-tool [8]: https://semisel.semikron-danfoss.com [9]: /technologies-solutions/featured-topics/semix-3p+ [10]: /technologies-solutions/featured-topics/semitrans-3+ [11]: /about-semikron-danfoss/our-esg-ambition [12]: /technologies-solutions/featured-topics/skiip4-sic [13]: /products/power-modules/power-modules-by-product-line/semitrans-20 [14]: https://app.livestorm.co/semikron-danfoss/more-compact-and-efficient-motor-drives-with-silicon -carbide [15]: https://app.livestorm.co/semikron-danfoss [16]: /download-center?status=Published [17]: https://semisel.semikron-danfoss.com [18]: https://shop.semikron-danfoss.com [19]: /sitemap [20]: /subscription-terms [21]: /contact [22]: /privacy-policy [23]: /terms [24]: /general-information [25]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/semikron-danfoss [26]: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTOFrE1Ib4PC4pWt5NfgrOw/", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Semikron Danfoss — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and manufactures power semiconductor modules, building semiconductor devices. | Develops and manufactures power semiconductor modules for industrial and automotive applications, relevant to the global semiconductor market. | Germany | Germany", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "68", "Y Score": "64", "Overall Score": "66", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Semtech Corporation (Canadian operations)", "Website": "https://www.semtech.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Has Canadian operations and develops analog and mixed-signal semiconductors for various markets.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Semtech Corporation (Canadian operations) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Semtech develops analog and mixed-signal semiconductors; Canadian operations are part of the company.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "semtech.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "semtech.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n* [Cross Reference][2]\n* [Parametric][3]\n* [Shop][4]\n* [Investors][5]\n* [mySemtech][6]\n* [ EN ][7]\n  * [EN][8]\n  * [CN (中文)][9]\n  * [JP (日本語)][10]\n  * [FR][11]\n[ [Semtech] ][12]\n* [LoRa®][13]\n  * [LoRa® Overview][14]\n    \n    ### LoRa Overview\n    \n    LoRa is the de facto wireless platform of Internet of Things (IoT). Semtech's LoRa chipsets\n    connect sensors to the Cloud and enable real-time communication of data and analytics that can\n    be utilized to enhance efficiency and productivity.\n    \n    [Read More][15]\n    * [LoRa (PHY)][16]\n    * [Benefits of LoRa][17]\n    * [LoRaWAN® Standard][18]\n    * [Products][19]\n  * [Applications][20]\n    \n    ### Applications Overview\n    \n    With an ever-increasing number of IoT vertical applications, LoRa devices and the LoRaWAN\n    standard is creating business efficiencies and improving lives around the world.\n    \n    [Read More][21]\n    * [Agriculture][22]\n    * [Cities][23]\n    * [Environment][24]\n    * [Healthcare][25]\n    * [Buildings][26]\n    * [Homes][27]\n    * [Industrial Control][28]\n    * [Retail][29]\n    * [Supply Chain and Logistics][30]\n    * [Electricity][31]\n    * [Gas][32]\n    * [Water][33]\n  * [Ecosystem][34]\n    \n    ### Ecosystem Overview\n    \n    LoRa is bolstered by a diverse global ecosystem of hardware manufacturers, software designers,\n    network providers, and industry associations.\n    \n    [Read More][35]\n    * [LoRa Alliance®][36]\n    * [Featured Sensor Use Cases][37]\n    * [Gateways][38]\n    * [Software][39]\n    * [Networks][40]\n    * [Industry Alliances][41]\n  * [Resources][42]\n    \n    ### Resources Overview\n    \n    Explore our top resources to help you learn more about LoRa devices and the LoRaWAN standard or\n    bring a LoRa-based solution to market.\n    \n    [Read More][43]\n    * [LoRa Products Overview][44]\n    * [Videos][45]\n    * [White Papers & Use Cases][46]\n    * [LoRa Developers & Tech Support][47]\n    * [LoRa Calculator][48]\n    * [Amazon Sidewalk][49]\n    * [Academy for LoRaWAN ][50]\n    * [Logo Use][51]\n    * [Press Releases][52]\n    * [Press Coverage][53]\n    * [Contact][54]\n* [Products][55]\n  * [Products Overview][56]\n    \n    ### Products Overview\n    \n    Thousands of customers worldwide rely on our diverse product portfolio and world class\n    technology roadmap for solutions in low power wireless communications, optical data transport,\n    video broadcasting, power management, circuit protection, touch sensing, and more.\n    \n    [Read More][57]\n    \n    ### Quick Links\n    * [Product Selector Guides][58]\n    * [Shop][59]\n    * [Parametric Search][60]\n  * [ LoRa® Wireless RF ][61]\n    \n    ### Products Overview\n    \n    LoRa®, a long range, low power platform, and the de facto wireless platform of Internet of\n    Things, is highly integrated and cost-effective, boasting a notable battery life of up to 20\n    years, a 3-mile range in urban environments and a 30-mile range outdoors.\n    \n    [Read More][62]\n    * [End-Nodes ICs][63]\n    * [ICs for Gateways][64]\n    * [LoRa Basics™ Modem & LoRa USP™][65]\n    * [Hardware Development Tools & Kits][66]\n  * [ Circuit Protection ][67]\n    \n    ### Products Overview\n    \n    Sophisticated devices that protect sensitive circuitry from Electrostatic Discharge (ESD),\n    Electrical Fast Transients (EFT), Cable Discharge Events (CDE), and other electrical overstress.\n    \n    [Read More][68]\n    \n    ### Circuit Protection Products\n    * [ESD Protection Diodes][69]\n    * [TVS Diodes][70]\n    \n    ### Interfaces\n    * [USB][71]\n    * [HDMI][72]\n    * [Antenna][73]\n    * [Ethernet][74]\n    * [RS-485][75]\n    * [Automotive Ethernet][76]\n    * [Automotive High Speed][77]\n    * [VBUS][78]\n  * [ Signal Integrity ][79]\n    \n    ### Products Overview\n    \n    A comprehensive portfolio of innovative optical, analog and mixed-signal semiconductor solutions\n    that serve the rising global demand for high-speed data transmission products.\n    \n    [Read More][80]\n    * [Data C"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] * [Cross Reference][2] * [Parametric][3] * [Shop][4] * [Investors][5] * [mySemtech][6] * [ EN ][7] * [EN][8] * [CN (中文)][9] * [JP (日本語)][10] * [FR][11] [ [Semtech] ][12] * [LoRa®][13] * [LoRa® Overview][14] ### LoRa Overview LoRa is the de facto wireless platform of Internet of Things (IoT). Semtech's LoRa chipsets connect sensors to the Cloud and enable real-time communication of data and analytics that can be utilized to enhance efficiency and productivity. [Read More][15] * [LoRa (PHY)][16] * [Benefits of LoRa][17] * [LoRaWAN® Standard][18] * [Products][19] * [Applications][20] ### Applications Overview With an ever-increasing number of IoT vertical applications, LoRa devices and the LoRaWAN standard is creating business efficiencies and improving lives around the world. [Read More][21] * [Agriculture][22] * [Cities][23] * [Environment][24] * [Healthcare][25] * [Buildings][26] * [Homes][27] * [Industrial Control][28] * [Retail][29] * [Supply Chain and Logistics][30] * [Electricity][31] * [Gas][32] * [Water][33] * [Ecosystem][34] ### Ecosystem Overview LoRa is bolstered by a diverse global ecosystem of hardware manufacturers, software designers, network providers, and industry associations. [Read More][35] * [LoRa Alliance®][36] * [Featured Sensor Use Cases][37] * [Gateways][38] * [Software][39] * [Networks][40] * [Industry Alliances][41] * [Resources][42] ### Resources Overview Explore our top resources to help you learn more about LoRa devices and the LoRaWAN standard or bring a LoRa-based solution to market. [Read More][43] * [LoRa Products Overview][44] * [Videos][45] * [White Papers & Use Cases][46] * [LoRa Developers & Tech Support][47] * [LoRa Calculator][48] * [Amazon Sidewalk][49] * [Academy for LoRaWAN ][50] * [Logo Use][51] * [Press Releases][52] * [Press Coverage][53] * [Contact][54] * [Products][55] * [Products Overview][56] ### Products Overview Thousands of customers worldwide rely on our diverse product portfolio and world class technology roadmap for solutions in low power wireless communications, optical data transport, video broadcasting, power management, circuit protection, touch sensing, and more. [Read More][57] ### Quick Links * [Product Selector Guides][58] * [Shop][59] * [Parametric Search][60] * [ LoRa® Wireless RF ][61] ### Products Overview LoRa®, a long range, low power platform, and the de facto wireless platform of Internet of Things, is highly integrated and cost-effective, boasting a notable battery life of up to 20 years, a 3-mile range in urban environments and a 30-mile range outdoors. [Read More][62] * [End-Nodes ICs][63] * [ICs for Gateways][64] * [LoRa Basics™ Modem & LoRa USP™][65] * [Hardware Development Tools & Kits][66] * [ Circuit Protection ][67] ### Products Overview Sophisticated devices that protect sensitive circuitry from Electrostatic Discharge (ESD), Electrical Fast Transients (EFT), Cable Discharge Events (CDE), and other electrical overstress. [Read More][68] ### Circuit Protection Products * [ESD Protection Diodes][69] * [TVS Diodes][70] ### Interfaces * [USB][71] * [HDMI][72] * [Antenna][73] * [Ethernet][74] * [RS-485][75] * [Automotive Ethernet][76] * [Automotive High Speed][77] * [VBUS][78] * [ Signal Integrity ][79] ### Products Overview A comprehensive portfolio of innovative optical, analog and mixed-signal semiconductor solutions that serve the rising global demand for high-speed data transmission products. [Read More][80] * [Data Center][81] * [Passive Optical Networks][82] * [Mobile Transport][83] * [ Professional AV ][84] ### Products Overview Advanced off-the-shelf technology that enables end-to-end systems and integrates advanced inline signal processing capabilities such as light compression, broadcast quality scaling and audio down-mixing. [Read More][85] * [BlueRiver®][86] * [USB Extension][87] * [ Smart Sensing ][88] ### Products Overview Intelligent sensing solutions that transform human-machine interaction. Semtech's Smart Sensing portfolio delivers ultra-low power proximity detection, precision force measurement, and interface control for mobile, automotive, wearables, and industrial applications. [Read More][89] * [PerSe® Connect][90] * [PerSe® Contact][91] * [PerSe® Control ][92] * [IO Expanders][93] * [Force Sensing Solutions][94] * [ Broadcast Video ][95] ### Products Overview Award-winning solutions designed specifically to push real-world broadcast boundaries in performance, reach, power, and signal integrity while reducing time to market and design risks. [Read More][96] * [AV Interface & Protocol Conversion][97] * [Configurable EQ/CD][98] * [Cable Drivers][99] * [Cable Equalizers][100] * [Crosspoints][101] * [Receivers (Deserializers)][102] * [Reclocking][103] * [Transmitters (Serializers)][104] * [ Power Management ][105] ### Products Overview A pioneer in power management ICs across networking and industrial power, handheld power and automotive applications, Semtech leads the quest to enable a new class of greener, smarter and smaller end products. [Read More][106] * [Buck (Step Down)][107] * [Boost (Step Up)][108] * [HotSwitch/Load Switch][109] * [Low Drop Out (LDO) Regulator][110] * [Neo-Iso Solid State Relays][111] * [Charge Pump][112] * [ Cellular IoT Solutions ][113] ### Products Overview Leading edge-to-Cloud solutions delivering the device, software and connectivity services needed to simplify and accelerate data-driven transformation with cellular IoT. [Read More][114] * [Managed Connectivity][115] * [Modules][116] * [Router Solutions][117] * [Technology][118] * [Technology Overview][119] ### Technology Overview Our highly differentiated, disruptive analog and mixed-signal semiconductors and advanced algorithms enable today's most innovative electronics within some of the fastest growing verticals and markets. [Read More][120] ### Quick Links * [Related Applications][121] * [LoRa White Papers & Infographics][122] * [Product Selector Guides][123] * [LoRa® Wireless RF For The IoT][124] ### LoRa Wireless RF ### For The IoT Overview LoRa is the de facto wireless platform of Internet of Things (IoT). Semtech's LoRa chipsets connect sensors to the Cloud and enable real-time communication of data and analytics that can be utilized to enhance efficiency and productivity. [Read More][125] * [LoRa (PHY)][126] * [Benefits of LoRa][127] * [LoRaWAN® Standard][128] * [PerSe® Smart Sensing][129] ### PerSe® Smart Sensing Overview Semtech's PerSe technology intelligently senses human presence for optimized connectivity and enhanced user experience. [Read More][130] ### Quick Links * [Infographic][131] * [Brochure][132] * [Blogs][133] * [Products][134] * [Signal Integrity][135] ### Signal Integrity Technologies Whether you need high-speed data center connectivity, low-latency wireless fronthaul, or efficient server connections, our FiberEdge®, DirectEdge™, Tri-Edge™, and CopperEdge™ solutions provide the signal integrity foundation for tomorrow's infrastructure challenges. [Read More][136] ### Quick Links * [FiberEdge® and DirectEdge™][137] * [CopperEdge™][138] * [Tri-Edge™ PAM4 CDR][139] * [BlueRiver Platform For SDVoE™][140] ### BlueRiver ### Platform For SDVoE™ BlueRiver AV-over-IP chipsets are the world’s only chipsets to transport uncompressed, zero-latency Ultra HD/4K HDR over standard Ethernet and are the foundation for Software Defined Video Over Ethernet (SDVoE) technology. [Read More][141] * [BlueRiver OVERVIEW][142] * [BlueRiver APPLICATIONS][143] * [BlueRiver VERTICAL MARKETS][144] * [SDVoE ALLIANCE®][145] * [Circuit Protection][146] ### Circuit Protection Overview Semtech is leading the way in Transient Voltage Suppression (TVS) protection solutions that safeguard electronics systems against damage or latch-up caused by electrostatic discharge (ESD), lightning (surge), and other destructive voltage transients. [Read More][147] * [Circuit Protection Overview][148] * [Z-Platform][149] * [Design Resources][150] * [Design Resources Overview][151] ### Design Resources Overview Semtech places a high importance on delivering superior design support and provides a wealth of tools and resources with the goal of shortening your time to revenue for your new product introductions. [Read More][152] * [Product Guides][153] * [Development Support Documentation][154] * [Parametric Search][155] * [Quality Assurance][156] * [LoRa GitHub][157] * [LoRa PCB Design Review][158] * [LoRa Calculator][159] * [LoRaWAN Academy and Training][160] * [Hardware Development Tools & Kits][161] * [Product Cross Reference Search][162] * [ Frequently Asked Questions][163] * [mySemtech Document Portal][164] * [IoT Applications][165] ### Internet of Things Award-winning LoRa Technology, ESD and surge protection, and smart control platforms for Internet of Things-enabled devices and low power, wide area network (LPWAN) infrastructure. [Read More][166] * * [Smart Agriculture][167] * [Smart Buildings][168] * [Smart Cities][169] * [Smart Emergency][170] * [Smart Environment][171] * [Smart Healthcare][172] * [Smart Home][173] * [Smart Industrial][174] * [Smart Logistics][175] * [Smart Utilities][176] * [Smart Consumer][177] * [Professional AV Applications][178] ### Professional AV AptoVision BlueRiver™ Technology uses commercial-off-the-shelf Ethernet networks to deliver higher performance, flexibility, and scalability to the Pro AV industry. [Read More][179] * * [AV Over IP][180] * [BYOM Video Conferencing][181] * [ HDMI Extender][182] * [HDMI Wall Plates][183] * [Hybrid AV Distribution][184] * [KVM Switches][185] * [Multiviewers][186] * [Point-to-Point Matrix Switching][187] * [Presentation Switchers][188] * [SDI Equipment][189] * [SDVoE™ Integration][190] * [Smart Display Modules (SDM)][191] * [USB-C][192] * [Video Walls][193] * [Other Applications][194] ### Other Applications Award-winning LoRa Technology, ESD and surge protection, and smart control platforms for Internet of Things-enabled devices and low power, wide area network (LPWAN) infrastructure. [Read More][195] * [Automotive][196] * [Advanced Driver Assistance Systems][197] * [Automotive Battery Management Systems][198] * [Automotive USB Charger][199] * [Infotainment Unit][200] * [Remote Keyless Entry][201] * [Telematics Unit][202] * [Broadcast Video][203] * [Broadcast Equipment][204] * [Consumer Electronics][205] * [Mobile Devices][206] * [Wearables][207] * [TVs, Set Top Boxes, Monitors][208] * [Laptops, Tablets, Computers][", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Semtech Corporation (Canadian operations) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Semtech develops analog and mixed-signal semiconductors; Canadian operations are part of the company. | Has Canadian operations and develops analog and mixed-signal semiconductors for various markets. | Canada | Canada", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "68", "Y Score": "65", "Overall Score": "66", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Valens Semiconductor", "Website": "https://www.valens.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Israel", "Continent / Geography": "ME(Israel)", "Operational Presence": "Israel", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops high-speed connectivity chips for automotive and audio/video.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IL", "Region Code": "ME", "Summary": "Valens Semiconductor — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops high-speed connectivity chips.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "valens.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "valens.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ [valens] [valens] ][1]\n* [Technology][2]\n* [\n  Solutions][3]\n  * [Column1][4]\n    * [ADAS & Autonomous][5]\n    * [In Cabin Experience][6]\n    * [Long Vehicles][7]\n  * [Column2][8]\n    * [Video Conferencing][9]\n    * [Education][10]\n    * [Digital Signage][11]\n  * [Column3][12]\n    * [Medical Imaging][13]\n    * [Entertainment][14]\n    * [Industrial Vision][15]\n* [\n  Company][16]\n  * [Column1][17]\n    * [About][18]\n    * [Newsroom][19]\n    * [Events][20]\n  * [Column2][21]\n    * [Career][22]\n    * [Resources][23]\n* [Investors][24]\n* [Contact Us][25]\n\n# We Push the Boundaries of Connectivity. Everywhere.\n\n## Our chipsets are the hidden gems embedded inside countless devices, transforming the digital\n## experiences of people worldwide\n\n## Leaders in\n## **High-Performance ****Connectivity**\n\nThe **Highest** Bandwidth\n\nHigh-speed connectivity for a variety of applications, with no latency.\n\nThe **Longest** Reach\n\nUnprecedented flexibility for system design over the simplest wiring infrastructure.\n\nThe **Lowest** Error Rate\n\nReliable, error-free connectivity for safety-critical systems.\n\n120\n\npatents granted\n\n50M+\n\nchips sold\n\n20\n\nyears of innovation\n\n7\n\nGlobal Offices\n\n100s\n\nof customers\n\n1\n\nEmmy Award\n\n### **One Technology.**\n### \n### Infinite Possibilities.\n\nAutomotive\n\nValens’ chipsets provide OEMs with an optimized, high-performance connectivity foundation upon which\nthey build the cars of the future while ensuring error-free links and uncompromised safety.\n\n[ ADAS & Autonomous ][26] [ In-Cabin ][27] [ Long Vehicles ][28]\n[\nVideo Conferencing\n\nOffering a complete suite of multimedia distribution solutions, Valens is a market leader with\nchipsets that power innovation and meet the evolving needs of the hybrid video conferencing market.\n\nTO PAGE\n\n][29] [\nEducation\n\nClassrooms are digitizing, with the proliferation of cameras, interactive whiteboards, and more.\nValens has the versatile, plug-and-play media distribution solution to support hybrid classrooms.\n\nTO PAGE\n\n][30] [\nDigital Signage\n\nSmart and simple digital signage architectures with uncompressed, zero-latency connectivity for\nlonger link distances and reliable 24/7 operation.\n\nTO PAGE\n\n][31] [\nMedical\n\nIn an industry that cannot compromise on quality, Valens chipsets support the highest resolution\nvideo imaging with no latency, enabling robotic surgeries, disposal endoscopies, and digital\noperating rooms.\n\nTO PAGE\n\n][32] [\nIndustrial\n\nWith a rich offering of high performance connectivity solutions, Valens guarantees seamless factory\nautomation and machine vision for the industrial market.\n\nTO PAGE\n\n][33] [\nEntertainment\n\nThe highest performance connectivity solution for entertainment setups, from home theaters to\nsuper-size immersive video walls and projection mapping.\n\nTO PAGE\n\n][34]\n\n### We Think\n### **Outside the Square**\n\nComposed of a team of bold visionaries, we transform industries and set new standards for\ninnovation.\n[ Our Story\n][35]\n\n### We Develop\n### **Superior Technology**\n\nOur cutting-edge chipsets enable unrivaled connectivity without compromise, even under the most\nchallenging conditions.\n[ Technology\n][36]\nOur Customers and Partners\nNews & Updates\n[\nJanuary 6, 2026 Pr\nValens Semiconductor Secures 4th VA7000 MIPI A-PHY Design Win with a Premium C…\n][37]\n[\nVideo Conferencing Whitepaper\nDelivering True Future Meeting Room Readiness with All-in-One Connectivity D… By Eli Ofek, Director\nof Business Development, Professional Audiovisual\n][38]\n[\nApril 2, 2025 Pr\nMobileye selects Valens Semiconductor’s VA7000 MIPI A-PHY chipsets for a…\n][39]\nChallenge us\n\nHow can we help you?\n\n[Archive][40]\n\n[ [valens] ][41]\n* [Company][42]\n  * [About][43]\n  * [Newsroom][44]\n  * [Events][45]\n  * [Resources][46]\n  * [Careers][47]\n  * [Distributors & Representatives][48]\n  * [Quality][49]\n* [Solutions][50]\n  * [Automotive][51]\n    * [ADAS & Autonomous][52]\n    * [In-Cabin Experience][53]\n    * [Long Vehicles][54]\n  * [Video Conferencing][55]\n  * [Education][56]\n  * [Digital Signa"}}, "page_text": "[ [valens] [valens] ][1] * [Technology][2] * [ Solutions][3] * [Column1][4] * [ADAS & Autonomous][5] * [In Cabin Experience][6] * [Long Vehicles][7] * [Column2][8] * [Video Conferencing][9] * [Education][10] * [Digital Signage][11] * [Column3][12] * [Medical Imaging][13] * [Entertainment][14] * [Industrial Vision][15] * [ Company][16] * [Column1][17] * [About][18] * [Newsroom][19] * [Events][20] * [Column2][21] * [Career][22] * [Resources][23] * [Investors][24] * [Contact Us][25] # We Push the Boundaries of Connectivity. Everywhere. ## Our chipsets are the hidden gems embedded inside countless devices, transforming the digital ## experiences of people worldwide ## Leaders in ## **High-Performance ****Connectivity** The **Highest** Bandwidth High-speed connectivity for a variety of applications, with no latency. The **Longest** Reach Unprecedented flexibility for system design over the simplest wiring infrastructure. The **Lowest** Error Rate Reliable, error-free connectivity for safety-critical systems. 120 patents granted 50M+ chips sold 20 years of innovation 7 Global Offices 100s of customers 1 Emmy Award ### **One Technology.** ### ### Infinite Possibilities. Automotive Valens’ chipsets provide OEMs with an optimized, high-performance connectivity foundation upon which they build the cars of the future while ensuring error-free links and uncompromised safety. [ ADAS & Autonomous ][26] [ In-Cabin ][27] [ Long Vehicles ][28] [ Video Conferencing Offering a complete suite of multimedia distribution solutions, Valens is a market leader with chipsets that power innovation and meet the evolving needs of the hybrid video conferencing market. TO PAGE ][29] [ Education Classrooms are digitizing, with the proliferation of cameras, interactive whiteboards, and more. Valens has the versatile, plug-and-play media distribution solution to support hybrid classrooms. TO PAGE ][30] [ Digital Signage Smart and simple digital signage architectures with uncompressed, zero-latency connectivity for longer link distances and reliable 24/7 operation. TO PAGE ][31] [ Medical In an industry that cannot compromise on quality, Valens chipsets support the highest resolution video imaging with no latency, enabling robotic surgeries, disposal endoscopies, and digital operating rooms. TO PAGE ][32] [ Industrial With a rich offering of high performance connectivity solutions, Valens guarantees seamless factory automation and machine vision for the industrial market. TO PAGE ][33] [ Entertainment The highest performance connectivity solution for entertainment setups, from home theaters to super-size immersive video walls and projection mapping. TO PAGE ][34] ### We Think ### **Outside the Square** Composed of a team of bold visionaries, we transform industries and set new standards for innovation. 