9] * [Supply Chain Management Service][130] [IP Portfolio][131] * [High Bandwidth Memory IP][132] * [Die-to-Die (2.5D) IP][133] * [Die-on-Die (3D) IP][134] * [Mixed Signal Front-End IP][135] * [SoC IP][136] * [Featured Partners][137] * [Contact Us][138] * Privacy Policy * Cookie Policcy [/upload/design/index/banner_01_mb_750x1200.jpg] Engineering Excellence. Global Trust. Forward Together. ## THE ADVANCED ASIC LEADER [ EXPLORE ][139] [ SCROLL ][140] [/upload/design/index/banner_02_mb_750x1200.jpg] Engineering Excellence. Global Trust. Forward Together. ## THE ADVANCED ASIC LEADER [ EXPLORE ][141] [ SCROLL ][142] [ 05 AUG 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in July 2026 ][143] [ 06 JUL 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in June 2026 ][144] [ 05 JUN 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in May 2026 ][145] [ 26 MAY 2026 Press Release GUC Showcases VSORA's Jotunn8 AI Inference Processor at the TSMC Europe Technology Symposium ][146] [ 05 MAY 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in Apr 2026 ][147] [ 04 MAY 2026 Press Release GUC Collaborate with Wiwynn to Advance Silicon-to-System Infrastructure for Next-Generation Hyperscale AI ][148] [ 23 APR 2026 Press Release GUC Announces 3nm 12 Gbps HBM4 PHY and Controller ][149] [ 07 APR 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in Mar 2026 ][150] [ 17 MAR 2026 Press Release GUC Announces Dr. FC Tseng Not to Participate in Next Board of Directors Election ][151] [ 05 MAR 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in Feb 2026 ][152] [ 26 FEB 2026 Press Release GUC Announces Tape-out of UCIe 64G IP on TSMC N3P Technology ][153] [ 05 FEB 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in Jan 2026 ][154] [ 28 JAN 2026 Press Release Lightmatter and GUC Partner to Produce Co-Packaged Optics (CPO) Solutions for AI Hyperscalers ][155] [ 05 JAN 2026 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in Dec 2025 ][156] [ 05 DEC 2025 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in Nov 2025 ][157] [ 24 NOV 2025 Press Release VSORA and GUC Partner on Jotunn8 Datacenter AI Inference Processor ][158] [ 17 NOV 2025 Press Release GUC and Ayar Labs Partner to Advance Co-Packaged Optics for Hyperscalers ][159] [ 05 NOV 2025 Press Release GUC Monthly Sales Report in Oct 2025 ][160] [ 20 OCT 2025 Press Release GUC Expands Presence in Japan with New Office Opening in Yokohama ][161] [ 16 OCT 2025 Press Release GUC Joins NVIDIA NVLink Fusion Ecosystem and to Speak at 2025 OCP Global Summit on Co-Packaged Optics ][162] CUSTOM CHIPS, INFINITE POSSIBILITIES ### TOTAL SOLUTIONS [ ASIC Design Service EXPLORE ASIC Design Service ][163] [ ASIC Production Service EXPLORE ASIC Production Service ][164] [ IP Portfolio At GUC, customers are our most important focus and they are fundamental to everything we do. We are dedicated to helping our customers overcome the challenges at every stage of their business. EXPLORE EXPLORE ][165] Drag Drag TRUSTED ASIC PARTNER FOR INDUSTRY LEADERS ### SUCCESS STORY [ EXPLORE ][166] [ IP GUC has been a key IP provider for both GUC ASIC and IP ecosystem. The IP portfolio includes HBM, Die-to-Die (2.5D) IP, Die-on-Die (3D) IP, Mixed Signal Front-End IP and Foundation IP. The following are some success stories that GUC would like to share with you. ][167] [ APT（Advanced Package Technology） GUC provides 2.5D and 3D Multi-die Advanced Packaging Technology Platform to serve ASIC customers in AI/HPC/Networking application. GUC's Total 2.5D/3D ASIC service solutions include critical IP (UCIe, GLink-2.5D/GLink-3D and HBM), 2.5D/3D packaging (CoWoS, InFO, SoIC and System on Wafer) design & SI/PI co-sim, and 2.5D/3D manufacturing & production. ][168] [ AI / HPC At the forefront of semiconductor innovation, GUC specializes in designing cutting-edge AI and HPC chips that leverage advanced process technologies and sophisticated packaging solutions. Our expertise includes seamless integration of HBM memory dies and high-speed SerDes, delivering exceptional data bandwidth and operational efficiency. We provide comprehensive system-level solutions that enhance power, signal, and thermal integrity to maximize performance. Leveraging our chiplet design expertise and die-to-die interconnect IPs, we enable scalable, low-latency architectures. With proven experience in full-reticle die sizes, optimized thermal design power, and intricate subsystem integration, we empower customers to overcome the challenges of today's compute-intensive workloads. Explore the following cases to discover our engineering excellence in AI and HPC applications. ][169] [ Networking GUC delivers advanced networking ASIC solutions tailored to the diverse requirements of modern infrastructure, from hyperscale datacenter switches to power-efficient optical networking. Our expertise spans high-performance CPU implementation, high-lane-count SerDes integration, low-power design, and advanced packaging solutions. For datacenter switches and Optical Transport Network (OTN), we enable ultra-high bandwidth with high-speed SerDes solutions while ensuring strong signal integrity, power integrity, and thermal integrity. In optical networking applications, we optimize low-power, low-voltage designs with compact packaging and enhanced power integrity. With deep experience across these domains, we empower customers to develop next-generation networking solutions that achieve high throughput, energy efficiency, and reliable performance. Explore the following cases to discover our engineering excellence in Networking applications. ][170] [ Automotive GUC offers industry-leading, customized ASIC design services tailored for automotive products, covering a wide range of applications such as ADAS, autonomous driving, digital cockpits, radar, LiDAR, cameras, microphones, and more. By leveraging optimized process design technologies and advanced packaging solutions, GUC leads the way in enabling the success of automotive products. Our solutions address the growing demand for exponential computational power while adhering to ISO 26262 and AEC-Q100 standards, ensuring high quality and reliability for our customers. Explore the following cases to discover our engineering excellence in automotive applications. ][171] [ Miscellaneous Consumer, Storage, and Industrial applications are increasingly integrating advanced functionality, driving the need for optimized process nodes and low-power design expertise to deliver cost-effective solutions. At GUC, we provide industry-leading low-power design solutions to enhance power efficiency, combined with IP subsystem integration capabilities and comprehensive system design solutions ensuring power, signal, and thermal integrity. With extensive experience across multiple process nodes and application segments, GUC empowers customers to develop high-quality, low-power, and cost-effective products. Explore the following cases to discover our engineering excellence in Consumer, Storage, and Industrial applications. ][172] IR CODE 3443 TECHNOLOGY-DRIVEN, VALUE-CENTERED ### INVESTOR GUC is committed to innovation, sustainability, and shareholder value. Through advanced ASIC design and low-power solutions, we drive the technology industry toward a greener and more responsible future. [ Financial Information ][173] [ Corporate Governance ][174] [ Shareholder Column ][175] [ Investor FAQ ][176] [ EXPLORE ][177] SMARTER CHIPS, GREENER FUTURE ### ESG We focus on Environmental, Social Responsibility, and Corporate Governance, ensuring that technological development aligns with sustainable business practices. [ EXPLORE ][178] Drag Drag [ Sustainability Honors ][179] [ ESG Articles ][180] [ Stakeholders ][181] ONE-STOP SOC DEVELOPMENT ### ABOUT GUC GUC is committed to innovation, sustainability, and shareholder value. Through advanced ASIC design and low-power solutions, we drive the technology industry toward a greener and more responsible future. [ ABOUT US ][182] [ RECRUITING ][183] [ CONTACT US ][184] OUR PARTNERS [ ][185] [ ][186] [ ][187] 