embedded]\n  Architectures & tools\n  \n  Architecture, tools, & software that power scalable, efficient Arm-based systems.\n  \n  [ Architectures ][20]\n  \n  Arm's trusted scalable, energy-efficient architectures\n  \n  [ Tools & software ][21]\n  \n  Tools to debug, optimize, & deploy software across Arm-based systems\n  \n  [Architecture and tools]\n  [ Licensing ][22]\n  \n  IP licensing models to build custom silicon & platforms.\n  \n  [ Arm Flexible Access ][23]\n  \n  Low-cost access to Arm IP, tools, & support, with license fees due only when you tape-out\n  \n  [ Arm Total Access ][24]\n  \n  The most comprehensive package of IP, tools, support, & training\n  \n  [Licensing]\n  [ All products ][25]\n  \n  Arm's full potfolio of CPUs, CSS, & IP.\n  \n  [ Arm AGI CPU ][26]\n  [ Compute Subsystems (CSS) ][27]\n  [ C1 CPUs ][28]\n  [ Cortex-A CPUs ][29]\n  [ Cortex-R CPUs ][30]\n  [ Cortex-M CPUs ][31]\n  [ Cortex-X CPUs ][32]\n  [ Neoverse CPUs ][33]\n  [ Mali GPUs ][34]\n  [ Ethos NPUs ][35]\n  [ System IP ][36]\n  [ Security IP ][37]\n  [ Subsystem IP ][38]\n* Markets\n  MARKETS\n  * Cloud AI\n  * Edge AI\n  * Physical AI\n  [ View all markets ][39]\n  [ Cloud AI ][40]\n  \n  Scalable, energy-efficient AI infrastructure across cloud & data centers.\n  \n  [ Cloud computing ][41]\n  \n  Scalable, multi-tenant infrastructure with balanced performance & efficiency\n  \n  [ Data center AI ][42]\n  \n  Compute platforms orchestrating AI across cloud & data centers\n  \n  [ High-performance computing ][43]\n  \n  Advanced compute for scientific & data-intensive workloads\n  \n  [ Telco & networking ][44]\n  \n  Programmable network infrastructure for intelligent, connected systems\n  \n  [Cloud AI]\n  [ Edge AI ][45]\n  \n  Power-efficient AI computing delivering everyday digital experiences.\n  \n  [ Gaming ][46]\n  \n  High-performance graphics & compute for immersive, responsive gameplay\n  \n  [ Industrial ][47]\n  \n  AI-enabled automation for monitoring, control, & predictive maintenance\n  \n  [ Laptops & PCs ][48]\n  \n  Agentic PC experiences powered by the Arm compute platform"}}, "page_text": "* [Skip to Main Content][1] * [Skip to Footer][2] Sorry, your browser is not supported. We recommend upgrading your browser. * [[arm]][3] * Products PRODUCTS * Cloud & data center * Autonomous machines * Mobile & PC * Wearables, smart home & embedded * Architectures & tools * Licensing * All products [ Products overview ][4] [ Cloud & data center ][5] Power-efficient, high-performance compute platform for AI, HPC, & cloud workloads. [ Arm AGI CPU ][6] Arm designed SoC for rapid deployment into servers for AI data centers [ Neoverse CSS ][7] Entire compute subsystems to accelerate time-to-market for server SoC designs [ Neoverse CPUs ][8] CPUs delivering industry leading performance-per-watt for server SoC designs [Cloud and data center] [ Autonomous machines ][9] Performance-driven platform for autonomous vehicles & robotics. [ Zena CSS ][10] Compute subsystems for autonomous vehicles & robotics [ AE technologies ][11] Purpose-built technologies for autonomous workloads, safety & security [Autonomous machines navigation image] [ Mobile & PC ][12] AI-first compute for advanced mobile, PC, & gaming experiences. [ Lumex CSS ][13] Mobile compute subsystems built for on-device AI [ Arm C1 CPUs ][14] High-performance & efficient compute for mobile SoCs [ Mali GPUs ][15] GPUs designed for high performance mobile gaming & immersive experiences [Mobile and PC] [ Wearables, smart home & embedded ][16] Power-efficient compute for wearables, smart home, industrial, & embedded IoT devices. [ Cortex-A ][17] Application CPUs for scalable performance across devices [ Cortex-M ][18] Low-power CPUs for microcontrollers used in embedded systems & real-time control [ Ethos ][19] Dedicated AI processors for efficient on-device AI & ML inference [Wearables, smart home and embedded] Architectures & tools Architecture, tools, & software that powe