Wide coverage", "High performance"], "pricing": null}, {"name": "SiP iMCP HTNB32L", "category": "IoT System-in-Package", "features": ["Connectivity via NB-IoT cellular networks", "Low power consumption", "Wide coverage", "High performance"], "pricing": null}], "services": [], "industries": ["Internet of Things (IoT)"], "key_markets": ["Brazil"]}, "financials": {"employee_count": null, "key_numbers": ["Certified Great Place to Work since 2018", "Third Sustainability Report published in 2025", "Copyright 2009-2023"]}, "relationships": {"customers": [], "investors": []}, "intel": {"synthesis": "HT Micron Semicondutores is a Brazilian semiconductor company focused on providing advanced semiconductor solutions, particularly in memory products and IoT System-in-Package (SiP) modules. The company emphasizes quality management, sustainability reporting, and social responsibility, and has been Great Place to Work certified since 2018. Its IoT SiP products (HTLRBL32L and HTNB32L) target massive IoT applications with LoRa/Bluetooth and NB-IoT connectivity options.", "actionable_insights": ["The company's focus on IoT SiP products positions it well for the growing IoT market in Brazil and globally.", "Sustainability reporting and Great Place to Work certification enhance its corporate reputation and employer branding.", "Its ability to offer both LoRa/Bluetooth and NB-IoT connectivity options addresses diverse IoT connectivity needs, potentially appealing to a wide range of IoT device manufacturers."]}, "location": {"address": "Avenida Unisinos, 1550, São Leopoldo – RS", "city": "São Leopoldo", "state": "RS", "country": "Brazil"}, "media": {"articles": [], "press_releases": [], "investor_presentations": []}}, "page_text": "", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "HT Micron — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Specializes in semiconductor packaging and testing services. | Brazilian company specializing in semiconductor packaging and testing, a key player in the local supply chain. | Brazil | Brazil", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "65", "Y Score": "63", "Overall Score": "64", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "KLA Corporation", "Website": "https://www.kla.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "USA", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Provides inspection and metrology systems for semiconductor manufacturing.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "KLA Corporation — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Provides inspection and metrology systems for semiconductor manufacturing; builds its own equipment.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "kla.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "kla.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to main content][1]\n* [US (English)][2]\n* [Mainland China (简体中文)][3]\n* [Taiwan (繁體中文)][4]\n* [Japan (日本語)][5]\n* [Korea (한국어)][6]\n* [KLA Advance][7]\n* [KLA Foundation][8]\n* [KLA Instruments][9]\n* [Home][10]\n* [Company][11]\n  * [About Us][12]\n    * [Overview][13]\n    * [Vision][14]\n    * [How We Do It][15]\n    * [KLA Foundation][16]\n    * [Management][17]\n    * [Board of Directors][18]\n  * [Impact][19]\n    * [Global Impact][20]\n      * [\n        \n        Proactively managing our environmental, social and governance (ESG) impacts is an integral\n        part of our mission. We are taking action, living out our values, and developing\n        technologies and ideas that inspire action.\n        \n        ][21]\n    * [Supporting Communities][22]\n      * [\n        \n        KLA Foundation is committed to investing in the global communities where KLA operates by\n        expanding access to high quality education and supporting community-centered solutions that\n        help people thrive. We partner with organizations that understand local needs and empower\n        KLA employees to turn their generosity into meaningful impact around the world.\n        \n        ][23]\n  * [Environmental, Social and Governance][24]\n    * [ESG][25]\n    * [Corporate Governance][26]\n    * [Compliance][27]\n    * [Suppliers][28]\n    * [Standards of Business Conduct][29]\n  * [Events][30]\n    * [Tradeshows & Seminars][31]\n    * [Recruiting][32]\n    * [Investors][33]\n  * [KLA Locations][34]\n    * [Overview][35]\n    * [Ann Arbor][36]\n    * [Mainland China][37]\n    * [Europe][38]\n    * [India][39]\n    * [Israel][40]\n    * [Japan][41]\n    * [Korea][42]\n    * [Singapore][43]\n    * [Taiwan][44]\n    * [United States][45]\n  * [ [view of the KLA office building]\n    \n    Videos\n    \n    Watch KLA's latest videos and explore our video channels.\n    \n    ][46]\n  * [Videos][47]\n* [Products & Technology][48]\n  * [Products][49]\n    * * [\n        \n        Our process-control and process-enabling solutions are designed to boost the innovation\n        speed of the electronics industry. We help our customers achieve leading-edge performance.\n        \n        ][50]\n    * [Chip Manufacturing][51]\n      * [Chemistry Process Control][52]\n      * [Defect Inspection and Review][53]\n      * [Deposition][54]\n      * [Etch][55]\n      * [In Situ Process Management][56]\n      * [Metrology][57]\n      * [Metal Deposition Processes][58]\n      * [Defect Inspection and Review][59]\n      * [Metrology][60]\n      * [In Situ Process Management][61]\n      * [Deposition][62]\n      * [Etch][63]\n      * [Chemistry Process Control][64]\n    * [Wafer Manufacturing][65]\n      * [Defect Inspection and Review][66]\n      * [In Situ Process Management][67]\n      * [Metrology][68]\n      * [Defect Inspection and Review][69]\n      * [Metrology][70]\n      * [In Situ Process Management][71]\n    * [Reticle Manufacturing][72]\n      * [Reticle Manufacturing][73]\n      * [Reticle Manufacturing][74]\n      * [Reticle Manufacturing][75]\n      * [Defect Inspection][76]\n      * [Metrology][77]\n      * [In Situ Process Management][78]\n    * [Packaging Manufacturing][79]\n      * [Wafer Inspection and Metrology ][80]\n      * [Wafer Processing Systems ][81]\n      * [Die Sorting and Inspection][82]\n      * [IC Component Inspection and Metrology][83]\n      * [Chemistry Process Control][84]\n      * [In Situ Process Management][85]\n      * [Wafer Inspection and Metrology][86]\n      * [Wafer Processing Systems][87]\n      * [Die Sorting and Inspection][88]\n      * [IC Component Inspection and Metrology][89]\n      * [Chemistry Process Control][90]\n      * [In Situ Process Management][91]\n    * [PCB & IC Substrate Manufacturing][92]\n      * [Automated Optical Shaping][93]\n      * [Chemistry Process Control][94]\n      * [Direct Imaging for Patterning][95]\n      * [Direct Imaging for Solder Mask][96]\n      * [Inkjet and Additive Printing][97]\n      * [Inspection and Metrology][98]\n      * [Direct Imaging for Patterning][99]\n      * [Dire"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to main content][1] * [US (English)][2] * [Mainland China (简体中文)][3] * [Taiwan (繁體中文)][4] * [Japan (日本語)][5] * [Korea (한국어)][6] * [KLA Advance][7] * [KLA Foundation][8] * [KLA Instruments][9] * [Home][10] * [Company][11] * [About Us][12] * [Overview][13] * [Vision][14] * [How We Do It][15] * [KLA Foundation][16] * [Management][17] * [Board of Directors][18] * [Impact][19] * [Global Impact][20] * [ Proactively managing our environmental, social and governance (ESG) impacts is an integral part of our mission. We are taking action, living out our values, and developing technologies and ideas that inspire action. ][21] * [Supporting Communities][22] * [ KLA Foundation is committed to investing in the global communities where KLA operates by expanding access to high quality education and supporting community-centered solutions that help people thrive. We partner with organizations that understand local needs and empower KLA employees to turn their generosity into meaningful impact around the world. ][23] * [Environmental, Social and Governance][24] * [ESG][25] * [Corporate Governance][26] * [Compliance][27] * [Suppliers][28] * [Standards of Business Conduct][29] * [Events][30] * [Tradeshows & Seminars][31] * [Recruiting][32] * [Investors][33] * [KLA Locations][34] * [Overview][35] * [Ann Arbor][36] * [Mainland China][37] * [Europe][38] * [India][39] * [Israel][40] * [Japan][41] * [Korea][42] * [Singapore][43] * [Taiwan][44] * [United States][45] * [ [view of the KLA office building] Videos Watch KLA's latest videos and explore our video channels. ][46] * [Videos][47] * [Products & Technology][48] * [Products][49] * * [ Our process-control and process-enabling solutions are designed to boost the innovation speed of the electronics industry. We help our customers achieve leading-edge performance. ][50] * [Chip Manufacturing][51] * [Chemistry Process Control][52] * [Defect Inspection and Review][53] * [Deposition][54] * [Etch][55] * [In Situ Process Management][56] * [Metrology][57] * [Metal Deposition Processes][58] * [Defect Inspection and Review][59] * [Metrology][60] * [In Situ Process Management][61] * [Deposition][62] * [Etch][63] * [Chemistry Process Control][64] * [Wafer Manufacturing][65] * [Defect Inspection and Review][66] * [In Situ Process Management][67] * [Metrology][68] * [Defect Inspection and Review][69] * [Metrology][70] * [In Situ Process Management][71] * [Reticl