olutions use AI to accelerate production of the very ICs that will power the next generation of AI innovation. ][131] * [Advanced Packaging][132] * [ Semiconductor innovation thrives in advanced packaging. Our solutions help advance connectivity within tomorrow's high-performance chips. ][133] * [Automotive][134] * [ Navigation, infotainment, driver assistance, autonomous driving, flying cars! Our solutions revolutionize quality control for the ICs that power the future of automotive. ][135] * [Internet of Things][136] * [ The Internet of Things is expanding quickly, and the demand for smart devices is growing with it! Our solutions drive increasing production to match it. ][137] * [5G Technology][138] * [ 5G's ultra-reliable low latency communication delivers higher data speeds and bandwidth to our mobile devices. Our solutions ensure these devices meet high quality and reliability standards. ][139] * [Services][140] * [Careers][141] * [Careers][142] * [Overview][143] * [Emerging Talent][144] * [How We Hire][145] * [Search Jobs][146] * [All KLA Jobs][147] * [Locations][148] * [Belgium][149] * [Europe][150] * [France][151] * [Germany][152] * [India][153] * [Ireland][154] * [Israel][155] * [Italy][156] * [Japan][157] * [Korea][158] * [Mainland China][159] * [Singapore][160] * [Taiwan][161] * [United Kingdom][162] * [United States][163] * [SPACER][164] * [Korea][165] * [Mainland China][166] * [Singapore][167] * [Taiwan][168] * [United States][169] * [United Kingdom][170] * [ [Innovation: Work at KLA ] Work at KLA Learn what it’s like to join a team making technology advancements that are bigger, and tinier, than the world has ever seen. ][171] * [Work at KLA][172] * [Newsroom][173] * [KLA Newsroom][174][Newsroom Home ][175] * [Blog][176] * [Videos][177] * [Events][178] * [Announcements][179] * [Investors][180] * [Overview][181] * [News & Events][182] * [Press Releases][183] * [Governance][184] * [Overview][185] * [Leadership][186] * [General Information][187] * [Conta