][248] * Packaging Manufacturing * * Back * Packaging Manufacturing * [Overview][249] * [Wafer Inspection and Metrology][250] * [Wafer Processing Systems][251] * [Die Sorting and Inspection][252] * [IC Component Inspection and Metrology][253] * [Chemistry Process Control][254] * [In Situ Process Management][255] * PCB & IC Substrate Manufacturing * * Back * PCB & IC Substrate Manufacturing * [Overview][256] * [Direct Imaging for Patterning][257] * [Direct Imaging for Solder Mask][258] * [Inspection and Metrology][259] * [Automated Optical Shaping][260] * [Inkjet and Additive Printing][261] * [Chemistry Process Control][262] * [PCB Software Solutions][263] * Software Solutions * * Back * Software Solutions * [Overview][264] * [Semiconductor Software Solutions][265] * [PCB Software Solutions][266] * OEM * * Back * OEM * [Overview][267] * [Capacitive Sensors][268] * [Process Control][269] * Other Industries * * Back * Other Industries * [Overview][270] * [Hard Disk Drive Manufacturing][271] * [Solar Manufacturing][272] * [University and Industry Research][273] * More Products * * Back * More Products * [Broadband Plasma][274] * [KLA Instruments][275] * [Pro Systems][276] * [Products A to Z][277] * Technology Trends * * Back * Technology Trends * [Artificial Intelligence][278] * [Advanced Packaging][279] * [Automotive][280] * [Internet of Things][281] * [5G Technology][282] * [Services][283] * Careers * * Back * Careers * Careers * * Back * Careers * [Overview][284] * [Emerging Talent][285] * [How We Hire][286] * Search Jobs * * Back * Search Jobs * [All KLA Jobs][287] * Locations * * Back * Locations * [Belgiu", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "KLA Corporation — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Provides inspection and metrology systems for semiconductor manufacturing; builds its own equipment. | Provides inspection and metrology systems for semiconductor manufacturing. | United States | USA", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "67", "Y Score": "62", "Overall Score": "64", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Renesas Electronics", "Website": "https://www.renesas.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Japan", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Japan)", "Operational Presence": "Japan", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Produces microcontrollers, analog, and power devices.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "JP", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Renesas Electronics — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Renesas is a semiconductor manufacturer that designs and produces its own microcontrollers, analog, and power devices.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "100", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "renesas.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "renesas.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ Skip to main content ][1]\nwarning\nAug 4, 2026: [UPDATE 4 - Impact of the 2026 Kumamoto Earthquake on Renesas Operations][2]\n\n## Account\n* [English][3]\n  \n  ## English\n  * [English][4]\n  * [中文][5]\n  * [日本語][6]\n* [Samples][7]\n* [Cart][8]\n\n[Log In][9]\n[[Renesas Electronics Corporation]][10]\n\n## Main navigation\n\n### [Menu][11]\n\n### [ Back][12]\n\n[Search][13]\n[Homepage banner illustrating an illuminated semiconductor chip with leaf texture in the center\nindicating business sustainability.]\n\n## Accelerating Growth Through Innovation for People and Society\n\nRenesas’ 2025 Business & Sustainability Report highlights our strategic progress, financial and ESG\nperformance.\n\n[Learn more ][14]\n[Humanoid robot homepage banner.]\n\n## Enter the Era of Physical AI\n\n[Learn More][15]\n[Cuckoo success story homepage banner featuring cuckoo's ai-powered induction cooktop.]\n\n## Cooking with Intelligence: CUCKOO Debuts AI-Powered Induction Range\n\nAI-enabled induction cooktop that detects boiling through Renesas MCUs and Reality AI software.\n\n[Learn more][16]\n[Analog branding homepage banner.]\n\n## The Bridge Between AI & the Real World\n\nFrom sensing and control, to compute, memory and beyond, Renesas powers the complete analog signal\nchain, where AI meets reality.\n\n[Learn More][17]\n\n## Explore our Design Resources\n\n[\n[Icon showing cog with magnifying glass illustration, indicating tools search.]\nSoftware & Tools\n][18]\n[\n[Icon showing circuitry illustration within a square, indicating electronic components of a circuit\nboard.]\nBoards & Kits\n][19]\n[\n[Icon showing bi-directional arrows illustration, indicating cross referencing.]\nCross Reference\n][20]\n[\n[Icon showing human within laptop screen illustration, indicating online training and virtual\nmeeting.]\nTechnical Support\n][21]\n\n## New Products\n\n[\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SCQFN chip package with 72 lead count.]\nRAA278831 Active\nASIL B Video Display and Diagnostics OpenLDI Bridge IC for Automotive HUD Systems\n][22][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of LQFP IC chip package with 64 lead count.]\nRX14T Active\n48MHz Entry-Level 32-bit Microcontroller for Motor Control with 128KB Flash\n][23][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of QFN chip package with 22 lead count.]\nRRW22125 Active\n25W to 45W Digital AC/DC SSR Flyback SiP with 700V, 480mΩ GaN FET\n][24][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of TSSOP IC chip package with 20 lead count.]\nRA0E3 Active\n32MHz Arm Cortex-M23 Entry-Level Ultra-Low Power General-Purpose Microcontroller with 16KB Flash\n][25][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of PQFN chip package with 8 lead count.]\nTP70H135G4PLSGB Active\n700V 135mΩ High‑Voltage GaN FET in PQFN 8×8 Industry‑Standard Package\n][26][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of STQFN IC chip package with 44 lead count.]\nPTX205R Active\nFlexible NFC Controller with Reader and Card Emulation for IoT\n][27][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of LSDIP chip package with 8 lead count.]\nRV1S9992A Active\n4A Output Current, Gate Drive, LSDIP 8, 15mm Creepage Distance Optocoupler\n][28][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SOIC chip package with 14 lead count.]\niW3701 Active\nDigital Two-Stage Combo Boost PFC and High-Voltage Buck Controller for High PF, Low THD Dimmable\nLighting Solutions in Industrial Applications to 250W\n][29][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SOICN chip package with 14 lead count.]\nRRA79044 Active\nQuad, Ultra-Low Power, RRIO, Operational Amplifier\n][30][\nNEW\n[3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SOIC chip package with 8 lead count.]\nISL28233A Active\nDual Micro-Power, High-Precision Operational Amplifier\n][31]\n[Technician holding semiconductor wafer in hand.]\n\n## Winning Combinations\n\nDelivering comprehensive solutions with analog, power, embedded processing, and connectivity\nproducts.\n\n[View All Winning Combinations][32]\n[ [Humanoid robot"}}, "page_text": "[ Skip to main content ][1] warning Aug 4, 2026: [UPDATE 4 - Impact of the 2026 Kumamoto Earthquake on Renesas Operations][2] ## Account * [English][3] ## English * [English][4] * [中文][5] * [日本語][6] * [Samples][7] * [Cart][8] [Log In][9] [[Renesas Electronics Corporation]][10] ## Main navigation ### [Menu][11] ### [ Back][12] [Search][13] [Homepage banner illustrating an illuminated semiconductor chip with leaf texture in the center indicating business sustainability.] ## Accelerating Growth Through Innovation for People and Society Renesas’ 2025 Business & Sustainability Report highlights our strategic progress, financial and ESG performance. [Learn more ][14] [Humanoid robot homepage banner.] ## Enter the Era of Physical AI [Learn More][15] [Cuckoo success story homepage banner featuring cuckoo's ai-powered induction cooktop.] ## Cooking with Intelligence: CUCKOO Debuts AI-Powered Induction Range AI-enabled induction cooktop that detects boiling through Renesas MCUs and Reality AI software. [Learn more][16] [Analog branding homepage banner.] ## The Bridge Between AI & the Real World From sensing and control, to compute, memory and beyond, Renesas powers the complete analog signal chain, where AI meets reality. [Learn More][17] ## Explore our Design Resources [ [Icon showing cog with magnifying glass illustration, indicating tools search.] Software & Tools ][18] [ [Icon showing circuitry illustration within a square, indicating electronic components of a circuit board.] Boards & Kits ][19] [ [Icon showing bi-directional arrows illustration, indicating cross referencing.] Cross Reference ][20] [ [Icon showing human within laptop screen illustration, indicating online training and virtual meeting.] Technical Support ][21] ## New Products [ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SCQFN chip package with 72 lead count.] RAA278831 Active ASIL B Video Display and Diagnostics OpenLDI Bridge IC for Automotive HUD Systems ][22][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of LQFP IC chip package with 64 lead count.] RX14T Active 48MHz Entry-Level 32-bit Microcontroller for Motor Control with 128KB Flash ][23][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of QFN chip package with 22 lead count.] RRW22125 Active 25W to 45W Digital AC/DC SSR Flyback SiP with 700V, 480mΩ GaN FET ][24][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of TSSOP IC chip package with 20 lead count.] RA0E3 Active 32MHz Arm Cortex-M23 Entry-Level Ultra-Low Power General-Purpose Microcontroller with 16KB Flash ][25][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of PQFN chip package with 8 lead count.] TP70H135G4PLSGB Active 700V 135mΩ High‑Voltage GaN FET in PQFN 8×8 Industry‑Standard Package ][26][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of STQFN IC chip package with 44 lead count.] PTX205R Active Flexible NFC Controller with Reader and Card Emulation for IoT ][27][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of LSDIP chip package with 8 lead count.] RV1S9992A Active 4A Output Current, Gate Drive, LSDIP 8, 15mm Creepage Distance Optocoupler ][28][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SOIC chip package with 14 lead count.] iW3701 Active Digital Two-Stage Combo Boost PFC and High-Voltage Buck Controller for High PF, Low THD Dimmable Lighting Solutions in Industrial Applications to 250W ][29][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SOICN chip package with 14 lead count.] RRA79044 Active Quad, Ultra-Low Power, RRIO, Operational Amplifier ][30][ NEW [3D illustration featuring top and bottom views of SOIC chip package with 8 lead count.] ISL28233A Active Dual Micro-Power, High-Precision Operational Amplifier ][31] [Technician holding semiconductor wafer in hand.] ## Winning Combinations Delivering comprehensive solutions with analog, power, embedded processing, and connectivity products. [View All Winning Combinations][32] [ [Humanoid robot in thinking position with illuminated brain illustration signifying robot's system compute capability.] Humanoid System Compute (Brain) Ultra-high AI compute brain coordinating real-time perception, control, and human-like movement. ][33] [ [Close‑up of a dexterous robotic hand with articulated joints and integrated actuators, illustrating precision manipulation and advanced motor control for robotics applications.] Dexterous Robotic Hand Modular, high‑precision motor control architecture for scalable dexterous robotic hands. ][34] [ [Humanoid robot hand holding battery indicating the robot's battery management system capabilities.] Humanoid Battery Management System Integrated humanoid robot BMS enabling safe, real-time power management, protection, and battery-state control. ][35] ## News & Updates [Visit Newsroom][36] ─────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Aug 8, 2026Blog │[New Analog Chief Underscores Breadth, Depth, and a Heavy Dose of Customer │Design Support][37] ─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Aug 4, 2026Notice │[UPDATE 4 - Impact of the 2026 Kumamoto Earthquake on Renesas Operations][38] ─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Jul 31, 2026Notice │[UPDATE 3 - Impact of the 2026 Kumamoto Earthquake on Renesas Operations][39] ─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Jul 31, 2026Press │[Renesas Reports Financial Results for the Second Quarter Ended June 30, Release │2026][40] ─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Jul 31, 2026Press │[Renesas Announces Consolidated Forecasts][41] Release │ ─────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── [Green leaf on a semiconductor circuit board chip, suggesting environment and business sustainability.] ## Accelerating Growth Through Innovation for People and Society Renesas’ 2025 Business & Sustainability Report highlights our strategic progress, financial and ESG performance. [Read Report][42] ## Events & Webinars A preview of technology events and webinars [View all events][43] [View all webinars][44] [ [Electronica India South] Exhibition Electronica India South Sep 16, 2026 - Sep 18, 2026 ][45] [ [Electronica 2026] Exhibition Electronica 2026 Nov 10, 2026 - Nov 13, 2026 ][46] ## Renesas 