 [ Support & community ][222] * [ Support ][223] * [Partner program][224] * [Learning][225] * [Video center][226] * [ST community][227] * [ST wiki][228] * [ English ][229] * [ 日本語 ][230] * [ 中文 ][231] * English Our **ST Recruiting Privacy Terms (Privacy Terms)** describes the privacy and security practices that STMicroelectronics, its subsidiaries, and affiliates employ when collecting, using, and handling personal information about you in connection with our online and offline recruitment activities. It also explains the choices you have in relation to these processing activities. By engaging with us (clicking one of the Call-To-Action buttons) you are subject to the Privacy Terms that we invite you to read them by clicking on [ST Recruiting Privacy Terms][232] Please note that when clicking a Call-To-Action button you are directed to the recruiting platform of our partner Eightfold, the Privacy Terms are always governing our online and offline recruitment activities. Find your next adventure [ST Banner] Security by design You’re in safe hands. We help you build secure, future-ready solutions that comply with global regulations, and market-specific requirements. [ Find out more ][233] [ST Banner] Security by design You’re in safe hands. We help you build secure, future-ready solutions that comply with global regulations, and market-specific requirements. [ Find out more ][234] [ST Banner] Security by design You’re in safe hands. We help you build secure, future-ready solutions that comply with global regulations, and market-specific requirements. [ Find out more ][235] Quick start * [ Careers ][236] * [ Design tools ][237] * [ Development tools ][238] * [ Community ][239] * [ eStore ][240] * [ Contact us ][241] ## Products & innovations for you ## Products & innovations for you Smart Mobility Power & Energy Cloud-connected Autonomous Things ### Smart Mobility We are improving mobility by making it safer, greener, and more connected for everyone. [ #### AutoDevKit ecosystem #### AutoDevKit ecosystem A complete integrated development environment to speed up automotive prototyping Start your design today ][242] [ #### Smarter SDV starts here #### Smarter SDV starts here Powering the shift to centralized automotive E/E architectures with smarter distribution, safer control, and higher efficiency Scalable SDV design resources ][243] ### Power & Energy We are enabling industries to increase energy efficiency and use more renewable energy. [ #### USB PD design guide #### USB PD design guide Learn how STUSB4531 simplifies USB-C Power Delivery design with practical guidance. Watch now ][244] [ #### 700 V PowerGaN #### 700 V PowerGaN Higher switching frequencies, smaller magnetics. For datacenter power, solar conversion, EV charging, and industrial motor drives. Explore 700 V e-mode p-GaN ][245] ### Cloud-connected Autonomous Things We are supporting the proliferation of secure, connected, autonomous devices enabled by edge AI. [ #### STM32 M.2 serial memory pack #### STM32 M.2 serial memory pack Add external flash to Nucleo-144 boards with five M.2 serial memory add-ons. Get the pack ][246] [ #### Next-gen sensing #### Next-gen sensing The IIS3DWB10IS features ISPU 2.0 edge AI processing and rugged reliability for 3-axis industrial predictive maintenance. Discover more ][247] ## Upcoming events Want to know more about our latest technologies?Come and meet us. [Check out all our upcoming events][248] [Check out all our upcoming events][249] Sep 29 - Oct 27 [ [event-tile-1-en] [event-tile-1-en] Workshop Workshop Online ### Master wireless embedded development with Zephyr 29 Sep - 27 Oct Online ### Master wireless embedded development with Zephyr ][250] Aug 23 - 26 [ [event-tile-2-en] [event-tile-2-en] Tradeshow Tradeshow Salt Lake City, UT ### Small Satellite Conference 23 Aug - 26 Aug Salt Lake City, UT ### Small Satellite Conference ][251] Sep 22 - 24 [ [event-tile-3-en] [event-tile-3-en] Tradeshow Tradeshow Anaheim, CA, US ### embedded world NA 2026 22 Sep - 24 Sep Anaheim, CA, US ### embedded world NA 2026 ][252] R&D 9,000 employees. Innovation. 21,000 patents. Partnerships. 200 active R&D programs. ## We have an unwavering commitment to innovation & technology We innovate to create unique technologies and products that provide our customers the best solutions to address their challenges and opportunities. [Discover innovation and technology at ST][253] [Discover innovation and technology at ST][254] [robot-industry-", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "STMicroelectronics — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: STMicroelectronics is a semiconductor manufacturer that designs and produces its own chips. | Provides a broad range of semiconductor solutions. | Switzerland; France | Switzerland/France/Italy", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "66", "Y Score": "62", "Overall Score": "64", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Leaders"}, {"Company": "Tata Electronics", "Website": "https://www.tataelectronics.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "India", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Major Indian conglomerate Tata Group's electronics arm, investing in semiconductor assembly and testing, and planning a fab in Dholera.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Tata Electronics — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Investing in semiconductor assembly and testing, planning a fab, builds technology.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "tataelectronics.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "tataelectronics.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[ Skip to Main Content ][1]\n[ [Tata Electronics] ][2] [ [Tata Group] ][3]\n* [ About Us ][4]\n  * [Who We Are][5]\n  * [Mission, Vision, and Values][6]\n  * [Our Journey][7]\n  * [Leadership][8]\n* [ Businesses ][9]\n  * [What We Do][10]\n  * [Electronics Manufacturing Services][11]\n  * [Semiconductor Assembly and Test][12]\n  * [Semiconductor Foundry][13]\n  * [Design Services][14]\n* [ Sustainability ][15]\n  * [Caring for the Earth][16]\n  * [Caring for the Community][17]\n* [ Newsroom ][18]\n* [ Careers ][19]\n  * [Work With Us][20]\n  * [Culture][21]\n  * [Grow With Us][22]\n  * [Early Careers][23]\n  * [Job Listings][24]\n* [ Contact Us ][25]\n[ [Tata Group] ][26]\nSearch Bar\nTata Electronics\n\n# Journey Towards Excellence\n\nTata Electronics is a prominent global player in the electronics & semiconductor manufacturing\nindustry, with strong capabilities in Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS), Semiconductor\nAssembly & Test (OSAT), Semiconductor Foundry, and Design Services. Established in 2020 as a\ngreenfield venture of the Tata Group, today, Tata Electronics is advancing India's position as a\nglobal electronics and semiconductor manufacturing hub.\n\npause\nAI-enabled Tech [Tata Electronics - AI-enabled technology] AI-enabled Tech\nPowered by People [Tata Electronics - Delivering end-to-end electronics manufacturing solutions]\nPowered by People\n[Tata Electronics - Working towards a greener tomorrow] Greener Tomorrow Greener Tomorrow\n[Tata Electronics - Offering a resilient supply chain for global customers] Resilient Supply Chain\nResilient Supply Chain\n\n## The **Future**\n## is Now\n\nWe deliver comprehensive end-to-end solutions across the entire electronics and semiconductor\nmanufacturing value chain. Our distinctive capabilities provide a geopolitically stable and\nresilient supply chain for our global customers.\n\n[Learn More ][27]\n\n## Complete Set of **Solutions**\n\n[Tata Electronics - Electronics Manufacturing Services]\n\n### Electronics Manufacturing Services\n\nWe build high-precision components for electronic products.\n\nWe build premium personal electronic devices that stand the test of quality and durability.\n\n[Learn More ][28]\n[Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Assembley and Test]\n\n### Semiconductor Assembly and Test\n\nOur Semiconductor Assembly and Test business focuses on multiple packaging technologies categorised\ninto traditional, advanced, and wafer platforms.\n\n[Learn More ][29]\n[Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Foundry]\n\n### Semiconductor Foundry\n\nAt our AI-enabled Semiconductor Fab, we deploy next-generation automation capabilities to\nmanufacture wafers on a large scale.\n\n[Learn More ][30]\n[Tata Electronics - Design Services]\n\n### Design Services\n\nWe provide customisable Design Services to manufacture chips for specific needs and migrate current\nproducts to new process technologies.\n\n[Learn More ][31]\n[Tata Electronics - Electronics Manufacturing Services]\nElectronics Manufacturing Services\n\nSemiconductor Assembly and Test\n\n[Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Assembley and Test]\n[Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Foundry]\n\nSemiconductor Foundry\n\nDesign Services\n\n[Tata Electronics - Design Services]\n\n## Co-creating Positive\n## **Change**\n* ### Embracing Circular Economies\n  \n  We are striving for Net Zero carbon emissions by implementing a range of sustainability\n  initiatives.\n  \n  \"Electronics manufacturing reimagines each product lifecycle as a chance to drive innovation and\n  champion sustainability.\"\n  \n  Dr Randhir Thakur, CEO & MD \n  \n  [Learn More ][32]\n* ### Empowering Communities\n  \n  Tata Electronics is committed to creating a socio-economic footprint by employing a large number\n  of women in its workforce and actively supporting local communities through initiatives in\n  healthcare, hygiene, and education.\n  \n  [Learn More ][33]\n* ### Nurturing Biodiversity\n  \n  Our biodiversity parks and green belts cover over 100 acres, dedicated to conserving more than\n  27,000 species of native plants and trees.\n  \n  We implement projects to r"}}, "page_text": "[ Skip to Main Content ][1] [ [Tata Electronics] ][2] [ [Tata Group] ][3] * [ About Us ][4] * [Who We Are][5] * [Mission, Vision, and Values][6] * [Our Journey][7] * [Leadership][8] * [ Businesses ][9] * [What We Do][10] * [Electronics Manufacturing Services][11] * [Semiconductor Assembly and Test][12] * [Semiconductor Foundry][13] * [Design Services][14] * [ Sustainability ][15] * [Caring for the Earth][16] * [Caring for the Community][17] * [ Newsroom ][18] * [ Careers ][19] * [Work With Us][20] * [Culture][21] * [Grow With Us][22] * [Early Careers][23] * [Job Listings][24] * [ Contact Us ][25] [ [Tata Group] ][26] Search Bar Tata Electronics # Journey Towards Excellence Tata Electronics is a prominent global player in the electronics & semiconductor manufacturing industry, with strong capabilities in Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS), Semiconductor Assembly & Test (OSAT), Semiconductor Foundry, and Design Services. Established in 2020 as a greenfield venture of the Tata Group, today, Tata Electronics is advancing India's position as a global electronics and semiconductor manufacturing hub. pause AI-enabled Tech [Tata Electronics - AI-enabled technology] AI-enabled Tech Powered by People [Tata Electronics - Delivering end-to-end electronics manufacturing solutions] Powered by People [Tata Electronics - Working towards a greener tomorrow] Greener Tomorrow Greener Tomorrow [Tata Electronics - Offering a resilient supply chain for global customers] Resilient Supply Chain Resilient Supply Chain ## The **Future** ## is Now We deliver comprehensive end-to-end solutions across the entire electronics and semiconductor manufacturing value chain. Our distinctive capabilities provide a geopolitically stable and resilient supply chain for our global customers. [Learn More ][27] ## Complete Set of **Solutions** [Tata Electronics - Electronics Manufacturing Services] ### Electronics Manufacturing Services We build high-precision components for electronic products. We build premium personal electronic devices that stand the test of quality and durability. [Learn More ][28] [Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Assembley and Test] ### Semiconductor Assembly and Test Our Semiconductor Assembly and Test business focuses on multiple packaging technologies categorised into traditional, advanced, and wafer platforms. [Learn More ][29] [Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Foundry] ### Semiconductor Foundry At our AI-enabled Semiconductor Fab, we deploy next-generation automation capabilities to manufacture wafers on a large scale. [Learn More ][30] [Tata Electronics - Design Services] ### Design Services We provide customisable Design Services to manufacture chips for specific needs and migrate current products to new process technologies. [Learn More ][31] [Tata Electronics - Electronics Manufacturing Services] Electronics Manufacturing Services Semiconductor Assembly and Test [Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Assembley and Test] [Tata Electronics - Semiconductor Foundry] Semiconductor Foundry Design Services [Tata Electronics - Design Services] ## Co-creating Positive ## **Change** * ### Embracing Circular Economies We are striving for Net Zero carbon emissions by implementing a range of sustainability initiatives. \"Electronics manufacturing reimagines each product lifecycle as a chance to drive innovation and champion sustainability.\" Dr Randhir Thakur, CEO & MD [Learn More ][32] * ### Empowering Communities Tata Electronics is committed to creating a socio-economic footprint by employing a large number of women in its workforce and actively supporting local communities through initiatives in healthcare, hygiene, and education. [Learn More ][33] * ### Nurturing Biodiversity Our biodiversity parks and green belts cover over 100 acres, dedicated to conserving more than 27,000 species of native plants and trees. We implement projects to restore lakes, aiming to expand water resources and safeguard migratory bird species. [Learn More ][34] pause/play button for co creating posive slides ## Our **People** [left-side-top-image] [right-side-top-image] Touch The New **Tomorrow** [Tata Electronic - Touch The New Tomorrow] [Tata Electronic - Touch The New Tomorrow] [Tata Electronic - Touch The New Tomorrow] [Tata Electronic - Touch The New Tomorrow] [Tata Electronic - Touch The New Tomorrow] [Tata Electronic - Touch The New Tomorrow] [Tata Electronic - Touch The New Tomorrow] [right-side-bottom-image] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] **Learn** While You Earn [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] [Tata Electronic - Learn While You Earn] Join Us [Apply Here ][35] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [left-side-bottom-image] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] [Tata Electronic - Join Us] % Women Workforce [Tata Electronic - Women Employees] [Tata Electronic - Women Employees] [Tata Electronic -