vation with CBA wafer bonding technology] [BiCS FLASH: generation 8 3D flash memory A novel architectural innovation with CBA wafer bonding technology] ][128] ## News * [ Kioxia and Sandisk Unveil New High-Performance QLC 3D Flash Memory Technology Designed for AI and Data-Intensive Applications ][129] August 12, 2026 KIOXIA News Releases * [ Kioxia Donates to Support 2026 Kumamoto Earthquake Relief Efforts ][130] August 06, 2026 KIOXIA News Releases * [ KIOXIA GP Series Super High IOPS SSD Named 'Best of Show' at FMS: the Future of Memory and Storage 2026 ][131] August 05, 2026 KIOXIA News Releases [ All News ][132] ## Business product information for memory and SSD. Business [ Business Products ][133] [ Application ][134] * [ Memory ][135] * [ SSD ][136] ## R&D to Create a New Era of Memory As a leading company in flash memory and SSD, KIOXIA delivers products that create new value. Research and development into cutting-edge technologies in many diverse fields is essential for realizing this. We implement technological innovation to pursue the potential of “memory.” [ Research and Technology Development ][137] ## Yokkaichi Plant and Kitakami Plant KIOXIA Group’s manufacturing sites have world-leading production scale, and state-of-the-art technologies that support the Group’s sustainable growth. The operations of Yokkaichi Plant and Kitakami Plant are coordinated to meet the expanding demand for flash memory. [ Yokkaichi Plant ][138] [ Access to Yokkaichi Plant ][139] [ Kitakami Plant (Kioxia Iwate Corporation) ][140] ## Corporate Group Information [ Company Information ][141] KIOXIA is a global leader in flash memory and solid state drives. Introducing company information including overview, access and management. [ Employment Opportunities ][142] People from various backgrounds fulfill their potential and leverage their strengths at KIOXIA Group. [ Corporate Group Information (KIOXIA Holdings Corporation) [A new window will open.] ][143] KIOXIA Corporation is a wholly-owned subsidiary of KIOXIA Holdings Corporation. For information on corporate group information and investor relations information, please visit the KIOXIA Holdings website. [KIOXIA Insights] [ KIOXIA Insights ][144] KIOXIA Insights highlights a range of activities that align with our mission to “uplift the world with ‘memory’”. By evolving “memory,” we create uplifting experiences and change the world. KIOXIA Corporation has officially changed its name from Toshiba Memory Corporation effective October 1, 2019. Some pages and/or documents may still include the name \"Toshiba Corporation\" or \"Toshiba Memory Corporation,\" please interpret those names to correspond to the new company name. * Icon definitions: * [A new window will open.]A new window will open. * [PDF will open in a new window.]PDF will open in a new window. * [A modal window will open.]A modal window will open. [ News ][145] [ Events ][146] [ Contact Us ][147] ## KIOXIA Holdings Corporation (Corporate / Investor Relations) [ KIOXIA Holdings Corporation Home [A new window will open.] ][148] [ Investor Relations [A new window will open.] ][149] * [[Youtube ]][150] * [[instagram ]][151] * [KIOXIA Group's Official Social Media Account List][152] * [Social Media Policy][153] * [Privacy Policy][154] * Cookie Settings * [Terms and Conditions][155] * [Trademarks][156] * [Site Map][157] * Copyright © 2022 KIOXIA Corporation. All Rights Reserved. [Page Top] [1]: /en-jp/contact.html [2]: https://www.kioxia.com/ja-jp/top.html [3]: https://www.kioxia.com/en-jp/top.html [4]: https://www.kioxia.com.cn/zh-cn/top.html [5]: https://hk.kioxia.com/en-hk/top.html [6]: https://kr.kioxia.com/ko-kr/top.html [7]: https://tw.kioxia.com/zh-tw/top.html [8]: https://apac.kioxia.com/en-apac/top.html [9]: https://americas.kioxia.com/pt-br/top.html [10]: https://americas.kioxia.com/en-ca/top.html [11]: https://americas.kioxia.com/en-us/top.html [12]: https://americas.kioxia.com/es-lar/top.html [13]: https://europe.kioxia.com