"Company": "Nanolithography Solutions", "Website": "https://www.nanolitho.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops advanced lithography tools and processes for semiconductor fabrication.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Nanolithography Solutions — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops lithography tools and processes for semiconductor fabrication, building their own technology.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "85", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "nanolitho.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "nanolitho.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Toggle navigation\n[+91 7829370000][1]\n* [About us][2]\n* [Expertise][3]\n* [Skill sets][4]\n* [Process Nodes][5]\n* [Projects][6]\n* [Careers][7]\n* [Employee login][8]\n* [Contact us][9]\n<\n\n## We Commit What We Deliver\n\n## Not All Commitment Can Be Delivered\n\n## But All Deliverables Can Be Committed\n\n## ABOUT US\n\n\n\n\nNanolitho Technologies Private Limited is a Private company incorporated on 09 March 2016, located\nin Bangalore, India.\n\nWe at Nanolitho are committed to delivering quality assured deliverables in all our services to our\ncustomers.\n\nOur future is built on meeting commitment by our day-to-day operations of our team members’\ncommitment to conducting business with uncompromising integrity and professionalism.\n\nGood Corporate Governance ensures the success of the customers on the basis of trust and respect. We\nconsider Corporate Governance to be an integrated, holistic approach that encompasses all corporate\nvalues, processes and goals.\n\n**Trust **\nWe take pride in our ethical culture, are honest, and do the right thing.\n\n**Respect **\nWe are inclusive, embrace diverse perspectives and value the role we play in our shared vision.\n\n**Collaboration **\nWe fuel more powerful ideas, deeper relationships and greater opportunities to achieve shared\nobjectives together.\n\nWe believe that putting Our Values into practice creates long-term benefits for shareholders,\ncustomers, and the employees.\n\n## EXPERTISE\n* Full chips starting from floorplanning to packaging.\n* RF and Analog Layout.\n* Standard cells.\n* Creating Pcells.\n* Methodology development.\n* Assembly rule checking.\n* IC Packaging (Wire Bond, BGA, WLCSP, QFN).\n* Latchup and ESD precautions.\n* CADENCE \"SKILL\" programming.\n* Blackbox flow.\n\n## SKILL SETS\n* Custom deep submicron Analog layout.\n* Interface with Design Engineers from various locations.\n* Work within a team framework.\n* Experience with GF 22nm FDSOI, TSMC 40nm LP/ULP, etc.\n* Understand issues involved in high speed Analog layouts.\n* Assembly rule checking.\n* IC Packaging (Wire Bond, BGA, WLCSP, QFN).\n* Latchup and ESD precautions.\n* Good communication skills.\n* Timely and quality execution of layout design.\n* Expertise on matching, parasitic reduction, ESD, DFM etc.\n* Proficiency in use of EDA tools for full custom layout and verification DRC/LVS/DFM etc.\n* Execute final pinout, package MB diagram.\n\n## PROCESS NODES\n\nSome of the process nodes we have worked on\n* 14nm FINFET\n* 22nm FDSOI\n* 28nm\n* 40nm\n* 45nm\n* 55nm\n* 65nm\n* 90nm\n* 130nm BICMOS\n* 180nm\n\n## PROJECTS\n\nTechnology\nCMOS 40nm LP\n\nFoundry\nTSMC\n\nTechnology\n22FDXSOI, 22nm\n\nFoundry\nGLOBALFOUNDRIES\n\n\n*images made intentionally blurred.\n\n*Prior approval for public sharing is obtained from customers.\n\n## CAREERS\n\nFirst Name\nField can not empty! Invalid Name\nLast Name\nField can not empty! Invalid Name\nEmail id\nField can not empty! Invalid Email id\nPhone no.\nField can not empty! Only 10 Digit no. Required\nComments\nAttachment\nFill captcha\nField can not empty!\n\n## EMPLOYEE LOGIN\n\nEmployee ID\nPlease Fill Out This Field\nPassword\nPlease Fill Out This Field\n\n## CONTACT US\n\n[\n][10]\nFirst Name Field can not empty! Invalid Name\nLast Name Field can not empty! Invalid Name\nEmail Field can not empty! Invalid Email id\nPhone Field can not empty! Only 10 Digit no. Required\nComments\nFill captcha Field can not empty!\n\n#### Address:\n\nNO. 4GC-101,4TH G CROSS,\n1H MAIN,EAST OF NGEF LAYOUT,\nKASTURI NAGAR,BANGALORE 560043.\n\n#### Phone:\n\n[+91 7829370000][11]\n\n#### Email:\n\n[[email protected]][12]\nCopyright 2017 All Rights Reserved\n[Web Design Company][13] : [Nextwebi.com][14]\n\n[1]: tel:+91 7829370000\n[2]: #aboutus\n[3]: #expertise\n[4]: #skill-sets\n[5]: #process-nodes\n[6]: #projects\n[7]: #careers\n[8]: https://portal.nanolitho.com\n[9]: #contactus\n[10]: https://www.google.com/maps/place/Nanolitho+Technologies+Pvt.,+Ltd../@13.008727,77.65699,16z/d\nata=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0xa4edd33f70f38be7!8m2!3d13.008727!4d77.65699?hl=en-US\n[11]: tel::+91 7829370000\n[12]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7a1915140e1b190e0"}}, "page_text": "Toggle navigation [+91 7829370000][1] * [About us][2] * [Expertise][3] * [Skill sets][4] * [Process Nodes][5] * [Projects][6] * [Careers][7] * [Employee login][8] * [Contact us][9] < ## We Commit What We Deliver ## Not All Commitment Can Be Delivered ## But All Deliverables Can Be Committed ## ABOUT US Nanolitho Technologies Private Limited is a Private company incorporated on 09 March 2016, located in Bangalore, India. We at Nanolitho are committed to delivering quality assured deliverables in all our services to our customers. Our future is built on meeting commitment by our day-to-day operations of our team members’ commitment to conducting business with uncompromising integrity and professionalism. Good Corporate Governance ensures the success of the customers on the basis of trust and respect. We consider Corporate Governance to be an integrated, holistic approach that encompasses all corporate values, processes and goals. **Trust ** We take pride in our ethical culture, are honest, and do the right thing. **Respect ** We are inclusive, embrace diverse perspectives and value the role we play in our shared vision. **Collaboration ** We fuel more powerful ideas, deeper relationships and greater opportunities to achieve shared objectives together. We believe that putting Our Values into practice creates long-term benefits for shareholders, customers, and the employees. ## EXPERTISE * Full chips starting from floorplanning to packaging. * RF and Analog Layout. * Standard cells. * Creating Pcells. * Methodology development. * Assembly rule checking. * IC Packaging (Wire Bond, BGA, WLCSP, QFN). * Latchup and ESD precautions. * CADENCE \"SKILL\" programming. * Blackbox flow. ## SKILL SETS * Custom deep submicron Analog layout. * Interface with Design Engineers from various locations. * Work within a team framework. * Experience with GF 22nm FDSOI, TSMC 40nm LP/ULP, etc. * Understand issues involved in high speed Analog layouts. * Assembly rule checking. * IC Packaging (Wire Bond, BGA, WLCSP, QFN). * Latchup and ESD precautions. * Good communication skills. * Timely and quality execution of layout design. * Expertise on matching, parasitic reduction, ESD, DFM etc. * Proficiency in use of EDA tools for full custom layout and verification DRC/LVS/DFM etc. * Execute final pinout, package MB diagram. ## PROCESS NODES Some of the process nodes we have worked on * 14nm FINFET * 22nm FDSOI * 28nm * 40nm * 45nm * 55nm * 65nm * 90nm * 130nm BICMOS * 180nm ## PROJECTS Technology CMOS 40nm LP Foundry TSMC Technology 22FDXSOI, 22nm Foundry GLOBALFOUNDRI