 "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Nanya Technology", "Website": "https://www.nanya.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Taiwan", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Taiwan)", "Operational Presence": "Taiwan", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Specializes in DRAM manufacturing, contributing to the global memory market.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "TW", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Nanya Technology — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Manufactures DRAM, a key semiconductor memory product.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "X Score": "63", "Y Score": "60", "Overall Score": "62", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Nordic Semiconductor", "Website": "https://www.nordicsemi.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Norway", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Norway)", "Operational Presence": "Norway", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops and manufactures Bluetooth Low Energy, ANT+, and IoT wireless communication chips.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "NO", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "Nordic Semiconductor — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and manufactures wireless communication chips.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "nordicsemi.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "nordicsemi.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Launch\n[\n\n## Fuel Gauge v2.0 released\n\n][1] [Advanced State-of-Health battery monitoring and fleet-wide observability][2]\nLaunch\n[\n\n## New nRF93M1 DK\n\n][3] [Low power, easy to use Cat 1 bis module with built in nRF Cloud services][4]\nLaunch\n[\n\n## New prototyping platform\n\n][5] [Start building with the tiny, dual-antenna nRF54L15 Tag today][6]\nLaunch\n[\n\n## Move faster with AI-assisted development\n\n][7] [Fast, accurate, token-efficient development across the entire device lifecycle][8]\nNew course\n[\n\n## Learn Low-Power Product Design\n\n][9] [Enroll in the Designing Low-Power Bluetooth LE Products Course][10]\nLaunch\n[\n\n## Firmware updates for life\n\n][11] [Prepare for CRA with nRF Cloud lifetime flat-rate FOTA][12]\nLaunch\n[\n\n## Unlock ultra-low-power edge AI\n\n][13] [nRF54LM20 DK now available][14]\n\n### Applications\n\nNordic provides reliable, secure, and ultra-low power wireless connectivity solutions for a wide\nrange of scalable applications in consumer, healthcare, and industrial IoT.\n\n[ Explore applications ][15]\n\n### nRF Cloud\n\n\nLaunch faster with nRF Cloud. A chip-to-cloud solution for device management, embedded observability\nand location services, pre-integrated on Nordic devices.\n\n[ Learn more ][16]\n\n### Edge AI\n\nEdge AI is more accessible and scalable than ever. Build smarter devices with embedded AI that run\ntrue ML at the edge – powered by Nordic’s ultra-low power wireless SoCs and SiPs.\n\n[ Read more ][17]\n\n### Latest News\n\n[ [AI-assisted development]\nCorporate\n][18] [\n28 May 2026\n\nNordic Semiconductor brings AI-assisted development to the entire product lifecycle\n\nCombining firmware development with real-world field data in one AI-assisted conversation – from\nfirst prototype to deployed fleet\n][19]\n[简体][20]\n[日本語][21]\n[한글][22]\n[繁體][23]\n[\n[nRF9151 with Skylo, LooUQ, Remsight, water monitor]\nCorporate\n06 Aug 2026\n\nNordic's nRF9151 opens satellite and cellular IoT to a new class of connected devices\n\n][24]\n[日本語][25]\n[한글][26]\n[\n[Sunricher’s]\nCustomer\n21 Jul 2026\n\nSmart sensing, smarter spaces: Sunricher’s Bluetooth® Mesh PIR sensor and Nordic’s nRF54L15 SoC\n\n][27]\n[简体][28]\n[\nProduct news\n06 Jul 2026\n\nNordic Semiconductor’s new Fuel Gauge v2.0 now available, offering advanced battery intelligence for\nIoT devices\n\n][29]\n[\n[nRF Cloud - CRA vulnerability]\nProduct news\n01 Jul 2026\n\nNordic expands nRF Cloud with firmware vulnerability scanning\n\n][30]\n[简体][31]\n[日本語][32]\n[한글][33]\n[繁體][34]\n[\n[Smart agriculture]\nCustomer\n22 Jun 2026\n\nNordic-powered livestock monitoring collar tag tracks health of grazing animals\n\n][35]\n[\nExplore Nordic news\n][36]\n[nRF Cloud Pricing Launch Hero]\n\n### Manage, update, and debug devices\n\nnRF Cloud, powered by Memfault, is a pre-integrated cloud platform for Nordic devices that unifies\ndevice management, embedded observability and location services.\n\n[ Get started free ][37]\n\n### Upcoming events\n\nCurrent period 2026 (23) 2025 (33) 2024 (35) 2023 (43) 2022 (43) 2021 (43) 2020 (25) 2019 (19) 2018\n(2)\n\n\n[\n25\nAug\n2026\n25\nAug\n2026\n\n#### Simplifying Terrestrial and Non-Terrestrial IoT with Nordic, LooUQ, and Skylo\n\n[Simplifying Terrestrial and Non-Terrestrial IoT with Nordic, LooUQ, and Skylo]\n][38]\n[\n26\nAug\n2026\n28\nAug\n2026\n\n#### IOTE Shenzhen 2026\n\n[IOTE Shenzhen 2026]\n][39] [Add to Calendar][40]\n[\n02\nSep\n2026\n02\nSep\n2026\n\n#### Design, Measure, Optimize: Low-Power Bluetooth LE on the nRF54L Series\n\n[Design, Measure, Optimize: Low-Power Bluetooth LE on the nRF54L Series]\n][41]\n[\n08\nSep\n2026\n08\nSep\n2026\n\n#### e4ds Tech Day 2026\n\n[e4ds Tech Day 2026]\n][42] [Add to Calendar][43]\n[\n22\nSep\n2026\n23\nSep\n2026\n\n#### The Things Conference 2026\n\n[The Things Conference 2026]\n][44] [Add to Calendar][45]\n[\n10\nNov\n2026\n13\nNov\n2026\n\n#### Electronica 2026\n\n[Electronica 2026]\n][46] [Add to Calendar][47]\n[\n10\nNov\n2026\n12\nNov\n2026\n\n#### Enlit Europe 2026\n\n[Enlit Europe 2026]\n][48] [Add to Calendar][49]\n[\n\n## Nordic Launches Device Observability and OTA Cloud Services with nRF Cloud\n\n][50] [Read the full story][51]\nCustomer Stories -"}}, "page_text": "Launch [ ## Fuel Gauge v2.0 released ][1] [Advanced State-of-Health battery monitoring and fleet-wide observability][2] Launch [ ## New nRF93M1 DK ][3] [Low power, easy to use Cat 1 bis module with built in nRF Cloud services][4] Launch [ ## New prototyping platform ][5] [Start building with the tiny, dual-antenna nRF54L15 Tag today][6] Launch [ ## Move faster with AI-assisted development ][7] [Fast, accurate, token-efficient development across the entire device lifecycle][8] New course [ ## Learn Low-Power Product Design ][9] [Enroll in the Designing Low-Power Bluetooth LE Products Course][10] Launch [ ## Firmware updates for life ][11] [Prepare for CRA with nRF Cloud lifetime flat-rate FOTA][12] Launch [ ## Unlock ultra-low-power edge AI ][13] [nRF54LM20 DK now available][14] ### Applications Nordic provides reliable, secure, and ultra-low power wireless connectivity solutions for a wide range of scalable applications in consumer, healthcare, and industrial IoT. [ Explore applications ][15] ### nRF Cloud Launch faster with nRF Cloud. A chip-to-cloud solution for device management, embedded observability and location services, pre-integrated on Nordic devices. [ Learn more ][16] ### Edge AI Edge AI is more accessible and scalable than ever. Build smarter devices with embedded AI that run true ML at the edge – powered by Nordic’s ultra-low power wireless SoCs and SiPs. [ Read more ][17] ### Latest News [ [AI-assisted development] Corporate ][18] [ 28 May 2026 Nordic Semiconductor brings AI-assisted development to the entire product lifecycle Combining firmware development with real-world field data in one AI-assisted conversation – from first prototype to deployed fleet ][19] [简体][20] [日本語][21] [한글][22] [繁體][23] [ [nRF9151 with Skylo, LooUQ, Remsight, water monitor] Corporate 06 Aug 2026 Nordic's nRF9151 opens satellite and cellular IoT to a new class of connected devices ][24] [日本語][25] [한글][26] [ [Sunricher’s] Customer 21 Jul 2026 Smart sensing, smarter spaces: Sunricher’s Bluetooth® Mesh PIR sensor and Nordic’s nRF54L15 SoC ][27] [简体][28] [ Product news 06 Jul 2026 Nordic Semiconductor’s new Fuel Gauge v2.0 now available, offering advanced battery intelligence for IoT devices ][29] [ [nRF Cloud - CRA vulnerability] Product news 01 Jul 2026 Nordic expands nRF Cloud with firmware vulnerability scanning ][30] [简体][31] [日本語][32] [한글][33] [繁體][34] [ [Smart agriculture] Customer 22 Jun 2026 Nordic-powered livestock monitoring collar tag tracks health of grazing animals ][35] [ Explore Nordic news ][36] [nRF Cloud Pricing Launch Hero] ### Manage, update, and debug devices nRF Cloud, powered by Memfault, is a pre-integrated cloud platform for Nordic devices that unifies device management, embedded observability and location services. [ Get started free ][37] ### Upcoming events Current period 2026 (23) 2025 (33) 2024 (35) 2023 (43) 2022 (43) 2021 (43) 2020 (25) 2019 (19) 2018 (2) [ 25 Aug 2026 25 Aug 2026 #### Simplifying Terrestrial and Non-Terrestrial IoT with Nordic, LooUQ, and Skylo [Simplifying Terrestrial and Non-Terrestrial IoT with Nordic, LooUQ, and Skylo] ][38] [ 26 Aug 2026 28 Aug 2026 #### IOTE Shenzhen 2026 [IOTE Shenzhen 2026] ][39] [Add to Calendar][40] [ 02 Sep 2026 02 Sep 2026 #### Design, Measure, Optimize: Low-Power Bluetooth LE on the nRF54L Series [Design, Measure, Optimize: Low-Power Bluetooth LE on the nRF54L Series] ][41] [ 08 Sep 2026 08 Sep 2026 #### e4ds Tech Day 2026 [e4ds Tech Day 2026] ][42] [Add to Calendar][43] [ 22 Sep 2026 23 Sep 2026 #### The Things Conference 2026 [The Things Conference 2026] ][44] [Add to Calendar][45] [ 10 Nov 2026 13 Nov 2026 #### Electronica 2026 [Electronica 2026] ][46] [Add to Calendar][47] [ 10 Nov 2026 12 Nov 2026 #### Enlit Europe 2026 [Enlit Europe 2026] ][48] [Add to Calendar][49] [ ## Nordic Launches Device Observability and OTA Cloud Services with nRF Cloud ][50] [Read the full story][51] Customer Stories - Sport & Fitness [ ## See.Sense NB-IoT cycle security tracker protects and locates bikes ][52] [Read the full story][53] Customer Stories - Connected Health [ ## MEZOO monitoring system enables remote care of cardiac patients ][54] [Read the full story][55] Customer Stories - Sport & Fitness [ ## Polar GPS multisport watches help improve athlete performance ][56] [Read the full story][57] Customer Stories - Education [ ## micro:bit: Creating Coders of the Future ][58] [Read the full story][59] Customer Stories - Industrial Automation [ ## Lynxemi wireless sensor reports industrial asset health to technicians ][60] [Read the full story][61] [ [Get Connected Blog] ][62] [Visit GetConnected Blog][63] ### Why did we choose Nordic? Bettear selected the nRF5340 SoC for the B-RTX based on the chip’s advanced technical capabilities. It’s dual Arm Cortex-M33 processors enable our device to isolate real-time audio tasks from general operations, ensuring low-latency and high-quality audio streaming. The high memory capacity provides ample resources for intensive audio processing, allowing the B-RTX to decode pre-recorded MP3 files and convert them into Auracast streams in real time. Beyond the technical excellence of the hardware, Nordic’s reputation and support network provided Bettear with the complete package needed to successfully develop and bring the B-RTX to market. Yami Thor, CTO, Bettear [View the full story][64] ### Why did we choose Nordic? The machine learning capabilities of Nordic’s nRF5340 SoC enable a number of our eCozy 2.0 smart thermostat solution’s key features and functionalities, such as anomaly detection and adaptive heating schedules. Furthermore, the comprehensive Nordic nRF Connect SDK provides a ready-made, integrated environment with an RTOS [Zephyr], protocol stacks [Matter, Zigbee, Bluetooth LE], hardware abstraction layers, drivers, libraries, and application samples. This saves significant development time compared to building these components from scratch. Andre Kholodov, CEO, eCozy GmbH [View the full story][65] ### Why did we choose Nordic? We selected Nordic’s nRF54L15 SoC because of its outstanding overall characteristics. By leveraging its powerful processing capabilities, ultra-low power consumption, larger memory capacity, and high operational efficiency, the IDR01 smart ring achieves significantly extended battery life. This enables developers to create products more efficiently. Furthermore, Nordic provides high-quality reference designs and development tools, coupled with robust and responsive technical support that makes the development process more efficient and convenient. The nRF Connect SDK was instrumental in our development process.” YanXiong Zhu, CEO, Shenzhen DO Intelligent Technology Co., Ltd [View the full story][66] ### Why did we choose Nordic? The nRF Connect SDK was very helpful in the development of the application code for the MTB04 smart shipping label. It provided ready-to-use drivers, libraries, and example projects that significantly reduced development time. This along with comprehensive documentation, reference designs, and development hardware—and responsive application engineers and a developer community—materially de-risked and improved the velocity of this launch.” Eason Huang, Product Director, Minew [View the full story][67] ### Why did we choose Nordic? We selected Nordic’s nRF52840 SoC for our PlayerData Edge Air indoor and outdoor sports data tracker due to the SoC’s Bluetooth performance, range, and low power consumption, as well as the fact the SoC is well supported from a software perspective. In addition, by incorporating the highly configurable Nordic nPM1300 PMIC in our solution, we have addressed the key element of power management while achieving an impressive form factor to help target the mass market. Prior to using the nPM1300, we relied on four discrete ICs to do the same job. Roy Hotrabhvanon, CEO, PlayerData [View the full story][68] Community - DevZone [ [Nordic DevZone - tech support and community] ][69] [Explore DevZone][70] × [1]: /Nordic-news/2026/07/Nordics-new-Fuel-Gauge-v2-0-now-available-offering-premium-battery-intelli gence-for-IoT-devices [2]: /Nordic-news/2026/07/Nordics-new-Fuel-Gauge-v2-0-now-available-offering-premium-battery-intelli gence-for-IoT-devices [3]: /Products/Development-hardware/nRF93M1-DK [4]: /Products/Development-hardware/nRF93M1-DK [5]: /Products/Development-hardware/nRF54L15-Tag [6]: /Products/Development-hardware/nRF54L15-Tag [7]: /Products/Technologies/AI-assisted-development [8]: /Products/Technologies/AI-assisted-development [9]: https://academy.nordicsemi.com/courses/designing-low-power-bluetooth-le-products/ [10]: https://academy.nordicsemi.com/courses/designing-low-power-bluetooth-le-products/ [11]: /Nordic-news/2026/03/Lifetime-flat-rate-FOTA-solution-readies-customers-for-Cyber-Resilience-A ct [12]: /Nordic-news/2026/03/Lifetime-flat-rate-FOTA-solution-readies-customers-for-Cyber-Resilience-A ct [13]: /Nordic-news/2026/03/Nordic-Semiconductor-strengthens-nRF54L-Series-leadership-in-ultra-low-po wer-edge-AI [14]: /Nordic-news/2026/03/Nordic-Semiconductor-strengthens-nRF54L-Series-leadership-in-ultra-low-po wer-edge-AI [15]: /Applications [16]: https://nrfcloud.com/#/ [17]: /Products/Technologies/Edge-AI [18]: /Nordic-news/2026/05/Nordic-Semiconductor-brings-AI-assisted-development-to-the-entire-product -lifecycle [19]: /Nordic-news/2026/05/Nordic-Semic