ead more\n][46][\n[Submarine workforce]\n\n### Submarine workforce built on the shoulders of giants\n\nRaytheon Australia is building upon the knowledge of their existing in-country experts\nRead more\n][47][\n[Poppy Ball 2023]\n\n### Meaningful partnerships in the communities where we live and work\n\nRaytheon Australia partners with RSL LifeCare as the Poppy Ball Platinum Sponsor, reaffirming our\ncommitment to the veteran community\nRead More\n][48]\n[Raytheon Australia Reflect RAP]\n\n### Acknowledgement of Country\n\nRaytheon Australia acknowledges the Traditional Custodians of Country throughout Australia and pays\nrespects to Elders, past and present. \n\n[Read more][49]\n[[rtx-au]][50]\n\nRaytheon Australia\n* [Who We Are][51]\n* [What We Do][52]\n* [News][53]\n* [Careers][54]\n\nRTX Businesses\n* [RTX][55]\n* [Collins Aerospace][56]\n* [Pratt & Whitney][57]\n* [Raytheon][58]\n\nGlobal Presence\n* [Raytheon UK][59]\n* [Raytheon Emirates (English)][60]\n* [Raytheon Emirates (عربى)][61]\n* [Raytheon Saudi Arabia (English)][62]\n* [Raytheon Saudi Arabia (عربى)][63]\n* [More][64]\n\nFOLLOW US\n* * [ Raytheon Australia on LinkedIn ][65]\n  * [ Raytheon Australia on Twitter ][66]\n  * [ Raytheon Australia on Facebook ][67]\n  * [ Raytheon Australia on YouTube ][68]\n  * [ Raytheon Australia on Instagram ][69]\n  * [ RSS ][70]\n* © 2026 Raytheon Australia. All rights reserved.\n* [Accessibility][71]\n* [Terms of Use][72]\n* [Privacy][73]\n* [Manage Cookies Settings][74]\n\nOur website uses cookies and other tools to improve the visitor experience. You can read more about\nthese cookies and tools by clicking on the gray button. To visit our site, click on a button to\nchoose your settings.\n[Accept recommended settings][75][Accept necessary cookies only][76]\n[Manage settings][77]\n[RTX.com Privacy Policy][78]\n\n[1]: https://www.rtx.com/\n[2]: https://www.rtx.com/collinsaerospace\n[3]: https://www.rtx.com/prattwhitney\n[4]: https://www.rtx.com/raytheon\n[5]: https: