lly obscured by graphic overlays.] [Person in a lab coat holding a pipette under blue lighting; face partially obscured by graphic overlays.] # Featured topic: Innovation From groundbreaking research to solutions that improve everyday life, innovation at Bosch means challenging the status quo and shaping the technologies of tomorrow. [ [Illustration of robots in the industry (ai generated image)] ## 7 reasons why Bosch is at the forefront of the robotics revolution ][80] * [About us][81] * [Our open positions][82] * [Get in touch][83] ## Our products for your home [Show all products][84] [ [Bosch products for home appliances] Home appliances ][85] [ [Power tools for private customers from Bosch ] Power tools ][86] [ [Garden tools from Bosch] Garden tools ][87] [ [Measuring tools from Bosch] Measuring tools ][88] [ [Cleaning tools from Bosch] Cleaning tools ][89] [ [Bosch products for heating, cooling, and well-being] Heating, cooling, and well-being ][90] [ [Bosch solutions for your smart home] Smart Home ][91] ## Our solutions for business clients [ ### Mobility Explore our complete portfolio of mobility solutions ][92] [ ### Industry and trades Discover our products and services for industry and trades ][93] ## Explore our stories [Explore all stories][94] ## Our featured topics Bosch develops innovations that provide solutions to the major challenges of our time. How? It’s all explained in our featured topics. [ [A person in a lab coat holding a pipette under blue lighting; face partially obscured by graphic overlays.] ### Innovation Shaping the future ][95] [ [A vehicle display showing the large text “SOFTWARE-DRIVEN MOBILITY”] ### Software-driven mobility The car of the future is personalized ][96] [ [A woman steps through the letters \"AI\"] ### Artificial intelligence AI for a better future ][97] [ [A father plays with his child in a modern bathroom while the mother looks on.] ### Energy efficiency Saving energy at home is easier than you think ][98] [ [Various hydrogen applications can be seen in molecules. These include a mobile fuel cell in a truck, hydrogen electrolysis and stationary fuel cells.] ### Hydrogen Energy of the future ][99] [ [Wood artist Adam Detre stands surrounded by trees behind a Bosch GCM 18V-305 GDC Professional cordless crosscut and miter saw, carefully aligning a long piece of wood.] ### Battery technology More than just a means of storing energy ][100] [ [A hand holds a tiny sensor on his fingertip.] ### MEMS-sensors Micro-Electro-Mechanical Systems ][101] [ [A woman charges an electric vehicle Xiaomi SU7 at a charging station] ### Electrification Electricity drives us ][102] ## Bosch on social media Follow us for the latest information about the company. ## Bosch customer service You need service or support? Our customer support is here for you whenever you need it. [To contact overview][103] [ Work LikeABosch — Apply now. Bosch Global Careers ][104] [ Become a business partner. Purchasing and logistics ][105] Invented for life * [General contact info][106] * [Questions and answers][107] * [Product security (PSIRT)][108] * [Innovations, patents, and licenses][109] * [Purchasing and logistics][110] * [Corporate information][111] * [Legal notice][112] * [Data protection notice (Privacy Policy)][113] * [Accessibility][114] * [ Privacy settings ][115] © Robert Bosch GmbH 2026, all rights reserved [1]: #main [2]: / [3]: /de/ [4]: /websites-worldwide/ [5]: /products-and-services/ [6]: /products-and-services/mobility/ [7]: /products-and-services/at-home/ [8]: /products-and-services/industry-and-trades/ [9]: /stories/ [10]: /stories/topics/ [11]: /stories/topics/innovation/ [12]: /stories/topics/software-driven-mobility/ [13]: /stories/topics/ai-for-a-better-future-at-bosch/ [14]: /stories/topics/energy-efficiency-at-home/ [15]: /stories/topics/hydrogen-energy/ [16]: /stories/topics/battery-technology/ [17]: /stories/topics/mems-micro-electro-mechanical-systems/ [18]: /stories/topics/electrification/