Infercom (EU)][15]\n    * [OVHcloud (EU)][16]\n    * [SouthernCrossAI (AU)][17]\n  * [Developers & Enterprises][18]\n  * [Government &\n    Public Sector][19]\n* Developers\n  * [Developer Showcase][20]\n  * [Early Access Program][21]\n  * [Community][22]\n  * [Pricing][23]\n  * [Docs][24]\n* [Resources][25]\n  * [Case Studies][26]\n  * [Blog][27]\n  * [Events][28]\n  * [Videos][29]\n  * [White Papers][30]\n  * [SambaAcademy][31]\n  * [Support][32]\n  * [Data Center Walkthrough][33]\n* Company\n  * [About Us][34]\n  * [Team][35]\n  * [Awards & Recognition][36]\n  * Newsroom\n    * [Press Releases][37]\n    * [News Coverage][38]\n  * [Careers][39]\n  * [Contact Us][40]\nMore results\nEn\n* [English][41]\n* [日本語][42]\n[ Contact Us ][43]\n[ Try It Now ][44]\n[ Start Building ][45] [ Contact Us ][46]\n* [ Products ][47]\n  * [ SambaCloud ][48]\n  * [ SambaStack ][49]\n  * [ SambaManaged ][50]\n  * [ Technology ][51]\n    * [ SambaRack ][52]\n    * [ RDU ][53]\n    * [ Dataflow ][54]\n* [ Solutions ][55]\n  * [ Inference Providers ][56]\n  * [ Sovereign AI ][57]\n    * [ Argyll (UK) ][58]\n    * [ Infercom (EU) ][59]\n    * [ OVHcloud (EU) ][60]\n    * [ SouthernCrossAI (AU) ][61]\n  * [ Developers & Enterprises ][62]\n  * [ Government &\n    Public Sector ][63]\n* [ Developers ][64]\n  * [ Developer Showcase ][65]\n  * [ Early Access Program ][66]\n  * [ Community ][67]\n  * [ Pricing ][68]\n  * [ Docs ][69]\n* [ Resources ][70]\n  * [ Case Studies ][71]\n  * [ Blog ][72]\n  * [ Events ][73]\n  * [ Videos ][74]\n  * [ White Papers ][75]\n  * [ SambaAcademy ][76]\n  * [ Support ][77]\n  * [ Data Center Walkthrough ][78]\n* [ Company ][79]\n  * [ About Us ][80]\n  * [ Team ][81]\n  * [ Awards & Recognition ][82]\n  * [ Newsroom ][83]\n    * [ Press Releases ][84]\n    * [ News Coverage ][85]\n  * [ Careers ][86]\n  * [ Contact Us ][87]\n[ Contact Us ][88][ Start Building ][89]\n\n# Speed x Scale\n\nThe new AI infrastructure equation\nfor premium inference\n\n[Connect with Experts][90]\n\n## Ready for Premium Inference?\n\nSemiAnalysis benchmark of SambaRack SN50 on MiniMax M2.7 shows fast decode performance in the part\nof the stack users feel the most.\n\n[See the Results][91]\n[semianalysis-benchmark-of-sambarack-sn50-logo]\n\n## SambaNova Completes First Close of $1B Financing at $11B Valuation\n\nSambaNova’s $11 billion valuation highlights the central role inference now plays in the enterprise\nAI stack. General Atlantic leads the round with significant investment from Seligman Ventures and T.\nRowe Price Associates, Inc.  JPMorganChase is the latest to select SambaNova RDUs for fast, on‑prem\nAI inference.\n\n[ Read More ][92]\n[RL]\n\n## Size your AI data center deployment\n\nOur virtual walkthrough helps you visualize energy requirements, floor space, and scale out to\nmulti-megawatt clusters with the SambaRack SN50.\n\n[ Get Started ][93]\n\n## Inference stack by design\n\n[SambaNova-ICONS-80x80_003]\n\n### Inference at scale\n\nThe groundbreaking dataflow technology and memory architecture delivers the performance and speed\nrequired for ever-growing AI models.\n\n[**Learn more →**][94]\n[Inference at scale][95]\n[Energy Efficiency]\n\n### Energy efficiency\n\nGenerating the maximum number of tokens per watt with the highest power efficiency naturally enables\nfast inference and scalability.\n\n[**Learn more →**][96]\n[Energy efficiency][97]\n[SambaNova-ICONS-80x80_DataCenters]\n\n### Infrastructure flexibility\n\nSambaStack switches between multiple frontier-scale models, enabling complex agentic AI workflows to\nexecute end-to-end on one node.\n\n[*"}}, "page_text": "[ SambaNova Completes First Close of $1B Financing at $11B Valuation ][1] [ The First Disaggregated Inference Demo for AI Agents Is Live ][2] [ SambaNova Powers 4 Sovereign AI Providers in Australia, Europe & the UK ][3] [[sambanova-white-logo]][4] [[sambanova-white-logo]][5] * Products * [SambaCloud][6] * [SambaStack][7] * [SambaManaged][8] * Technology * [SambaRack][9] * [RDU][10] * [Dataflow][11] * Solutions * [Inference Providers][12] * [Sovereign AI][13] * [Argyll (UK)][14] * [Infercom (EU)][15] * [OVHcloud (EU)][16] * [SouthernCrossAI (AU)][17] * [Developers & Enterprises][18] * [Government & Public Sector][19] * Developers * [Developer Showcase][20] * [Early Access Program][21] * [Community][22] * [Pricing][23] * [Docs][24] * [Resources][25] * [Case Studies][26] * [Blog][27] * [Events][28] * [Videos][29] * [White Papers][30] * [SambaAcademy][31] * [Support][32] * [Data Center Walkthrough][33] * Company * [About Us][34] * [Team][35] * [Awards & Recognition][36] * Newsroom * [Press Releases][37] * [News Coverage][38] * [Careers][39] * [Contact Us][40] More results En * [English][41] * [日本語][42] [ Contact Us ][43] [ Try It Now ][44] [ Start Building ][45] [ Contact Us ][46] * [ Products ][47] * [ SambaCloud ][48] * [ SambaStack ][49] * [ SambaManaged ][50] * [ Technology ][51] * [ SambaRack ][52] * [ RDU ][53] * [ Dataflow ][54] * [ Solutions ][55] * [ Inference Providers ][56] * [ Sovereign AI ][57] * [ Argyll (UK) ][58] * [ Infercom (EU) ][59] * [ OVHcloud (EU) ][60] * [ SouthernCrossAI (AU) ][61] * [ Developers & Enterprises ][62] * [ Government & Public Sector ][63] * [ Developers ][64] * [ Developer Showcase ][65] * [ Early Access Program ][66] * [ Community ][67] * [ Pricing ][68] * [ Docs ][69] * [ Resources ][70] * [ Case Studies ][71] * [ Blog ][72] * [ Events ][73] * [ Videos ][74] * [ White Papers ][75] * [ SambaAcademy ][76] * [ Support ][77] * [ Data Center Walkthrough ][78] * [ Company ][79] * [ About Us ][80] * [ Team ][81] * [ Awards & Recognition ][82] * [ Newsroom ][83] * [ Press Releases ][84] * [ News Coverage ][85] * [ Careers ][86] * [ Contact Us ][87] [ Contact Us ][88][ Start Building ][89] # Speed x Scale The new AI infrastructure equation for premium inference [Connect with Experts][90] ## Ready for Premium Inference? SemiAnalysis benchmark of SambaRack SN50 on MiniMax M2.7 shows fast decode performance in the part of the stack users feel the most. [See the Results][91] [semianalysis-benchmark-of-sambarack-sn50-logo] ## SambaNova Completes First Close of $1B Financing at $11B Valuation SambaNova’s $11 billion valuation highlights the central role inference now plays in the enterprise AI stack. General Atlantic leads the round with significant investment from Seligman Ventures and T. Rowe Price Associates, Inc. JPMorganChase is the latest to select SambaNova RDUs for fast, on‑prem AI inference. [ Read More ][92] [RL] ## Size your AI data center deployment Our virtual walkthrough helps you visualize energy requirements, floor space, and scale out to multi-megawatt clusters with the SambaRack SN50. [ Get Started ][93] ## Inference stack by design [SambaNova-ICONS-80x80_003] ### Inference at scale The groundbreaking dataflow technology and memory architecture delivers the performance and speed required for ever-growing AI models. [**Learn more →**][94] [Inference at scale][95] [Energy Efficiency] ### Energy efficiency Generating the maximum number of tokens per watt with the highest power efficiency naturally enables fast inference and scalability. [**Learn more →**][96] [Energy efficiency][97] [SambaNova-ICONS-80x80_DataCenters] ### Infrastructure flexibility SambaStack switches between multiple frontier-scale models, enabling complex agentic AI workflows to execute end-to-end on one node. [**Learn more →**][98] [Infrastructure flexibility][99] ## Dataflow Architecture Explained RMSNorm × #### RMSNorm Rescales each token's activations to a steady magnitude, keeping computation stable. QKV × #### QKV Projects each token into Query, Key, and Value — the three roles attention runs on. Attention × #### Attention Every token weighs its relationship to all others, pulling in what matters most. Projection × #### Projection Blends the attention output back into each token's residual stream. FFN × #### FFN Transforms each token through experts — in MoE, only the few that matter fire. [dataflow-graph] PMU/PCU Three-Tier Memory Multichip View Full Video Back Dataflow Architecture Explained Full Video PMU/PCU Three-Tier Memory Multichip View RDU vs GPU 0:00 0:00 ## The Goldilocks Zone for agents The SN50 delivers 3X the savings compared to competitive chips for agentic inference. Co-Founder and Chief Technologist Kunle Olukotun explains how SN50 tiered memory allows agents to have access to a cache for models and prompts, further improving efficiency. [ Read more ][100] ## Build with the best open-source models [MiniMax M2.7] ### MiniMax M2.7 The latest frontier model from MiniMax, MiniMax M2.7 is the first in the M-series that deeply participates in its own evolution. Built for complex agent harnesses, multi-agent collaboration, and high-fidelity productivity tasks, M2.7 hits 56.22% on SWE-Pro, 55.6% on VIBE-Pro for end-to-end project delivery, and 57.0% on Terminal Bench 2. Best of all, SambaNova leads on speed at 435 output tokens/s, >3x faster than any other provider. [DeepSeek] ### DeepSeek We support the groundbreaking DeepSeek models, including the 671-billion-parameter DeepSeek-V3.1, which excels in coding, reasoning, and mathematics at a fraction of the cost of other models. On our SambaNova RDU, DeepSeek-V3.1 achieves remarkable speeds of up to 200 tokens / second, as measured independently by Artificial Analysis. [Llama] ### Llama As a launch partner for Meta's Llama 4 series, we've been at the forefront of open-source AI innovation. SambaCloud was the first platform to support all three variants of Llama 3.1 (8B, 70B, and 405B) with fast inference. We are excited to work with Meta to deliver fast inference on both Scout and Maverick models. [OpenAI gpt-oss-120b] ### OpenAI gpt-oss-120b OpenAI recently released gpt-oss-120b, a model that delivers high accuracy in just 120-billion parameter with a Mixture of Experts (MoE) architecture. As a small but efficient model, it runs extremely fast on SambaNova RDUs at over 600 tokens per second, making it a great choice for near real-time agentic AI. * [ai-labs-white] * [Aion-labs] * [AIXplan] * [Argonne] * [Black Box] * [crew-ai-white] * [hugging-face-white] * [hume-new-logo] * [Los Alamos] * [maitai-logo] * [Meta] * [OpenRouter] * [parasail-white] * [tacc-white] * [zilliz-white] ## Sovereign AI around the world Meet our network of sovereign AI data center partners. Powered by SambaNova, each delivers top-tier performance and the flexibility of open source within their national borders. AUSTRALIA [ [SCX.ai Logo - Black] ][101] EUROPE [ [infercom-v2] ][102] [ [ovhcloud] ][103] UNITED KINGDOM [ [argyll-v2] ][104] **SambaStack** ## The only chips-to-model computing built for AI ### Inference | Bring Your Own Checkpoints SambaNova provides simple-to-integrate APIs for Al inference, making it easy to onboard applications. Our APIs are OpenAI compatible allowing you to port your application to SambaNova in minutes. ### Auto Scaling | Load Balancing | Monitoring | Model Management | Cloud Create | Server Management SambaOrchestrator simplifies managing AI workloads across data centers. Easily monitor and manage model deployments and scale automatically to meet user demand. SambaRack™ is a state-of-the-art system that can be set up easily in data centers to run Al inference workloads. SambaRack SN40-16 is our fourth generation system optimized for low power inference (average of 10 kWh) and running many models simultaneously. SambaRack SN50 is our fifth-generation system optimized for fast agentic inference at a fraction of the cost running the largest models, like gpt-oss-120b and DeepSeek. ### SN40 | SN50 RDU At the heart of SambaNova's innovation lies the RDU. With a unique three-tier memory architecture and dataflow processing, RDU chips are able to achieve much faster inference using a lot less power than other architectures. * **Complete AI** platform that provides a fully integrated end-to-end agentic AI stack – spanning across agents, models, knowledge, and data. * **Composable AI** platform that is open, unifies structured and unstructured data, queries in any environment, and deploys on any AI model. Build or use pre-built AI agents — all with business-aware intelligence. * **Sovereign AI** platform that keeps data secure and governed while business teams query in any environment. IT stays in control, while business teams self-serve AI — and both can focus on what matters. [ SemiAnalysis Benchmarks SambaRack SN50 with Fast Inference on MiniMax M2.7 ][105] [ Blog ][106] #### SemiAnalysis Benchmarks SambaRack SN50 with Fast Inference on MiniMax M2.7 July 30, 2026 [ SambaNova Completes First Close of $1B Financing at $11B Valuation ][107] [ News ][108] #### SambaNova Completes First Close of $1B Financing at $11B Valuation July 8, 2026 [ The First Disaggregated Inference Demo for AI Agents Is Live ][109] [ Blog ][110] #### The First Disaggregated Inference Demo for AI Agents Is Live June 3, 2026 ## Ready for fast, scalable inference? [ Get Started ][111] [[sn-new-gray-logo]][112] [ ][113][ ][114][ ][115] Legal * [Legal Agreements][116] * [Privacy Policy][117] About * [Team][118] * [Careers][119] * [Awards & Recognition][120] Contact * [Start Building][121] * [Contact Us][122] * [Support][123] © SambaNova, Inc. All Rights Reserved. [1]: https://sambanova.ai/press/sambanova-completes-first-close-of-1b-financing-at-11b-valuation [2]: https://sambanova.ai/blog/first-disaggregated-inference-demo-for-ai-agents-live [3]: https://sambanova.ai/press/sambanova-powers-the-ai-backbone-for-three-sovereign-ai-providers-ac ross-australia-europe-and-the-u.k [4]: / [5]: / [6]: https://sambanova.ai/products/sambacloud [7]: https://sambanova.ai/products/sambastack [8]: https://sambanova.ai/products/sambamanaged [9]: https://sambanova.ai/products/sambarack [10]: https://sambanova.ai/products/rdu-ai-chips [11]: https://sambanova.ai/products/dataflow-architecture [12]: https://sambanova.ai/solutions/inference-provide