://aionsilicon.com/services/ [15]: https://aionsilicon.com/partners/ [16]: https://aionsilicon.com/markets/ [17]: https://aionsilicon.com/about-us/ [18]: https://aionsilicon.com/resources/ [19]: https://aionsilicon.com/faq/ [20]: https://aionsilicon.com/contact/ [21]: https://aionsilicon.com/services/ [22]: https://aionsilicon.com/partners/ [23]: https://aionsilicon.com/markets/ [24]: https://aionsilicon.com/about-us/ [25]: https://aionsilicon.com/resources/ [26]: https://aionsilicon.com/careers/ [27]: https://aionsilicon.com/contact/ [28]: https://aionsilicon.com/faq/ [29]: https://aionsilicon.com/privacy-policy/ [30]: https://aionsilicon.com/cookie-policy/ [31]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/aionsilicon [32]: # [33]: # [34]: # [35]: https://cookiedatabase.org/tcf/purposes/ [36]: # [37]: # [38]: # [39]: # [40]: # [41]: # [42]: # [43]: https://cookiedatabase.org/tcf/purposes/ [44]: # [45]: # [46]: # [47]: #", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Sondrel — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Provides ASIC design services and turnkey solutions, building custom chips. | UK-based ASIC design services and turnkey solutions for semiconductor companies. | United Kingdom | United Kingdom", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "63", "Y Score": "57", "Overall Score": "60", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Texas Instruments", "Website": "https://www.ti.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "USA", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Produces analog chips, microcontrollers, and processors.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Texas Instruments — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Texas Instruments produces analog chips, microcontrollers, and processors.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "100", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "ti.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "ti.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "## CAN XL technology, now at your fingertips\n\nHandle higher data loads faster with the industry's first commercially available CAN XL transceiver\n\n[Read news release][1]\n\n## What will it take to bring humanoid robots into the real world?\n\nDiscover how advances in semiconductor technologies are enabling humanoid robots to perceive, move\nand interact more safely in real-world environments\n\n[Read article][2]\n\n## Redefine what's possible in battery management\n\nSee how EIS technology is enabling the future of battery monitoring in your EV and ESS designs\n\n[Watch now][3]\n\n## The technology behind the intelligent chassis\n\nDesign safer, more responsive chassis systems with TI's industry-leading real-time processing,\nsensing, motor control, and power management technologies\n\n[Browse applications][4]\n\n# The world leader in semiconductor innovation\n\nOur 80,000+ analog and embedded processing products give engineers the confidence to create what's\nnext across the systems and devices people depend on every day.\n\n#### [Automotive][5]\n\nAdvance safer, more innovative vehicle systems across electrification, safety and connectivity.\n\n[ arrow-right Explore automotive ][6]\n\n### [Data center][7]\n\nAccelerate scalable, efficient data center systems across compute, power and connectivity.\n\n[ arrow-right Explore data center ][8]\n\n#### [Industrial][9]\n\nEnable smarter industrial systems built on enhanced automation, reliability and safety.\n\n[ arrow-right Explore industrial ][10]\n\n### [Personal electronics][11]\n\nPower the next generation of personal electronics with smarter, more efficient solutions.\n\n[ arrow-right Explore personal electronics ][12]\n\n## Turning bold ideas into real-world breakthroughs\n\nFrom connected devices to life-saving systems, our technology powers the innovations shaping how\npeople live, move and work.\n\n[ Learn more about TI ][13]\n\n## What's new\n\n[ View all new products ][14]\n[TPLD1202][15]\n[ Programmable logic devices (PLD) ][16]\n[ NEW ][17] [ACTIVE][18]\n[ TPLD1202 ][19]\n\nProgrammable logic IC with 10 general-purpose inputs or outputs (GPIOs) and I²C, SPI\n\nApprox. price (USD) 1ku | 0.506\n\n[INA510-Q1][20]\n[ Difference amplifiers ][21]\n[ NEW ][22] [PREVIEW][23]\n[ INA510-Q1 ][24]\n\n13-MHz, 1.8-V to 5.5-V, Difference Amplifier for Differential to Single-ended conversion\n\nApprox. price (USD) 1ku | 0.21\n\n[SN74LVC2G07B-Q1][25]\n[ Noninverting buffers & drivers ][26]\n[ NEW ][27] [ACTIVE][28]\n[ SN74LVC2G07B-Q1 ][29]\n\nAutomotive 2-ch, 1.1V-to-5.5V buffers with open-drain outputs\n\nApprox. price (USD) 1ku | 0.13\n\n[SN74LVC1G373B-Q1][30]\n[ D-type latches ][31]\n[ NEW ][32] [ACTIVE][33]\n[ SN74LVC1G373B-Q1 ][34]\n\nAutomotive 1ch D-Type Latch with 3-state output\n\n[F29P329SM-Q1][35]\n[ Automotive powertrain, zonal & chassis control MCUs ][36]\n[ NEW ][37] [ACTIVE][38]\n[ F29P329SM-Q1 ][39]\n\nAutomotive C2000 64-bit MCU with C29 200MHz, lockstep, functional safety compliance, 2MB\n\nApprox. price (USD) 1ku | 4.65\n\n[CD74HC4094-Q1][40]\n[ Shift registers ][41]\n[ NEW ][42] [ACTIVE][43]\n[ CD74HC4094-Q1 ][44]\n\nAutomotive 8-stage shift-and-store bus register with 3-stage outputs\n\nApprox. price (USD) 1ku | 0.197\n\n[ View all new products ][45]\n\n## Latest articles\n\n24 Jun 2026 | [COMPANY BLOG][46]\n[What will it take to bring humanoid robots into the real world? Read our experts’ insights][47]\nHumanoid robots are one way AI is becoming physical, and semiconductor technologies will enable them\nto take the next step \n[Read article][48]\n09 Jun 2026 | Technology\n[ Reliability will define the next decade of energy storage ][49]\n[ arrow-right Read article ][50]\n01 Jun 2026 | Technology\n[ The intelligent chassis: The silent upgrade that's changing how cars move ][51]\n[ arrow-right Read article ][52]\n27 May 2026 | Technology\n[ The chips that change the world ][53]\n[ arrow-right Read article ][54]\n\n## Shape how the future unfolds\n\nPut your talent to work within a community of world-leading engineers and problem solvers who are\nadvancing semiconductor technology that shapes every"}}, "page_text": "## CAN XL technology, now at your fingertips Handle higher data loads faster with the industry's first commercially available CAN XL transceiver [Read news release][1] ## What will it take to bring humanoid robots into the real world? Discover how advances in semiconductor technologies are enabling humanoid robots to perceive, move and interact more safely in real-world environments [Read article][2] ## Redefine what's possible in battery management See how EIS technology is enabling the future of battery monitoring in your EV and ESS designs [Watch now][3] ## The technology behind the intelligent chassis Design safer, more responsive chassis systems with TI's industry-leading real-time processing, sensing, motor control, and power management technologies [Browse applications][4] # The world leader in semiconductor innovation Our 80,000+ analog and embedded processing products give engineers the confidence to create what's next across the systems and devices people depend on every day. #### [Automotive][5] Advance safer, more innovative vehicle systems across electrification, safety and connectivity. [ arrow-right Explore automotive ][6] ### [Data center][7] Accelerate scalable, efficient data center systems across compute, power and connectivity. [ arrow-right Explore data center ][8] #### [Industrial][9] Enable smarter industrial systems built on enhanced automation, reliability and safety. [ arrow-right Explore industrial ][10] ### [Personal electronics][11] Power the next generation of personal electronics with smarter, more efficient solutions. [ arrow-right Explore personal electronics ][12] ## Turning bold ideas into real-world breakthroughs From connected devices to life-saving systems, our technology powers the innovations shaping how people live, move and work. [ Learn more about TI ][13] ## What's new [ View all new products ][14] [TPLD1202][15] [ Programmable logic devices (PLD) ][16] [ NEW ][17] [ACTIVE][18] [ TPLD1202 ][19] Programmable logic IC with 10 general-purpose inputs or outputs (GPIOs) and I²C, SPI Approx. price (USD) 1ku | 0.506 [INA510-Q1][20] [ Difference amplifiers ][21] [ NEW ][22] [PREVIEW][23] [ INA510-Q1 ][24] 13-MHz, 1.8-V to 5.5-V, Difference Amplifier for Differential to Single-ended conversion Approx. price (USD) 1ku | 0.21 [SN74LVC2G07B-Q1][25] [ Noninverting buffers & drivers ][26] [ NEW ][27] [ACTIVE][28] [ SN74LVC2G07B-Q1 ][29] Automotive 2-ch, 1.1V-to-5.5V buffers with open-drain outputs Approx. price (USD) 1ku | 0.13 [SN74LVC1G373B-Q1][30] [ D-type latches ][31] [ NEW ][32] [ACTIVE][33] [ SN74LVC1G373B-Q1 ][34] Automotive 1ch D-Type Latch with 3-state output [F29P329SM-Q1][35] [ Automotive powertrain, zonal & chassis control MCUs ][36] [ NEW ][37] [ACTIVE][38] [ F29P329SM-Q1 ][39] Automotive C2000 64-bit MCU with C29 200MHz, lockstep, functional safety compliance, 2MB Approx. price (USD) 1ku | 4.65 [CD74HC4094-Q1][40] [ Shift registers ][41] [ NEW ][42] [ACTIVE][43] [ CD74HC4094-Q1 ][44] Automotive 8-stage shift-and-store bus register with 3-stage outputs Approx. price (USD) 1ku | 0.197 [ View all new products ][45] ## Latest articles 24 Jun 2026 | [COMPANY BLOG][46] [What will it take to bring humanoid robots into the real world? Read our experts’ insights][47] Humanoid robots are one way AI is becoming physical, and semiconductor technologies will enable them to take the next step [Read article][48] 09 Jun 2026 | Technology [ Reliability will define the next decade of energy storage ][49] [ arrow-right Read article ][50] 01 Jun 2026 | Technology [ The intelligent chassis: The silent upgrade that's changing how cars move ][51] [ arrow-right Read article ][52] 27 May 2026 | Technology [ The chips that change the world ][53] [ arrow-right Read article ][54] ## Shape how the future unfolds Put your talent to work within a community of world-leading engineers and problem solvers who are advancing semiconductor technology that shapes every aspect of life. [ Explore careers ][55] ## Where innovation meets impact [ arrow-right Learn more about our impact ][56] 40,000 patents held worldwide $2B+ invested in R&D 30+ regions driving global innovation $370M given by the TI foundation since 1964 100% renewable electricity used at all of TI's 300mm wafer fabs $71M+ invested in STEM education since 2010 [1]: https://www.ti.com/about-ti/newsroom/news-releases/2026/ti-advances-next-generation-industrial- systems-with-the-first-commercially-available-can-xl-transceiver.html?HQS=asc-tech-inno-canxl_null-b hp-pr-null-wwe [2]: https://www.ti.com/about-ti/behind-chip/articles/what-will-it-take-to-bring-humanoid-robots-int o-the-real-world-read-our-experts-insights.html?HQS=multi-tech-atm-humanoid1q26_rob-bhp-blog-null-ww e [3]: https://www.ti.com/video/6399224863112?HQS=app-tech-inno-smarteischipset_ve-bhp-v-null-wwe [4]: https://www.ti.com/applications/automotive/chassis-control-safety/overview.html?HQS=multi-tech- auto-chassis_sdv-bhp-pp-null-wwe [5]: https://www.ti.com/applications/automotive/overview.html [6]: https://www.ti.com/applications/automotive/overview.html [7]: https://www.ti.com/applications/data-center/overview.html [8]: https://www.ti.com/applications/data-center/overview.html [9]: https://www.ti.com/applications/industrial/overview.html [10]: https://www.ti.com/applications/industrial/overview.html [11]: https://www.ti.com/applications/personal-electronics/overview.html [12]: https://www.ti.com/applications/personal-electronics/overview.html [13]: /about-ti.html [14]: //www.ti.com/prod-list/new-products?releasePeriod=364 [15]: /product/TPLD1202?jktype=homepageproduct [16]: https://www.ti.com/product-category/logic-voltage-translation/configurable-programmable-logic- ics/programmable-logic-devices/products.html [17]: //www.ti.com/prod-list/new-products?releasePeriod=364 [18]: https://www.ti.com/support-quality/quality-policies-procedures/product-life-cycle.html [19]: /product/TPLD1202?jktype=homepageproduct [20]: /product/INA510-Q1?jktype=homepageproduct [21]: https://www.ti.com/product-category/amplifiers/difference/products.html [22]: //www.ti.com/prod-list/new-products?releasePeriod=364 [23]: https://www.ti.com/support-quality/quality-policies-procedures/product-life-cycle.html [24]: /product/INA510-Q1?jktype=homepageproduct [25]: /product/SN74LVC2G07B-Q1?jktype=homepageproduct [26]: https://www.ti.com/product-category/logic-voltage-translation/buffers-drivers-transceivers/non inverting-buffers-drivers/products.html [27]: //www.ti.com/prod-list/new-products?releasePeriod=364 [28]: https://www.ti.com/support-quality/quality-policies-procedures/product-life-cycle.html [29]: /product/SN74LVC2G07B-Q1?jktype=homepageproduct [30]: /product/SN74LVC1G373B-Q1?jktype=homepageproduct [31]: https://www.ti.com/product-category/logic-voltage-translation/flip-flops-latches-registers/d-t ype-latches/products.html [32]: //www.ti.com/prod-list/new-products?releasePeriod=364 [33]: https://www.ti.com/support-quality/quality-policies-procedures/product-life-cycle.html [34]: /product/SN74LVC1G373B-Q1?jktype=homepageproduct [35]: /product/F29P329SM-Q1?jktype=homepageproduct [36]: https://www.ti.com/product-category/microcontrollers-processors/mcus/automotive/powertrain-zon e-chassis/products.html [37]: //www.