 | USA", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "63", "Y Score": "57", "Overall Score": "60", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Lumentum (Canada)", "Website": "https://www.lumentum.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Canada", "Continent / Geography": "NA(Canada)", "Operational Presence": "Canada", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops lasers and photonic integrated circuits for optical networks.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "CA", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Lumentum (Canada) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops lasers and photonic integrated circuits, building semiconductor-based components.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "lumentum.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "lumentum.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[\n[Lumentum-Dark-Gray-logo]\n][1]\nProducts\nSolutions\nAbout Us\n[Contact Us][2]\n[[Lumentum-Dark-Gray-logo]][3]\n\n# The People Behindthe Light\n\n[Read Blog][4]\n[\n[CNBC’s “Squawk on the Street” Michael Hurlston interview]\nIn The News\n\nLumentum CEO on AI Build-Out\n\nWatch Video\n][5]\n[\n[In the News]\nIn The News\n\nLumentum promotes both VCSELs and indium phosphide lasers for co-packaged optics\n\nRead More\n][6]\n[\n[Updated Financial Release Image]\nFinancial News\n\nLumentum Announces Fourth Quarter and Full Fiscal Year 2026 Results\n\nRead More\n][7]\n[\n[Headshot of Michael Hurlston with Optica Award text]\nNews Release\n\nMichael Hurlston Named Recipient of the 2026 Optica i4 Individual Achievement Prize\n\nRead More\n][8]\n\n## Product Highlights\n\nData Center\nDCI, Metro, Long Haul, Submarine\nIndustrial Laser\nSensing VCSEL\n\n##### Powering hyperscale data centers with cutting-edge technology.\n\n[ View all Data Center Products][9]\n[Lumentum R300 Optical Circuit Switch (OCS) – Photonic switching solution.]\n\n##### 300x300 Optical Circuit Switch (OCS)\n\nR300\nView Product Details\n[eml200g]\n\n##### EML 200G PAM4 CWDM Laser\n\nHL13E1CP00-Ln\nView Product Details\n[ELSFP Transceiver]\n\n##### External Laser Source (ELS) Module with Ultra-High-Power Laser\n\nELSFP-350\nView Product Details\n[Lumentum TRO optical transceiver module with a yellow pull tab used for high-speed data\ncommunication networks.]\n\n##### 1.6T 2×DR4 TRO OSFP Transceiver Module\n\nView Product Details\n\n## Lumentum At A Glance\n\n[poster-image]\n\n#### ILLUMINATING THE NETWORKS OF TOMORROW\n\nwatch video\n45 +\n\nYears of photonic leadership\n\n14K+\n\nNumber of global employees\n\n1450+\n\nNumber of patents\n\n[innovation]\n\nExtensive materials science expertise across multiple semiconductor platforms.\n\n[manufacturing-excellence]\n\nVertically-integrated manufacturing ensures quality control and supply chain resilience.\n\n[sustainability]\n\nCommitted to sustainability in both operations and product design.\n\n[reliable-delivery]\n\nFocused on delivering the technologies that matter most to our customers.\n\n## More About Us\n\nCareers\n[Smiling lab technician in protective gear working at a computer in a cleanroom.]\n\n## Imagine a future in photonics\n\nJoin a global team at the forefront of photonic innovation driving the world’s most advanced\ncommunications systems.\n\n[Explore Opportunities][10]\nInvestor Relations\n[Speaker presenting data on a screen to an audience in a conference room.]\n\n## Access financial information\n\nExplore the latest news, i