annel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops lasers and photonic integrated circuits, building semiconductor-based components. | Develops lasers and photonic integrated circuits for optical networks. | Canada | Canada", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "61", "Y Score": "57", "Overall Score": "59", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "NXP Semiconductors", "Website": "https://www.nxp.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Netherlands", "Continent / Geography": "EU(Netherlands)", "Operational Presence": "Netherlands", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Specializes in automotive, security, and IoT chips.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "NL", "Region Code": "EU", "Summary": "NXP Semiconductors — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: NXP is a semiconductor manufacturer that designs and produces its own chips.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "100", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "nxp.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "nxp.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "For best experience this site requires Javascript to be enabled. To enable on your browser, follow\nour [accessibility instructions][1].×\n[ ][2]\nProducts Applications Design Center Support Company [Store][3]\n* [Language ][4]\n* [\n  Orders\n  ][5]\n* [Sign In][6]\n\n**** There is secure information available for this page.\n\nView Secure Informationreenter your password\n\n**Important:** This page contains [secure information][7] about our products. [Sign in][8] to access\nauthorized resources.\n\n**Important:** This page contains secure information about our products.\n\n[ View Secure Information ][9]\n\n**Important:** Authentication is required to view secure content.\n\n[ reenter your password ][10]\n\n# Automotive, IoT & Industrial Solutions\n* Facebook\n* Twitter\n* LinkedIn\n* Printer\n1. Step Forward\n2. UWB\n3. New DNPU\n\nTECHNOLOGY\n\n# Simplifying Industrial Automation\n\nBosch Rexroth and NXP help industrial developers build faster with a pre-hardened platform for\nfactory automation, robotics, energy and more applications.\n\n[Learn more][11]\nTECHNOLOGY\n\n# Trimension UWB Powers BMW Digital Key\n\nTrimension Ultra-Wideband powers BMW Digital Key Plus and presence detection, rolling out across the\nBMW group fleet starting with select 2026 vehicle programs.\n\n[See details][12]\nPRODUCT\n\n# AI Accelerated with Ara DNPUs\n\nMeet the Ara240 discrete NPU, enabling real-time AI in the physical world with scalable edge\nperformance and efficiency.\n\n[Learn more][13]\n\n## Together, we accelerate the breakthroughs that advance our world.\n* [ Automotive][14]\n* [ Industrial][15]\n* [ Consumer][16]\n* [ Technologies][17]\n* [ Edge AI][18]\n\n### [Automotive][19]\n* [Software-Defined Vehicle][20]\n* [ADAS and Safe Driving][21]\n* [Body and Vehicle Control][22]\n* [Connected Vehicle][23]\n* [Electrification and Powertrain][24]\n* [Infotainment and In-Vehicle Experience][25]\n\n[Learn more][26]\n[S32M2 for 12V Motor Control]\n\n### S32M2 for 12V Motor Control\n\nactive\n\nHigh-voltage analog functionality with a robust embedded MCU core.\n\n[Learn more][27]\n\n### [Industrial][28]\n* [Building and Home Automation][29]\n* [Data Center and Server][30]\n* [Factory Automation][31]\n* [Healthcare][32]\n* [Power and Energy][33]\n* [Retail Automation][34]\n* [Robotics][35]\n* [Transportation][36]\n* [Avionics][37]\n\n[Learn more][38]\n[i.MX 94 Applications Processor]\n\n### i.MX 94 Applications Processor\n\npreproduction\n\ni.MX MPU with integrated TSN switch and rich protocol support.\n\n[Learn more][39]\n\n### [Consumer][40]\n* [Home Appliances][41]\n* [Home Entertainment][42]\n* [Mobile Devices and Peripherals][43]\n\n[Learn more][44]\n[i.MX RT700 Crossover MCU]\n\n### i.MX RT700 Crossover MCU\n\nactive\n\nFive computing cores to power AI-enabled edge devices.\n\n[Learn more][45]\n\n### [Technologies][46]\n* [AI/ML][47]\n* [Digital Twin][48]\n* [Edge Computing][49]\n* [Electrification][50]\n* [Functional Safety][51]\n* [Human Machine Interface (HMI)][52]\n* [Low Power][53]\n* [Motor Control][54]\n* [Power Conversion][55]\n* [Security][56]\n* [Wired Connectivity][57]\n* [Wireless Connectivity and Networks ][58]\n\n[Learn more][59]\n[RW612 Wireless MCU]\n\n### RW612 Wireless MCU\n\nactive\n\nHighly integrated, low-power, tri-radio wireless MCU.\n\n[Learn more][60]\n\n### [Edge AI][61]\n* [Automotive Edge AI][62]\n* [EIQ Neutron NPU][63]\n* [Ara Discrete NPU][64]\n* [Embedded Vision][65]\n\n[Learn more][66]\n[FRDM i.MX 8M Plus Development Platform]\n\n### FRDM i.MX 8M Plus Development Platform\n\nactive\n\nLow-cost edge AI dev board with rich vision interfaces.\n\n[Learn more][67]\n\n## Spotlight on Physical AI\n\n[SPOTLIGHT animation]\nFeatured\n\n## Accelerating Physical AI at the Edge with Ara\n\nBuild the right-sized AI solution with a scalable portfolio that helps bring secure, intelligent\nexperiences to the edge.\n\n[Learn more][68] [Explore Ara DNPU][69]\n[\nDemo\n\n### See How Agentic AI Enables Devices to Decide and Act\n\nVideo Playlist   On-Demand\n\n][70] [\nArticle\n\n### Learn How We Scale Trusted Physical AI at the Edge\n\nJul 30, 2026\n\n][71] [\nArticle\n\n### Learn How Our AI solutions Help Crea"}}, "page_text": "For best experience this site requires Javascript to be enabled. To enable on your browser, follow our [accessibility instructions][1].× [ ][2] Products Applications Design Center Support Company [Store][3] * [Language ][4] * [ Orders ][5] * [Sign In][6] **** There is secure information available for this page. View Secure Informationreenter your password **Important:** This page contains [secure information][7] about our products. [Sign in][8] to access authorized resources. **Important:** This page contains secure information about our products. [ View Secure Information ][9] **Important:** Authentication is required to view secure content. [ reenter your password ][10] # Automotive, IoT & Industrial Solutions * Facebook * Twitter * LinkedIn * Printer 1. Step Forward 2. UWB 3. New DNPU TECHNOLOGY # Simplifying Industrial Automation Bosch Rexroth and NXP help industrial developers build faster with a pre-hardened platform for factory automation, robotics, energy and more applications. [Learn more][11] TECHNOLOGY # Trimension UWB Powers BMW Digital Key Trimension Ultra-Wideband powers BMW Digital Key Plus and presence detection, rolling out across the BMW group fleet starting with select 2026 vehicle programs. [See details][12] PRODUCT # AI Accelerated with Ara DNPUs Meet the Ara240 discrete NPU, enabling real-time AI in the physical world with scalable edge performance and efficiency. [Learn more][13] ## Together, we accelerate the breakthroughs that advance our world. * [ Automotive][14] * [ Industrial][15] * [ Consumer][16] * [ Technologies][17] * [ Edge AI][18] ### [Automotive][19] * [Software-Defined Vehicle][20] * [ADAS and Safe Driving][21] * [Body and Vehicle Control][22] * [Connected Vehicle][23] * [Electrification and Powertrain][24] * [Infotainment and In-Vehicle Experience][25] [Learn more][26] [S32M2 for 12V Motor Control] ### S32M2 for 12V Motor Control active High-voltage analog functionality with a robust embedded MCU core. [Learn more][27] ### [Industrial][28] * [Building and Home Automation][29] * [Data Center and Server][30] * [Factory Automation][31] * [Healthcare][32] * [Power and Energy][33] * [Retail Automation][34] * [Robotics][35] * [Transportation][36] * [Avionics][37] [Learn more][38] [i.MX 94 Applications Processor] ### i.MX 94 Applications Processor preproduction i.MX MPU with integrated TSN switch and rich protocol support. [Learn more][39] ### [Consumer][40] * [Home Appliances][41] * [Home Entertainment][42] * [Mobile Devices and Peripherals][43] [Learn more][44] [i.MX RT700 Crossover MCU] ### i.MX RT700 Crossover MCU active Five computing cores to power AI-enabled edge devices. [Learn more][45] ### [Technologies][46] * [AI/ML][47] * [Digital Twin][48] * [Edge Computing][49] * [Electrification][50] * [Functional Safety][51] * [Human Machine Interface (HMI)][52] * [Low Power][53] * [Motor Control][54] * [Power Conversion][55] * [Security][56] * [Wired Connectivity][57] * [Wireless Connectivity and Networks ][58] [Learn more][59] [RW612 Wireless MCU] ### RW612 Wireless MCU active Highly integrated, low-power, tri-radio wireless MCU. [Learn more][60] ### [Edge AI][61] * [Automotive Edge AI][62] * [EIQ Neutron NPU][63] * [Ara Discrete NPU][64] * [Embedded Vision][65] [Learn more][66] [FRDM i.MX 8M Plus Development Platform] ### FRDM i.MX 8M Plus Development Platform active Low-cost edge AI dev board with rich vision interfaces. [Learn more][67] ## Spotlight on Physical AI [SPOTLIGHT animation] Featured ## Accelerating Physical AI at the Edge with Ara Build the right-sized AI solution with a scalable portfolio that helps bring secure, intelligent experiences to the edge. [Learn more][68] [Explore Ara DNPU][69] [ Demo ### See How Agentic AI Enables Devices to Decide and Act Video Playlist On-Demand ][70] [ Article ### Learn How We Scale Trusted Physical AI at the Edge Jul 30, 2026 ][71] [ Article ### Learn How Our AI solutions Help Create Seamless Conversations May 19, 2026 ][72] [ Document ### Discover How Regulations and Responsible AI Shape the Future White Paper May 5, 2025 ][73] ## Start Designing Today with NXP [Find the right product][74] ### Product Finders * [Product Advisor][75] * [Product Selector][76] * [Cross Reference][77] [Find and build your next project][78] ### Design Resources * [Community][79] * [Design Advisor][80] * [Development Boards and Designs][81] * [Documentation][82] * [Engineering Services][83] * [ Partner Directory][84] * [ Partner Marketplace][85] * [Software][86] ### Ready to gain access to everything NXP? The reasons for registering keep growing. [Sign up today][87] and unlock a premium experience on NXP.com. [Discover the Benefits][88] Wij zijn NXP. 我们是恩智浦. Nous sommes NXP. 우리는 NXP입니다. Wir sind NXP. 私たちはNXPです. [We are NXP][89]. * [About NXP][90] * [Corporate Overview][91] [img] ### Enabling a Better, More Sustainable World As our digitally-enhanced world is evolving to anticipate and automate people's needs, NXP strives to engage, protect and respect our relationship with the wider world. * [ Sustainability ][92] * [ Stories ][93] [img] ### Long-Term Success With R&D Investment Investing in solutions that drive long-term, profitable growth, free cash flow and robust capital returns to our owners; enabling our customers' success. * [ Investors Relations ][94] [img] ### Decades of Expertise and Innovation Our technology enabled the first words relayed from the moon and ever since we’ve been accelerating the breakthroughs that advance our world. * [NXP History][95] ## Bright Minds. Bright Futures. NXP team members create breakthrough technologies that advance our world. We're looking for innovative, passionate, and talented people like you to join our team. The future starts here. * [Careers at NXP][96] * [NXP Newsroom][97] * [NXP Smarter World Blog][98] Scroll down [][99] * [About NXP][100] * [Careers][101] * [Investors][102] * [Media][103] * [Contact][104] * [Subscribe][105] * [ [Facebook]][106] * [ [YouTube] ][107] * [ [X (formerly Twitter)]][108] * [ [LinkedIn]][109] * [Privacy][110] * [Terms of Use][111] * [Terms of Sale][112] * [Slavery and Human Trafficking Statement][113] * [Accessibility][114] ©2006-2020 NXP Semiconductors