53] #### [VIEW ALL →][154] * Europe & Africa Sales ### Sales Locator * [Finland][155] * [France][156] * [Germany][157] * [Israel][158] * [Italy][159] * [Norway][160] * [Spain][161] * [Sweden][162] * [United Kingdom][163] #### [VIEW ALL →][164] * Asia Pacific Sales ### Sales Locator * [Australia][165] * [China][166] * [India][167] * [Indonesia][168] * [Japan][169] * [Singapore][170] * [South Korea][171] * [Taiwan][172] * [Vietnam][173] #### [VIEW ALL →][174] * Online Store ### Lattice Products * [Silicon Devices][175] * [Software, Cables, & Boards][176] #### [BUY ONLINE →][177] * Discontinued Products ### Discontinued Products * [Rochester Electronics][178] * [Arrow Electronics][179] * [Blog][180] * [About Lattice][181] * About Lattice ### About Lattice * [About the Company][182] * [Corporate Stewardship][183] * [Contact Us][184] * Investor Relations ### Investor Relations * [Investor Overview][185] * [Online Investor Kit][186] * [Investor FAQ][187] * [Board Of Directors][188] * [Management][189] * [Corporate Governance][190] * [SEC Filings][191] * [Quarterly Earnings][192] * [Analysts][193] * [Ethics][194] * Newsroom ### Newsroom * [Announcements][195] * [Blogs][196] * [Upcoming Product Events ][197] * [Image Library][198] * [Video Library][199] * [Webinar Library][200] * [Media Contacts][201] * Careers ### Careers * [Careers Homepage][202] * [Search Job Openings][203] * [Our Benefits][204] * [Sign In][205] [Register][206] * * [ [en] ][207] * [ [ja] ][208] * [ [zh] ][209] en * [ [Lattice Acquires AMI] #### **Lattice Acquires AMI** #### Creates Industry’s Leading Secure Management and Control Platform Learn More ][210] * [ [Lattice Nvidia_2026AI Excellence] #### **Lattice + NVIDIA Edge AI Solution** #### Efficiently Bridge from Sensor to Compute Learn More ][211] * [ [MachXO5 Family Hero Images] #### **Achieve Secure System Control** #### With Built-in Trust, HRoT, and Crypto Agility Learn More ][212] * [ [Build Smarter Humanoids with Lattice FPGAs] #### **Build Smarter Humanoids with Lattice FPGAs** #### Real-time Sensing, Edge AI Inference, and Zero Trust Security Learn More ][213] * [ [DataCenter] #### **Smarter Control for Next-Gen Datacenters** #### With Deterministic, FPGA-based Secure Server Management That Scales With AI‑driven #### Infrastructure Learn More ][214] ### The Low Power Programmable Leader ## OUR PRODUCTS Lattice low power FPGAs and easy-to-use software tools enable designers to innovate and reduce development time for their Industrial, Automotive, Communications, Computing, and Consumer applications. [[TDQ-Product-356x208-thumbnail]][215] **Lattice MachXO5-NX TDQ ** is industry’s first secure control FPGA with full CNSA 2.0 compliant and post-quantum cryptography (PQC) support. [[Product-Selector-Guide1]][216] [Lattice FPGA Product Selector Guide][217] provides a quick and easy way to identify Lattice FPGA devices, features, and specifications. [[CrossLinkU-Board-Product-356x208-thumbnail]][218] **CrossLinkU-NX Evaluation Board** is a platform for general purpose application development using CrossLinkU-NX device, the first FPGA with hard USB2/3 (5Gbps) interface. [ EXPLORE OUR PRODUCTS][219] ## OUR SOLUTION STACKS Whether you're designing for a smart factory, advanced driver experiences, AI datacenters, leading-edge telecom infrastructure, or connected home, Lattice Solution Stacks allow you to quickly unleash your innovation. [[Sentry-Product-356x208-thumbnail]][220] The **Lattice Sentry solution stack** enables a cyber resilient and NIST SP 800-193 compliant PFR solution with easy-to-use FPGA design tools and a full suite of custom design services. [[mVision-356x208-thumbnail]][221] The **Lattice mVision solution stack ** helps embedded vision system designers to evaluate, develop, and deploy FPGA-based embedded vision applications, such as machine vision, robotics, ADAS, video surveillance, and drones. [[sensAI-Product-356x208-thumbnail]][222] The **Lattice sensAI solution stack** includes everything you need to evaluate, develop, and deploy FPGA-based Machine Learning / Artificial Intelligence solutions. [ EXPLORE MORE SOLUTIONS][223] ### OUR LATEST NEWS #### [Lattice to Deliver Keynote at 2026 OCP Global Summit][224] #### [An Open Letter to AMI Customers & Ecosystem Partners][225] #### [Lattice Semiconductor Completes Acquisition of AMI][226] [ EXPLORE MORE NEWS ][227] #### ABOUT LATTICE * [Our Company][228] * [Newsroom][229] * [Investor Relations][230] * [Careers][231] * [Newsletter][232] #### SALES * [Americas][233] * [Europe & Africa][234] * [Asia Pacific][235] * [Online Store][236] #### SUPPORT * [Technical Support][237] * [Software Licensing][238] * [Partner Network][239] * [Legacy Devices & Software][240] * [Training][241] * [Contact Us][242] #### FOLLOW [Lattice QR code] * ©2026 Lattice Semiconductor | * [ Legal Notices ][243] | * [ Privacy Policy ][244] | * [ Site Map ][245] | * [ Use of Cookies ][246] | * [Accessibility Statement][247] [1]: /en [2]: /en [3]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/Solutions [4]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/Solutions/Industrial-Overview [5]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/Solutions/Solutions/SolutionsDetails02/Automate [6]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/Solutions/Solutions/SolutionsDetails02/Drive [7]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/Solutions/Solutions/SolutionsDetails02/mVision [8]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/Solutions/Solutions/SolutionsDetails02/sensAI [9]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/Solutions/Solutions/SolutionsDetails02/LatticeSentry [10]: https://www.latticesemi.com/en/So", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Lattice Semiconductor — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Lattice Semiconductor designs and manufactures low-power FPGAs, which are semiconductor products. | Specializes in low-power FPGAs. | United States | USA", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "61", "Y Score": "56", "Overall Score": "58", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductor