 * [ **Balun** [バラン] ][69] * [ **Coupler** [カプラ] ][70] * [ **Filters** [Filters] ][71] * [ **Phase Shifter** [フェイズシフタ] ][72] * [ **RF Switch** [RFスイッチ] ][73] * [ **Front End Module** [フロントエンドモジュール] ][74] * [ **Acoustic wave device** ][75] * [ **Connectors** [Connectors] ][76] * [ **Antennas and related products** ][77] * [ **Connectivity Modules** ][78] * [ **Ionizers / Active Oxygen Module (Ozonizers)** [Ionizer / Active Oxygen Module (Ozonizer)] ][79] View More [All Products ][80] ## Product InformationSolutions We offer a broad variety of ideas and suggestions to help our customers with product planning, development, and implementation. [All Solutions][81] * [ RFID solution For fashion, retail, healthcare, and manufacturing industries Read more ][82] * [ Integrated Renewable Energy Control Solution efinnos Realizing self-consumption-type renewable energy control using AI Read more ][83] * Previous * Next * [Exhibitions][84] View a list of exhibitions. * [Webinars][85] View a list of webinars. * [Support][86] Product introduction videos, catalogs, informational materials, and other useful tools. * [my Murata][87] Membership site, offering special content and services not available from our Electronic Components and Solutions sites. * [Murata Community Forum][88] Your questions answered by experts. [Products] ･ Connectivity Modules ･ Chip Ferrite Beads * [SimSurfing][89] Simulation software, component simulation data at your fingertips... ## Email Newsletter Our email newsletter helps keep you up to date on a wide selection of our products, events, and promotions, as well as information on uses for our components, applications, and technical data services. [Sign Up for Free][90] ## Innovator in Electronics Leading the way in innovation in the electronics industry. [For corporate information, sustainability, investor relations, etc., see our corporate website.][91] Your Opinions and Requests about Our Website [Respond to a survey][92] [PageTOP][93] *Share This Page*