r products. | Develops 60GHz wireless chipsets and phased array antenna modules. | Canada | Canada", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "57", "Y Score": "58", "Overall Score": "58", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Powerchip Semiconductor Manufacturing Corporation (PSMC)", "Website": "https://www.psmc.com/", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Taiwan", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Taiwan)", "Operational Presence": "Taiwan", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Taiwanese semiconductor manufacturer offering memory and foundry services.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "TW", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Powerchip Semiconductor Manufacturing Corporation (PSMC) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: PSMC is a semiconductor manufacturer offering memory and foundry services, directly building chips.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "psmc.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "Profitable Sales and Marketing", "domain": "psmc.com", "founded_year": null, "employee_count": null, "description": "Profitable Sales and Marketing (PSMC) is a marketing education and consulting company that offers e-sessions, books, audio programs, a podcast, and a weekly newsletter to help businesses market profitably."}, "business": {"products": [{"name": "What’s in It for Me? Marketing from the Customer’s Point of View?", "category": "Book (audio or print)", "features": "Marketing from the customer's point of view", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Mistakes I Made Buying Advertising", "category": "Book (audio or print)", "features": "Common mistakes in buying advertising", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Mistakes I Made My First Five Years in Business (and How You Can Avoid Them)", "category": "Book (audio or print)", "features": "Lessons from first five years in business", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Profitable Marketing Secrets", "category": "Audio packages", "features": "Cultivating Customers via E-mail, How to Have a Successful Trade Show, Addressing the Changing Business Environment, What Sets Companies Apart: Management, Identifying Your Target Market, Entrepreneurship Success Stories", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Profitable Marketing Weekly", "category": "Newsletter", "features": "Weekly marketing tips and insights", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Profitable Marketing Podcast", "category": "Podcast", "features": "Marketing advice and strategies", "pricing": null}], "services": [{"name": "No Junk Food Marketing", "category": "E-Session", "features": "Creates a marketing plan tailored to your business", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Profitable Selling", "category": "E-Session", "features": "Helps your staff sell more by working smarter, not harder", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Intriguing Press Releases", "category": "E-Session", "features": "Teaches you how to put together an effective press release", "pricing": null}, {"name": "Profitable Pricing", "category": "E-Session", "features": "Uses the three factors of setting prices to assist you in pricing what you offer", "pricing": null}], "industries": [], "key_markets": []}, "financials": {"key_numbers": [], "employee_count": null}, "relationships": {"customers": [], "investors": [], "partners": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Profitable Sales and Marketing is a small marketing education and consulting company that sells books, audio programs, a podcast, a newsletter, and e-sessions aimed at helping businesses improve marketing profitability. The homepage highlights practical marketing topics such as customer-oriented marketing, advertising mistakes, and pricing strategies. No financial figures, employee counts, or client references are disclosed.", "insights": ["The company appears to focus on entrepreneurial education, offering content in both print and audio formats to cater to different learning preferences.", "E-sessions provide tailored consulting/training services, indicating a service model complementing the passive income from books and audio products.", "No specific industries or geographic markets are targeted on the homepage, suggesting a general business audience."]}, "media": {"articles": [], "press_releases": [], "investor_presentations": []}}, "page_text": "Profitable Sales and Marketing is a small marketing education and consulting company that sells books, audio programs, a podcast, a newsletter, and e-sessions aimed at helping businesses improve marketing profitability. The homepage highlights practical marketing topics such as customer-oriented marketing, advertising mistakes, and pricing strategies. No financial figures, employee counts, or client references are disclosed.", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Powerchip Semiconductor Manufacturing Corporation (PSMC) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: PSMC is a semiconductor manufacturer offering memory and foundry services, directly building chips. | Taiwanese semiconductor manufacturer offering memory and foundry services. | Taiwan | Taiwan", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "58", "Y Score": "58", "Overall Score": "58", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Qorvo", "Website": "https://www.qorvo.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "United States", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Supplies RF front-end modules and power management solutions for mobile, infrastructure, and defense applications.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "Qorvo — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Supplies RF front-end modules, designs and manufactures its own products.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "qorvo.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "qorvo.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Homepage Hero Spatium 2560x597.jpg]\nSpatium SSPAs\n\n# Lose the tube. Gain reliability at wideband high power.\n\n[Explore How][1]\n[New Qorvo Website Homepage Hero.jpg]\nNew Website\n\n# Everything you need. Easier to find.\n\n[Watch the Tour][2]\n[Home News_Events.png]\nStuck on a design problem?\n\n# Tap into our community of experts.\n\n[Join the Conversation][3]\nProductsAbout UsNews & Events\n\n## Explore our Solutions\n\n[Automotive][4][Consumer][5][Defense &\nAerospace][6][Industrial][7][Infrastructure][8][Mobile][9][Foundry & Services][10]\n\n## Featured Resources for\n\nAutomotiveConsumerDefense & AerospaceIndustrialInfrastructureMobileFoundry & Services\nSelect\n\n### Drive connectivity, control and performance in vehicles\n\nConnectivity, sensing and control systems are expanding across the vehicle, tightening performance\nand integration demands. Qorvo brings RF, power and sensing together to strengthen connections,\nmanage power and extend control across increasingly complex vehicle architectures.\n\n[\n[What Automotive Qualification Really Means]\nTechnical Article\n\n### What Automotive Qualification Really Means \n\nUnderstand what qualification standards require and why they matter. See how testing and validation\ndrive reliable performance in automotive systems.\n\n][11][\n[Connected Car For Dummies® ]\nE-Book\n\n### Connected Car For Dummies®  \n\nUnderstand the technologies shaping connected vehicles, from telematics and V2X to secure access and\nin-vehicle connectivity.\n\n][12][\n[Green Light for Innovation: Accelerating Safer Roads with V2X Communication]\nTechnical Article\n\n### Green Light for Innovation: Accelerating Safer Roads with V2X Communication \n\nDiscover how V2X communication enhances road safety through real-time vehicle-to-vehicle and\ninfrastructure connectivity.\n\n][13][\n[Ultra-Wideband & CCC Digital Key - E-Guide]\nE-Book\n\n### Ultra-Wideband & CCC Digital Key - E-Guide \n\nLearn how UWB proximity verification strengthens Digital Key systems with precise, spoof-resistant\nvehicle access.\n\n][14][\n[UWB Radar Sensing: Beyond Ranging]\nTechnical Article\n\n### UWB Radar Sensing: Beyond Ranging \n\nExplore how Ultra-Wideband radar sensing enables precise detection and awareness across automotive,\nindustrial and smart systems.\n\n][15]\n\n## Featured Design Hub Resources\n\n[Explore all design tools][16]\n[\n\n### Hardware\n\nStart your design with our compact, fully assembled and easy to integrate evaluation boards.\n\n][17][\n\n### Calculators\n\nTools and models to simulate, calculate, and validate designs.\n\n][18][\n\n### Software\n\nEvaluate functionality and integrate faster using our software packages.\n\n][19][\n\n### Documentation\n\nBuild with confidence using our practical, in-depth technical articles, white papers and e-books.\n\n][20]\n\n### Save Time With QSPICE®\n\nReduce model-making time and effort with significantly better SPICE basics.\n\n[Learn More][21]\n\n## Success Stories\n\nSee how our customers partner with us to solve complex design challenges, accelerate development,\noptimize performance and get to market faster.\n\n[See All Success Stories][22]\n[\n[Pozyx: Enhancing Dairy Farm Productivity and Animal Welfare]\n\n### Pozyx: Enhancing Dairy Farm Productivity and Animal Welfare\n\n][23][\n[Lockheed Martin: Strengthening Next-Generation Defense Capabilities]\n\n### Lockheed Martin: Strengthening Next-Generation Defense Capabilities\n\n][24][\n[Budweiser Budvar: Solving Logistics Challenges]\n\n### Budweiser Budvar: Solving Logistics Challenges\n\n][25]\n[Homepage We are Qorvo 1.png]\nWe are Qorvo\n\n## Building a Better World Together\n\nAt Qorvo, we understand that our work affects the world we live in, and it's only natural for us to\ncommit to influencing that world in a positive way. Our team supports customers with innovative\nsolutions while prioritizing employee well-being, environmental sustainability and supply chain\nexcellence.\n\n[Learn More][26]\n\n## Quickstart\n\nStart designing today with Qorvo\n\n[Boards & Kits][27][Calculators][28][Software][29][Support Forums][30]\n\n## [Our Customer Awards "}}, "page_text": "[Homepage Hero Spatium 2560x597.jpg] Spatium SSPAs # Lose the tube. Gain reliability at wideband high power. [Explore How][1] [New Qorvo Website Homepage Hero.jpg] New Website # Everything you need. Easier to find. [Watch the Tour][2] [Home News_Events.png] Stuck on a design problem? # Tap into our community of experts. [Join the Conversation][3] ProductsAbout UsNews & Events ## Explore our Solutions [Automotive][4][Consumer][5][Defense & Aerospace][6][Industrial][7][Infrastructure][8][Mobile][9][Foundry & Services][10] ## Featured Resources for AutomotiveConsumerDefense & AerospaceIndustrialInfrastructureMobileFoundry & Services Select ### Drive connectivity, control and performance in vehicles Connectivity, sensing and control systems are expanding across the vehicle, tightening performance and integration demands. Qorvo brings RF, power and sensing together to strengthen connections, manage power and extend control across increasingly complex vehicle architectures. [ [What Automotive Qualification Really Means] Technical Article ### What Automotive Qualification Really Means Understand what qualification standards require and why they matter. See how testing and validation drive reliable performance in automotive systems. ][11][ [Connected Car For Dummies® ] E-Book ### Connected Car For Dummies® Understand the technologies shaping connected vehicles, from telematics and V2X to secure access and in-vehicle connectivity. ][12][ [Green Light for Innovation: Accelerating Safer Roads with V2X Communication] Technical Article ### Green Light for Innovation: Accelerating Safer Roads with V2X Communication Discover how V2X communication enhances road safety through real-time vehicle-to-vehicle and infrastructure connectivity. ][13][ [Ultra-Wideband & CCC Digital Key - E-Guide] E-Book ### Ultra-Wideband & CCC Digital Key - E-Guide Learn how UWB proximity verification strengthens Digital Key systems with precise, spoof-resistant vehicle access. ][14][ [UWB Radar Sensing: Beyond Ranging] Technical Article ### UWB Radar Sensing: Beyond Ranging Explore how Ultra-Wideband radar sensing enables precise detection and awareness across automotive, industrial and smart systems. ][15] ## Featured Design Hub Resources [Explore all design tools][16] [ ### Hardware Start your design with our compact, fully assembled and easy to integrate evaluation boards. ][17][ ### Calculators Tools and models to simulate, calculate, and validate designs. ][18][ ### Software Evaluate functionality and integrate faster using our software packages. ][19][ ### Documentation Build with confidence using our practical, in-depth technical articles, white papers and e-books. ][20] ### Save Time With QSPICE® Reduce model-making time and effort with significantly better SPICE basics. [Learn More][21] ## Success Stories See how our customers partner with us to solve complex design challenges, accelerate development, optimize performance and get to market faster. [See All Success Stories][22] [ [Pozyx: Enhancing Dairy Farm Productivity and Animal Welfare] ### Pozyx: Enhancing Dairy Farm Productivity and Animal Welfare ][23][ [Lockheed Martin: Strengthening Next-Generation Defense Capabilities] ### Lockheed Martin: Strengthening Next-Generation Defense Capabilities ][24][ [Budweiser Budvar: Solving Logistics Challenges] ### Budweiser Budvar: Solving Logistics Challenges ][25] [Homepage We are Qorvo 1.png] We are Qorvo ## Building a Better World Together At Qorvo, we understand that our work affects the world we live in, and it's only natural for us to commit to influencing that world in a positive way. Our team supports customers with innovative solutions while prioritizing employee well-being, environmental sustainability and supply chain excellence. [Learn More][26] ## Quickstart Start designing today with Qorvo [Boards & Kits][27][Calculators][28][Software][29][Support Forums][30] ## [Our Customer Awards ][31] * [Samsung] * [Xiaomi] * [Northrop Grumman] * [Honor] ## Stay up to date with us. Sign up for notification on new products, product/process change notifications (PCNs) and end of life (EOL) alerts. [Sign Up][32] Qorvo products are at work connecting, protecting and powering the planet. We bring core radio frequency (RF) and power technologies and solutions to automotive, consumer, defense & aerospace, industrial & enterprise, infrastructure and mobile markets. ### Stay Connected * [[Facebook]][33] * [[X]][34] * [[LinkedIn]][35] * [[YouTube]][36] ### Quick Links * [Products][37] * [Solutions][38] * [Design Hub][39] * [New Products][40] * [Product Compliance][41] ### News & Resources * [Blog Posts][42] * [Events & Trade Shows][43] * [News Releases][44] * [Success Stories][45] * [Technical Articles][46] ### Company * [About Us][47] * [Careers][48] * [Corporate Videos][49] * [Quality][50] * [Locations][51] * [Inves