tivity. ][76][ [Ultra-Wideband & CCC Digital Key - E-Guide] E-Book ### Ultra-Wideband & CCC Digital Key - E-Guide Learn how UWB proximity verification strengthens Digital Key systems with precise, spoof-resistant vehicle access. ][77][ [UWB Radar Sensing: Beyond Ranging] Technical Article ### UWB Radar Sensing: Beyond Ranging Explore how Ultra-Wideband radar sensing enables precise detection and awareness across automotive, industrial and smart systems. ][78] ## Featured Design Hub Resources [Explore all design tools][79] [ ### Hardware Start your design with our compact, fully assembled and easy to integrate evaluation boards. ][80][ ### Calculators Tools and models to simulate, calculate, and validate designs. ][81][ ### Software Evaluate functionality and integrate faster using our software packages. ][82][ ### Documentation Build with confidence using our practical, in-depth technical articles, white papers and e-books. ][83] ### Save Time With QSPICE® Reduce model-making time and effort with significantly better SPICE basics. [Learn More][84] ## Success Stories See how our customers partner with us to solve complex design challenges, accelerate development, optimize performance and get to market faster. [See All Success Stories][85] [ [Pozyx: Enhancing Dairy Farm Productivity and Animal Welfare] ### Pozyx: Enhancing Dairy Farm Productivity and Animal Welfare ][86][ [Lockheed Martin: Strengthening Next-Generation Defense Capabilities] ### Lockheed Martin: Strengthening Next-Generation Defense Capabilities ][87][ [Budweiser Budvar: Solving Logistics Challenges] ### Budweiser Budvar: Solving Logistics Challenges ][88] [Homepage We are Qorvo 1.png] We are Qorvo ## Building a Better World Together At Qorvo, we understand that our work affects the world we live in, and it's only natural for us to commit to influencing that world in a positive way. Our team supports customers with innovative solutions while prioritizing employee well-being, environmental sustainabilit