tra2-titanium-silver-lte-sm-l715fzsains/buy/ [11]: /in/computers/galaxy-book/galaxy-book6-series/buy/ [12]: /in/tvs/qled-tv/qn900f-65-inch-neo-qled-8k-mini-led-smart-tv-qa65qn900fuxxl/ [13]: /in/tvs/oled-tv/s95f-65-inch-oled-4k-smart-tv-qa65s95faulxl/ [14]: /in/lifestyle-tvs/the-frame/ls03he-65-inch-the-frame-smart-tv-qa65ls03heulxl/ [15]: /in/audio-devices/soundbar/q990f-black-hw-q990f-xl/ [16]: /in/monitors/gaming/odyssey-", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Samsung Electronics — channel participant (chatgpt_recall). Verify: Samsung produces memory chips, system LSI, and offers foundry services. | Produces memory chips, system LSI, and foundry services. | South Korea | South Korea", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "57", "Y Score": "58", "Overall Score": "58", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Siliconware Precision Industries (SPIL)", "Website": "https://www.spil.com.tw", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Malaysia", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Malaysia)", "Operational Presence": "Malaysia", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Major OSAT with operations in Malaysia, providing advanced packaging services.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "MY", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Siliconware Precision Industries (SPIL) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Major OSAT providing advanced packaging services, directly involved in semiconductor manufacturing.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "spil.com.tw", "data": {"company": {"name": "Siliconware Precision Industries Co., Ltd. (SPIL)", "domain": "spil.com.tw", "founded_year": null, "description": "SPIL is a world-class IC packaging and testing services provider, dedicated to enhancing quality and developing technical innovations to satisfy customers' needs. The company offers comprehensive packaging solutions and advanced technology to meet future packaging demands."}, "business": {"products": [{"name": "Laminate Substrate", "category": "IC Packaging"}, {"name": "Leadframe", "category": "IC Packaging"}, {"name": "Wafer Level (WLCSP)", "category": "IC Packaging"}, {"name": "Stacked Die", "category": "IC Packaging"}, {"name": "Multi-Package", "category": "IC Packaging"}, {"name": "2.5D/3D Integration with TSV", "category": "Technology"}, {"name": "System in Package (SiP)", "category": "Technology"}, {"name": "FanOut-WLP", "category": "Technology"}, {"name": "Flip Chip", "category": "Technology"}, {"name": "Fine Pitch WB", "category": "Technology"}, {"name": "Molding", "category": "Technology"}, {"name": "Antenna in Package (AiP)", "category": "Technology"}], "services": ["Assembly", "Test", "Bumping", "Quality"], "industries": ["PC", "Hand-held Product", "Consumer Product", "Wire Communication"], "key_markets": []}, "financials": {"key_numbers": ["NTD 0 Billion Revenue", "100% conflict-free material", "90% recycling rate", "90% customer satisfaction"], "employee_count": null}, "relationships": {"customers": [], "investors": []}, "intel": "SPIL is a leading semiconductor packaging and testing services provider. The company emphasizes innovation, high performance, miniaturization, and multifunctional integration. It reports a 90% customer satisfaction rate and 100% conflict-free materials. Key offerings include IC packaging (leadframe, substrate, wafer-level), assembly/test/bumping services, and advanced technologies such as 2.5D/3D TSV, SiP, FanOut-WLP, and AiP. The company serves PC, handheld, consumer, and wire communication markets.", "media": {"articles": [], "press_releases": [], "investor_presentations": []}}, "page_text": "", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Siliconware Precision Industries (SPIL) — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Major OSAT providing advanced packaging services, directly involved in semiconductor manufacturing. | Major OSAT with operations in Malaysia, providing advanced packaging services. | Malaysia | Malaysia", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "61", "Y Score": "55", "Overall Score": "58", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "SkyWater Technology", "Website": "https://www.skywatertechnology.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "United States", "Continent / Geography": "NA(United States)", "Operational Presence": "United States", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Provides semiconductor foundry services, including advanced packaging and MEMS, supporting the US semiconductor ecosystem.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "US", "Region Code": "NA", "Summary": "SkyWater Technology — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Provides semiconductor foundry services, builds technology.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "skywatertechnology.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "skywatertechnology.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "[Skip to content][1]\n\nWe are pleased to announce that SkyWater is now part of IonQ. For additional information, please\nread the [announcement][2] or visit [Investors.IonQ.com][3].\n* [Investors][4]\n* [Suppliers][5]\n* [Careers][6]\n\n[SkyPort Customer Portal][7]\n[[Skywater Technology]][8]\n* [Services][9]\n  * [Technology as a Service (TaaS)][10]\n  * [Technology & Design Enablement][11]\n  * [Manufacturing][12]\n* [Technologies][13]\n  * [CMOS][14]\n  * [Heterogenous Integration][15]\n  * [MEMS, Photonics & Custom][16]\n  * [Rad-Hard][17]\n  * [Superconducting][18]\n  * [ThermaView℠ ROIC Solutions][19]\n* [Markets][20]\n  * [Aerospace & Defense][21]\n  * [Automotive][22]\n  * [Biomedical][23]\n  * [Industrial][24]\n* [Resources][25]\n  * [Press Releases][26]\n  * [Events][27]\n  * [Blog][28]\n  * [Visual Library][29]\n  * [Podcast][30]\n* [About][31]\n  * [Who We Are][32]\n  * [Leadership][33]\n  * [Strategic Technology Partners][34]\n  * [Certifications & Policies][35]\n  * [SkyWater Acquires Fab 25][36]\n* [Get Started][37]\n[SkyPort Customer Portal][38]\n[Investors][39] [Careers][40]\n\n# We Streamline the Concept-to-Production Journey\n\nSkyWater is a U.S.-based, pure-play semiconductor manufacturer and a DMEA-accredited Trusted\nsupplier.\n\n[Get Started][41] [About SkyWater][42]\n[07/31/2026][43] | [Press Releases][44]\n[ IonQ Completes Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][45]\n[07/28/2026][46] | [Press Releases][47]\n[ IonQ Receives Regulatory Approval to Complete Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][48]\n[02/25/2026][49] | [Press Releases][50]\n[ SkyWater Technology Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Fiscal Year 2025 Results ][51]\n[See All Press Releases][52]\n[07/31/2026][53]\n[ IonQ Completes Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][54]\n[07/28/2026][55]\n[ IonQ Receives Regulatory Approval to Complete Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][56]\n[02/25/2026][57]\n[ SkyWater Technology Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Fiscal Year 2025 Results ][58]\n[See All Articles][59]\n\n## Celebrating 250 Years of American Ingenuity\n\nAs our nation celebrates its 250th anniversary, we’re reflecting on the builders, innovators,\nengineers, entrepreneurs, and problem-solvers whose contributions have shaped America’s past and who\nare helping define its future.\n\nAt SkyWater, we see that spirit every day in the people advancing technology, strengthening domestic\nmanufacturing, and tackling some of the world’s most complex challenges.\n\n## Technologies\n\nWe enable innovators with diverse technology categories.\n\n[\n\n### Mixed-Signal CMOS\n\nLearn More\n][60]\n[\n\n### Rad-Hard\n\nLearn More\n][61]\n[\n\n### MEMS\n\nLearn More\n][62]\n[\n\n### Superconducting\n\nLearn More\n][63]\n[\n\n### Photonics\n\nLearn More\n][64]\n[\n\n### Heterogeneous Integration\n\nLearn More\n][65]\n\n## Markets\n\nSkyWater partners with fabless companies, IDMs and OEMs to bring solutions to market for a wide\nrange of applications.\n* ### [Aerospace & Defense][66]\n* ### [Automotive][67]\n* ### [Biomedical][68]\n* ### [Industrial][69]\n\n## Connect with us on LinkedIn\n\n## Let’s make your next project a reality.\n\n[Get Started][70]\n[[Skywater Technology]][71]\n* [Services][72]\n  * [Technology as a Service (TaaS)][73]\n  * [Technology & Design Enablement][74]\n  * [Manufacturing][75]\n* [Markets][76]\n  * [Healthcare][77]\n* [Technologies][78]\n  * [CMOS][79]\n* [Resources][80]\n  * [Podcast][81]\n  * [Press Releases][82]\n  * [Events][83]\n* [About][84]\n  * [Who We Are][85]\n  * [Leadership][86]\n* [Support][87]\n  * [Careers][88]\n  * [Suppliers][89]\n\n##### Services\n* [Technology as a Service (TaaS)][90]\n* [Technology & Design Enablement][91]\n* [Manufacturing][92]\n\n##### Markets\n* [Aerospace & Defense][93]\n* [Automotive][94]\n* [Biomedical][95]\n* [Industrial][96]\n\n##### Technologies\n* [CMOS][97]\n* [Heterogenous Integration][98]\n* [MEMS, Photonics & Custom][99]\n* [Rad-Hard][100]\n* [Superconducting][101]\n\n##### Resources\n* [Press Releases][102]\n* [Events][103]\n* [Blog][104]\n* [Podcast][105]\n* [Visual Library][106]\n\n##### About\n* [Who We Are][107]\n* [Leadership][108]\n* [Strategic Technology P"}}, "page_text": "[Skip to content][1] We are pleased to announce that SkyWater is now part of IonQ. For additional information, please read the [announcement][2] or visit [Investors.IonQ.com][3]. * [Investors][4] * [Suppliers][5] * [Careers][6] [SkyPort Customer Portal][7] [[Skywater Technology]][8] * [Services][9] * [Technology as a Service (TaaS)][10] * [Technology & Design Enablement][11] * [Manufacturing][12] * [Technologies][13] * [CMOS][14] * [Heterogenous Integration][15] * [MEMS, Photonics & Custom][16] * [Rad-Hard][17] * [Superconducting][18] * [ThermaView℠ ROIC Solutions][19] * [Markets][20] * [Aerospace & Defense][21] * [Automotive][22] * [Biomedical][23] * [Industrial][24] * [Resources][25] * [Press Releases][26] * [Events][27] * [Blog][28] * [Visual Library][29] * [Podcast][30] * [About][31] * [Who We Are][32] * [Leadership][33] * [Strategic Technology Partners][34] * [Certifications & Policies][35] * [SkyWater Acquires Fab 25][36] * [Get Started][37] [SkyPort Customer Portal][38] [Investors][39] [Careers][40] # We Streamline the Concept-to-Production Journey SkyWater is a U.S.-based, pure-play semiconductor manufacturer and a DMEA-accredited Trusted supplier. [Get Started][41] [About SkyWater][42] [07/31/2026][43] | [Press Releases][44] [ IonQ Completes Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][45] [07/28/2026][46] | [Press Releases][47] [ IonQ Receives Regulatory Approval to Complete Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][48] [02/25/2026][49] | [Press Releases][50] [ SkyWater Technology Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Fiscal Year 2025 Results ][51] [See All Press Releases][52] [07/31/2026][53] [ IonQ Completes Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][54] [07/28/2026][55] [ IonQ Receives Regulatory Approval to Complete Acquisition of SkyWater Technology ][56] [02/25/2026][57] [ SkyWater Technology Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Fiscal Year 2025 Results ][58] [See All Articles][59] ## Celebrating 250 Years of American Ingenuity As our nation celebrates its 250th anniversary, we’re reflecting on the builders, innovators, engineers, entrepreneurs, and problem-solvers whose contributions have shaped America’s past and who are helping define its future. At SkyWater, we see that spirit every day in the people advancing technology, strengthening domestic manufacturing, and tackling some of the world’s most complex challenges. ## Technologies We enable innovators with diverse technology categories. [ ### Mixed-Signal CMOS Learn More ][60] [ ### Rad-Hard Learn More ][61] [ ### MEMS Learn More ][62] [ ### Superconducting Learn More ][63] [ ### Photonics Learn More ][64] [ ### Heterogeneous Integration Learn More ][65] ## Markets SkyWater partners with fabless companies, IDMs and OEMs to bring solutions to market for a wide range of applications. * ### [Aerospace & Defense][66] * ### [Automotive][67] * ### [Biomedical][68] * ### [Industrial][69] ## Connect with us on LinkedIn ## Let’s make your next project a reality. [Get Started][70] [[Skywater Technology]][71] * [Services][72] * [Technology as a Service (TaaS)][73] * [Technology & Design Enablement][74] * [Manufacturing][75] * [Markets][76] * [Healthcare][77] * [Technologies][78] * [CMOS][79] * [Resources][80] * [Podcast][81] * [Press Releases][82] * [Events][83] * [About][84] * [Who We Are][85] * [Leadership][86] * [Support][87] * [Careers][88] * [Suppliers][89] ##### Services * [Technology as a Service (TaaS)][90] * [Technology & Design Enablement][91] * [Manufacturing][92] ##### Markets * [Aerospace & Defense][93] * [Automotive][94] * [Biomedical][95] * [Industrial][96] ##### Technologies * [CMOS][97] * [Heterogenous Integration][98] * [MEMS, Photonics & Custom][99] * [Rad-Hard][100] * [Superconducting][101] ##### Resources * [Press Releases][102] * [Events][103] * [Blog][104] * [Podcast][105] * [Visual Library][106] 