Technology\nMilComm\nAvionics\nRadar\n[Two pilots in a cockpit with illuminated controls, one adjusting an overhead panel, and city lights\nvisible outside.]\nAvionics\nElevate your next innovations in guidance, navigation, flight control, data acquisition, power\ndistribution, engine control, and motor control systems.\n[Explore Solutions][19]\n[Nighttime Earth with satellite against sunrise.]\nSpace Technology\nSuperior beamforming, RF and microwave, data conversion, precision linear, and power systems for\nLEO, GEO, and beyond.\n[Explore Solutions][20]\n[Camouflaged soldier uses radio outdoors, with another s"}}, "page_text": "# Engineering Better Energy Storage Rimac Energy and ADI are advancing battery storage with a next-generation platform that helps improve efficiency, usable energy, scalability, and grid performance. [ Read on Signals+ ][1] # Engineering Better Energy Storage Rimac Energy and ADI are advancing battery storage with a next-generation platform that helps improve efficiency, usable energy, scalability, and grid performance. [ Read on Signals+ ][2] # Inside Efficient Battery Balancing Discover the algorithms behind efficient active battery balancing and how streamlined software strategies can improve battery performance, efficiency, and system reliability. [ Read the Tech Article ][3] # Inside Efficient Battery Balancing Discover the algorithms behind efficient active battery balancing and how streamlined software strategies can improve battery performance, efficiency, and system reliability. [ Read the Tech Article ][4] # Powering the Clean Energy Grid Find technologies that help accelerate electrification, modernize the grid, and support the clean energy transition—from energy storage to grid infrastructure. [ Find Energy Solutions ][5] # Powering the Clean Energy Grid Find technologies that help accelerate electrification, modernize the grid, and support the clean energy transition—from energy storage to grid infrastructure. [ Find Energy Solutions ][6] Get to Know Us Together, with our customers, we co-create solutions across aerospace, automotive, communications, consumer, energy, industrial automation, and healthcare. [ [Online shopping concept with a cart icon on a laptop screen.] ### eShop ][7] [ [What We Do] ### What We Do (Signals+) ][8] [ [Hands typing on a laptop with icons for document, play, chat, and pencil, symbolizing multimedia] ### ContentZone ][9] [ [Online shopping concept with a cart icon on a laptop screen.] ## eShop ][10] [ [What We Do] ## What We Do (Signals+) ][11] [ [Hands typing on a laptop with icons for document, play, chat, and pencil, symbolizing multimedia] ## ContentZone ][12] Explore Our Solutions Gallery Select an Industry Aero & Defense Automotive Consumer Data Center Energy Healthcare Industrial Instrumentation Smart Buildings Wireless Comms [Soldier in camouflage with communication gear stands on a rocky coastline at night, overlooking a naval ship, planes, and satellite under a lit moon.] Amplify your secure military comms by addressing size, weight, power, and cost challenges for handheld, shipborne, and vehicle radios. [Explore Solutions][13] Elevate your next innovations in guidance, navigation, flight control, data acquisition, power distribution, engine control, and motor control systems. [Explore Solutions][14] Superior beamforming, RF and microwave, data conversion, precision linear, and power systems for LEO, GEO, and beyond. [Explore Solutions][15] RF, digitizer, and signal processing solutions enable the design of high performance, low power radar systems with a wide variety of architectures and frequency bands. [Explore Solutions][16] 1. MilComm 2. Avionics 3. Space Technology 4. Radar [ Browse All Aero & Defense Solutions ][17] [Soldier in camouflage with communication gear stands on a rocky coastline at night, overlooking a naval ship, planes, and satellite under a lit moon.] [ Browse Complete Aerospace and Defense Solutions Portfolio ][18] Space Technology MilComm Avionics Radar [Two pilots in a cockpit with illuminated controls, one adjusting an overhead panel, and city lights visible outside.] Avionics Elevate your next innovations in guidance, navigation, flight control, data acquisition, power distribution, engine control, and motor control systems. [Explore Solutions][19] [Nighttime Earth with satellite against sunrise.] Space Technology Superior beamforming, RF and microwave, data conversion, precision linear, and power systems for LEO, GEO, and beyond. [Explore Solutions][20] [Camouflaged soldier uses radio outdoors, with another soldier in background.] MilComm Amplify your secure military comms by addressing size, weight, power, and cost challenges for handheld, shipborne, and vehicle radios. [Explore Solutions][21] [Naval radar array atop ship's superstructure against cloudy sky.] Radar RF, digitizer, and signal processing solutions enable the design of high performance, low power radar systems with a wide variety of architectures and frequency bands. [Explore Solutions][22] [A top-down diagram of a car with sensors on the roof detecting objects around.] Solutions for wired and wireless battery management systems, on-board chargers, and traction inverters for more efficient EV platforms. [Explore Solutions][23] Solutions for pillar-to-pillar HD displays, spatial audio, voice and acoustic systems for a personalized and immersive cabin experience. [Explore Solutions][24] Solutions for autonomous system applications, which integrate high bandwidth low-latency connectivity, precision sensing, intelligent power management and LED drivers. [Explore Solutions][25] Ethernet connectivity enabled cutting-edge solutions for software-defined vehicle systems, enabling zonal architecture and optimizing body control applications. [Explore Solutions][26] 1. Electrification and Powertrain 2. Cabin Experience and Infotainment 3. ADAS, Autonomous Driving and Safety 4. Body Electronics [ Browse All Automotive Solutions ][27] [A top-down diagram of a car with sensors on the roof detecting objects around.] [ Browse Complete Automotive Solutions Portfolio ][28] ADAS, Autonomous Driving and Safety Cabin Experience and Infotainment Body Electronics Electrification and Powertrain [Car interior with holographic dashboard, heads-up display, and steering wheel.] ADAS, Autonomous Driving and Safety Solutions for autonomous system applications, which integrate high bandwidth low-latency connectivity, precision sensing, intelligent power management and LED drivers. [Explore Solutions][29] [A digital touchscreen dashboard inside a car.] Cabin Experience and Infotainment Solutions for pillar-to-pillar HD displays, spatial audio, voice and acoustic systems for a personalized and immersive cabin experience. [Explore Solutions][30] [Futuristic sports car with neon orange grid lines in a vibrant digital urban setting.] Body Electronics Ethernet connectivity enabled cutting-edge solutions for software-defined vehicle systems, enabling zonal architecture and optimizing body control applications. [Explore Solutions][31] [A silhouette of a car, with batteries and other internal parts.] Electrification and Powertrain Solutions for wired and wireless battery management systems, on-board chargers, and traction inverters for more efficient EVs. [Explore Solutions][32] [Person on a video call in a cozy living room with a stylus, TV showing hot air balloons, smart speaker with lights, and a guitar.] Explore how ADI enables smaller, smarter and longer lasting consumer electronic devices. [Explore Solutions][33] Explore our innovations in high-fidelity audio, long battery life, and advanced processing in earbuds, smartwatches, headphones, and extended reality products. [Explore Solutions][34] Our best-in-class performance for home theater and gaming products offer complete audio and video solutions that bring a lifelike experience to your home. [Explore Solutions][35] Discover how our professional-grade, high-performance audio and video solutions create differentiated, industry-standard platforms and systems. [Explore Solutions][36] 1. Personal Electronics 2. Hearables & Wearables 3. Home Theater & Gaming 4. Unified Comms and ProAV [ Browse All Consumer Solutions ][37] [Person on a video call in a cozy living room with a stylus, TV showing hot air balloons, smart speaker with lights, and a guitar.] [ Browse Complete Consumer Solutions Portfolio ][38] Hearables & Wearables Personal Electronics Home Theater & Gaming Unified Comms and ProAV [Modern office meeting room: Video conference with city view.] Unified Comms and ProAV Find out how our professional-grade, high-quality, high-performance audio and video solutions create differentiated and industry-standard based platforms and systems. [Explore Solutions][39] [Smiling man on a sofa holding a tablet, wearing a smartwatch, with shelves and plants in the background.] Personal Electronics Explore how ADI enables smaller, smarter and longer lasting consumer electronic devices. [Explore Solutions][40] [Close-up of a smartwatch showing 85 bpm and a heart icon, with a hand pointing at the screen.] Hearables & Wearables Learn about our innovations in high-fidelity audio, long battery life, and advanced processing within earbuds, smartwatches, headphones, and extended reality products. [Explore Solutions][41] [Father and daughter celebrate video game victory in bright living room.] Home Theater & Gaming Our best-in-class performance for home theater and gaming products offer complete audio and video solutions that bring a lifelike experience to your home. [Explore Solutions][42] [Man working on a laptop in front of server racks with blue and pink data streams.] Learn about ADI’s extensive power solutions for 48V and 12V systems, portfolio from 2A to 2000A, and data center power delivering max efficiency in minimal space. [Explore Solutions][43] Learn how ADI's power solutions meet demanding data center needs with high-performance, high-reliability products for next-gen server equipment. [Explore Solutions][44] ADI's optical networking solutions power efficient, compact optical modules for data center, enterprise, and telecom markets. [Explore Solutions][45] 1. AI Accelerators 2. Server Equipment 3. Optical Networking [ Browse All Data Center Solutions ][46] [Man working on a laptop in front of server racks with blue and pink data streams.] [ Browse Complete Data Center Solutions Portfolio ][47] Optical Networking Server Equipment AI Accelerators [Abstract: Light beams become binary on dark blue.] AI Accelerators Learn about ADI’s extensive power solutions for 48V and 12V systems, portfolio from 2A to 2000A, and data center power delivering maximum efficiency in minimal space. [Explore Solutions][48] [Man with glasses adjusts network equipment in server room.] Server Equipment Learn how ADI's power solutions meet demanding data center needs with high-performance, high-reliability products for next-gen server equipment. [Explore Solutions][49] [Illustration: Glowing fiber optic cables with binary code.] Optical Networking ADI's optical networking solutions power efficient, compact optical modules for data center, enterprise, and telecom markets. [Explore Solutions][50] [Person with a laptop near a battery container, wind turbines, power lines, and solar panels under a blue sky.] ADI's smart grid solutions enhance monitoring, security, grid edge intelligence, and the delivery of data for actionable insights. [Explore Solutions][51] Learn how ADI's system-level expertise in energy storage applications helps boost grid resiliency and efficiency to expand the clean energy ecosystem. [Explore Solutions][52] Learn how ADI's solutions help to power the transition to efficient, reliable, and safe renewable energy generation from wind and solar. [Explore Solutions][53] 1. Smart Grid Infrastructure 2. Energy Storage 3. Renewable Energy Generation [ Browse All Energy Solutions ][54] [Person with a laptop nea