ow more][22] ## Our style ### PURPOSE Our reason for being reflects the benefits we aim to bring to society. Our actions are guided by our purpose: **to make people’s lives better and smarter through the use of technology**. [ know more][23] [Positivo TecnologIA] [BNDS] [ [Compliance Positivo]][24] [SESI-ODS] [ Lei 14.611/2023 ][25] [Consumidor Moderno] [Prêmio LATAM] [Prêmio Cliente SA Bronze 2023] [Prêmio Cliente SA Ouro 2023] [Consumidor] [A Era do Diálogo] [Empresa amiga da justiça TJ SP] [Top 100 Open Corps] [Great Place to Work] [Consumidor] Register to receive the Positivo Tecnologia’s news. Ao clicar em “enviar” a Positivo Tecnologia tratará os seus dados de acordo com a [ **Política de Privacidade e Cookies.**][26] Successful registration! [Terms of use][27] | [Privacy][28] © POSITIVO TECNOLOGIA S/A All rights reserved. Pictures for illustrative purposes only. [ [Facebook Positivo Tecnologia]][29] [ [Instagram Positivo Tecnologia]][30] [ [Linkedin Positivo Tecnologia]][31] [1]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/en/covid-en [2]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/en [3]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/about-us [4]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/our-style [5]: http://ri.positivotecnologia.com.br [6]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/press-room [7]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/contact-us [8]: https://positivotecnologia.gupy.io/ [9]: https://www.facebook.com/PositivoTecnologia [10]: https://www.instagram.com/positivotecnologia/ [11]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/25950 [12]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/institucional [13]: https://loja.positivoempresas.com.br/?utm_source=site-positec&utm_medium=banner_home&utm_campa ign=site-positec&utm_term=loja_positivo_empresas&utm_content=lancamento [14]: https://www.br.vaio.com/notebook/fe-amd/?utm_source=positivotecnologia.com.br&utm_medium=site& utm_campaign=referral_banner [15]: https://www.positivosmais.com/?utm_source=positivotecnologia.com.br&utm_medium=site&utm_campai gn=referral_banner [16]: https://positivo.solucoesempagamentos.com.br/?utm_source=positivotecnologia.com.br&utm_medium= site&utm_campaign=referral_banner [17]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/institucional [18]: https://loja.positivoempresas.com.br/?utm_source=site-positec&utm_medium=banner_home&utm_campa ign=site-positec&utm_term=loja_positivo_empresas&utm_content=lancamento [19]: https://www.br.vaio.com/notebook/fe-amd/?utm_source=positivotecnologia.com.br&utm_medium=site& utm_campaign=referral_banner [20]: https://www.positivosmais.com/?utm_source=positivotecnologia.com.br&utm_medium=site&utm_campai gn=referral_banner [21]: https://positivo.solucoesempagamentos.com.br/?utm_source=positivotecnologia.com.br&utm_medium= site&utm_campaign=referral_banner [22]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/about-us [23]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/our-style [24]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/compliance [25]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/relatoriomte [26]: https://privacidade.positivotecnologia.com.br/?_ga=2.20182140.519726873.1662982478-1859004073. 1660243592 [27]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/terms-of-use [28]: https://www.positivotecnologia.com.br/privacy [29]: https://www.facebook.com/PositivoTecnologia [30]: https://www.instagram.com/positivotecnologia/ [31]: https://www.linkedin.com/company/25950", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Positivo Tecnologia — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Manufacturer of computers and electronics, integrating semiconductor components, indicating they build their own devices. | Brazilian manufacturer of computers and electronics, integrating semiconductor components. | Brazil | Brazil", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "58", "Y Score": "54", "Overall Score": "56", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "Sahasra Semiconductors", "Website": "https://www.sahasrasemi.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "India", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(India)", "Operational Presence": "India", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Sahasra Semiconductors is a leading OSAT player in India, providing assembly, testing, and packaging services for semiconductor devices.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "IN", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "Sahasra Semiconductors — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: OSAT player providing assembly, testing, and packaging services, which are part of semiconductor manufacturing.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "90", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "sahasrasemi.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "sahasrasemi.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "Loading...\n\n* [Home][1]\n* [About Us][2]\n* [Annual Return][3]\n* [Project Milestones][4]\n* [Approvals][5]\n* [Products Offering][6]\n* [Contact][7]\n\nIndia’s First\nNAND FLASH IC Packaging Company\nSahasra\n\n## About Us\n\nSahasra Semiconductors Pvt. Ltd (SSPL), a Sahasra Group Company, is India’s first and only private\ncompany offering NAND FLASH IC packaging and testing services. Established at Bhiwadi, Rajasthan\nthis ATMP (Assembly, Testing, Marking & Packaging) facility with all the required clean rooms\ncommenced its trials and sample production in March 2023.\n\nSSPL already has another distinction to its name of being one of the only 2 domestic companies\napproved by GOI for the Specified Electronic Components Segment under the PLI Scheme and SPECS\nschemes. Other than this SSPL also has customised incentive package approval from state government\nof Rajasthan.\n\nWith initial focus on COB and Micro SD cards, SSPL will quickly move on to packaging of internal\nmemory products such as eMMC, BGAs, etc that are widely used in Laptops, Servers, Desktops, Tablets,\nMobile Phones, Drones, Industrial Electronics, Automotive Electronics, IOT and several other\napplications.\n\nSahasra Group through its other entities is already engaged in the manufacturing of USB Drives,\nMicro SD cards and SSD’s for its Indian and overseas OEM customers as well as distribution of the\nsame via E-commerce and retail partners. This backward integration was a natural step for Sahasra\nand its technology associates/partners to increase the value addition with the growing demand of\nstorage in India fulfilling the Honourable PM Narendra Modi’s call of “Make in India” and helping\nthe country in being self-reliant **\"Atmanirbhar\"**.\n\n## Management Team\n\n[Amrit Manwani]\n\n#### Mr. Amrit Manwani\n\n(CMD, Sahasra Group)\n[Mr. Varun Manwani]\n\n#### Mr. Varun Manwani\n\n(Director, Sahasra Group)\n[Mr. Parvez A. Khan]\n\n#### Mr. Parvez A. Khan\n\n(Director, Design & Engineering)\n[Mr. Jerry S. Enriquez ]\n\n#### Mr. Jerry S. Enriquez\n\n(Business Unit Head)\n\n## Annual Return\n\nMGT - 7 is an electronic form that is allocated to all the companies by the Ministry of Corporate\nAffairs for filing details of their annual return.\n\nThe Registrar of Companies uses to maintain this e-form via electronic mode and on the basis of the\nstatement of correctness given by the company. It is a popular form among the companies which are\nrequired to file the form as per the norms and regulations of the Ministry of Corporate Affairs.\n\nRecently, the Ministry of Corporate Affairs has amended specific provisions/ rules which\nnecessitates the company to place the copy of their annual return (Form No. MGT-7) on the company’s\nwebsite. Accordingly, the web-link of the same is to be disclosed in the Directors Report.\n\n[ Annual Return (F.Y. 2020-21)][8]\n[Annual Return (F.Y. 2021-22)][9]\n[Annual Return (F.Y. 2022-23)][10]\n[Annual Return F.Y. 2023-24][11]\n[Annual Return F.Y. 2024-25][12]\n\n## Current Project Status\n\nSample manufacturing started in March 2023 & Mass manufacturing will be from SEP 2023\n\n## Installed Equipments\n\n[Wafer Back Grinder]\n\n###### Wafer Back Grinder\n\n[Dicing Saw Machine]\n\n###### Dicing Saw Machine\n\n[Die Bonder Machine]\n\n###### Die Bonder Machine\n\n[Laser Marking Machine]\n\n###### Laser Marking Machine\n\n[Laser Cutting Machine]\n\n###### Laser Cutting Machine\n\n[Saw Singulation & Pick and Place Machine ]\n\n###### Saw Singulation & Pick and Place\n\n[microSD Tester ]\n\n###### microSD Tester\n\n## Approval Stages\n\n#### Production Linked Incentive (PLI)\n\n#### Approved\n\n#### Scheme for Promotion of Manufacturing of Electronic Components and Semiconductors (SPECS)\n\n#### Approved\n\n#### Scheme for land registration by Rajasthan Government\n\n#### Approved\n\n#### Customized Pacakage by Rajasthan Government\n\n#### Approved\n\n#### Production Linked Incentive (PLI) Scheme for White Goods (LED Drivers-IC Packaging)\n\n#### Approved\n\n## Products Offering\n\n### COB\n\n### MicroSD Card\n\n[eMMC]\n\n### embedded Multi Media Card (eMMC)\n\n### BGA\n\n## M"}}, "page_text": "Loading... * [Home][1] * [About Us][2] * [Annual Return][3] * [Project Milestones][4] * [Approvals][5] * [Products Offering][6] * [Contact][7] India’s First NAND FLASH IC Packaging Company Sahasra ## About Us Sahasra Semiconductors Pvt. Ltd (SSPL), a Sahasra Group Company, is India’s first and only private company offering NAND FLASH IC packaging and testing services. Established at Bhiwadi, Rajasthan this ATMP (Assembly, Testing, Marking & Packaging) facility with all the required clean rooms commenced its trials and sample production in March 2023. SSPL already has another distinction to its name of being one of the only 2 domestic companies approved by GOI for the Specified Electronic Components Segment under the PLI Scheme and SPECS schemes. Other than this SSPL also has customised incentive package approval from state government of Rajasthan. With initial focus on COB and Micro SD cards, SSPL will quickly move on to packaging of internal memory products such as eMMC, BGAs, etc that are widely used in Laptops, Servers, Desktops, Tablets, Mobile Phones, Drones, Industrial Electronics, Automotive Electronics, IOT and several other applications. Sahasra Group through its other entities is already engaged in the manufacturing of USB Drives, Micro SD cards and SSD’s for its Indian and overseas OEM customers as well as distribution of the same via E-commerce and retail partners. This backward integration was a natural step for Sahasra and its technology associates/partners to increase the value addition with the growing demand of storage in India fulfilling the Honourable PM Narendra Modi’s call of “Make in India” and helping the country in being self-reliant **\"Atmanirbhar\"**. ## Management Team [Amrit Manwani] #### Mr. Amrit Manwani (CMD, Sahasra Group) [Mr. Varun Manwani] #### Mr. Varun Manwani (Director, Sahasra Group) [Mr. Parvez A. Khan] #### Mr. Parvez A. Khan (Director, Design & Engineering) [Mr. Jerry S. Enriquez ] #### Mr. Jerry S. Enriquez (Business Unit Head) ## Annual Return MGT - 7 is an electronic form that is allocated to all the companies by the Ministry of Corporate Affairs for filing details of their annual return. The Registrar of Companies uses to maintain this e-form via electronic mode and on the basis of the statement of correctness given by the company. It is a popular form among the companies which are required to file the form as per the norms and regulations of the Ministry of Corporate Affairs. Recently, the Ministry of Corporate Affairs has amended specific provisions/ rules which necessitates the company to place the copy of their annual return (Form No. MGT-7) on the company’s website. Accordingly, the web-link of the same is to be disclosed in the Directors Report. [ Annual Return (F.Y. 2020-21)][8] [Annual Return (F.Y. 2021-22)][9] [Annual Return (F.Y. 2022-23)][10] [Annual Return F.Y. 2023-24][11] [Annual Return F.Y. 2024-25][12] ## Current Project Status Sample manufacturing started in March 2023 & Mass manufacturing will be from SEP 2023 ## Installed Equipments [Wafer Back Grinder] ###### Wafer Back Grinder [Dicing Saw Machine] ###### Dicing Saw Machine [Die Bonder Machine] ###### Die Bonder Machine [Laser Marking Machine] ###### Laser Marking Machine [Laser Cutting Machine] ###### Laser Cutting Machine [Saw Singulation & Pick and Place Machine ] ###### Saw Singulation & Pick and Place [microSD Tester ] ###### microSD Tester ## Approval Stages #### Production Linked Incentive (PLI) #### Approved #### Scheme for Promotion of Manufacturing of Electronic Components and Semiconductors (SPECS) #### Approved #### Scheme for land registration by Rajasthan Government #### Approved #### Customized Pacakage by Rajasthan Government #### Approved #### Production Linked Incentive (PLI) Scheme for White Goods (LED Drivers-IC Packaging) #### Approved ## Products Offering ### COB ### MicroSD Card [eMMC] ### embedded Multi Media Card (eMMC) ### BGA ## Market Segments ## Group Companies [[Image]][13] ### Sahasra Electronics Pvt. Ltd. (Unit-1) Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS) ### Infopower Technologies Pvt. Ltd. PCB Manufacturing & Electronics Manufacturing Services (EMS) [ [Sahasra Electronic Solutions Limited]][14] ### Sahasra Electronic Solutions Limited IT Products & Motherboards [ [Image]][15] ### Sahasra Electronics Rwanda Pvt. Ltd. LED Lighting & Solar Systems ## Contact Us Plot No. B-2, ELCINA Electronics Manufacturing Cluster, Industrial Area Salarpur, Bhiwadi, Distt. Alwar, Rajasthan, India [[email protected]][16] +91-120-2462782/83 ### Sahasra \"Sahasra\" was conceived in the year 2000, the new millennium and is ever since among the fastest growing electronic companies in India. The group comprises of 6 businesses providing end-to-end electronic solutions from design to manufacturing to distribution. Sahasra Semiconductors Pvt. Ltd (SSPL), a Sahasra Group Company, is India’s first and only private company to start India’s first NAND FLASH IC packaging and testing operations. #### Contact Us Plot No. B-2, ELCINA Electronics Manufacturing Cluster, Industrial Area Salarpur, Bhiwadi, Distt. Alwar, Rajasthan, India **Phone:** +91-0120-2462782/83 **Email:** [[email protected]][17] © Copyright 2024 **Sahasra Semiconductors Pvt. Ltd.** All Rights Reserved Designed & Developed by [Sahasra Group][18] [1]: #home-section [2]: #about-section [3]: #annual-return [4]: #project-milestones [5]: #services [6]: #Products-offering [7]: #contact [8]: Annual-Return/Annual%20Return_FY%202020-21.pdf [9]: Annual-Return/Annual%20Return_FY%202021-22.pdf [10]: Annual-Return/Annual%20Return_FY%202022-23.pdf [11]: Annual-Return/Annual_Return_FY_2023-24.pdf [12]: Annual-Return/Annual_Return_FY_2024-25.pdf [13]: http://sahasraelectronics.com/ [14]: # [15]: http://sahasraelectronics.rw/ [16]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection [17]: /cdn-cgi/l/email-protection [18]: https://www.sahasraelectronics.com", "discovery_snippets": [], "classify": {"summary": "Sahasra Semiconductors — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: OSAT player providing assembly, testing, and packaging services, which are part of semiconductor manufacturing. | Sahasra Semiconductors is a leading OSAT player in India, providing assembly, testing, and packaging services for semiconductor devices. | India | India", "role_description": "Solution Provider"}}, "X Score": "57", "Y Score": "54", "Overall Score": "56", "Industry Category": "ICT, Automation, Semiconductor / Semiconductors", "Quadrant": "Trailblazers"}, {"Company": "SemiLEDs", "Website": "https://www.semileds.com", "Founded": "Not publicly disclosed", "Headquarters": "Taiwan", "Continent / Geography": "APAC(Taiwan)", "Operational Presence": "Taiwan", "Ownership": "Not publicly disclosed", "Employees": "Not publicly disclosed", "Core Categories": "Not publicly disclosed", "Specialty Focus": "Develops and manufactures LED chips and components, part of the broader semiconductor industry.", "Key Brands Represented": "Not publicly disclosed", "Retail / E-commerce / Both": "No", "Distribution Type": "Solution Provider", "Contact Person": "", "Role": "", "Email": "", "LinkedIn": "", "Office No.": "", "Country Code": "TW", "Region Code": "APAC", "Summary": "SemiLEDs — channel participant (openai_web_search_discover). Verify: Develops and manufactures LED chips, a semiconductor product.", "Data Sources": "google_ai", "Data Confidence": "Medium", "Quality Score": "3", "commercial_role": "Solution Provider", "verify_confidence": "95", "_evidence_snapshot": {"source": "", "domain": "semileds.com", "data": {"company": {"name": "semileds.com"}, "business": {"products": [], "services": []}, "intel": {"summary": "top of page\n* [\n  \n  HOME\n  \n  ][1]\n* [\n  \n  PRODUCT\n  \n  ][2]\n  * [Chips][3]\n  * [Application Notes][4]\n  * [Environmental Policy][5]\n  * [Terms of Sale][6]\n* [\n  \n  INVESTORS\n  \n  ][7]\n  * [News][8]\n  * [Corporate Governance][9]\n  * [Financial Information][10]\n  * [Executive Management][11]\n  * [Contact Finance][12]\n* [\n  \n  CONTACT US\n  \n  ][13]\n* More\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\n[SL_logo-color.png]\n\nSemiLEDs Corporation incorporated in Delaware in January 2005.\n\n\nSemiLEDs is a manufacturer of ultra-high brightness LED chips with state of the art fabrication\nfacilities in Hsinchu Science Park, Taiwan.\n\n \n\nSemiLEDs specializes in the development and manufacturing of metal alloy vertical LED chips in blue\n(white), green and UV using our patented and proprietary MvpLED™ technology. This unique design\nallows for higher performance and longer lumen maintenance.\n\n\nSemiLEDs is fully [ISO9001 Certified][14].\n\npractice_areas\n[LA4_0008 V-1.jpg]\n\n#### TECHNOLOGY\n\nPatented and unique technology  which provides advantages in design and value that are unparalleled\nin the industry\n\n[Read More ][15]\n[DSC_0197_edited.jpg]\n\n#### LEDs\n\nSemiLEDs portfolio of products along with partner enabled packages based on SemiLEDs chips.\n\n\n[Read More][16]\n[shutterstock_87564733_edited.jpg]\n\n#### APPLICATION\n\nSemiLEDs products offer a strong value proposition to LED users in various industry segments.\n\n\n[Read More ][17]\ncontact\n\nContact Us\n\nOUR ADDRESS\n\n3F, No.11 Ke Jung Rd., Chu-Nan Site,\nHsinchu Science Park, Chu-Nan 350,\nMiao-Li County, Taiwan, R. O. C\n\n\nTel      : +886-37-586788\nFax     : +886-37-582688\nE-mail: [sales@semileds.com][18] \n\nFor any general inquiries, please fill in the following contact form:\n\nCompany Name\nEmail\nSubject\nMessage\n\n# Privacy Policy\n\nSubmit\n\nThanks for submitting!\n\nbottom of page\n\n[1]: https://www.semileds.com\n[2]: https://www.semileds.com/product\n[3]: https://www.semileds.com/product\n[4]: https://www.semileds.com/product\n[5]: https://www.semileds.com/product\n[6]: https://www.semileds.com/termsofsale\n[7]: https://www.semileds.com/investors\n[8]: https://www.semileds.com/news\n[9]: https://www.semileds.com/corporategovernance\n[10]: https://www.semileds.com/investors\n[11]: https://www.semileds.com/investors\n[12]: https://www.semileds.com/investors\n[13]: https://www.semileds.com\n[14]: http://www.semileds.com/system/files/ISO.pdf\n[15]: https://www.semileds.com/product\n[16]: https://www.semileds.com/product\n[17]: https://www.semileds.com/product\n[18]: mailto:sales@semileds.com"}}, "page_text": "top of page * [ HOME ][1] * [ PRODUCT ][2] * [Chips][3] * [Application Notes][4] * [Environmental Policy][5] * [Terms of Sale][6] * [ INVESTORS ][7] * [News][8] * [Corporate Governance][9] * [Financial Information][10] * [Executive Management][11] * [Contact Finance][12] * [ CONTACT US ][13] * More Use tab to navigate through the menu items. [SL_logo-color.png] SemiLEDs Corporation incorporated in Delaware in January 2005. SemiLEDs is a manufacturer of ultra-high brightness LED chips with state of the art fabrication facilities in Hsinchu Science Park, Taiwan. SemiLEDs specializes in the development and manufacturing of metal alloy vertical LED chips in blue (white), green and UV using our patented and proprietary MvpLED™ technology. This unique design allows for higher performance and longer lumen maintenance. SemiLEDs is fully [ISO9001 Certified][14]. practice_areas [LA4_0008 V-1.jpg] #### TECHNOLOGY Patented and unique technology which provides advantages in design and value that are unparalleled in the industry [Read More ][15] [DSC_0197_edited.jpg] #### LEDs SemiLEDs portfolio of products along with partner enabled packages based on SemiLEDs chips. [Read More][16] [shutterstock_87564733_edited.jpg] #### APPLICATION SemiLEDs products offer a strong value proposition to LED users in various industry segments. [Read More ][17] contact Contact Us OUR ADDRESS 3F, No.11 Ke Jung Rd., Chu-Nan Site, Hsinchu Science Park, Chu-Nan 350, Miao-Li County, Taiwan, R. O. C Tel : +886-37-586788 Fax : +886-37-582688 E-mail: [sales@semileds.com][18] For any general inquiries, please fill in the following contact form: Company Name Email Subject Message # Privacy Policy Submit Thanks for submitting! bottom of page [1]: https://www.semileds.com [2]: https://www.semileds.com/product [3]: https://www.semileds.com/product [4]: https://www.semileds.com/product [5]: https://www.semileds.com/product [6]: https://www.semileds.com/termsofsale [7]: https://www.semileds.com/investors [8]: https://www.semileds.com/news [9]: https://www.semileds.com/corporategovernance [10]: https://www.semileds.com/investors [11]: https://www.semileds.com/investors [12]: https://www.semileds.com/investors [13]: https://www.semileds.com [14]: http://www.semileds.c