n\n### Trending Topics\n\nDocument\nYour browser does not support the video tag. Your browser does not support the video tag.\n\n# We Deliver\n# Material Innovation\n# That Changes\n# The World\n\n## Trending\n\n[UC Berkeley to Join Applied Materials’ EPIC Center to Speed Chip Innovation ]\n\n**UC Berkeley to Join Applied Materials’ EPIC Center to Speed Chip Innovation **\n\nView Press Release\n[Pax Silica: Chip to Grid White Paper Available]\n\n**Pax Silica: Chip to Grid White Paper Available**\n\nLearn More\n[Advancing DRAM Performance With Logic-Class Technologies]\n\n**Advancing DRAM Performance With Logic-Class Technologies**\n\nView Blog\n[Applied Materials to Report Fiscal Third Quarter 2026 Results on Aug. 13, 2026]\n\n**Applied Materials to Report Fiscal Third Quarter 2026 Results on Aug. 13, 2026**\n\nView Press Release\n\n###### COMPANY\n\n## Advancing the World's Technology One Angstrom at a Time\n\n####  \n\n#### Applied's expertise in modifying materials at atomic levels and on an industrial scale\n#### enables our customers to transform possibilities into reality.\n\n[ Learn more about us ][56]\n\n## How will you deliver material innovation today?\n\n#### Be a catalyst to unlock the power of ideas and do what others think can't be done. There are no\n#### limits to what we can achieve together.\n\n[ Learn more about working here ][57]\n\n###### **EXPLORE MORE**\n\n##### Fostering innovation through venture investments, research and joint development programs.\n\n[ Applied Ventures ][58]\n[ Collaboration ][59]\n** **\n[ [Applied Materials Logo] ][60]\n* [\n  \n  Products & Services\n  \n  ][61]\n* [\n  \n  Company\n  \n  ][62]\n* [\n  \n  Contact Sales\n  \n  ][63]\n* [\n  \n  Careers\n  \n  ][64]\n\n###### Follow Us\n\n©2026 Applied Materials, Inc.\n* [\n  Sitemap\n  ][65]\n* [\n  Terms of Use\n  ][66]\n* [\n  Privacy\n  ][67]\n* [\n  Supply Chain Transparency\n  ][68]\n* [\n  Cookies\n  ][69]\n\nDocument\n\n[1]: /in/en.html\n[2]: /cn/zh_cn.html\n[3]: