Other Resources Access case studies, podcasts, and white papers for deeper insights into Wiliot’s impact and solutions * [ Case Studies ][36][ Whitepapers ][37][ Blogs ][38][ Podcast ][39] * [ ###### About us ][40] * [ ###### News ][41] * [ ###### Events ][42] * [ ###### Press ][43] * [ ###### Impact ][44] * [ ###### Team ][45] * [ ###### Locations ][46] [NEWS: Wiliot Formally Announces its Partnership with AT&T][47] Solutions By Solutions [Inventory Intelligence][48] [Automated Receiving][49] [Reusable Asset Tracking][50] [Automated Shipment Verification][51] [Temperature Monitoring][52] By Industry [Grocery][53] [General Retail][54] [Post & Parcel][55] [Quick Service Restaurant][56] How it works [Wiliot Overview][57] [IoT Pixels][58] [Network Infrastracture][59] [Wiliot Physical AI Platform][60] [AI & Ambient IoT][61] Resources The Basics [Supply Chain AI][62] [Physical AI][63] [Ambient IoT][64] [Bluetooth Beacon][65] [Battery Free Bluetooth][66] [Bluetooth Sticker][67] [Cold Chain Monitoring][68] [Digital Product Passports][69] [Supply Chain Visibility][70] [Reusable Transport][71] [Reusable Transport Tracking][72] [ Explore all the basics ][73] Other Resources [Case Studies][74] [Whitepapers][75] [Blogs][76] [Podcast][77] [ Partners ][78] [ Careers ][79] [ Contact Us ][80] # Every asset connected. # One intelligent view. The only full-stack supply chain intelligence platform turning billions of sensor signals into actionable insights. [Request Demo][81] ## Every asset connected. ## One intelligent view. Physical AI for your Supply Chain [Request Demo][82] ## How it Works Wiliot connects physical items to the cloud using battery-free IoT Pixels, simple network infrastructure, and AI-driven services. This transforms raw data into actionable insights for smarter, more efficient operations. ###### IoT Pixels Low-cost, battery-free Bluetooth sensors attach to items and harvest energy from ambient radio signals to transmit data — such as location, temperature, humidity, and light. [ Explore Wiliot IoT Pixels ][83] ###### Network Infrastructure Off-the-shelf bridges and gateways (hubs), which are quick to deploy, wake up nearby IoT Pixels using radio signals, receive their data, and forward it securely to the Wiliot Physical AI platform. [ Uncover the Network Infrastructure ][84] ###### Wiliot Physical AI Platform The Wiliot Physical AI platform is where raw sensing data is transformed into smart decisions and where our agents and specialized AI models live. Providing alerts, analytics, and dashboards. [ Discover the Wiliot Physical AI Platform ][85] Wiliot Physical AI ## Trusted intelligence for your connected environment ## Inventory ## Intelligence Real-time, scan-free inventory visibility that drives 99%+ accuracy and fuels your supply chain decision making. [ Learn more ][86] ## Automated ## Receiving AI-powered automation that eliminates manual steps and speeds workflows with continuous, scan-free data. [ Learn more ][87] ## Reusable Asset ## Tracking Eliminate asset shrink and optimize fleet utilization without manual counts. [ Learn more ][88] ## Automated Shipment ## Verification Automatically prevent mis-shipments and wrong loads before trucks leave the dock. [ Learn more ][89] ## Temperature ## Monitoring Temperature and dwell-time sensing detects risks on perishable goods before losses occur. [ Learn more ][90] case studies ## Real-time visibility, real-world results Online Retailer Enhances Supply Chain Efficiency and Reduces Costs with the Wiliot Intelligence Platform [ Read more ][91] Grocery Retailer Boosts Efficiency and Cuts Waste with the Wiliot Intelligence Platform [ Read more ][92] Online Retailer Enhances Supply Chain Efficiency and Reduces Costs with the Wiliot Intelligence Platform [ Read more ][93] ## Optimizing Mail Operations: Royal Mail Digitizes its Core Delivery Assets to Gain Unprecedented ## Visibility [ Read more ][94] ## Optimizing Mail Operations: Royal Mail Digitizes its Core Delivery Assets to Gain Unprecedented ## Visibility [ Read more ][95] ## Optimizing Mail Operations: Royal Mail Digitizes its Core Delivery Assets to Gain Unprecedented ## Visibility [ Read more ][96] our latest news ## Stay updated with our newest blogs and events [ featured blog Press Release Wiliot Collaborates with AT&T Business as Demand for Physical AI in Enterprise Supply Chains Accelerates Internationally Read more ][97] [ Articles ### Supply Chain AI in QSR: Why the Real ROI Isn't at the Drive-Thru Read more ][98] [ Articles ### If Your Supply Chain Still Uses RFID, it’s Outdated. Physical AI is the New Tech in Town. Read more ][99] [ Whitepaper ### RFID vs. Wiliot: The Real Cost of Blind Spots in Your Supply Chain Read more ][100] [ Event ### NRF 2027: Retail's Big Show Read more ][101] [ Event ### Pack Expo International 2026 Read more ][102] [ Event ### Winning With Walmart: 2026 Supplier Forum & Innovation Crawl Read more ][103] ## Wiliot FAQs ### What does Wiliot do? Wiliot helps enterprises gain real-time visibility into their supply chain by turning physical products into digital data sources. Using the Wiliot Physical AI platform, companies can track the location, movement, and condition of items automatically — without scanning — enabling smarter, faster, and more efficient operations. ### What is the Wiliot Physical AI platform? The Wiliot Physical AI platform connects the physical world to AI systems by continuously capturing data from products and assets. It combines Wiliot’s IoT Pixels, network infrastructure, and cloud-based AI to create a live, always-on view of supply chain operations — enabling automation, optimization, and real-time decision-making. ### How is Wiliot different from traditional supply chain technologies like RFID or barcodes? Traditional technologies rely on manual scans or fixed checkpoints, creating gaps in visibility. Wiliot provides continuous, ambient data capture without scanning, eliminating blind spots and reducing infrastructure costs — while delivering real-time, item-level intelligence across the entire supply chain. ### What is Physical AI and why does it matter? Physical AI brings real-world operations into AI systems by turning physical items into continuous data sources. This matters because most supply chains today rely on delayed or incomplete data. With Physical AI, companies can move from reactive decisions to proactive, automated operations driven by real-time insights. ### How does Wiliot enable supply chain AI? Supply Chain AI requires accurate, real-time data to work effectively. Wiliot provides that data layer by continuously capturing information from physical items. This allows AI systems to detect issues, predict outcomes, and automate workflows — improving inventory accuracy, reducing waste, and optimizing logistics performance. ### What business outcomes can companies achieve with Wiliot? Companies using Wiliot improve inventory accuracy, reduce labor and operational costs, minimize waste, and increase product availability. By automating data capture and enabling AI-driven decisions, organizations can unlock significant ROI while building more resilient, efficient supply chains. > visibility...enabled #### Step into the future of supply chain visibility [Request Demo][104] Transform #### Step into the future of supply chain visibility [Request Demo][105] **Solutions** [Inventory Intelligence][106][Automated Receiving][107][Reusable Asset Tracking][108][Automated Shipment Verification][109][Temperature Monitoring][110] **How it Works** [Wiliot Overview][111][IoT Pixels][112][Network Infrastructure][113][Wiliot Physical AI Platform][114] **Resources** [Case Studies][115][Podcast][116][The Basic][117][Blogs][118][Partners][119] **About** [Company][120][News][121][Events][122][Press][123][Careers][124][Team][125][Locations][126] [Privacy Policy][127][Terms of use][128] [1]: https://www.wiliot.com/blog/wiliot-collaborates-with-at-t-business-as-demand-for-physical-ai-in -enterpr